"(gray boxes)</span> These items always refer to parts of KOReader. It can be "
"something on the screen that you can tap/select/set or some feature of the "
"application:"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-size: 1rem;\">KOReader 使用者介面（灰色"
"底框）</span> 這些條目始終指向 KOReader 的組成部分，可以是螢幕上可點擊、選"
"擇、設定的項，也可以是軟體的某項功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td.p:1249-8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Status bar</span> <span class=\"ui\">Font weight</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span> <span class=\"ui\">字重</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td.p:1254-12
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--green-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: 1rem;"
"\">Menu paths (green)</span> These are the locations of settings and menu "
"items in the KOReader menu system:"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--green-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: 1rem;\">"
"選單路徑（綠色）</span> 這些是 KOReader 選單系統中各設定項與選單項所在的位"
"置："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td.div:1258-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Highlight style"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 劃線樣式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td.p:1263-12
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color: var(--external-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: "
"1rem;\">External apps and services (purple)</span> These are services or "
"applications that work with KOReader. They are marked with a different color "
"because we want to emphasize that <b>these are not a part of KOReader "
"project</b> so they are not under our control:"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color: var(--external-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: "
"1rem;\">外部應用與服務（紫色）</span> 這些是可與 KOReader 配合使用的服務或應"
"用程式。之所以用不同顏色標出，是為了強調<b>它們不屬於 KOReader 項目</b>，因此"
"不受我們控制："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td:1266-43
msgid "Calibre, Readwise, KoHighlights..."
msgstr "Calibre、Readwise、KoHighlights 等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td.p:1272-12
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--internal-link-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: "
"1rem;\">Internal links (teal)</span> These links with a house icon at the "
"end, take you to the other parts of this guide:"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--internal-link-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: "
"1rem;\">內部連結（青色）</span> 這類連結末尾帶有房子圖示，可跳轉到本指南的其"
"他部分："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td:1274-92
msgid "Gestures"
msgstr "手勢"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td.p:1280-12
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--blue-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: 1rem;"
"\">External links (blue)</span> These are regular links that go outside the "
"guide:"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--blue-color); font-weight: bold;font-size: 1rem;\">"
"外部連結（藍色）</span> 這些是指向本指南之外的普通連結："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.table.tr.td:1282-58
msgid "Project Gutenberg"
msgstr "古騰堡計畫"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.p:1291-6
msgid ""
"We also have different boxes and tags in the guide to inform or warn you:"
msgstr "本指南還穿插有不同樣式的註釋欄與標籤，用以提供說明或警示資訊："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div:1293-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> I am a warning "
"box. I explain things when you need to be extra careful."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 這是一條警告註釋"
"欄，用來提醒使用者應當額外謹慎操作的事項。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div:1296-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> I am "
"an info box. I give contextual information or extra explanations."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 這是一"
"條說明註釋欄，用來展示相關背景資訊或補充解釋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div:1299-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> I am a tip box. I "
"contain tips that makes your life easier when using KOReader."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 這是一條提示註釋"
"欄，用來展示讓 KOReader 更便利的操作小技巧。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.p:1302-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced topic\"></span> I am an "
"<b>ADVANCED</b> tag. If you see me on a heading, it means that you need to "
"have a certain degree of technical knowledge like <b>working with a file "
"system, CSS knowledge, installation of external files</b> etc. depending on "
"the procedure."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced topic\"></span> 我是一個<b>"
"進階</b>標籤。如果它出現在某個標題旁，表示你需要具備一定程度的技術知識，例如"
"<b>操作檔案系統、掌握 CSS 知識、安裝外部檔案</b>等，具體取決於操作步驟。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.p:1307-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_highlight\"></span> These stars on the navigation "
"menu show the newly added sections since the last guide update. <b>Also two "
"buttons at the corner of the page with the same stars allow you to jump "
"between newly added sections directly.</b> Note that navigation menu stars "
"don't cover all the additions, smallest headings are omitted there to avoid "
"crowding. But you can see all of the additions using the corner buttons."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_highlight\"></span> 導航選單中的這些星標標示出自上次指"
"南更新以來新增的章節。<b>頁面角落還有兩個帶相同星標的按鈕，可讓你直接在各新增"
"章節之間跳轉。</b>請注意，導航選單中的星標並未覆蓋全部新增內容，為避免擁擠，"
"最小的標題不會標出。但透過角落按鈕可以檢視所有新增內容。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.p:1312-6
msgid ""
"KOReader is developed and supported by volunteers all around the world. You "
"can be a part of this project too by:"
msgstr "KOReader 由來自全世界的志願者開發並提供技術支援。你也可以參與本項目："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.ul.li:1314-7
msgid "Fixing bugs and implementing new features"
msgstr "修正故障及加入新功能"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.ul.li:1315-7
msgid ""
"Translating the program into your language or improving an existing "
"translation"
msgstr "將軟體介面譯為其他語種，或改善現有的翻譯細節"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.ul.li:1316-7
msgid ""
"Helping others with your knowledge in the forums or on GitHub issues and "
"discussions"
msgstr "以你的經驗幫助論壇上和 GitHub 議題區的其他使用者"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.p:1321-6
msgid ""
"Check <a href=\"#L1-reachus\" class=\"internalink\">REACH US</a> section for "
"the links."
msgstr ""
"請查閱<a href=\"#L1-reachus\" class=\"internalink\">聯絡我們</a>區域尋找對應"
"連結。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div:1326-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> Recently we "
"noticed some \"official looking\" KOReader pages on the net which are <b>not "
"a part of our project</b>. We advise you to be careful and only use these "
"official sources for downloading KOReader:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 近來我們發現網上出"
"現一些「看起來像官方」的 KOReader 頁面，它們<b>並不屬於本項目</b>。請務必謹"
"慎，僅透過以下官方來源下載 KOReader："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div.ul.li:1333-8
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://koreader.rocks/\">koreader.rocks</a>: Our official domain "
"which you should see in your address bar right now. <b>Other domains "
"including koreader.com are NOT US!</b>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://koreader.rocks/\">koreader.rocks</a>：我們的官方域名，你現"
"在應該能在位址列中看到它。<b>包括 koreader.com 在內的其他域名都不是我們！</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div.ul.li:1335-8
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader\">KOReader GitHub page</a>: "
"This is where you can download the official releases for all operating "
"systems and devices."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader\">KOReader GitHub 頁面</a>：可"
"在此下載面向所有作業系統與裝置的官方正式版本。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.div.ul.li:1337-8
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://f-droid.org/packages/org.koreader.launcher.fdroid/\">F-"
"Droid release</a>: Android version of KOReader which is provided by us. "
"<b>There is no Play Store version of KOReader!</b>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://f-droid.org/packages/org.koreader.launcher.fdroid/\">F-"
"Droid 版本</a>：由我們提供的 KOReader 安卓版本。<b>KOReader 沒有 Play 商店版"
"本！</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1345-6
msgid "1 WHAT CAN YOU DO WITH KOREADER?"
msgstr "1 KOReader 能做什麼？"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1347-6
msgid ""
"Despite its minimalistic looks, KOReader is a very powerful and customizable "
"application. This section is like a <b>how-to oriented</b> table of "
"contents. So if you are a new user, this is the best place to start. Here "
"you can discover what KOReader can do and learn how to do it by following "
"the links."
msgstr ""
"儘管介面極簡，KOReader 卻是一款功能強大且可高度自訂的軟體。本章節相當於一份"
"<b>以操作為導向</b>的目錄，最適合新使用者作為上手起點。你可以在這裡瞭解 "
"KOReader 能做什麼，並透過連結學習具體操作方法。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1350-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> Name "
"of KOReader comes from the beginnings of the project: <b>K</b>indle/<b>K</"
"b>obo <b>O</b>pen Reader. Of course the reader grew so much over the years, "
"now an accurate abbreviation would be something like <b>KKPRCSALMOReader</b> "
"(Kindle Kobo Pocketbook Remarkable Cervantes Sony Android Linux MacOS Open "
"reader) but this is not that nice to pronounce, so we choose to keep it "
"simple :)"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"KOReader 的名稱來自本項目的起點：<b>K</b>indle/<b>K</b>obo <b>O</b>pen "
"Reader。當然，這款閱讀軟體經過多年發展已經獲得了長足進步，現在更準確的縮寫應"
"該類似 <b>KKPRCSALMOReader</b>（Kindle Kobo Pocketbook Remarkable Cervantes "
"Sony Android Linux MacOS Open reader），不過這個讀起來不太順口，所以我們還是"
"決定簡單點 :-)"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1354-6
msgid "Transfer your reading materials in different ways"
msgstr "用多種方式匯入閱讀材料"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1357-7
msgid ""
"<b>USB mass storage</b> mode for supporting devices <a href=\"#L2-"
"transferring\" class=\"internalink\">Transferring books to your reader</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>USB 大容量儲存裝置</b>（需閱讀裝置支援該功能）<a href=\"#L2-"
"transferring\" class=\"internalink\">將書籍傳輸到閱讀裝置</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1360-7
msgid ""
"<b>Cloud storage</b> (<span class=\"external\">Dropbox</span>/FTP/Webdav) "
"with suitable accounts <a href=\"#L2-transferring\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Transferring books to your reader</a>"
msgstr ""
"用配套帳號登入<b>雲端儲存</b>（<span class=\"external\">Dropbox</span>/FTP/"
"Webdav）上傳下載 <a href=\"#L2-transferring\" class=\"internalink\">將書籍傳"
"輸到閱讀裝置</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1363-7
msgid ""
"KOReader can act as an <b>SSH server</b>, so you can use an SFTP application "
"or your file manager to directly transfer files <a href=\"#L2-pluginslist\" "
"class=\"internalink\">List of internal plugins</a>"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 可作為 <b>SSH 伺服器</b>，使用 SFTP 軟體或檔案瀏覽器傳輸文件 <a "
"href=\"#L2-pluginslist\" class=\"internalink\">內建外掛清單</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1365-7
msgid ""
"With the <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> plugin you can send books "
"from your Calibre Library directly to your KOReader devices over wifi <a "
"href=\"#L2-transferring\" class=\"internalink\">Transferring books to your "
"reader</a>"
msgstr ""
"藉助 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 外掛，可透過 Wi-Fi 直接從 "
"Calibre 書庫將書籍傳送到 KOReader <a href=\"#L2-transferring\" "
"class=\"internalink\">將書籍傳輸到閱讀裝置</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1368-7
msgid ""
"Access public <b>OPDS (Open Publication Distribution System)</b> catalogs or "
"use your own servers to access your library <a href=\"#L2-opdscatalogs\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Using OPDS Catalogs</a>"
msgstr ""
"存取公共<b> OPDS（開放出版發行系統）</b>書目，或使用自己的伺服器存取書庫 <a "
"href=\"#L2-opdscatalogs\" class=\"internalink\">使用 OPDS 書目</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1371-7
msgid ""
"With the <b>News downloader plugin</b> you can download RSS and Atom news "
"entries to your device as HTML files <a href=\"#L2-pluginslist\" "
"class=\"internalink\">List of internal plugins</a>"
msgstr ""
"藉助<b>新聞下載器外掛</b>，你可以將 RSS 及 Atom 的文章以 HTML 檔案格式下載至"
"閱讀裝置 <a href=\"#L2-pluginslist\" class=\"internalink\">內建外掛清單</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1374-7
msgid ""
"With the Wallabag plugin you can retrieve articles from your Wallabag "
"account (a server based read-it-later service like <span "
"class=\"external\">Pocket</span>) <a href=\"#L2-transferring\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Transferring books to your reader</a>"
msgstr ""
"透過 Wallabag 外掛從 Wallabag 帳號中拉取文章（一款自託管的類似 <span "
"class=\"external\">Pocket</span> 的開源稍後閱讀服務）<a href=\"#L2-"
"transferring\" class=\"internalink\">將書籍傳輸到閱讀裝置</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1377-6
msgid "Adjust the appearance of text as you wish"
msgstr "按照個人偏好調整文字樣式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1379-7
msgid ""
"Change fonts (including your own), font size, contrast, boldness, kerning, "
"word spacing, word expansion, text alignment, line spacing, column layout, "
"margins... <a href=\"#L1-formattingyourbook\" "
"class=\"internalink\">FORMATTING YOUR E-BOOK</a>"
msgstr ""
"更換字型（包括使用者自有的字型）、調整字型大小、對比度、粗細、字距微調、文字"
"間距、文字擴展、文字對齊方式、行間距、分欄版式及頁邊距等 <a href=\"#L1-"
"formattingyourbook\" class=\"internalink\">格式化電子書</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1381-7
msgid ""
"Use speed reading plugins like <b>Perception Expander</b> and <b>FastReader "
"(RSVP)</b> for faster reading <a href=\"#L1-readingimprovements\" "
"class=\"internalink\">READING IMPROVEMENTS</a>"
msgstr ""
"藉助 <b>Perception Expander</b>、<b>FastReader (RSVP)</b> 等速讀外掛加快閱讀"
"速度 <a href=\"#L1-readingimprovements\" class=\"internalink\">閱讀體驗改進</"
"a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1385-7
msgid ""
"Use the included powerful <span class=\"ui\">style tweaks</span> or write "
"your own ones to change how your books are rendered precisely <a href=\"#L2-"
"styletweaks\" class=\"internalink\">Style tweaks</a>"
msgstr ""
"使用功能強大的內建<span class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>工具或自行編寫樣式，可實"
"現對書籍渲染樣式的精確控制 <a href=\"#L2-styletweaks\" class=\"internalink\">"
"樣式微調</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1388-7
msgid ""
"Invert screen colors for <span class=\"ui\">night mode</span> manually or "
"automatically <a href=\"#L2-autowarmth\" class=\"internalink\">Auto Warmth "
"And Night Mode</a>"
msgstr ""
"手動或自動開啟<span class=\"ui\">夜間模式</span>，翻轉螢幕顏色 <a href=\"#L2-"
"autowarmth\" class=\"internalink\">自動暖度與夜間模式</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1391-7
msgid ""
"Adjust your frontlight color warmth automatically <a href=\"#L2-autowarmth\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Auto Warmth And Night Mode</a>"
msgstr ""
"自動調整你的前光暖度 <a href=\"#L2-autowarmth\" class=\"internalink\">自動暖"
"度與夜間模式</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1394-6
msgid "Take notes and make highlights while reading"
msgstr "閱讀時做筆記和劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1396-7
msgid ""
"Highlight text with different styles and colors, place bookmarks <a "
"href=\"#L1-annotating\" class=\"internalink\">BOOKMARKS, HIGHLIGHTS AND "
"NOTES</a>"
msgstr ""
"用不同的樣式和顏色劃線標註文段、新增書籤 <a href=\"#L1-annotating\" "
"class=\"internalink\">書籤、劃線與筆記</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1398-7
msgid ""
"Two-tap mode for academic/longer highlights <a href=\"#L2-howtohighlight\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Highlight modes of KOReader</a>"
msgstr ""
"適用於學術或長文段劃線的雙擊模式 <a href=\"#L2-howtohighlight\" "
"class=\"internalink\">KOReader 的劃線模式</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1400-7
msgid ""
"Add notes using a customizable keyboard including diacritic modifiers <a "
"href=\"#L2-keyboard\" class=\"internalink\">Keyboard Usage And Tips</a>"
msgstr ""
"使用可自訂的帶拼音符號鍵盤撰寫筆記 <a href=\"#L2-keyboard\" "
"class=\"internalink\">鍵盤用法與技巧</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1402-7
msgid ""
"Take screenshots <a href=\"#L2-predefinedgestures\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Predefined Gestures</a>"
msgstr ""
"擷取螢幕快照 <a href=\"#L2-predefinedgestures\" class=\"internalink\">內建手"
"勢</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1404-7
msgid ""
"Track your reading statistics including <b>reading progress</b>, <b>time "
"range</b> and <b>calendar views</b>"
msgstr ""
"記錄你的閱讀資料，包括<b>閱讀進度</b>、<b>時間跨度</b>與<b>日曆檢視</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1408-6
msgid "Export your notes and highlights flexibly"
msgstr "隨心所欲地匯出筆記和劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1410-7
msgid ""
"Export your notes and highlights to your device as text, markdown, HTML, "
"JSON or Kindle clippings format <a href=\"#L2-exportinghighlights\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Exporting highlights</a>"
msgstr ""
"將筆記和劃線標註以純文字、Markdown、HTML、JSON 或 Kindle 筆記與摘錄格式匯出 "
"<a href=\"#L2-exportinghighlights\" class=\"internalink\">匯出劃線</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1412-7
msgid ""
"Synchronize to online services like <span class=\"external\">Joplin</span>, "
"<span class=\"external\">Readwise</span>, <span class=\"external\">Memos</"
"span>, <span class=\"external\">Flomo</span> and <span "
"class=\"external\">XMNote</span> <a href=\"#L2-exportinghighlights\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Exporting highlights</a>"
msgstr ""
"同步至線上服務，例如 <span class=\"external\">Joplin</span>、<span "
"class=\"external\">Readwise</span>、<span class=\"external\">Memos</span>、"
"<span class=\"external\">Flomo</span> 和 <span class=\"external\">XMNote</"
"span> <a href=\"#L2-exportinghighlights\" class=\"internalink\">匯出劃線</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1417-6
msgid "Arrange and browse your library easily"
msgstr "輕鬆整理和瀏覽個人藏書庫"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1419-7
msgid ""
"Powerful <b>File Browser</b> where you can copy, move, rename, create, "
"delete files and folders and perform bulk operations <a href=\"#L2-"
"filebrowser\" class=\"internalink\">File Browser Usage</a>"
msgstr ""
"強大的<b>檔案瀏覽器</b>，你可在其中複製、移動、重新命名、建立、刪除檔案和資料"
"夾以及執行批次操作 <a href=\"#L2-filebrowser\" class=\"internalink\">檔案瀏覽"
"器用法</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1422-7
msgid ""
"See your library as you like with many detailed and mosaic views <a "
"href=\"#L2-filebrowser\" class=\"internalink\">File Browser Usage</a>"
msgstr ""
"以你喜歡的方式瀏覽書庫，支援多種詳情檢視與馬賽克檢視 <a href=\"#L2-"
"filebrowser\" class=\"internalink\">檔案瀏覽器用法</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1424-7
msgid ""
"Add your books to your <span class=\"ui\">Favorites</span> for quick access "
"or create your own <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> with sorting and "
"filtering <a href=\"#L2-collections\" class=\"internalink\">Collections</a>"
msgstr ""
"將書籍新增到<span class=\"ui\">最愛</span>以便快速存取，或建立<span "
"class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>對書籍排序和篩選 <a href=\"#L2-collections\" "
"class=\"internalink\">收藏清單</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1429-6
msgid "Fly through your book with powerful tools"
msgstr "使用強大的工具快速翻頁你的書籍"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1431-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Skim widget</span> to quickly jump between pages, "
"chapters, bookmarks <a href=\"#L2-skimwidget\" class=\"internalink\">Skim "
"Widget</a>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>可在頁面、章節和書籤之間快速跳轉 <a "
"href=\"#L2-skimwidget\" class=\"internalink\">快速翻頁工具</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1434-7
msgid ""
"Unique <span class=\"ui\">Book map</span> to see a bird’s eye map of your "
"book including all your notes and highlights <a href=\"#L2-bookmap\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Book Map</a>"
msgstr ""
"藉助<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖</span>功能，可縱覽全書鳥瞰圖，一覽所有筆記與"
"劃線標註 <a href=\"#L2-bookmap\" class=\"internalink\">書籍地圖</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1437-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> to move through pages like a film "
"reel <a href=\"#L2-pagebrowser\" class=\"internalink\">Page Browser</a>"
msgstr ""
"藉助<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>功能，可像翻閱膠片般流暢切換和預覽頁"
"面 <a href=\"#L2-pagebrowser\" class=\"internalink\">頁面瀏覽器</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1440-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks browser</span> to browse your highlights and "
"notes easily <a href=\"#L1-annotating\" class=\"internalink\">BOOKMARKS, "
"HIGHLIGHTS AND NOTES</a>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">書籤瀏覽器</span>可輕鬆瀏覽劃線標註及閱讀筆記 <a "
"href=\"#L1-annotating\" class=\"internalink\">書籤、劃線與筆記</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1443-7
msgid ""
"Create an alternative table of contents automatically or manually if you "
"don't like the one that comes with your book <a href=\"#L2-toctools\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Table of Contents Tools</a>"
msgstr ""
"如果不滿意書籍內建目錄，可自動或手動建立替代性目錄進行替代 <a href=\"#L2-"
"toctools\" class=\"internalink\">目錄工具</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1445-7
msgid ""
"Hide and exclude certain parts of your book like <b>Appendix, Index, "
"References</b> etc. for more accurate page counts <a href=\"#L2-"
"hiddenflows\" class=\"internalink\">Excluding sections: Custom hidden flows</"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"隱藏並排除書籍中的特定部分，例如<b>附錄、索引、參考文獻</b>等，以獲得更準確的"
"頁數統計 <a href=\"#L2-hiddenflows\" class=\"internalink\">排除章節：自訂隱藏"
"頁</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1449-6
msgid "Control KOReader like a virtuoso"
msgstr "玩轉 KOReader"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1451-7
msgid ""
"Powerful <b>gesture system</b> with 200+ actions allows you to control every "
"aspect of KOReader with a tap or swipe <a href=\"#L2-gesturecategories\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Gesture Categories</a>"
msgstr ""
"強大的<b>手勢系統</b>內建 200 餘項操作命令，點擊、滑動即可控制 KOReader 各項"
"功能 <a href=\"#L2-gesturecategories\" class=\"internalink\">手勢分類</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1454-7
msgid ""
"If you have a keyboard (internal, wired or bluetooth) you can also assign "
"keyboard shortcuts to these actions <a href=\"#L2-keyboardshortcuts\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Keyboard Shortcuts</a>"
msgstr ""
"若配備鍵盤（內建、有線或藍牙），你還可為上述操作分配鍵盤快速鍵 <a href=\"#L2-"
"keyboardshortcuts\" class=\"internalink\">快速鍵</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1456-7
msgid ""
"Or create your own menus with your favorite actions with <span "
"class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span> and access them with a tap or swipe <a "
"href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" class=\"internalink\">Quick Menu</a>"
msgstr ""
"你可以透過<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>自訂專屬選單，新增常用操作，點擊"
"或滑動即可隨時叫出 <a href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" class=\"internalink\">快速選單</"
"a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1459-7
msgid ""
"Create <b>Profiles</b> to control every aspect of KOReader and automate "
"actions <a href=\"#L2-profiles\" class=\"internalink\">Profiles</a>"
msgstr ""
"透過建立<b>設定檔</b>，可全面控制 KOReader 各項功能並實現操作自動化 <a "
"href=\"#L2-profiles\" class=\"internalink\">設定檔</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1463-6
msgid "Search, Lookup and Translation tools"
msgstr "搜尋、查閱和翻譯工具"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1465-7
msgid ""
"Search the document by selecting or entering text (including <b>regular "
"expressions</b>)"
msgstr "透過選取文字或手動輸入來檢索書籍（支援<b>正規表示式</b>）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1466-7
msgid "Search in your bookmarks, highlights and notes"
msgstr "在書籤、劃線及筆記中檢索"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1467-7
msgid ""
"Lookup text in <span class=\"external\">Wikipedia</span> or in installed "
"dictionaries and translate it by a long-tap"
msgstr ""
"長按文字即可在<span class=\"external\">維基百科</span>或已安裝字典中查詢，並"
"進行翻譯"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1469-7
msgid ""
"Translate parts of the text or the whole page between more than 130 languages"
msgstr "將選取文字或整頁內容譯為多達 130 種語言"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1470-7
msgid ""
"Discuss, translate or explain the text using online or local AI models "
"(after installing the plugins) <a href=\"#L2-plugintypes\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Plugin types</a>"
msgstr ""
"使用線上或本地 AI 模型討論、翻譯或解釋文字內容（需先安裝相應外掛） <a "
"href=\"#L2-plugintypes\" class=\"internalink\">外掛種類</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1473-6
msgid "KOReader can control your device"
msgstr "KOReader 可以控制你的裝置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1475-7
msgid ""
"KOReader can update itself <a href=\"#L2-devicetips\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Device Tips</a>"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 可自動更新 <a href=\"#L2-devicetips\" class=\"internalink\">裝置相關"
"技巧</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1476-7
msgid "Dim or turn off your <b>screen light</b> after a set interval"
msgstr "在設定的時間間隔後調暗或關閉<b>螢幕亮度</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1478-7
msgid ""
"Set your page refresh intervals for different reading conditions <a "
"href=\"#L2-mangarefresh\" class=\"internalink\">Adjusting the page refresh "
"interval</a>"
msgstr ""
"為不同的閱讀場景設定獨立的頁面重新整理頻率 <a href=\"#L2-mangarefresh\" "
"class=\"internalink\">調整頁面重新整理間隔</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1479-7
msgid ""
"Set your own <b>sleep screen</b> from many options like random images, book "
"cover, reading, progress and even a screenshot of a picture in a book."
msgstr ""
"可用隨機圖片、書籍封面、閱讀進度甚至書中插圖的截圖等多種選項來設定自己的<b>螢"
"幕保護</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1481-7
msgid ""
"Set battery <b>charge limit alarms</b> to prevent deep discharge/over charge "
"<a href=\"#L2-devicetips\" class=\"internalink\">Device Tips</a>"
msgstr ""
"設定電量<b>充電限制提醒</b>，防止深度放電與過度充電 <a href=\"#L2-"
"devicetips\" class=\"internalink\">裝置相關技巧</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1483-7
msgid ""
"Set a memory usage alert (useful for devices for smaller memory) and "
"optionally restart KOReader upon reaching this limit <a href=\"#L2-"
"devicetips\" class=\"internalink\">Device Tips</a>"
msgstr ""
"設定記憶體用量提醒或在到達限制時選擇性重啟 KOReader 程式（這對於記憶體較小的"
"裝置十分有用）<a href=\"#L2-devicetips\" class=\"internalink\">裝置相關技巧</"
"a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1486-6
msgid "PDF documents are easier to read on e-ink with KOReader"
msgstr "KOReader 讓 PDF 文件在電子墨水螢幕上閱讀體驗更佳"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1488-7
msgid "Crop margins automatically or manually"
msgstr "自動或手動裁剪頁邊空白"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1490-7
msgid ""
"<b>Reflow</b> documents to extract text and read easier on a small screen"
msgstr "<b>重排文件</b>以提取文字，以便在小螢幕上更輕鬆閱讀"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1493-7
msgid ""
"Apply <b>OCR</b> to documents without text layers, like scanned old books <a "
"href=\"#L2-ocr\" class=\"internalink\">OCR (Optical Character Recognition)</"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"對不包含文字層的 PDF 文件（如舊書掃描件）進行 <b>OCR</b> 識別 <a href=\"#L2-"
"ocr\" class=\"internalink\">OCR（光學字元識別）</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1496-7
msgid ""
"Different zoom types and page flow directions to read <b>multi-column "
"documents</b> like scientific articles easily <a href=\"#L2-readingpdfs\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Reading large PDFs on a small screen</a>"
msgstr ""
"支援多種頁面縮放方式及翻頁方向，讓學術文獻等<b>分欄文件</b>更容易閱讀 <a "
"href=\"#L2-readingpdfs\" class=\"internalink\">在小螢幕上閱讀大尺寸 PDF</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1499-7
msgid ""
"Auto straighten tilted documents, like scanned old books <a href=\"#L2-"
"pdfbottom\" class=\"internalink\">PDF Specific Bottom Menu Items</a>"
msgstr ""
"自動校正文件傾斜（比如舊書掃描件）<a href=\"#L2-pdfbottom\" "
"class=\"internalink\">PDF 文件專有底部選單項</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1501-7
msgid ""
"Save your highlights directly into PDFs which allows you to see them without "
"KOReader <a href=\"#L2-savepdfhighlights\" class=\"internalink\">Saving "
"highlights into PDF</a>"
msgstr ""
"將劃線標註匯出為 PDF 檔案，以便在 KOReader 以外的環境中瀏覽 <a href=\"#L2-"
"savepdfhighlights\" class=\"internalink\">將劃線標註儲存到 PDF</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1503-7
msgid ""
"Import highlights from PDFs and export them in many other formats <a "
"href=\"#L2-importpdfhighlights\" class=\"internalink\">Importing PDF "
"Highlights</a>"
msgstr ""
"從 PDF 匯入劃線標註，並匯出為多種其他格式 <a href=\"#L2-"
"importpdfhighlights\" class=\"internalink\">匯入 PDF 劃線</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1505-7
msgid ""
"Special <b>Panel zoom</b> feature for reading mangas <a href=\"#L2-"
"panelzoom\" class=\"internalink\">Panel zoom feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"針對漫畫閱讀的<b>分格縮放</b>功能 <a href=\"#L2-panelzoom\" "
"class=\"internalink\">面板縮放功能</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1508-7
msgid ""
"Adjustable screen refresh settings for perfectly balancing between ghosting "
"and speed <a href=\"#L2-mangarefresh\" class=\"internalink\">Adjusting the "
"page refresh interval</a>"
msgstr ""
"可調整的頁面重新整理設定，實現殘影與翻頁速度的完美平衡 <a href=\"#L2-"
"mangarefresh\" class=\"internalink\">調整頁面重新整理間隔</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1511-6
msgid "Advanced features for power users"
msgstr "面向硬核使用者的高階功能"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1513-7
msgid ""
"Add your own <b>CSS style tweaks</b> for books <a href=\"#L2-styletweaks\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Style tweaks</a>"
msgstr ""
"為書籍新增你自己的 <b>CSS 樣式微調</b> <a href=\"#L2-styletweaks\" "
"class=\"internalink\">樣式微調</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1516-7
msgid ""
"<b>User patches</b> system which allows you to change the core behaviors of "
"KOReader <a href=\"#L2-userpatches\" class=\"internalink\">User patches</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>使用者補丁</b>允許使用者改變 KOReader 的系統執行機制 <a href=\"#L2-"
"userpatches\" class=\"internalink\">使用者補丁</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1519-7
msgid ""
"Create a <b>QR code</b> from your clipboard to share text and links to other "
"devices"
msgstr "在剪貼簿中生成<b> QR 碼</b>以向其他裝置分享文字和連結"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1522-7
msgid "View HTML source of an EPUB document"
msgstr "檢視 EPUB 文件的 HTML 原始碼"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1524-7
msgid "Create and edit text files on your device"
msgstr "在閱讀裝置上建立及編輯純文字檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1526-7
msgid "Open a terminal emulator and run commands on your device"
msgstr "開啟終端模擬器並在閱讀裝置上執行命令列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1528-7
msgid "See your CPU, memory and battery usage stats"
msgstr "檢視 CPU、記憶體和電池的使用資料"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1537-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-basicusage"
msgid "2 BASIC USAGE"
msgstr "2 基本用法"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1539-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-transferring"
msgid "2.1 Transferring Documents"
msgstr "2.1 傳輸檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1541-6
msgid ""
"KOReader supports <b>PDF/PDB/XPS, EPUB/MOBI/FB2, DJVU, CBR/CBT/CBZ, DOCX/"
"RTF, HTML/HTMLZ, TXT/MD and CHM</b> files. It can also open <b>ZIP</b> "
"archives and show image files."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 支援 <b>PDF/PDB/XPS，EPUB/MOBI/FB2，DJVU，CBR/CBT/CBZ，DOCX/RTF，"
"HTML/HTMLZ，TXT/MD 和 CHM</b> 等格式的檔案，還可開啟 <b>ZIP</b> 壓縮檔並顯示"
"圖片檔案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1545-6
msgid ""
"There are many ways to transfer your documents to your device. Note that you "
"may need to restart KOReader to index the transferred documents (or refresh "
"directory if you have Pocketbook/Android)."
msgstr ""
"有許多方法可以將書籍傳輸到閱讀裝置。請注意，KOReader 可能需要重啟（如果是在 "
"Pocketbook/Android 上則是重新整理目錄）以完成對新傳輸檔案的索引。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1547-6
msgid ""
"In addition to transferring files the same way you would with the built-in "
"reader application, other options are available depending on your device:"
msgstr ""
"除了以與內建閱讀器應用程式相同的方式傳輸檔案外，根據你的裝置不同，還有其他選"
"項可供選擇："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1550-7
msgid ""
"<b>USB mass storage mode within KOReader:</b> This mode is available for "
"KOBO and some CERVANTES devices."
msgstr ""
"<b>KOReader 內建的 USB 大容量儲存模式</b>：KOBO 及部分 CERVANTES 型號支援該功"
"能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1553-7
msgid ""
"<b>Cloud storage (<span class=\"external\">Dropbox</span>/FTP/Webdav):</b> "
"To use this function you have to add accounts for a cloud storage server via "
"menu shown below. Process is explained via <span class=\"ui\">info</span> "
"buttons in the menu while adding accounts:"
msgstr ""
"<b>雲端儲存（<span class=\"external\">Dropbox</span>/FTP/Webdav）</b>：使用該"
"功能前，須透過下方展示的選單項登入雲服務帳號。詳細操作步驟可在新增帳號時點擊"
"選單中的<span class=\"ui\">說明</span>按鈕檢視："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:1557-7
msgid ""
"TOP MENU (in File Browser) / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_tools.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / Cloud storage"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器中的）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_tools.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / 雲端儲存"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1560-7
msgid ""
"<b>SSH/SFTP access:</b> KOReader can act like an <b>SSH server</b>, which "
"you can access from a computer to transfer files (available on Kobo, Kindle, "
"Cervantes). You can use an SFTP application (like <span "
"class=\"external\">Filezilla</span>) or access via your file manager if your "
"operating system supports. Check our <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/"
"koreader/wiki/SSH\">wiki</a> for how-to and also see the warning box below."
msgstr ""
"<b>SSH/SFTP 存取</b>：KOReader 可作為<b> SSH 伺服器</b>，以便使用電腦傳輸文件"
"（該功能支援 Kobo、Kindle、Cervantes 的閱讀器）請使用 SFTP 軟體（如 <span "
"class=\"external\">Filezilla</span>）或檔案瀏覽器（部分作業系統內建）請查閱"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/SSH\">維基頁面</a>瞭解具"
"體操作流程；另請注意下方的警告註釋欄內容。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1564-7
msgid ""
"<b>Calibre transfer:</b> With the <span class=\"external\">Calibre plugin</"
"span> you can send documents from your Calibre Library directly to your "
"KOReader devices via a wifi connection. Check our <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/calibre\">wiki</a> for how-to."
msgstr ""
"<b>Calibre 傳輸</b>：藉助 <span class=\"external\">Calibre 外掛</span>，可透"
"過 Wi-Fi 直接從 Calibre 書庫將書籍傳送到 KOReader 中。請查閱<a "
"href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/calibre\">維基頁面</a>瞭解操"
"作方法。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1569-7
msgid ""
"<b>News downloader:</b> With this plugin you can download <b>RSS and Atom</"
"b> news entries as HTML files. Check <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/"
"koreader/wiki/News-downloader\">wiki</a> for how-to."
msgstr ""
"<b>新聞下載器</b>：該外掛可以 HTML 格式下載 <b>RSS 及 Atom 訂閱源</b>提供的文"
"章。請查閱<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/News-"
"downloader\">維基頁面</a>瞭解操作方法。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1574-7
msgid ""
"<b>OPDS (Open Publication Distribution System) catalogs:</b> You can access "
"public catalogs or use your own servers to access your library. More info "
"here: <a href=\"#L2-opdscatalogs\" class=\"internalink\">Using OPDS "
"Catalogs</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>OPDS（開放出版發行系統）書目</b>：你可以存取公共書目，或使用自己的伺服器存"
"取書庫。更多資訊見 <a href=\"#L2-opdscatalogs\" class=\"internalink\">使用 "
"OPDS 書目</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1577-7
msgid ""
"<b>Wallabag:</b> With this plugin you can retrieve articles from <span "
"class=\"external\">Wallabag</span>, a server based read-it-later service "
"like Pocket. Check <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/"
"Wallabag\">wiki</a> page for more info."
msgstr ""
"<b>Wallabag</b>：此外掛可以從 <span class=\"external\">Wallabag</span> 中拉取"
"文章，這是一款自託管的類 Pocket 稍後閱讀軟體。請查閱<a href=\"https://"
"github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/Wallabag\">維基頁面</a>瞭解更多資訊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1582-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> Be careful if you "
"decide to use the SSH feature without a password, because this allows open "
"access to your device. But if you are using a local wifi and turn on your "
"device wifi for a short time, this risk is negligible."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 在不設定密碼的情況"
"下使用 SSH 功能應當額外謹慎，因為這將使閱讀裝置可被公開存取。不過如果只是臨時"
"開啟裝置 Wi-Fi 且接入的是家庭 Wi-Fi 網路，這個風險是可以忽略的。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1585-6
msgid "Accessing your books"
msgstr "開啟書籍"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1587-6
msgid "Following methods are available for accessing your books:"
msgstr "可以從下列途徑開啟匯入的書籍："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1589-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> - Dedicated section is here: <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">File Browser usage</a>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span> - 可點擊<a class=\"internalink\" "
"href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">檔案瀏覽器用法</a>檢視詳細操作方式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1591-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Favorites</span> - A list which you can add your books by "
"long pressing on them in the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">最愛</span> - 由使用者選定書籍組成的清單，可在<span "
"class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中長按書籍新增"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1593-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">History</span> - List of books you opened"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span> - 曾經開啟過的書"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1595-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> - Personalized book lists you created. "
"Dedicated section is here: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"collections\">Collections</a>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span> - 由使用者自行建立的書籍清單。請點擊<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-collections\">收藏清單</a>詳細瞭解"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1599-6
msgid "You can change how these screens look from:"
msgstr "若要改變書籍呈現方式，請按照如下路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1601-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU (in File Browser) / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / Display mode"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器中的）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / 書籍陳列方式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1604-6
msgid ""
"If you want to change how many items are visible on these screens, look here:"
msgstr "若想調整這些螢幕上顯示的項目數量，請在此處設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1606-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU (in File Browser) / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Mosaic and detailed "
"list settings"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器中的）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 陳列參數設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1609-6
msgid ""
"You can assign gestures for each of these dialogs. For example while reading "
"a book, you can access your <span class=\"ui\">History</span> or <span "
"class=\"ui\">Favorites</span> with a gesture and open another book without "
"going through the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>."
msgstr ""
"每個對話方塊可指定專屬呼出手勢。例如在閱讀過程中可使用手勢喚出<span "
"class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span>或者<span class=\"ui\">最愛</span>視窗來開啟另一"
"本書，無需開啟<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1612-6
msgid ""
"You can search a book in the <span class=\"ui\">History</span> screen by "
"<b>filename</b> or <b>book metadata</b> from the upper left hamburger menu "
"button."
msgstr ""
"在<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span>介面點擊左上角的漢堡狀選單鍵，可以按照<b>"
"檔名</b>或<b>書籍元資料</b>檢索書籍。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1616-6
msgid ""
"You can also set KOReader to start with <span class=\"ui\">Favorites</span> "
"or <span class=\"ui\">History</span> screen instead of <span "
"class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> via:"
msgstr ""
"還可將<span class=\"ui\">最愛</span>或者<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span>視"
"窗設定為 KOReader 起始畫面，代替預設的<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>。"
"請按如下路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1621-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU (in File Browser) / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / Start with"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器中的）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> / 啟動後起始畫面顯示"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1624-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-tapzones"
msgid "2.2 Tap Zones"
msgstr "2.2 點擊區域"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1628-6
msgid ""
"In the image above, you can see the positions of the default tap zones of "
"KOReader. To show the <span class=\"ui\">top menu</span> or <span "
"class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span> you can tap the indicated zones. You can "
"also swipe down the upper zone to show the <span class=\"ui\">top menu</"
"span>. On non-touch devices like Kindle 4 you can open the <span "
"class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span> by pressing the button that corresponds to "
"the <b>ENTER/OK</b> action."
msgstr ""
"下方的圖片展示了 KOReader 的預設點擊區域功能劃分；請點擊螢幕上的對應區域呼出"
"<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>或者<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>。"
"<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>也可透過從螢幕上端下滑來呼出。在非觸控式螢"
"幕閱讀裝置上（如 Kindle 4），<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>可透過按動<b>"
"確認鍵</b>呼出。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1634-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> As indicated in "
"the image above, <span class=\"ui\">top menu</span> opening zone is divided "
"into 3 areas. If you swipe down the first 1/3 of the top edge, <span "
"class=\"ui\">top menu</span> opens with the <b>first menu tab</b>. Second "
"1/3 area opens the <b>most recently used menu tab</b>. And last area opens "
"the <b>last menu tab</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 如上圖所示，<span "
"class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>觸發區域被劃為三部分。當從最左邊區域下滑時，將直"
"接顯示<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>的<b>第一頁</b>； 從最右邊區域下滑"
"時，將直接顯示<b>最後一頁</b>；當從中間區域下滑時，將直接顯示<b>上次使用過的"
"頂部選單頁</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1639-6
msgid ""
"If you want top open both menus at the same time, you can set <span "
"class=\"ui\">top menu</span> zone to open both the <span class=\"ui\">top</"
"span> and <span class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span> at the same time via this "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"若要在點擊<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>區域時同時呼出<span class=\"ui\">"
"頂部選單</span>及<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>，請按照下方所示選單項設"
"定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1644-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and Gestures / Activate Menu"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 啟動選單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1647-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Corner tap zones</span> can be used for many different "
"type of gestures including <b>TAP, DOUBLE TAP, TWO FINGER TAP</b> and <b>TAP "
"and HOLD</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">四角觸控區</span>可用於多種手勢，如<b>點擊、雙擊、雙指點擊"
"</b>以及<b>長按</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1651-6
msgid ""
"<b>PREVIOUS PAGE</b> and <b>NEXT PAGE</b> zones can also be used for "
"<b>DOUBLE TAP</b> gestures at the same time."
msgstr "另外，<b>前一頁</b>和<b>後一頁</b>觸控區還支援<b>雙擊</b>手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1656-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Status bar</span> zone can be tapped to cycle between the "
"<span class=\"ui\">status bar</span> items if <b>only one item is visible</"
"b>. If all items are visible, tapping will show and hide the <span "
"class=\"ui\">status bar</span>."
msgstr ""
"在<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>觸控區點擊時，若<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</"
"span>設定為<b>僅顯示一項</b>，則會循環切換各項目；若顯示所有項目，點擊將使"
"<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>顯示或隱藏。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1660-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-textappearance"
msgid "2.3 Changing Basic Settings"
msgstr "2.3 更改基本設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1662-6
msgid ""
"These are just a few quick settings to get you started. Please read the <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-formattingyourbook\">FORMATTING YOUR E-"
"BOOK</a> section of the guide for a detailed walkthrough. You can learn more "
"about the <span class=\"ui\">Bottom Menu</span> which is mostly used to "
"adjust text, from here: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"bottomexplained\">Bottom Menu Items</a>"
msgstr ""
"這裡只列出幾項幫助你快速上手的設定。詳細的分步講解請參閱指南的 <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-formattingyourbook\">格式化電子書</a> 章節。"
"主要用於調整文字的 <span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span> 的更多內容，可參見：<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-bottomexplained\">底部選單項</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td:1673-9
msgid "Change the font*"
msgstr "更改字型*"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td.div:1674-13
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.div.table.tr.td.div:139-12"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Font"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td:1679-9
msgid "Adjust text size"
msgstr "調整字型大小"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td.div:1680-13
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.div.table.tr.td.div:145-12"
msgid "BOTTOM MENU /"
msgstr "底部選單 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td:1684-9
msgid "Make text darker"
msgstr "加深文字顏色"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td.div:1685-13
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.div.table.tr.td.div:150-12"
msgid "BOTTOM MENU /"
msgstr "底部選單 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td:1691-9
msgid "Invert the colors on screen (white on black text)"
msgstr "反轉螢幕顏色（顯示為黑底白字）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.table.tr.td.div:1692-13
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Night Mode"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 夜間模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1698-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> *Font "
"selection is only available on reflowable documents (EPUB, HTML, DOCX, RTF, "
"TXT…). Fixed-layout documents like PDF/DJVU are not supported."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> *字型"
"選擇功能僅適用於可重排文件（如 EPUB、HTML、DOCX、RTF、TXT）；不支援 PDF 和 "
"DJVU 等固定版式文件。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1701-6
msgid "Controlling the backlight / frontlight"
msgstr "控制背光或前光"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1703-6
msgid ""
"You can control your screen light via this menu. If you have warm lighting "
"(normal white LEDs+orange ones) you can control them separately from this "
"dialog. You can also define a gesture for this dialog:"
msgstr ""
"此選單可控制螢幕燈光。若裝置配備有暖光燈（普通白色 LED 燈混合橙色 LED 燈而"
"成），可在此處分別控制兩種燈光。若要指定呼出本對話方塊的手勢，請按如下路徑操"
"作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1705-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Frontlight"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 前光設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1708-6
msgid "Changing the screen displayed while sleeping"
msgstr "變更裝置休眠時的螢幕顯示"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1710-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> Sleep "
"screen customization is only available on <b>Cervantes, Kobo, Kindle</b> and "
"<b>Remarkable</b> devices. On <b>Pocketbook, Android, Linux</b> and "
"<b>MacOS</b>, this feature is not supported."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 自訂螢"
"幕保護功能僅適用於 <b>Cervantes、Kobo、Kindle</b> 和 <b>Remarkable</b> 裝置；"
"在 <b>Pocketbook、Android、Linux</b> 和 <b>MacOS</b> 上不支援此功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1716-6
msgid ""
"You can choose a book cover or a custom image as sleep screen via this menu:"
msgstr "可透過以下選單將書籍封面或自訂圖片設定為螢幕保護："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1718-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Screen / Sleep screen"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕 / 螢幕保護"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1721-6
msgid ""
"You can use JPG/PNG files as wallpaper (properly dithered grayscale images "
"look best). Transfer the files from your computer into any folder on your "
"device. And choose this folder as your sleep screen wallpaper folder via "
"this menu:"
msgstr ""
"可將 JPG/PNG 圖片用作桌布（經過適當抖動處理的灰階圖片效果最佳）。將圖片檔案從"
"電腦匯入閱讀裝置的任意資料夾，再透過以下選單將該資料夾指定為螢幕保護桌布資料"
"夾："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1723-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Screen / Sleep screen / Wallpaper / Custom images"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕 / 螢幕保護 / 桌布 / 自訂圖片"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1726-6
msgid ""
"Please refer to this <a href=\"https://www.mobileread.com/forums/"
"showpost.php?p=3728291&postcount=17\">Mobileread forum post</a> for advanced "
"information about preparing sleep screen images."
msgstr ""
"更多關於製作螢幕保護圖片的專業資訊，請參閱這則<a href=\"https://"
"www.mobileread.com/forums/showpost.php?p=3728291&postcount=17\">Mobileread 論"
"壇主題帖</a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1729-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-keyboard"
msgid "2.4 Keyboard Usage"
msgstr "2.4 鍵盤用法"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1731-6
msgid ""
"If you are looking for information about <span class=\"ui\">keyboard "
"shortcuts</span>, click <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"keyboardshortcuts\">here</a> to go that section. This heading only explains "
"the keyboard usage."
msgstr ""
"此處僅展示鍵盤基本用法；若要檢視<span class=\"ui\">鍵盤快速鍵</span>相關資"
"訊，請點擊<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-keyboardshortcuts\">此處</a>前"
"往對應章節。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1735-7
msgid ""
"Tap outside the input field to close the keyboard, tap the input field to "
"show the keyboard again"
msgstr "點擊輸入框以外的區域關閉鍵盤；點擊輸入框再次呼出鍵盤"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1736-7
msgid ""
"<b>Swipe up</b> keys to enter uppercase version of that letter (or lowercase "
"if you are already in <b>shift</b> mode)"
msgstr ""
"對字母按鍵<b>上滑</b>輸入對應大寫字母（如已按下 <b>Shift</b> 鍵則為輸入對應小"
"寫字母）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1739-7
msgid "You can change the appearance of the keyboard:"
msgstr "若要改變鍵盤樣式，請按照下方路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:1740-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Device / Keyboard / Keyboard settings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 裝置相關/ 鍵盤 / 鍵盤設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1742-7
msgid "You can select more than one layout:"
msgstr "KOReader 提供多種鍵盤佈局："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:1743-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Device / Keyboard / Keyboard layout"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 裝置相關 / 鍵盤 / 鍵盤佈局"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1745-7
msgid ""
"You can change between your selected layouts by tapping the <img "
"loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/keyboard_world.png\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> icon on the keyboard"
msgstr ""
"點擊鍵盤上的<img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"keyboard_world.png\" style=\"width:22px;\">圖示即可切換鍵盤佈局"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1749-6
msgid "Entering extra characters"
msgstr "特殊符號的輸入"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1751-6
msgid ""
"Koreader keyboard allows entering extra characters when you tap and hold a "
"key. Most frequently used extra characters are shown below. You can tap and "
"hold the key in the <b>gray box</b> to get the surrounding characters:"
msgstr ""
"長按鍵盤按鍵可輸入特殊字元；常用特殊字元如下圖所示。長按某個數字鍵（圖上的<b>"
"灰色框</b>）以鍵入其周圍的字元："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1756-6
msgid ""
"In addition to the long-press popup, you can also enter these extra "
"characters by swiping on a key. In the example below, you can swipe up on "
"the <b>a</b> key to enter an <b>uppercase A</b> or swipe other directions to "
"enter the characters shown. Note that the example shown includes the full "
"popup for demonstration. You don’t need to open this popup, you can directly "
"swipe on the keys. Once you get used to the locations of the extra "
"characters, you can enter them much quicker this way."
msgstr ""
"除了長按鍵盤按鍵彈出的特殊字元視窗外，還可透過在按鍵上滑動輸入特殊字元。如下"
"方圖示，在字母 <b>a</b> 按鍵向其他方向滑動，可輸入對應字元（如上滑輸入大寫字"
"母 <b>A</b>）。請注意圖中的完整特殊字元視窗僅供演示，在滑動時不必等待視窗彈出"
"即可完成輸入。熟悉特殊字元的位置排布之後，滑動輸入會讓打字非常迅速。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1762-6
msgid ""
"If this feature interferes with your usage, you can disable it by unchecking:"
msgstr "若該功能影響正常鍵入，可透過取消下列選項來停用："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1764-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\">/ Device / Keyboard / Swipe to input additional "
"characters"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\">/ 裝置相關 / 鍵盤 / 滑動輸入特殊字元"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1766-6
msgid ""
"Additionally there are some shortcuts for easier text manipulation. You can "
"<b>tap and hold</b> these keys for extra actions:"
msgstr ""
"另外，快速鍵可以讓字元修改更加便捷。<b>長按</b>下列按鍵以執行對應操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1769-7
msgid "<b>Left Arrow</b> - Moves the cursor to the beginning of the line"
msgstr "<b>左方向鍵</b> - 將游標移至行首"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1771-7
msgid "<b>Right Arrow</b> - Moves the cursor to the end of the line"
msgstr "<b>右方向鍵</b> - 將游標移至行末"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1775-6
msgid ""
"Also <span class=\"ui\">backspace</span> key behaves different when you make "
"swipe gestures on it:"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">回退鍵</span>在滑動手勢下可執行不同操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1779-7
msgid "<b>Tap:</b> Delete a character"
msgstr "<b>點擊</b>：刪除前一個字元"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1781-7
msgid "<b>Long-press:</b> Delete the whole line"
msgstr "<b>長按</b>：刪除整行"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1783-7
msgid "<b>Swipe left:</b> Delete part of the word left of the cursor"
msgstr "<b>左滑</b>：刪除游標左側的字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1785-7
msgid "<b>Swipe up:</b> Delete the whole word"
msgstr "<b>上滑</b>：刪除游標所在的整個字詞"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1789-6
msgid ""
"For more information, you can check the <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"koreader/koreader/wiki/Virtual-keyboard\">related wiki page</a>."
msgstr ""
"詳細資訊請查閱對應<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/"
"Virtual-keyboard\">維基頁面</a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1791-6
msgid ""
"KOReader also integrates the Chinese stroke keyboard for inputting "
"simplified and traditional Chinese characters. You can find more info about "
"it in our <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/Chinese-"
"keyboard\">wiki</a>."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 亦包含用於輸入繁體及簡體中文的筆畫輸入法。請查閱<a href=\"https://"
"github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/Chinese-keyboard\">維基頁面</a>瞭解更多資"
"訊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1793-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-autowarmth"
msgid "2.5 Auto Warmth / Night Mode"
msgstr "2.5 自動暖度及夜間模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1795-6
msgid ""
"This plugin allows you to adjust frontlight warmth in devices with "
"<b>natural (yellow/orange) light</b> and set <span class=\"ui\">night mode</"
"span> (inverted screen colors – <b>white text on black background</b>) "
"automatically according to a schedule. It can control them both or you can "
"choose <span class=\"ui\">only warmth control</span> or <span "
"class=\"ui\">only night mode control</span> mode, so you can adjust the "
"other one manually."
msgstr ""
"該外掛適用於支援<b>自然光（黃色光/橘色光）</b>的裝置，用於按照時間表自動調整"
"螢幕前光暖度及開啟<span class=\"ui\">夜間模式</span>（螢幕顏色反轉為<b>黑底白"
"字</b>）。該功能既可同時設定兩者，又可單獨開啟<span class=\"ui\">暖度控制</"
"span>或<span class=\"ui\">夜間模式</span>以便手動調整另一項。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1801-6
msgid ""
"This plugin comes enabled as default when you install KOReader. If for some "
"reason it is not in the menu, you can enable it here:"
msgstr ""
"本外掛隨 KOReader 安裝過程預設啟用。若其未列於選單中，可透過下列路徑啟用："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1803-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / More tools / Auto Warmth and Night Mode"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 更多工具 / 自動開啟暖光及夜間模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1806-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> If "
"you have a PocketBook device and frontlight or warmth slider is not working "
"in KOReader, please be sure that in the PocketBook reader (which comes with "
"your device) <b>SmartLight-Auto</b> option is set to <b>Disabled</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 若部"
"分 PocketBook 型號在 KOReader 中設定螢幕前光或暖度滑塊無效，請確保裝置原生閱"
"讀功能中的<b>智慧燈光控制</b>選項設為<b>停用</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1810-6
msgid ""
"You can adjust the warmth of your screen frontlight automatically in two "
"different ways:"
msgstr "螢幕前光暖度自動調整功能提供兩種切換模式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1812-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Fixed schedule:</span> In this mode your frontlight "
"warmth changes according to the daily schedule you entered. This mode is "
"<b>static</b>, it doesn’t account for daylight length. The schedule stays "
"the same all around the year."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">固定時間表</span>：按照使用者輸入的時間點切換螢幕前光暖"
"度。該模式的切換點是<b>固定</b>的，全年保持不變、無視白晝長度的季節變化。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1815-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Sun's position:</span> This option calculates Sun’s "
"position in your location according to <b>coordinates</b> and <b>altitude</"
"b> information you entered. Frontlight warmth is adjusted gradually "
"according to this calculated Sun position data. This mode is <b>dynamic</b>. "
"As the length of daylight changes around the year, plugin adjusts the "
"schedule accordingly."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">太陽方位</span>：根據使用者輸入的<b>經緯</b>及<b>海拔</b>"
"資訊計算所在地太陽方位，並依照太陽起落資料調整螢幕前光暖度。該模式的切換點是"
"<b>動態變化</b>的，隨一年四季白晝長短變化而調整。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1820-6
msgid ""
"First have a look at this image to familiarize yourself with the terms used "
"in the plugin:"
msgstr "在使用該模式前，請先瀏覽下圖熟悉外掛內的專業術語："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1824-6
msgid "Fixed Schedule Mode"
msgstr "固定時間表模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1827-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.ol.li:292-6"
msgid "Go to the plugin menu:"
msgstr "按照下列路徑找到外掛選單："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:1827-34
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.ol.li.div:292-33"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Screen / Auto Warmth and Night Mode"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕相關 / 自動切換暖光及夜間模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1830-7
msgid ""
"Tap Activate menu item and then tap <span class=\"ui\">According to the "
"fixed schedule</span>"
msgstr "單擊啟用選單項，然後單擊<span class=\"ui\">按固定計畫</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1832-7
msgid ""
"Go back to previous menu and tap <span class=\"ui\">Fixed schedule settings</"
"span> menu item"
msgstr "回到上級選單，點擊<span class=\"ui\">固定時間表設定</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1835-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.ol.li:300-6"
msgid ""
"Set your warmth transition schedule by setting times for various items here. "
"Refer to the image above for an explanation of items."
msgstr "調整各選單項以設定暖度切換時間表。選單中的專業詞彙含義請參閱上方圖片。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1838-6
msgid "Sun’s Position Mode"
msgstr "太陽方位模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1841-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.ol.li:306-6"
msgid "Go to the plugin menu:"
msgstr "按照下列路徑找到外掛選單："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:1842-8
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.ol.li.div:307-7"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Screen / Auto Warmth and Night Mode"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕相關 / 自動切換暖光及夜間模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1845-7
msgid ""
"Tap <span class=\"ui\">Activate</span> menu item and then tap <span "
"class=\"ui\">According to the sun's position</span>"
msgstr ""
"點擊<span class=\"ui\">啟用</span>，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">根據太陽方位切"
"換</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1848-7
msgid ""
"Go back to previous menu and tap <span class=\"ui\">Location settings</span> "
"menu item. Set your <b>coordinates</b> (necessary) and <b>altitude</b> "
"(optional) correctly and give a <b>name</b> to your location."
msgstr ""
"返回上級選單，點擊<span class=\"ui\">座標設定</span>。設定當前<b>經緯</b>（必"
"填）及<b>海拔</b>（選填），並為該座標起個<b>標題</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1854-7
msgid ""
"Go back to previous menu and tap <span class=\"ui\">Warmth and night mode "
"settings</span> menu item"
msgstr "返回上級選單，點擊<span class=\"ui\">暖度及夜間模式設定</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1857-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+basicusage.ol.li:322-6"
msgid ""
"Set your warmth transition schedule by setting times for various items here. "
"Refer to the image above for an explanation of items."
msgstr "調整各選單項以設定暖度切換時間表。選單中的專業詞彙含義請參閱上方圖片。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1860-6
msgid ""
"You can see your current schedule via <span class=\"ui\">Currently active "
"parameters</span> menu option."
msgstr ""
"透過<span class=\"ui\">當前生效的計畫</span>選項，可檢視裝置正在使用的時間"
"表。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1864-6
msgid "Night Mode"
msgstr "夜間模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1866-6
msgid ""
"While setting the warm light percentages for different intervals, you can "
"also set that interval to <span class=\"ui\">Night Mode</span>, which "
"inverts the screen colors when that interval starts. If your minimum "
"frontlight is still too bright or if you prefer a dark page background, you "
"can activate this feature. To enable this, in the dialog below, tap the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Night mode</span> checkbox and tap <span "
"class=\"ui\">Set</span>."
msgstr ""
"在為不同的時段設定暖光百分比時，你還可以將該時段設定為<span class=\"ui\">夜間"
"模式</span>，這會在該時段開始時反轉螢幕顏色。如果你的前光最低亮度仍然太亮，或"
"者如果你喜歡深色頁面背景，則可以啟用此功能。要啟用此功能，請在下面的對話方塊"
"中，單擊<span class=\"ui\">夜間模式</span>核取方塊，然後單擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">設定</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1869-6
msgid ""
"When you do this, a <b>moon icon</b> will appear in the menu next to this "
"interval. To disable night mode, just disable the <span class=\"ui\">Night "
"mode</span> checkbox in that interval."
msgstr ""
"設定後該時段旁將出現<b>月亮圖示</b>。停用則只需取消勾選對應時段的<span "
"class=\"ui\">夜間模式</span>選擇框。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1875-6
msgid "Frontlight auto on/off"
msgstr "螢幕前光自動開關"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1877-6
msgid ""
"This feature turns your frontlight on at sunset and turns it off at sunrise "
"according to your <span class=\"ui\">Currently active parameters</span> in "
"this plugin. You can override this change by manually turning your "
"frontlight on/off. On the next sunrise/sunset, <span "
"class=\"ui\">AutoWarmth</span> will toggle it again if it is necessary. You "
"can activate it by selecting <span class=\"ui\">Frontlight off during the "
"day</span> menu item in this plugin."
msgstr ""
"該功能會自動根據<span class=\"ui\">當前生效的計畫</span>在日落時開啟螢幕前"
"光、在日出時關閉。使用者也可忽略當前計畫，手動開啟或關閉螢幕前光；<span "
"class=\"ui\">自動調整暖度</span>功能仍會在設定的下個時間段自動啟動。勾選"
"<span class=\"ui\">白天時關閉螢幕前光</span>選項即可啟用該功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1882-6
msgid "Faster warmth transitions"
msgstr "讓暖度切換更快"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1884-6
msgid ""
"If you want your frontlight warmth to change quickly instead of a more "
"gradual change:"
msgstr ""
"若希望螢幕前光暖度調節以快速切換而非平滑漸變方式執行，請按下列路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1886-7
msgid "Set the mode to <b>Fixed schedule</b> following the instructions above"
msgstr "參照前文說明將模式改為<b>固定時間表</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1888-7
msgid "And adjust the settings similar to the image below:"
msgstr "並調整下圖所示的選項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1893-6
msgid ""
"As you can see in these settings above, there is only a one minute "
"difference between day-night transition. So the screen warmth goes from <b>0 "
"to 100 (or reverse) in only one minute</b>. You can increase this time "
"separation to make the transition duration longer."
msgstr ""
"按上圖所示時間表，暖度晝夜切換將在一分鐘內完成。這意味著螢幕前光暖度將<b>在一"
"分鐘內從 0 調節到 100（或反過來）</b>。該用時可單獨設定以拉長切換過程。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1901-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-userinterface"
msgid "3 LEARNING THE USER INTERFACE"
msgstr "3 認識本軟體使用者介面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1903-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has a simple, mainly black and white user interface because "
"gradients and different shades of gray can cause flashing and ghosting on e-"
"ink screens which can degrade reading experience."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 採用簡潔的以黑白為主的使用者介面，這是因為漸層色和不同深淺的灰色會導"
"致電子墨水螢幕出現閃屏和殘影現象，進而影響閱讀體驗。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1905-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has 2 main interfaces: <span class=\"ui\">reading screen</span> and "
"<span class=\"ui\">file browser</span>. We will explain <span "
"class=\"ui\">reading screen</span> here. <span class=\"ui\">File browser</"
"span> is explained in <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">this "
"section</a> of the guide."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 有兩套核心介面：<span class=\"ui\">閱讀介面</span>及<span "
"class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>。接下來將先介紹<span class=\"ui\">閱讀介面</"
"span>；<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>請前往本指南<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-filebrowser\">對應章節</a>瞭解。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1911-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-readingscreen"
msgid "3.1 Reading Screen"
msgstr "3.1 閱讀介面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1913-6
msgid "<b>READING SCREEN</b> has two menus:"
msgstr "<b>閱讀介面</b>有兩套選單："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1917-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">TOP MENU</span> includes menu items related to the "
"general usage of KOReader. You will access your books, KOReader preferences, "
"plugins etc. here."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>包含與 KOReader 使用相關的大部分常見選項。"
"在其中可翻查書籍、調整 KOReader 功能、設定外掛等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:1919-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">BOTTOM MENU</span> is focused on options for <b>document "
"formatting</b> like font weight/size, line spacing etc. While adjusting your "
"text appearance, you will mostly interact with the <span class=\"ui\">BOTTOM "
"MENU</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>則整合與<b>書籍排版</b>相關的選項，如字重、"
"字型大小、行間距等。調整文字樣式將主要在<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>中"
"操作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1928-6
msgid ""
"Image above shows the elements you can see on your reader screen when "
"reading a book:"
msgstr "上圖展示了可能出現在閱讀介面上的各類元素："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1930-7
msgid ""
"<b>Indicator icons:</b> These icons inform you about certain ongoing "
"processes and states. You will see them at the top left corner of your "
"screen during certain operations. Normally they are smaller but here we show "
"them bigger for clarity. Next heading explains these indicator icons in "
"detail: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-indicators\">Indicator icons</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>指示圖示</b>：這些圖示說明某些狀態及當前程序，將在特定階段出現在螢幕左上"
"角。實際顯示中這類圖示的尺寸會更小，此處僅放大以供識別。接下來的一節詳細介紹"
"了各圖示對應的功能：<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-indicators\">指示圖示"
"</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1932-7
msgid ""
"<b>Status bar:</b>This is a highly configurable area where you can see "
"various information about your book and KOReader. Click here to go to the "
"section: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Status bar</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>狀態列</b>：這是一個高度可自訂的區域，你可以在此檢視關於書籍和 KOReader 的"
"各種資訊。請前往<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-statusbar\">狀態列</a>章"
"節瞭解詳情"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1933-7
msgid ""
"<b>Alternate Status bar:</b> In addition to the default <span "
"class=\"ui\">Status bar</span>, we have an <span class=\"ui\">Alt status "
"bar</span> which appears at the top of the page if you enable it. Click here "
"for details: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-statusbar\">Status bar</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>頂部狀態列</b>：除了介面底部的預設<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>，螢幕頂"
"部還提供<span class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>可自行啟用。請前往<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-statusbar\">狀態列</a>章節瞭解詳情"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1936-7
msgid ""
"<b>Publisher page numbers:</b> If the publisher of your book included the "
"page numbers from the paper printed version of the book, you will see them "
"like this. Click here for more info about <b>publisher page numbers</b>: <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-pagenumbering\">Page Numbering</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>出版商頁碼</b>：如果出版商提供了印刷版書籍的頁碼，它們就會這樣顯示。點擊此"
"處可瞭解有關<b>出版商頁碼</b>的更多資訊：<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"pagenumbering\">頁碼編號</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1938-7
msgid ""
"<b>Highlight types:</b> You can see the different highlight types here. Also "
"you can make colored highlights if your device has a suitable screen. Click "
"here to go to the section: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-"
"annotating\">Bookmarks, Highlighting and Notes</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>劃線樣式</b>：KOReader 提供如圖所示的多種劃線樣式。若閱讀裝置配有彩色螢"
"幕，使用者還可使用彩色劃線。點擊<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-"
"annotating\">書籤、劃線和筆記</a>章節瞭解詳情"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:1940-7
msgid ""
"<b>Note marker:</b> Note marker icon shows up when you add a note to a "
"highlight. We have different types of note markers. Click here for more "
"info: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-annotating\">Bookmarks, "
"Highlighting and Notes</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>筆記標識</b>：該圖示出現在添加了筆記的劃線旁。KOReader 提供多種樣式的筆記"
"標識。前往<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L1-annotating\">書籤、劃線和筆記</"
"a>章節瞭解詳情"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1944-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-indicators"
msgid "3.2 Indicator icons"
msgstr "3.2 指示圖示"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:1946-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has some indicators to inform you about certain ongoing processes "
"and states as you can see in the image above. You will see them at the top "
"left corner of your screen during certain operations."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 使用如上圖所示的圖示指示某些狀態或當前程序，它們會在特定階段出現在螢"
"幕左上角。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1951-12
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Partial rendering icons</span> This group of icons "
"belong to the partial rendering procedure and probably you will see these "
"icons more frequently than the others. You see these icons when you change "
"the settings on the <span class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">分段渲染圖示</span> 這組圖示指示了分段渲染程序，會"
"比其他圖示更常出現。當使用者調整了<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>中的選"
"項，這組圖示就會顯示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1954-8
msgid ""
"This feature, allows you to preview the text appearance adjustments much "
"quicker by only rendering the current chapter instead of the whole book. "
"Also rotating your screen orientation is now much faster thanks to this "
"feature. This feature is <b>ENABLED</b> by default. If necessary, it can be "
"disabled per book (with a tap), or globally (with a long-tap) on:"
msgstr ""
"該功能透過僅渲染當前章節（而非整本書）以便使用者快速預覽樣式調整效果。得益於"
"此功能，螢幕旋轉也會更快生效。該功能預設<b>啟用</b>；若要為當前書籍或全部書籍"
"停用該功能，可點擊或長按下列選單項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.div:1957-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / Document / Enable partial renderings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / 文件相關 / 啟用分段渲染"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1960-8
msgid ""
"After confirming your changes whole book has to be re-rendered so this is a "
"multi-step procedure. These icons shows the stage of rendering as explained "
"below:"
msgstr ""
"在確認設定變更後，整本書需要重新渲染，因此這是一項分多階段的過程。下方羅列了"
"各圖示對應的渲染階段："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1967-12
msgid ""
"In this stage, document is <b>partially</b> rendered. Page count, footer "
"info and many things are <b>innacurate</b>. You can see how the new settings "
"look and adjust further. You can also turn pages, jump links in this state."
msgstr ""
"在此階段，文件僅有<b>局部</b>渲染。頁碼計數、頁尾資訊等受影響資料是<b>不準確"
"</b>的。使用者可快速預覽設定後的文字樣式並進一步調整。在此階段使用者仍可翻頁"
"及使用跳轉連結跳轉閱讀位置。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1972-12
msgid ""
"A full rendering is happening in the <b>background</b>. You can still turn "
"pages, jump links, change settings."
msgstr ""
"此圖示代表<b>後臺</b>正在執行全書完整渲染。此時使用者仍可翻頁、使用跳轉連結跳"
"轉頁面位置及調整設定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1976-12
msgid ""
"Full rendering is done, but <b>not yet applied</b> because KOReader is "
"waiting for you to be <b>idle</b> to reload the rest of the book (idle=not "
"interacting with the device). You can still turn pages, jump links, change "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"此圖示代表已完成全書完整渲染但<b>尚未生效</b>，因為 KOReader 正等待使用者<b>"
"空閒</b>（未操作裝置）以重新載入書籍的剩餘部分。此時使用者仍可翻頁、使用跳轉"
"連結跳轉頁面位置及調整設定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1982-12
msgid ""
"You've been idle for a while so KOReader is now reloading the whole "
"document. At this step KOReader is <b>blocked</b> to prevent interaction."
msgstr ""
"使用者已空閒一段時間，KOReader 正重新載入整本書。在此階段，KOReader 會<b>遮蔽"
"一切手勢</b>避免干預。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:1987-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"Partial rendering is only possible if your EPUB is composed of multiple "
"fragments. EPUB files are basically .zip archives that contain .html files. "
"Some books can be a single .html file while others may be composed of "
"multiple .html files like each chapter of the book is a separate .html file. "
"<b>If your book is only a single .html file, partial rendering can not work, "
"because for each change KOReader still has to calculate the whole book.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 分段渲"
"染只有在 EPUB 由多個檔案片段組成時才可用。EPUB 檔案本質上是包含 .html 檔案的 "
"ZIP 壓縮檔。有的書籍只有一個 .html 檔案，有的則由多個 .html 檔案構成，比如每"
"一章都是獨立的 .html 檔案。<b>如果當前書籍只有一個 .html 檔案，分段渲染就無法"
"啟用，因為每次更改時 KOReader 仍須重新計算整本書。</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:1995-12
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Highlighting icon</span> This icon shows up when "
"you are in the <span class=\"ui\">Select and highlight mode</span>. KOReader "
"has an additional highlight mode which allows you to start a highlight and "
"turn pages to make long highlights which can span multiple pages. You can "
"read about this in the <a class=\"internalink\" "
"href=\"#bookmarks\">BOOKMARKS, HIGHLIGHTING AND NOTES</a> section of this "
"guide. When you start a highlight in this mode, this icon is shown at the "
"corner to remind you that you are still in the highlighting mode. It "
"disappears when you finish your highlight by <b>selecting the end of the "
"passage</b> or when you <b>cancel the highlight</b> (by tapping again on the "
"beginning of your highlight or on this <span class=\"ui\">highlighting icon</"
"span>)."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">劃線模式圖示</span> 進入<span class=\"ui\">選擇與劃"
"線模式</span>時，該圖示將會顯示。KOReader 擁有獨立的劃線模式，以實現跨多頁的"
"劃線。請前往<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#bookmarks\">書籤、劃線和筆記</a>"
"一節瞭解詳情。當開始劃線操作後，該圖示將顯示於螢幕左上角，提醒使用者當前仍處"
"於劃線模式下。當使用者<b>選擇到文段末尾</b>自動結束劃線操作時或使用者<b>取消"
"劃線</b>（透過再次點擊劃線的開頭或該<span class=\"ui\">劃線圖示</span>）時，"
"該圖示就會消失。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2006-12
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Pokemon ball icon</span> This icon shows up when "
"you press for a long time on a word (intentionally or accidentally). "
"KOReader has a normal <b>long press</b> menu. And an additional <b>very long "
"press</b> menu when you hold your finger longer than 3 seconds. This icon "
"means that you activated this very long press menu."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">寶可夢球圖示</span> 當在某個字上長按（有意或無意）"
"時，該圖示將會顯示。KOReader 提供包含常用選項的<b>長按</b>選單，以及在<b>持續"
"長按</b>超過三秒時的擴充選單。該圖示代表使用者觸發了這款擴充選單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2016-12
msgid ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">Flip mode icon</span> This icon shows up when you "
"tap the top left corner if:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"label_red\">翻頁模式圖示</span> 滿足下列條件時，點擊螢幕左上角"
"將出現該圖示："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2019-9
msgid "You are reading a PDF document"
msgstr "當前正在閱讀 PDF 文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2020-9
msgid ""
"And you are in a zoomed in view other than 100% (column, row or manual) or "
"in the <span class=\"ui\">reflow mode</span>"
msgstr ""
"並且頁面處於放大狀態（分欄縮放、行縮放或手動縮放）；或者文件處於<span "
"class=\"ui\">頁面重排模式</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2023-8
msgid ""
"This mode temporarily displays the full page without cropping, scaled to fit "
"your screen. You can turn the pages in this mode. To exit this mode, tap on "
"this icon."
msgstr ""
"在當前圖示下，螢幕將暫時顯示未經裁切和放大的完整頁面，此時使用者仍可翻頁。再"
"次點擊該圖示將退出這種顯示模式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2027-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-statusbar"
msgid "3.3 Status bar"
msgstr "3.3 狀態列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2029-6
msgid ""
"KOReader have two status bars, a <span class=\"ui\">Bottom status bar</span> "
"which is enabled by default. And we have an <span class=\"ui\">Alt status "
"bar</span> which appears at the top of the page if you enable it. This <span "
"class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> is available only in reflowable documents "
"(epub, html, docx, rtf, txt…)."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 有兩塊狀態列，一條是預設啟用的<span class=\"ui\">底部狀態列</span>；"
"另一條是備選的<span class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>，啟用後將出現在頁面頂部。"
"<span class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>僅對 EPUB、HTML、DOCX、RTF、TXT 等可重排"
"檔案格式可用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2034-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Bottom status bar</span> is the newer one which is "
"actively maintained. <span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> is a remnant "
"from earlier versions of KOReader so we are not adding new features to it. "
"But you can still enable this <span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> if "
"you find it useful. You can enable it from:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">底部狀態列</span>是新加的，正在持續維護中。<span "
"class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>來自 KOReader 早期版本遺留，因此不會再有功能擴"
"展。如有需要，可透過下列路徑啟用<span class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2039-6
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Alt Status Bar"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 頂部狀態列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2042-6
msgid ""
"You can configure the <span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> from this "
"menu:"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>可透過如下選單設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2045-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+userinterface.div:146-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Alt status bar"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列 / 頂部狀態列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2048-6
msgid ""
"Instructions in the rest of this section are for the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Bottom status bar</span>."
msgstr "本節接下來的說明將圍繞<span class=\"ui\">底部狀態列</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2050-6
msgid "Chapter progress bar"
msgstr "章節進度列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2052-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Progress bar</span> in the <span class=\"ui\">status bar</"
"span> normally shows your progress for the whole book. But it can also show "
"your progress for the <b>current chapter</b> instead. This can be useful for "
"example, if a book has lots of short chapters. In this case it might be hard "
"to see your progress in the current chapter so <span class=\"ui\">chapter "
"status bar</span> can be more informative here. You can enable the feature "
"from this menu:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>中的<span class=\"ui\">閱讀進度列</span>預設"
"顯示全書進度。但也可設定為顯示<b>當前章節</b>進度。該功能適合諸如劃分諸多短章"
"節的書籍，此時<span class=\"ui\">章節狀態列</span>可能更有用。請透過下列路徑"
"啟用該功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2058-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Progress bar / Show chapter-progress "
"bar instead"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列 / 閱讀進度列 / 改為顯示章節進度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2061-6
msgid ""
"Also you can assign a gesture to switch between normal and chapter progress "
"bars. You can find this action under:"
msgstr "也可透過指定一種手勢，在全書進度列和章節進度列間切換。該選項位於："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2063-6
msgid "Gesture selection menu / Reader / Toggle chapter progress bar"
msgstr "手勢選擇選單 / 閱讀器相關 / 章節進度列開關"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2065-6
msgid "Configuring the status bar"
msgstr "設定狀態列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2067-6
msgid ""
"You can configure the bottom status bar from this menu. Feel free to explore "
"the <span class=\"ui\">SETTINGS</span> sub-menu to customize your status bar "
"as you like."
msgstr ""
"此選單可用來設定底部狀態列。請自行探索<span class=\"ui\">設定</span>子選單，"
"打造自己喜歡的狀態列。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2070-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2073-6
msgid ""
"There are many items you can show on the status bar. But by default, only "
"one is shown at a time and you have to tap on the status bar to cycle "
"between them. If you want to show all items at once, enable it from here:"
msgstr ""
"狀態列上可顯示多個項目，但預設僅顯示一項；點擊狀態列可循環顯示不同項目。若要"
"同時顯示多個項目，請按照下列路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2075-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Configure items / Show all selected "
"items at once"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列 / 設定項目 / 顯示所有選定項目"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2078-6
msgid "Sorting the status bar items:"
msgstr "為狀態列項目排序："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2080-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Configure items / Arrange items in "
"status bar"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列 / 設定項目 / 狀態列項目排序"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2083-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> If you are showing "
"the <span class=\"ui\">progress bar</span> and the <span class=\"ui\">status "
"bar items</span> on the same line, you will notice that the progress bar's "
"width changes slightly depending on other items' sizes. If you find this "
"disturbing, you have the option to make the progress bar width fixed, by "
"enabling the <span class=\"ui\">Lock width at minimum</span> option from its "
"menu:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 若把<span "
"class=\"ui\">閱讀進度列</span>與<span class=\"ui\">狀態列項目</span>顯示在同"
"一行，你會發現閱讀進度列的寬度會隨其他項目的大小而略有變化。若覺得這樣影響觀"
"感，可透過其選單啟用<span class=\"ui\">鎖定寬度為最小值</span>選項，把閱讀進"
"度列的寬度固定下來："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:2089-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Status bar / Progress bar / Lock width at minimum"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 狀態列 / 閱讀進度列 / 鎖定寬度為最小值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2092-6
msgid "Changing the status bar font"
msgstr "更改狀態列字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2094-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+userinterface.p:195-0"
msgid "You can change the font of status bar items from here:"
msgstr "你可以在此更改狀態列項目的字型："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2096-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+userinterface.div:197-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Status bar / Configure items / Item font"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 狀態列 / 設定項目 / 項目字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2099-6
msgid ""
"You can use all your installed fonts for the status bar. If you want to fit "
"lots of information, we can suggest <b>DINish Condensed</b> font, which you "
"can download from its <a href=\"https://github.com/playbeing/"
"dinish\">project page</a> and install using the same procedure which you can "
"find here: <a href=\"#L2-fonts\" class=\"internalink\">Using your own fonts</"
"a>"
msgstr ""
"你可以把已安裝的所有字型用於狀態列。若想容納更多資訊，推薦 <b>DINish "
"Condensed</b> 字型，可從其<a href=\"https://github.com/playbeing/dinish\">項"
"目頁面</a>下載，並按照此處所述的同一流程安裝：<a href=\"#L2-fonts\" "
"class=\"internalink\">使用自己的字型</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2103-6
msgid "Using \"dynamic filler\" item for status bar alignment"
msgstr "使用「動態填充器」項調節狀態列對齊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2105-6
msgid ""
"KOReader's status bar has a special item called <span class=\"ui\">dynamic "
"filler</span>. When you add this invisible item to your status bar, it will "
"expand to fill the available space like an inflated balloon, pushing other "
"items on both sides as you can see in the image below (<b>dynamic filler</b> "
"is visualized as a blue rectangle):"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 的狀態列有一項特殊項目，名為<span class=\"ui\">動態填充器</span>。把"
"這個不可見項目加入狀態列後，它會像充了氣的氣球一樣撐滿可用空間，把兩側的其他"
"項目推開，如下圖所示（<b>動態填充器</b>以藍色矩形示意）："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2110-6
msgid ""
"You can enable and move this item like the other status bar items from the "
"same menu. You can also combine this item with the <span class=\"ui\">custom "
"text</span> item explained below to adjust your layout further."
msgstr ""
"可以像其他狀態列項目一樣，在同一選單中啟用並移動該項目。也可以把它與下文介紹"
"的<span class=\"ui\">自訂文字</span>項目搭配使用，進一步調整佈局。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2115-6
msgid "Using \"Custom Text\" item for status bar alignment"
msgstr "使用「自訂文字」項調節狀態列對齊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2116-6
msgid ""
"There is a special status bar item named <span class=\"ui\">Custom text</"
"span>. This item can show your chosen text in the status bar. You can also "
"use this feature to create a separator between the status bar items as you "
"can see in the example below:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">自訂文字</span>是一項特殊的狀態列項目。該項可用於在狀態列"
"中顯示選定文字。可利用該項在狀態列項目之間插入空白間隔，如下圖所示："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2121-7
msgid "First enable this option with a short press on it from this menu"
msgstr "首先，在下列選單中短按該選項啟用功能"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:2123-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Status bar items / Custom text: "
"‘KOReader’"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列 / 狀態列項目 / 自訂文字：「KOReader」"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2125-7
msgid ""
"Then long-press on it again to open its settings. Enter a <b>\"space\"</b> "
"character in the first box and enter the number of repetitions in the second "
"box, which will determine how wide your separator will be."
msgstr ""
"接著，長按該選項開啟設定選單。在第一個輸入框中輸入<b>空格</b>，然後在第二個輸"
"入框中輸入重複次數來調整所需的分割寬度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2129-6
msgid ""
"You can choose another character as a separator. You can also move this item "
"like other status bar items to change its order to adjust your groups."
msgstr ""
"也可選擇其他字元作為分隔符。該項和其他狀態列項目一樣可調整順序，藉此達到分組"
"效果。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2131-6
msgid ""
"You can also use this item in combination with the <span "
"class=\"ui\">dynamic filler</span> item explained above to adjust your "
"layout further."
msgstr ""
"也可以把這個項目與上文介紹的<span class=\"ui\">動態填充器</span>項目搭配使"
"用，進一步調整佈局。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2134-6
msgid "Status bar presets"
msgstr "狀態列預設"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2136-6
msgid ""
"KOReader allows you to have more than one status bar layout and switch "
"between them. Using this feature, you can have different layouts for cases "
"like these examples:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 允許儲存多套狀態列佈局並在它們之間切換。藉助此功能，可以為下面這類情"
"形分別設定不同的佈局："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2139-7
msgid "A layout showing more items when using wider landscape orientation"
msgstr "在較寬的橫屏下顯示更多項目的佈局"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2140-7
msgid "A layout with the <b>chapter name</b> item when reading specific books"
msgstr "閱讀特定書籍時，使用包含<b>章節名稱</b>項目的佈局"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2142-7
msgid ""
"A layout with <b>memory usage</b> item when reading large comics to keep an "
"eye on your memory"
msgstr ""
"閱讀大型漫畫時，使用包含<b>記憶體佔用</b>項目的佈局，以便隨時留意記憶體情況"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2146-6
msgid ""
"To create a preset, first adjust your status bar to your liking by adding "
"and ordering items (as explained before in this section). Then select:"
msgstr ""
"要建立預設，先按本節前面介紹的方法新增並排序項目，把狀態列調整成自己喜歡的樣"
"子，然後選擇："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2148-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Status bar / Status bar presets / Create new preset "
"from current settings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 狀態列 / 狀態列預設 / 基於當前設定建立新的預設"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2151-6
msgid ""
"This will create a preset with your current status bar layout. Repeat this "
"for other layouts that you want to create. After this, you can switch "
"between your new layouts from the same menu. You can also use <span "
"class=\"ui\">gestures</span>, <span class=\"ui\">profiles</span> and <span "
"class=\"ui\">quick menu</span> to quickly switch between your <b>status bar "
"presets</b>."
msgstr ""
"這會以當前狀態列佈局建立一個預設。對其他想儲存的佈局重複此操作即可。之後可以"
"在同一選單中切換這些新佈局。也可以藉助<span class=\"ui\">手勢</span>、<span "
"class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>和<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>快速切換<b>狀態"
"列預設</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2155-6
msgid "External content item"
msgstr "外部內容項目"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2157-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">External content</span> is a special status bar item that "
"allows KOReader plugins to show content in the status bar. For example <span "
"class=\"ui\">Read Timer</span> plugin uses this item to show the timer in "
"the status bar. Currently you don't need to enable it manually but you can "
"find it here:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">外部內容</span>是一項特殊的狀態列項目，可讓 KOReader 外掛"
"在狀態列中顯示內容。例如<span class=\"ui\">閱讀計時器</span>外掛就用它在狀態"
"列顯示計時。目前無需手動啟用，但可以到這裡找到它："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2161-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Status bar / Status bar items / External content"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 狀態列 / 狀態列項目 / 外部內容"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2164-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-topexplained"
msgid "3.4 Top Menu Items"
msgstr "3.4 頂部選單項"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2166-6
msgid ""
"Here we will only give an overview of the items in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">top menu</span> structure to make you familiar with the menu. "
"Detailed information is available under the related sections of this guide."
msgstr ""
"此處僅大致介紹<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>中的選項以便上手。詳細資訊請"
"查閱後文的相關章節。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2172-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">NAVIGATION</span> This menu contains items that allows "
"you to navigate the book you are currently reading. <b>Table of contents, "
"bookmarks, book map...</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">定位</span>：本頁選單包含用於在當前閱讀書籍中定位文段的選"
"項，如<b>目錄、書籤、書籍地圖</b>等"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2176-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">TYPESETTING</span> This menu contains items that allows "
"you to change the appearance of your book. <b>Font settings, style tweaks..."
"</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">版面設定</span>：此頁選單包含用於調整書籍版式的選項，如<b>"
"字型設定、樣式微調</b>等"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2180-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">SETTINGS</span> This menu contains settings for KOReader "
"and your device. <b>E-ink, light, gesture settings...</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">設定</span>：此頁選單包含與 KOReader 及當前裝置相關的選"
"項，如<b>顯示效果、螢幕前光、手勢</b>等"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2184-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">TOOLS</span> This menu contains plugins that can expand "
"the functionality of KOReader."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">工具</span>：此頁選單包含用於擴充 KOReader 功能的各類外"
"掛。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2188-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">SEARCH</span> This menu contains items related to search "
"and lookup. <b>Text search, dictionary, translation, Wikipedia...</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">搜尋</span>：此頁選單包含與搜尋和查詢相關的功能，如<b>文字"
"搜尋，字典，翻譯，維基百科</b>等"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2192-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">FILE BROWSER</span> This button opens the <span "
"class=\"ui\">file browser</span> which is the interface for managing your "
"library."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>：此按鈕用於開啟<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏"
"覽器</span>，這裡是管理書庫的介面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2197-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">MAIN</span> This menu contains tools for accessing your "
"books like <b>history, favorites, collections</b>. Also <b>book information</"
"b>, <b>update</b> and <b>exit</b> items are under this menu."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">主選單</span>：此頁選單包含尋找書籍的工具，如<b>歷史記錄、"
"最愛、收藏清單</b>等。<b>書籍資訊</b>、<b>更新 KOReader </b>及<b>退出 "
"KOReader </b>選項也在此頁中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2204-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-bottomexplained"
msgid "3.5 Bottom Menu Items"
msgstr "3.5 底部選單項"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2206-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> If you long-tap on "
"their names in the bottom menu, KOReader will show you an explanation."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 長按底部選單中的選"
"項名稱，KOReader 就會顯示該選項的說明。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2211-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">View mode</span> If you change to <span "
"class=\"ui\">continuous</span> mode you can scroll the document like a web "
"page. This mode is more suitable for non e-ink screen types (LCD, OLED). In "
"continuous mode <b>you lose top and bottom margins</b> so text may be cut on "
"the first and last line of screen. To solve this problem you can enable "
"<span class=\"ui\">Page overlap</span>:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">閱讀模式</span>：切換到<span class=\"ui\">頁面連續</span>"
"模式，可以像瀏覽網頁一樣滑動閱讀書籍。該模式更適合配備非電子墨水螢幕（LCD、"
"OLED）的閱讀裝置。在頁面連續模式下，<b>頁面的頂部和底部頁邊空白將被裁切</b>，"
"因此首行和末行文字可能會被裁掉。啟用<span class=\"ui\">頁面重疊</span>可以避"
"免這一問題："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2216-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Page Overlap"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 頁面重疊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2219-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Render mode</span> option determines how your document is "
"rendered by KOReader. Default is <span class=\"ui\">WEB</span> and generally "
"you don’t need to change this setting. When a book (or saved web page) is "
"very complicated (specified widths or margins, negative margins, floats "
"etc.) and layout looks bad or overflow the screen, you can try other "
"rendering modes."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">渲染模式</span>：該選項決定 KOReader 如何呈現頁面。預設設"
"定為<span class=\"ui\">網頁</span>且通常無需改變。當某本書籍（或快取的網頁）"
"使用了複雜排版（指定了頁面寬度或頁邊距，使用了負邊距或浮動元素等），版式出現"
"錯亂或內容超出螢幕時可嘗試其他渲染模式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2223-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Zoom (dpi)</span> setting can be thought of as a "
"<b>general zoom factor</b> for the document (except font size). At 96 dpi "
"(which is the default setting), images in the document are rendered at their "
"original dimensions. Basically you will use this setting if you want to "
"<b>make images bigger without making the text bigger</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">縮放（dpi）</span>：該選項可視為文件<b>全域縮放比例</b>"
"（不會影響字型大小）。在預設設定 96 dpi 下，書籍中的圖片將以原始尺寸呈現。簡"
"單來說該選項可以在<b>放大圖片的同時保持文字大小不變</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2231-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Word spacing</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Word "
"expansion</span> settings are related and they determine how your text will "
"look when it is justified. When you justify text, space is added between "
"words so that both edges of each line are aligned with both margins. Since "
"word counts of lines are not equal all the time, in justified alignment, "
"text has to be compressed or expanded to fill the line."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">文字間距</span>和<span class=\"ui\">文字擴展</span>這兩項"
"設定彼此關聯，共同決定文字在兩端對齊時的樣子。文字兩端對齊時，詞與詞之間的空"
"白會被加大，使每行文字的左右邊緣都與頁邊距對齊。由於每行的字數並不總是相同，"
"兩端對齊時文字需要被壓縮或拉伸以填滿一行。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2235-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Word spacing</span> How much the <b>space</b> characters "
"in a line of text can be compressed to fit more words. This setting doesn’t "
"affect words, it only changes the space between them."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">文字間距</span>：為容納更多文字，一行文字中的<b>空白</b>允"
"許被壓縮的程度。該選項不會影響文字，只會改變文字的間隔。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2239-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Word expansion</span> If you have too much white space in "
"a line, how much of that can be distributed into the words by expanding "
"them. This setting affects the appearance of words. If you don’t want your "
"words to expand, set this to <span class=\"ui\">none</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">文字擴展</span>：當一行文字中有太多空白時，將這些空白分拆"
"到字母之間而使單詞被拉伸的程度。該選項將影響單詞的樣式。若不希望單詞被拉伸，"
"請將該選項設定為<span class=\"ui\">無</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2242-6
msgid ""
"You can experiment with different settings until the text looks pleasing to "
"you, then set them as defaults via their respective dialogs."
msgstr ""
"請自行探索各種選項組合，讓文字呈現自己喜歡的樣式，然後在各選項對話方塊中將所"
"選設定儲存為預設值。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2248-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Contrast</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Font weight</span> "
"are two options that you can use to make your text bolder (or lighter). You "
"can achieve the same appearance with either of these options but they use "
"different methods to achieve it. Of course you can use them both at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">對比度</span>和<span class=\"ui\">字重</span>影響文字筆畫"
"濃淡。這兩個選項都可以讓文字呈現某種樣式，但它們的技術原理不同。當然，這兩項"
"可以同時生效。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2252-6
msgid "The differences between them can be summarized as:"
msgstr "兩個選項間的區別可以這樣概括："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:2255-7
msgid "Contrast"
msgstr "對比度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div.p:2257-8
msgid "<b>+</b> Doesn’t change font width, book length stays the same"
msgstr "<b>+</b> 不改變字型寬度，不影響書籍總頁數"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div.p:2259-8
msgid "<b>+</b> Doesn’t need to re-render document, faster"
msgstr "<b>+</b> 無需重新繪製書籍，調整速度快"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div.p:2261-8
msgid "<b>-</b> Might look bad on LCD or low DPI screens"
msgstr "<b>-</b> 在 LCD 或低 DPI 螢幕上可能影響觀感"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:2264-7
msgid "Font weight"
msgstr "字重"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div.p:2266-8
msgid "<b>+</b> Will use proper weighted fonts if you have them installed"
msgstr "<b>+</b> 如果已安裝，將使用適當字重的字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div.p:2268-8
msgid "<b>+</b> Looks better on LCD or low DPI screens"
msgstr "<b>+</b> 在 LCD 和低 DPI 螢幕上觀感更佳"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div.p:2270-8
msgid "<b>-</b> Has to re-render fonts, slower"
msgstr "<b>-</b> 需要重新渲染字型，調整速度慢"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2275-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Font kerning</span> adjusts the spacing between letters "
"to achieve a visually pleasing result. Default is <span class=\"ui\">best</"
"span> option, which might be <b>slower</b> when opening files (depending on "
"your device) but <b>has better support for ligatures</b> (see the image "
"below for an example), joined <b>Arabic</b> glyphs and some other scripts. "
"If your device is slow, you can try <span class=\"ui\">good</span> which is "
"faster and may still look correct with western latin-script text."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">字距微調</span>是調節特定字母組合之間的間距以提升視覺效果"
"的功能。預設的<span class=\"ui\">最佳</span>選項可能會<b>拖慢</b>書籍開啟速度"
"（受閱讀裝置效能影響），但對<b>連字</b>（如下圖所示）、<b>連筆阿拉伯字形</b>"
"及某些書體的支援更好。若閱讀裝置效能較差可將改為<span class=\"ui\">較好</"
"span>選項，在保證拉丁字母書體正確顯示的前提下提升裝置響應速度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2285-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Font hinting</span> is a typographical technique that "
"adjusts the characters in a font to fit in a low-resolution grid, like an e-"
"ink screen. When enabled, the result is sharper and easier to read "
"characters, at the cost of slight distortion of the original font design."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">字型微調</span>是一種排版技術，透過調整字型中的字形來適配"
"低解析度的像素網格（例如電子墨水螢幕）。啟用後字形會更清晰、更易辨認，代價是"
"原始字型設計會略微變形。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2288-6
msgid ""
"Difference of <b>font hinting</b> is more visible on <b>standard-resolution "
"screens</b> or at <b>smaller font sizes</b>. On a very high-resolution "
"screen, the difference is much less noticeable because the pixels are small "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"<b>字型微調</b>的差異在<b>標準解析度螢幕</b>上或使用<b>較小字型大小</b>時更明"
"顯。在解析度非常高的螢幕上，由於像素足夠小，差異要小得多。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2292-6
msgid "Here is a more detailed comparison:"
msgstr "下面是更詳細的對比："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2296-41
msgid "Hinting OFF"
msgstr "關閉字型微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2298-9
msgid ""
"KOReader shows the font's true mathematical shape, without forcing it to "
"snap to the pixel grid."
msgstr "KOReader 按字型真實的數學輪廓顯示字形，不強制它對齊到像素網格。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2301-41
msgid "Hinting ON"
msgstr "開啟字型微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2303-9
msgid ""
"The font is modified to fit the pixel grid of your screen. Letter shapes may "
"differ slightly from the original font."
msgstr "字型會被調整以適配螢幕的像素網格，字形可能與原始字型略有差異。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2310-10
msgid ""
"The font may appear slightly <b>softer, blurrier, or have some unevenness</"
"b> (e.g., the two vertical lines in an 'M' might look like they have "
"different thicknesses)."
msgstr ""
"字型可能顯得略微<b>柔和、模糊或不夠均勻</b>（例如字母「M」的兩條豎線看起來粗"
"細不一）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:2317-10
msgid ""
"The font appears <b>sharper, crisper, and more solid</b>. The letters have "
"consistent stroke weights."
msgstr "字型顯得<b>更清晰、更銳利、更紮實</b>，各字母的筆畫粗細一致。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2323-6
msgid ""
"In KOReader, <span class=\"ui\">font hinting</span> is <b>enabled by "
"default</b> and uses the <b>FreeType library</b>'s hinting algorithm instead "
"of font's internal instructions (to be safe because font internal "
"instructions might be broken). But you can try the font designer's "
"instructions embedded in the font file to see if it looks better:"
msgstr ""
"在 KOReader 中，<span class=\"ui\">字型微調</span>預設<b>啟用</b>，並使用 "
"<b>FreeType 庫</b>的微調演算法，而非字型內建的指令（出於穩妥考慮，字型內建指"
"令可能存在缺陷）。不過也可以改用字型設計師嵌入字型檔案中的指令，看看效果是否"
"更好："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2328-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Off</span> Hinting is disabled."
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">關閉</span> 已停用字型微調。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2330-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Native</span> KOReader uses the font's internal hinting "
"instructions."
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">原生</span> KOReader 使用字型內建的微調指令。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2332-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Auto</span> <b>(on by default)</b> KOReader uses "
"FreeType's hinting algorithm, ignoring font's internal hinting. Handles "
"<b>CJK</b> text better."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">自動</span><b>（預設開啟）</b>KOReader 使用 FreeType 的微"
"調演算法，忽略字型內建的微調指令，對<b>中日韓</b>文字的處理更好。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2342-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Alt status bar</span> enables an alternative status bar "
"which is available only in reflowable documents (EPUB, HTML, DOCX, RTF, "
"TXT…). After enabling it here, you can configure <span class=\"ui\">alt "
"status bar</span> via:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>是對 EPUB、HTML、DOCX、RTF、TXT 等可重排"
"格式的文件啟用一塊補充狀態列。啟用該功能後，可透過下列路徑詳細設定<span "
"class=\"ui\">頂部狀態列</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2346-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+userinterface.div:447-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Status Bar / Alt status bar"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 狀態列 / 頂部狀態列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2349-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Embedded style</span> and <span class=\"ui\">embedded "
"fonts</span> determine if publisher’s styles and fonts embedded in the "
"document will be used (or ignored) to render the document. These are general "
"on/off switches. You can achieve more fine tuned tweaks for your document "
"via:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">內嵌樣式</span>及<span class=\"ui\">內嵌字型</span>決定 "
"KOReader 是否使用出版商在書籍中內建的排版樣式和字型來渲染頁面。這些選項通常是"
"開關形式，可透過下列路徑更精細地調整頁面表現："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2353-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Style Tweaks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2356-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Image scaling</span> determines how images in your "
"document are rendered. <span class=\"ui\">Best</span> looks more pleasing "
"but it is slower."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">圖片縮放</span>決定書籍中的插圖如何呈現。<span "
"class=\"ui\">最佳</span>選項可獲得更好的觀感，但會拖慢閱讀裝置。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2360-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-uitips"
msgid "3.6 User Interface Tips"
msgstr "3.6 使用者介面的使用技巧"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2362-6
msgid ""
"KOReader’s user interface and options can change depending on the file type "
"you open. There are two main categories of documents:"
msgstr ""
"根據開啟的檔案格式不同，KOReader 的使用者介面及設定選項可能會有所差異。"
"KOReader 支援的檔案格式大致可分為兩類："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2364-7
msgid "<b>Fixed layout documents</b> (pdf, djvu, image files...)"
msgstr "<b>固定版式文件</b>（PDF、DJVU、圖片檔案等）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2366-7
msgid "<b>Reflowable documents</b> (epub, html, docx, rtf, txt…)."
msgstr "<b>可重排文件</b>（EPUB、HTML、DOCX、RTF、TXT 等）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2370-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has lots of features so its menu system reflects this complexity. "
"We have a <span class=\"ui\">Menu Search</span> feature for finding menu "
"items quickly. If you remember the name of a menu item but don't remember "
"where it is, you can use this feature:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 包含眾多功能，因此擁有複雜的選單系統，可使用<span class=\"ui\">搜尋"
"選單</span>功能快速尋找特定設定項。若使用者對某項設定的名稱有印象卻不知道如何"
"找到它，可藉助該功能檢索："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2373-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Help / Menu search"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 幫助 / 搜尋選單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2376-6
msgid ""
"Also you can assign this feature to a gesture or add it to your <a "
"href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" class=\"internalink\">Quick Menu</a> for faster "
"access."
msgstr ""
"此外，可為該功能指定喚出手勢，或將其新增到<a href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" "
"class=\"internalink\">快速選單</a>以方便使用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2382-12
msgid ""
"On the <span class=\"ui\">bottom menu</span> if you tap and hold an option’s "
"name, you can see its explanation."
msgstr "點擊<span class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>中的選項標題可以檢視其功能介紹。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2387-9
msgid "You can change the interface language via:"
msgstr "使用者介面的語言可透過下列路徑更改："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.div:2388-9
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Language"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 介面語言"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2395-9
msgid ""
"If you want to change the size of user interface, there is a <span "
"class=\"ui\">DPI</span> setting for that:"
msgstr ""
"如果你想改變使用者介面的大小，有一個 <span class=\"ui\">DPI</span> 設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.div:2398-9
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Screen / Screen DPI"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕 / 螢幕 DPI"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2401-9
msgid ""
"You can choose a value from the menu or select <span class=\"ui\">Custom "
"dpi</span> to enter a value for fine tuning: <b>Higher DPI = Bigger "
"Interface</b>. Note that there is also a <span class=\"ui\">Zoom (dpi)</"
"span> setting in the bottom bar. That one is related to the documents only. "
"You can find the explanation in the next section."
msgstr ""
"你可以從選單中選擇一個值，或選擇<span class=\"ui\">自訂 DPI</span> 後輸入一個"
"值微調：<b>更高的 DPI = 更大的介面</b>。請注意，底部欄中還有一個<span "
"class=\"ui\">縮放（DPI）</span>設定。該設定僅與文件相關。你可以在下一節中找到"
"相關說明。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2407-12
msgid ""
"If you tap and hold an <b>option</b> or <b>menu item</b> (font weight, line "
"spacing etc.), you can set its value as <span class=\"ui\">DEFAULT</span>. "
"The new value will only be applied to books opened from now on. Previously "
"opened books will keep their settings. You can identify default values as a "
"<span class=\"ui\">star</span> (★) in the menu or as a <span "
"class=\"ui\">black border</span> around the indicators as seen below:"
msgstr ""
"長按某一<b>選項</b>或<b>選單項</b>（如字重、行間距等）可將其當前設定指定為"
"<span class=\"ui\">預設選項</span>，僅對之後開啟的書籍生效。之前開啟的書籍將"
"保持原設定。選單中的預設項會帶有<span class=\"ui\">星號</span>（★）或<span "
"class=\"ui\">黑色邊框</span>作為識別標記，如下圖所示："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2417-12
msgid ""
"You can <b>close</b> full screen dialogs (<span class=\"ui\">History, Table "
"of Contents, Reading Statistics</span> etc.) by <b>swiping down</b>. (Except "
"<span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</span> window. You can use any multi swipe "
"gesture to close this one)"
msgstr ""
"可使用<b>下滑</b>手勢對<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄、目錄、閱讀統計</span>等全"
"螢幕對話方塊執行<b>關閉</b>操作。（<span class=\"ui\">書籤</span>是個例外，但"
"可以透過指定其他多指手勢來關閉）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2423-12
msgid ""
"You can take a <span class=\"ui\">screenshot</span> by making a <b>long "
"diagonal swipe</b> with your finger. Also <b>touching opposing diagonal "
"corners</b> will take a screenshot. You can use this second gesture for "
"example when viewing an image. Also if your device has a keyboard, you can "
"take a screenshot with the <span class=\"ui\">Alt + Shift + G</span> "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"有兩種手勢可以用來進行<span class=\"ui\">螢幕擷圖</span>，一種是<b>沿對角線長"
"劃</b>，另外一種是用雙指同時<b>點擊任意一對螢幕對角</b>。第二種手勢可以用於在"
"瀏覽圖片時截圖。如果閱讀裝置配有實體鍵盤，還可以按下 <span "
"class=\"ui\">Alt+Shift+G</span> 組合鍵來截圖。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2430-15
msgid ""
"If you want to open a random page of a book, we have a <b>Jump to a random "
"page</b> action which you can assign to any gesture. It is in the <b>Reader</"
"b> category of the <span class=\"ui\">Gesture Manager</span>."
msgstr ""
"如果你想隨機開啟一本書的某一頁，我們提供了一個<b>跳轉到隨機頁</b>的操作，你可"
"以將其分配給任何手勢。該操作位於<b>閱讀器</b>的<span class=\"ui\">手勢管理員"
"</span>的類別中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2436-8
msgid ""
"In dialogs containing adjustment arrow buttons like the one above, you can "
"<b>tap and hold</b> on arrow buttons to change the value in bigger "
"increments."
msgstr ""
"在包含如上圖所示的調整箭頭按鈕的對話方塊中，你可以<b>點擊並按住</b>箭頭按鈕，"
"以更大的幅度更改值。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2438-8
msgid ""
"You can <b>close</b> this type of dialog (non-full screen) by tapping "
"outside of its window."
msgstr "你可以透過點擊此類對話方塊（非全螢幕）視窗之外的位置來<b>關閉</b>它。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2440-8
msgid ""
"You can <b>move</b> this type of dialog by holding its window title and "
"dragging."
msgstr "你可以透過按住其視窗標題並拖動來<b>移動</b>此類對話方塊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2442-8
msgid ""
"You can make this type of dialog <b>semi-transparent</b> by tapping and "
"holding the <b>window title</b> (when you want to see the text under it "
"while adjusting a value)."
msgstr ""
"你可以透過點擊並按住<b>視窗標題</b>（當你想在調整值的同時檢視其下方的文字"
"時），使此類對話方塊<b>半透明</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2448-12
msgid ""
"<b>Creating new folders -</b> In situations when you need to choose a "
"location (cloud storage, move to archive plugin, exporter plugin), KOReader "
"presents you a screen that looks like our <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</"
"span>. If you want to create a new folder while choosing:"
msgstr ""
"<b>建立新資料夾——</b>在需要選擇位置（雲端儲存、移動到封存外掛、匯出外掛）時，"
"KOReader 會顯示一個類似我們的<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>的介面。如果"
"你想在選擇時建立新資料夾："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ol.li:2451-9
msgid ""
"First navigate to the folder from the <span class=\"ui\">Folder chooser "
"screen</span>"
msgstr "首先，從<span class=\"ui\">資料夾選擇器介面</span>導航到該資料夾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ol.li:2452-9
msgid ""
"Then <b>long-press</b> the <span class=\"ui\">Home icon</span> shown at the "
"upper-left corner of this screen"
msgstr "然後<b>長按</b>螢幕左上角的<span class=\"ui\">主介面圖示</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2459-12
msgid ""
"KOReader supports <b>dictionary lookup</b> in EPUB and scanned PDF/DJVU "
"documents. To see the dictionary definition or translation, just tap and "
"hold a word."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 支援在 EPUB 和掃描的 PDF/DJVU 文件中進行<b>字典查詢</b>。要檢視字典"
"定義或翻譯，只需點擊並長按一個字即可。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2461-8
msgid ""
"Pressing and holding a word brings up a dialog where you can also search the "
"selection in the document for more occurrences or look it up on Wikipedia."
msgstr ""
"在文字上長按，彈出對話方塊可尋找該詞在當前書籍中的其他出現位置，或者查詢維基"
"百科。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2465-12
msgid ""
"When viewing <span class=\"ui\">dictionary</span> and <span "
"class=\"ui\">wikipedia</span> results, you can long-press on word(s) in "
"these windows to search them further in the dictionary/wikipedia. This will "
"open another window with the result, so you won't lose your previous search."
msgstr ""
"檢視<span class=\"ui\">字典</span>和<span class=\"ui\">維基百科</span>結果"
"時，可以在這些視窗裡長按詞語，繼續用字典或維基百科檢索。這會另開一個結果視"
"窗，因此不會丟失之前的搜尋結果。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2469-8
msgid ""
"If you have opened several search windows as described in the previous tip, "
"you can close them <b>all at once</b> by long-pressing the close <span "
"class=\"ui\">X</span> button."
msgstr ""
"如果按上一條技巧打開了多個搜尋視窗，想<b>一次性全部關閉</b>它們，長按關閉 "
"<span class=\"ui\">X</span> 按鈕即可。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:2475-12
msgid ""
"If you want to check the current date you can tap on the clock in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">TOP MENU</span>."
msgstr ""
"如果你想檢視當前日期，可以點擊<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>中的時鐘圖"
"示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2479-6
msgid "Scrolling types"
msgstr "捲動類型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2481-6
msgid "KOReader has three types of touch scrolling. You can access this from:"
msgstr "KOReader 有三種觸控捲動方式。你可以透過以下方式進入："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2483-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and Gestures / Scrolling"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 觸控與手勢 / 捲動"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2486-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> You "
"have to enable <span class=\"ui\">Continuous mode</span> from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Bottom menu</span> to be able to use scrolling."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 要使用"
"滑動瀏覽，須先啟用<span class=\"ui\">頁面連續</span>模式，該選項位於<span "
"class=\"ui\">底部選單</span>中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2492-7
msgid ""
"<b>Classic scrolling:</b> This mode works exactly like your phone/tablet "
"scrolling."
msgstr "<b>經典捲動</b>：此模式的工作原理與你的手機/平板電腦捲動完全相同。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2495-7
msgid ""
"<b>Turbo scrolling:</b> This mode allows you to scroll faster than <span "
"class=\"ui\">classic scrolling</span>. Also you can scroll several pages "
"without lifting your finger. Scrolling amount is proportional to the "
"distance you move your finger after you initiated scrolling."
msgstr ""
"<b>加速捲動</b>：此模式允許你比<span class=\"ui\">經典捲動</span>更快地捲動。"
"你還可以在不抬起手指的情況下捲動多頁。捲動量與開始捲動後移動手指的距離成正"
"比。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2498-7
msgid ""
"<b>On-release scrolling:</b> This scrolling type is more suitable for e-ink "
"screens. Because unlike other scrolling types, this mode doesn’t refresh "
"your page continuously while scrolling. It works like <span "
"class=\"ui\">classic scrolling</span> but intermediate steps are not shown. "
"So when you scroll with your finger and then release, page jumps to that "
"position. This is especially useful <b>to reposition and adjust the view</b> "
"if your book contains pictures or tables and you want to see all of it."
msgstr ""
"<b>鬆手時捲動頁面</b>：這種頁面捲動方式更適合電子墨水螢幕裝置。與其他頁面捲動"
"方式不同，該方式不會在捲動時持續重新整理頁面。它的工作原理與<span "
"class=\"ui\">經典捲動</span>類似，但不會顯示中間過程，用手指滑動，鬆手時頁面"
"會直接跳到對應位置。該模式對包含插圖或圖表的書籍尤其有用，便於<b>改變頁面位置"
"及調整檢視</b>以完整檢視這類元素。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2504-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+userinterface.div:605-0"
msgid "Go back to previous location"
msgstr "返回前一位置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2506-6
msgid ""
"This useful feature works like the <b>Back</b> button in your browser. When "
"you jump to some other part of the book using <span class=\"ui\">Skim "
"widget, Bookmarks list, Book map</span> etc. KOReader remembers your "
"previous location. This is useful for example if you follow an internal link "
"or reference. With one tap you can go back to where you come from. You can "
"access this feature from:"
msgstr ""
"這個有用的功能類似於瀏覽器中的<b>後退</b>按鈕。當你使用<span class=\"ui\">快"
"速翻頁工具、書籤清單、書籍地圖</span>等跳轉到書籍的其他部分時。KOReader 會記"
"住你之前的位置。例如，如果你遵循內部連結或參考，這很有用。只需輕輕一點，你就"
"可以回到你原來的地方。你可以從以下位置存取此功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2510-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Go back to previous location"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 返回前一位置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2513-6
msgid ""
"Also you can go forward too, from the same menu. This feature is assigned to "
"<span style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> multiswipe gesture. You can "
"assign this to another gesture if you want (like tapping a corner) or add it "
"to your <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span>."
msgstr ""
"在該選單中還可前轉頁面。該功能預設被指定給 <span style=\"font-family: "
"microns;\"></span> 多指滑動手勢，使用者可另行指定給另外的手勢（如點擊螢幕一"
"角），或將該功能列入<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2516-6
msgid "Prevent flashing on pages with images and in the menu"
msgstr "防止圖片頁面和選單重新整理"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2518-6
msgid ""
"KOReader normally perform a full refresh on pages containing images (which "
"you can observe as a black flash). The reason is to get rid of the residue "
"and ghosting from the previous page. But this might not be necessary "
"depending on your device and personal preferences. You can disable this auto-"
"refresh behavior here:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 通常會對包含圖片的頁面進行完整重新整理（你可以看到黑色閃爍）。原因是"
"去除上一頁的殘留和重影。但根據你的裝置和個人喜好，這可能不是必需的。你可以在"
"此處停用此自動重新整理行為："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2520-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / Screen / E-ink Settings / Full refresh rate / "
"Always flash on pages with images"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:24px;\"> / 螢幕 / 電子墨水設定 / 全刷頻率 / 始終重新整理圖片"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2523-6
msgid ""
"Also you can disable black flashing of user interface from here if it "
"disturbs you:"
msgstr "如果使用者介面出現黑色閃爍，你也可以從這裡停用："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2525-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Screen / E-ink Settings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕相關 / 電子墨水螢幕設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2534-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-navigating"
msgid "4 NAVIGATING YOUR DOCUMENT"
msgstr "4 瀏覽內容"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2536-6
msgid ""
"There are different ways of moving through your document in KOReader with "
"their own strengths. You can use the:"
msgstr "在 KOReader 中瀏覽文件有不同的方法，各有優缺點。你可以使用："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2539-7
msgid "Skim Widget"
msgstr "快速翻頁工具"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2540-7
msgid "Book Map"
msgstr "書籍地圖"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2541-7
msgid "Page Browser"
msgstr "頁面瀏覽器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2544-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-skimwidget"
msgid "4.1 Skim Widget"
msgstr "4.1 快速翻頁工具"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2546-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Skim Widget</span> is a very functional navigation tool. "
"You can use it to:"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>是非常有用的定位工具，可用來："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2549-7
msgid ""
"Jump to any part of your book by directly tapping on the <span "
"class=\"ui\">progress bar</span> or entering the page number"
msgstr ""
"透過直接點擊<span class=\"ui\">閱讀進度列</span>上的位置，或輸入頁碼跳至指定"
"頁面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2551-7
msgid "Navigate between chapters"
msgstr "章節導航"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2552-7
msgid "Navigate between bookmarks"
msgstr "書籤導航"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2555-6
msgid "How to open the Skim Widget:"
msgstr "呼出快速翻頁工具的方法："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2557-7
msgid ""
"With a long-tap on the <span class=\"ui\">Status Bar</span> area at the "
"bottom of your screen"
msgstr "長按螢幕底部的<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>區域"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2559-7
msgid "From this menu:"
msgstr "從這個選單："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:2559-27
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Skim document"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 快速翻頁"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2561-7
msgid "You can assign a gesture to it"
msgstr "您可以為其指定一個手勢"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2562-7
msgid "You can add it to your <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span>"
msgstr "你可以將其新增到<span class=\"ui\">快速選單中</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2565-6
msgid "Using the Skim Widget"
msgstr "快速翻頁工具的用法"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2567-6
msgid ""
"First let's have a quick look at the diagram below. You will see that we "
"have two different <span class=\"ui\">Skim Widget</span>s. They have the "
"same functions, only their size is different:"
msgstr ""
"先來快速瀏覽下方的圖表。可以看到<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>有兩種"
"樣式。這兩種有相同的功能，區別僅是尺寸不同："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2570-7
msgid ""
"<b>FULL-SIZE SKIM WIDGET:</b> This is the default <span class=\"ui\">skim "
"widget</span> you will see when you install KOReader. It is bigger than the "
"<span class=\"ui\">compact skim widget</span> so buttons are more "
"comfortable to press. This widget opens at the <b>center of the screen</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>全尺寸快速翻頁工具</b>：這是安裝 KOReader 後預設啟用的<span class=\"ui\">"
"快速翻頁工具</span>。它的尺寸比<span class=\"ui\">精簡快速翻頁工具</span>更"
"大，因此上面的各種按鈕更易點擊。該工具會顯示在<b>螢幕中間</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2575-7
msgid ""
"<b>COMPACT SKIM WIDGET:</b> This is the slimmer version of the default <span "
"class=\"ui\">skim widget</span>. It can be more useful if you are making "
"highlights for example. Since this widget is smaller and opens at the <b>top "
"or bottom of the screen</b>, it doesn't obstruct the page as much as the "
"default widget."
msgstr ""
"<b>精簡快速翻頁工具</b>： 這是預設<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>的精"
"簡版本。它的尺寸更小巧，會顯示在<b>螢幕頂部或底部</b>，因此不像預設工具那樣遮"
"擋螢幕，在諸如劃線文段時會更便於使用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2579-6
msgid ""
"If you want to use the <span class=\"ui\">compact skim widget</span>, you "
"can do this by choosing <span class=\"ui\">Top</span> or <span "
"class=\"ui\">Bottom</span> from this menu:"
msgstr ""
"若要使用<span class=\"ui\">精簡快速翻頁工具</span>，可點擊如下選單中的<span "
"class=\"ui\">頂部</span>或<span class=\"ui\">底部</span>選項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2583-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Navigation / Skim dialog position:"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 書頁定位 / 快速翻頁工具位置："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2586-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> Both skim widgets "
"are movable. You can move them by pressing on an empty area of the widget "
"and dragging. Also you can make these dialogs semi-transparent by long-"
"pressing on an empty area on the widget. But semi-transparency is triggered "
"only in its initial position. Once moved, long-pressing moves it back to the "
"initial position."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 兩種快速翻頁工具都"
"可以移動。按住工具欄的空白區域並拖動即可移動。另外，長按空白區域還能讓對話方"
"塊進入半透明狀態，但半透明只在其初始位置時才會觸發。移動位置後，再次長按會把"
"它移回初始位置。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2589-6
msgid ""
"Now back to the diagram. You can see that on some buttons, there are two "
"descriptions in different colors:<b> blue and orange </b>. It means that "
"this button has two functions: a <b>normal press</b> action and a <b>long-"
"press</b> action. If you press normally, it will perform the <span "
"class=\"label_blue\">BLUE</span> function. If you press longer, it will "
"perform the <span class=\"label_orange\">ORANGE</span> function."
msgstr ""
"接下來回到圖表。圖示的部分按鈕有使用<b>藍色和橙色</b>兩種顏色的兩種描述，這些"
"按鈕在<b>點擊</b>或<b>長按</b>時功能不同。點擊將執行<span "
"class=\"label_blue\">藍色</span>功能，長按將執行<span class=\"label_orange\">"
"橙色</span>功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2599-6
msgid "Explanations of the numbered items (long-press action in bold):"
msgstr "圖中編號項的功能說明（粗體代表長按時的功能）："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2602-7
msgid ""
"Jump to the beginning of the previous chapter / <b>Jump to the first page of "
"the book</b>"
msgstr "轉到上一章開頭/<b>轉到本書扉頁</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2603-7
msgid ""
"Jump to the previous bookmark / <b>Jump to the first bookmark in the book</b>"
msgstr "轉到上一處書籤/<b>轉到本書第一處書籤</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2604-7
msgid "Bookmark current page / <b>Open bookmarks dialog</b>"
msgstr "將當前頁新增為書籤/<b>開啟書籤對話方塊</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2605-7
msgid ""
"Jump to the next bookmark / <b>Jump to the last bookmark in the book</b>"
msgstr "轉到下一處書籤/<b>轉到本書最後一處書籤</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2606-7
msgid ""
"Jump to the beginning of the next chapter / <b>Jump to the last page of the "
"book</b>"
msgstr "轉到下一章開頭/<b>跳到本書尾頁</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2607-7
msgid "Jump backward (-) or forward (+) this many pages"
msgstr "按所示數字間隔回退（－）或快進（＋）頁碼"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2608-7
msgid ""
"This number shows the current page number. If you tap on it, a dialog opens "
"which allows you to enter a page number or percentage to jump directly. "
"<b>If you long-press, it takes you back to the page where you opened the "
"<span class=\"ui\">skim widget</span>.</b> This is useful for example if you "
"want to check some other part of the book quickly and return to your reading "
"where you left."
msgstr ""
"該數字為當前頁碼。點擊將開啟對話方塊以輸入指定頁碼或百分比跳轉。<b>長按時則將"
"回到最初開啟<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>時的頁碼。</b>該功能對於諸"
"如想快速翻頁書籍其他章節然後回到當前位置等情況非常有用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2610-7
msgid ""
"This is the <span class=\"ui\">progress bar</span>. Thin lines are the "
"chapter marks which shows the beginning of the chapters. You can tap on this "
"<span class=\"ui\">progress bar</span> to jump to that part of the book. "
"Little arrows are <span class=\"ui\">session start arrows</span> which marks "
"the place where you started reading this book in the current session. This "
"arrows reset when you switch between books."
msgstr ""
"這是<span class=\"ui\">閱讀進度列</span>。細線是顯示每章節起始處的章節標記。"
"點擊<span class=\"ui\">閱讀進度列</span>任意位置將轉到對應頁碼。遊標是<span "
"class=\"ui\">閱讀起始點</span>，用於顯示本次閱讀開始時的頁碼。遊標位置將隨書"
"籍切換而重設。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2613-7
msgid ""
"This button in the <span class=\"ui\">compact skim widget</span> works same "
"as the long-press function of the item <b>number 7</b>. It takes you back to "
"the page where you opened the <span class=\"ui\">skim widget</span>. This is "
"useful for example if you want to check some other part of the book quickly "
"and return to your reading where you left."
msgstr ""
"此按鈕僅出現在<span class=\"ui\">精簡快速翻頁工具</span>中，功能與長按<b>編"
"號 7 </b>相同，使頁面回到開啟<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>時所處頁"
"碼。該功能對於諸如想快速翻頁書籍其他章節然後回到當前位置等情況非常有用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2617-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> If you want to "
"open a random page of a book, we have a <b>Jump to a random page</b> action "
"which you can assign to any gesture. It is in the <b>Reader</b> category of "
"the <span class=\"ui\">Gesture Manager</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 若要隨機開啟書籍的"
"某一頁，KOReader 提供<b>跳轉到隨機頁</b>操作，可以把它指定給任意手勢。它位於"
"<b>閱讀器</b>類目下的<span class=\"ui\">手勢管理員</span>中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2622-6
msgid "Chapter Marks"
msgstr "章節標記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2624-6
msgid ""
"KOReader can show chapter boundaries from your documents on the <span "
"class=\"ui\">SKIM WIDGET</span> and <span class=\"ui\">PROGRESS BAR</span>."
msgstr ""
"書籍斷章點可以顯示在<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>或者<span "
"class=\"ui\">閱讀進度列</span>上。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2629-6
msgid ""
"If your document has too many heading levels, your chapter marks can look "
"crowded like the example above. You can change the depth of visible ToC mark "
"levels via:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的文件有太多的標題級別，你的章節標記可能會像上面的例子一樣顯得擁擠。你"
"可以透過以下方式更改可見目錄標記級別的深度："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2631-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Progress Bars"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 閱讀進度列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2636-6
msgid "You can also use this reduced ToC for:"
msgstr "你還可以將此簡化的目錄用於："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2638-7
msgid "chapter titles (if it is shown on <span class=\"ui\">Status Bar</span>)"
msgstr "章節標題（如果顯示在<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>上）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2639-7
msgid "chapter navigation"
msgstr "章節導航"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2640-7
msgid "reading time left estimates"
msgstr "剩餘閱讀時間估算"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2643-6
msgid "These options are in the same menu."
msgstr "這些選項位於同一選單中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2645-6
msgid ""
"If your document doesn’t have a Table of Contents, you can enable <span "
"class=\"ui\">ALTERNATIVE TABLE OF CONTENTS</span>. When this setting is "
"enabled, KOReader will build a ToC from document headings (if available) or "
"from individual HTML files in the EPUB. Long press on this menu item for "
"extra info:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的文件沒有目錄，你可以啟用<span class=\"ui\">替代目錄</span>。啟用此設"
"定後，KOReader 將根據文件標題（如果可用）或 EPUB 中的單個 HTML 檔案構建目錄。"
"長按此選單項可取得更多資訊："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2647-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.div:115-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Alternative table of contents"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 替代性目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2650-6
msgid ""
"You can find more info about the <b>table of contents</b> tools available in "
"KOReader in this relevant section of the guide: <a class=\"internalink\" "
"href=\"#toctools\">Table Of Contents Tools</a>"
msgstr ""
"你可以在本指南的相關部分找到 KOReader 中可用的<b>目錄</b>工具的更多資訊：<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#toctools\">目錄工具</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2653-6
msgid "4.2 Marking Pages"
msgstr "4.2 標記頁面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2655-6
msgid ""
"After learning how to navigate, we will now learn <b>how to mark pages</b> "
"in a document. This will allow us to quickly jump between different parts of "
"our document."
msgstr ""
"學會瀏覽文件之後，下面來學習如何在文件中<b>標記頁面</b>，以便快速跳轉到文件的"
"不同部分。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2658-6
msgid "Pinned page"
msgstr "鎖定頁"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2662-6
msgid ""
"If there is a page in a document that you frequently jump to (for example "
"<b>Reference pages</b> section of a book), you can pin this page to easily "
"jump there. You can have only <b>one pinned page per book</b>, so if you "
"need more places to jump, check the <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</span> "
"feature below."
msgstr ""
"如果文件中有某一頁需要頻繁跳轉（例如某本書的<b>參考頁</b>章節），可以把這頁鎖"
"定，方便快速前往。每本書只能有<b>一個鎖定頁</b>；若需要更多跳轉位置，請檢視下"
"文的<span class=\"ui\">書籤</span>功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2668-6
msgid "How to pin/unpin a page:"
msgstr "如何鎖定或取消鎖定頁面："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2671-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.ol.li:139-1"
msgid "Open the <span class=\"ui\">Skim widget</span>."
msgstr "開啟<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2672-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.ol.li:140-1"
msgid ""
"Press the <span class=\"ui\">page number</span> in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Skim widget</span>."
msgstr ""
"點擊<span class=\"ui\">頁碼</span>（<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>"
"內）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2674-7
msgid ""
"A dialog will open and you will see the <span class=\"ui\">Pin current page</"
"span> button there. Press normally <b>to pin</b> the page or long-press "
"<b>to remove the pin.</b>"
msgstr ""
"會彈出一個對話方塊，其中有<span class=\"ui\">鎖定本頁</span>按鈕。點擊可<b>鎖"
"定</b>該頁，長按則<b>取消鎖定。</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.p:2678-8
msgid ""
"You can reach this dialog from this menu too, which you can also assign a "
"<span class=\"ui\">gesture</span> to reach:"
msgstr ""
"也可以從下面這個選單進入該對話方塊，還可以為它指定一個<span class=\"ui\">手勢"
"</span>以便快速呼出："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:2681-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Go to page"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 前往頁面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2687-6
msgid "How to jump to your pinned page:"
msgstr "如何跳轉到鎖定頁："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2690-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.ol.li:158-1"
msgid "Open the <span class=\"ui\">Skim widget</span>."
msgstr "開啟<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2691-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.ol.li:159-1"
msgid ""
"Press the <span class=\"ui\">page number</span> in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Skim widget</span>."
msgstr ""
"點擊<span class=\"ui\">頁碼</span>（<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>"
"內）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2693-7
msgid ""
"Press the <span class=\"ui\">Go to pinned page</span> button in the opening "
"dialog."
msgstr "在彈出的對話方塊中點擊<span class=\"ui\">轉到鎖定頁</span>按鈕。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2699-6
msgid "How to go back:"
msgstr "如何返回："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2701-6
msgid ""
"After jumping to the pinned page, you can return to your previous reading "
"position with this menu action:"
msgstr "跳轉到鎖定頁之後，可以透過下面這個選單操作返回之前的閱讀位置："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2703-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Go back to previous location"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 返回前一位置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2706-6
msgid ""
"Also you can use the <span class=\"ui\">swipe left then right</span> single "
"finger swipe to go back."
msgstr "也可以使用<span class=\"ui\">先左後右</span>單指滑動來返回。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2709-6
msgid ""
"Pinning/jumping is much faster if you assign <a href=\"#L1-gestures\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Gestures</a> to these actions:"
msgstr ""
"如果為這些操作指定<a href=\"#L1-gestures\" class=\"internalink\">手勢</a>，鎖"
"定和跳轉會快得多："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2712-7
msgid ""
"For example you can assign a gesture to the <span class=\"ui\">Pin current "
"page</span> action."
msgstr "例如，可以為<span class=\"ui\">鎖定本頁</span>操作指定一個手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2715-7
msgid ""
"Another gesture to the <span class=\"ui\">Go to pinned page</span> action."
msgstr "為<span class=\"ui\">轉到鎖定頁</span>操作指定另一個手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2718-7
msgid ""
"And some other gesture to the <span class=\"ui\">Back to previous location</"
"span>"
msgstr "再為<span class=\"ui\">返回前一位置</span>指定其他手勢"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2721-6
msgid ""
"Now you can quickly pin a page, jump to it when reading and go back with "
"just three taps. You can also add these actions to your <a href=\"#L1-"
"qmandprofiles\" class=\"internalink\">Quick Menu</a> of course."
msgstr ""
"現在只需三次點擊，就能快速鎖定某頁、在閱讀時跳到該頁並返回。當然，也可以把這"
"些操作新增到<a href=\"#L1-qmandprofiles\" class=\"internalink\">快速選單</"
"a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2724-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.div:192-0"
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "書籤"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2726-6
msgid ""
"You can add (and remove) a bookmark by tapping the <span class=\"ui\">top "
"right corner</span> of a page. This is the equivalent of <b>folding the "
"corner of the page</b> on a printed book and shows a similar icon at the "
"corner when you add a bookmark."
msgstr ""
"可透過點擊頁面的<span class=\"ui\">右上角</span>來新增（或移除）書籤。這相當"
"於在紙質書上<b>折起書角</b>；新增書籤後，書角會顯示一個類似的圖示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2730-6
msgid ""
"You can access your bookmarks from the <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</span> "
"window and then tap on the bookmarks to jump to the relevant page:"
msgstr ""
"可以從<span class=\"ui\">書籤</span>視窗檢視書籤，點擊某條書籤即可跳轉到對應"
"頁面："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2733-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.div:201-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Bookmarks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 書籤"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2736-6
msgid ""
"You can open this window quickly by <span class=\"ui\">swipe left with "
"double finger</span> gesture or <span class=\"ui\">up then left</span> "
"single finger swipe."
msgstr ""
"可以透過<span class=\"ui\">雙指左滑</span>手勢或<span class=\"ui\">先上後左</"
"span>單指滑動快速開啟此視窗。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2740-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-bookmap"
msgid "4.3 Book Map"
msgstr "4.3 書籍地圖"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2742-6
msgid ""
"Book map is a powerful and unique feature of KOReader which can be very "
"useful for getting an overview of a book. For example if you are reading a "
"book non-linearly by skipping some parts to read them later, it would be "
"hard to track your progress. Book Map can show you which parts of the book "
"you have already read, at a glance."
msgstr ""
"書籍地圖是 KOReader 的一個強大而獨特的功能，對於瞭解一本書非常有用。例如，如"
"果你透過跳過某些部分稍後閱讀來非線性地閱讀一本書，那麼很難追蹤你的進度。書籍"
"地圖可以一目瞭然地顯示你已經讀過這本書的哪些部分。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2745-6
msgid "Additionally you can:"
msgstr "此外，你還可以："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2747-7
msgid ""
"See how much time you have spent on each page (if <span class=\"ui\">Reading "
"Statistics</span> plugin is enabled)"
msgstr ""
"檢視你在每個頁面上花費了多少時間（如果啟用了<span class=\"ui\">閱讀統計</"
"span>外掛）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2749-7
msgid "Check which pages have bookmark, highlights and notes"
msgstr "檢查哪些頁面有書籤、劃線和筆記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2750-7
msgid ""
"Navigate directly to any part of the book like the <span class=\"ui\">SKIM "
"WIDGET</span>"
msgstr ""
"與<span class=\"ui\">快速翻頁工具</span>功能類似，可直接定位到書籍的任意文段"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2753-6
msgid ""
"You can access Book Map via menu and you can also assign a gesture for "
"quicker access:"
msgstr "你可以透過選單存取書籍地圖，也可以指定手勢以更快地存取："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2755-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Book map"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 書籍地圖"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2758-6
msgid "Book map controls"
msgstr "書籍地圖控制元件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2759-6
msgid ""
"When you open the <span class=\"ui\">Book Map</span> first time while "
"reading a book, it will be in <span class=\"ui\">Grid View</span> mode, "
"fitting all chapters on a single screen to give the best initial overview of "
"the book’s content. To get a detailed information about usage, tap the info "
"icon at the upper left corner. You can close the Book Map by tapping <span "
"class=\"ui\">X</span> on the upper right corner or with any multiswipe "
"gesture (<b>UP-DOWN, LEFT-RIGHT</b> etc.)."
msgstr ""
"當你在閱讀一本書時第一次開啟<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖</span>時，它將處於"
"<span class=\"ui\">網格檢視</span>模式，將所有章節都放在一個螢幕上，以提供書"
"籍內容的最佳初始概述。要取得有關使用情況的詳細資訊，請點擊左上角的資訊圖示。"
"你可以透過點擊右上角的 <span class=\"ui\">X</span> 或使用任何多指滑動手勢"
"（<b>上下、左右</b>等）關閉書籍地圖。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2770-7
msgid "Chapter boundaries"
msgstr "章節邊界"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2771-7
msgid ""
"Black bars indicate read pages. Higher bars means more time spent in page."
msgstr "黑色條表示已讀頁面。條越高，表示在該頁停留的時間越長。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2772-7
msgid "Bookmark icon shows bookmarked pages as the name says."
msgstr "書籤圖示顧名思義會標出已新增書籤的頁面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2773-7
msgid "Striped square icon shows pages with highlights."
msgstr "塊狀條紋圖示表示該頁包含劃線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2774-7
msgid "Pencil icon shows pages with notes."
msgstr "鉛筆圖示顯示帶有筆記的頁面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2775-7
msgid ""
"Numbers in a circle shows your previous locations. When you choose <span "
"class=\"ui\">Go back to previous location</span> from the menu, you will "
"jump back here in order."
msgstr ""
"若使用了跳頁功能，帶圓圈的數字將指示之前所在的閱讀位置。在閱讀介面使用<span "
"class=\"ui\">返回前一位置</span>時，將按照數字標記的順序逐一回到該位置。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2777-7
msgid "Triangle shows your current page."
msgstr "三角形顯示你當前的頁面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2778-7
msgid "Vertical scrollbar shows your current view level."
msgstr "垂直捲動條顯示你當前的檢視級別。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2779-7
msgid "Vertical scrollbar shows your current page width level."
msgstr "垂直捲動條顯示你當前的頁面寬度級別。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2782-6
msgid ""
"You can customize <span class=\"ui\">Book Map</span> by changing these "
"options:"
msgstr "你可以透過更改以下選項自訂<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2784-6
msgid ""
"- First try swiping <span class=\"ui\">LEFT</span> and <span "
"class=\"ui\">RIGHT</span> along the bottom edge of the screen to change "
"width of columns indicating pages and observe how it changes the scale of "
"the map."
msgstr ""
"- 首先，嘗試沿螢幕底部邊緣向<span class=\"ui\">左</span>滑動和向<span "
"class=\"ui\">右</span>滑動，以調整代表頁面的分欄寬度，並觀察它如何更改地圖的"
"比例。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2788-6
msgid ""
"- Then try swiping <span class=\"ui\">UP</span> and <span class=\"ui\">DOWN</"
"span> along the left edge of the screen to change chapter title depth and "
"switch to the <span class=\"ui\">Flat View</span>. See examples below."
msgstr ""
"- 然後，嘗試沿螢幕左邊緣向<span class=\"ui\">上</span>和向<span class=\"ui\">"
"下</span>滑動，以更改章節標題深度並切換到<span class=\"ui\">平面檢視</span>。"
"請參閱下面的範例。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2792-6
msgid ""
"In addition to default <span class=\"ui\">Grid View</span> above, here you "
"can see the <span class=\"ui\">Flat View</span> on the left and Grid View "
"without chapter titles on the right. Note the changing left vertical "
"scrollbar between views. If you want to switch back to the default view, you "
"can long-press the info icon at the upper left corner."
msgstr ""
"除了上面預設的<span class=\"ui\">網格檢視</span>外，你還可以在左側看到<span "
"class=\"ui\">平面檢視</span>，在右側看到沒有章節標題的網格檢視。請注意檢視之"
"間左垂直捲動條的變化。如果你想切換回預設檢視，你可以長按左上角的資訊圖示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2801-6
msgid "Book map options"
msgstr "書籍地圖選項"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2805-6
msgid ""
"When you tap the menu icon on the <b>Book map</b> screen you are presented "
"with the menu above. Menu options are explained below:"
msgstr ""
"當你點擊<b>書籍地圖</b>螢幕上的選單圖示時，你會看到上面的選單。選單選項解釋如"
"下："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2810-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">About book map:</span> Short explanation of Book map "
"usage and icon descriptions."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">關於書籍地圖</span>：書籍地圖使用和圖示描述的簡短說明。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2812-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Available gestures:</span> Gestures you can use to change "
"the settings of Book map instead of using this menu."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">可用手勢</span>：你可以使用手勢更改書籍地圖的設定，而不是"
"使用此選單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2814-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Page browser on tap:</span> If this is checked, when you "
"tap on a page in Book map, <span class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> opens. "
"This shows you an overview of the area you selected. If you disable this "
"option, a tap in Book map directly takes you to that page. But remember, "
"depending on factors like your screen size, touch screen sensitivity, tap "
"accuracy etc. you might end up in adjacent pages."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">即點即看的頁面瀏覽器</span>：勾選此選項後，點擊書籍地圖中"
"的某一頁將進入<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>檢視，展示所點擊區域的頁"
"碼。取消勾選，點擊則會直接前往對應頁。請注意，受螢幕尺寸、觸控靈敏度、點擊精"
"準性等因素，開啟的可能是目標頁面的臨近頁面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2817-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Switch current/initial views:</span> If you customized "
"your Book map view, tapping this switches between the <b>default view</b> "
"and your <b>customized view</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">切換當前/初始檢視</span>：如果你自訂了書籍地圖檢視，點擊此"
"按鈕可在<b>預設檢視</b>和<b>自訂檢視</b>之間切換。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2820-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Switch grid/flat views:</span> Switch between separate "
"chapters or continuous chapters views."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">切換網格/平面檢視</span>：在單獨的章節或連續的章節檢視之間"
"切換。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2822-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Chapter levels:</span> Change the depth of chapter/sub "
"chapter levels."
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">章節級別</span>：更改章節/子章節級別的深度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2824-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Page slot width:</span> Make each page slot wider or "
"narrower."
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">頁面槽寬度</span>：使每個頁面槽更寬或更窄。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2826-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">10-page markers:</span> As you increase this value, first "
"it will add markers to every <b>10<sup>th</sup> page</b>, then it will make "
"them bigger and eventually it will add markers to every <b>5<sup>th</sup> "
"page</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">十頁標記</span>：隨著該值增大，首先會在每<b> 10 </b>頁處新"
"增標記，接著標記會變大，最終還會進一步在每<b> 5 </b>頁處新增標記。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2832-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-pagebrowser"
msgid "4.4 Page Browser"
msgstr "4.4 頁面瀏覽器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2833-6
msgid ""
"Page Browser can be used to navigate between pages like in a photo album by "
"showing thumbnails of the pages as a grid. You can open <span "
"class=\"ui\">Page Browser</span> by tapping on the <span class=\"ui\">Book "
"Map</span> or from the menu. You can also assign a gesture for easier access."
msgstr ""
"頁面瀏覽器以網格形式展示書頁縮圖，可用於像瀏覽相簿一樣快速定位頁面。<span "
"class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>可透過點擊<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖</span>或"
"從選單中進入。還可透過指定手勢來快速呼出。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2839-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.div:307-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Page browser"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 頁面瀏覽器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2844-6
msgid ""
"Usage of <span class=\"ui\">Page Browser</span> is explained below. You can "
"also tap on the <span class=\"ui\"> top left corner hamburger menu button </"
"span> on this screen to see these explanations. A long-press on the same "
"button adds/removes chapter titles from the bottom strip."
msgstr ""
"下方展示了<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>的用法。也可透過點擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">介面左上角的漢堡狀選單鍵</span>檢視功能介紹。長按該按鍵還可顯示"
"或隱藏底部定位欄中的章節標題。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2851-7
msgid ""
"Swipe <b>left / right</b> over this top edge to increase / decrease the "
"number of the <b>columns</b>."
msgstr "在頂部邊緣<b>左滑或右滑</b>可增加或減少書頁縮圖的<b>分欄</b>的數量。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2853-7
msgid ""
"Swipe <b>up / down</b> over this left edge to increase / decrease the number "
"of the <b>rows</b>."
msgstr "在左側邊緣<b>上滑或下滑</b>可增加或減少書頁縮圖<b>行數</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2855-7
msgid ""
"Swipe the pages area to move the viewed pages. <b>Up / down</b> to scroll "
"one row (2 pages in the example), <b>left / right</b> to scroll one screen "
"(4 pages in the example)."
msgstr ""
"在中間區域滑動可移動顯示的縮圖。<b>上滑或下滑</b>將捲動一行（在圖示中對應 2 "
"塊縮圖），<b>左滑或右滑</b>可翻過整屏（在圖示中對應 4 塊縮圖）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2858-7
msgid "Tap any page to open that page in reading view."
msgstr "點擊縮圖可在閱讀檢視中閱讀該頁。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2859-7
msgid ""
"On the bottom area, tapping on a page focuses the thumbnail view on that "
"page. Swiping <b>left / right</b> will jump one stripe width."
msgstr ""
"點擊底部刻度條區域的任意位置以該頁為中心顯示縮圖。在底部<b>左滑或右滑</b>將跳"
"過一整塊刻度條對應的頁數。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:2861-7
msgid ""
"Icons on the bottom area are same as the ones used in <span "
"class=\"ui\">Book Map</span> and explained under that section."
msgstr ""
"底部區域的圖示與<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖</span>中使用的圖示相同，並在該節"
"中進行了解釋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2865-6
msgid "Alternative theme for Book map and Page Browser"
msgstr "書籍地圖及頁面瀏覽器擁有備選主題"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2867-6
msgid ""
"Book map and page browser has an <b>Alternative theme</b> with a different "
"shading scheme which you can activate from their hamburger menus. This theme "
"uses alternating colors for the chapter headings so chapter boundaries is "
"more visible in the <span class=\"ui\">Book map</span> and <span "
"class=\"ui\">Page browser</span>. But the usage of gray color in this theme "
"requires flashing to black so it might be distracting for some users. You "
"can try both and use the one you like."
msgstr ""
"透過漢堡狀選單鍵還可為書籍地圖和頁面瀏覽器套用不同底紋的<b>備選主題</b>。該主"
"題對章節標題交替上色，使章節邊界在<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖</span>和<span "
"class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>中更易識別。但該主題使用的灰色會觸發 e-ink 全螢"
"幕刷新，可能會干擾閱讀。請自行嘗試是否需要啟用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2873-6
msgid "4.5 Page Numbering"
msgstr "4.5 頁碼編號"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2875-6
msgid ""
"Page numbers in KOReader <span class=\"ui\">status bar</span> behave "
"differently depending on the document type; some are fixed, while others "
"adjust dynamically. In the image below, you can see an overview of the page "
"numbering system of KOReader. You can come back to this chart while reading "
"this section."
msgstr ""
"KOReader <span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>中的頁碼會因文件類型而異；有些是固定"
"的，另一些則會動態調整。下圖概覽了 KOReader 的頁碼編排體系。閱讀本節時，可隨"
"時回看這張圖表。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2878-6
msgid ""
"As you can see, documents that KOReader is able to open, can be divided into "
"two categories which we will explain below:"
msgstr "如圖所示，KOReader 能夠開啟的文件可分為以下兩類，下文將分別說明："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2882-6
msgid "1. Fixed-Layout Documents"
msgstr "固定版式文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2884-6
msgid ""
"<b>PDF, DjVu and CBR/CBZ</b> are examples of this type of documents. Also "
"known as <b>non-reflowable</b>, these documents has a static layout. This "
"means, every element on the page (text and image) is precisely positioned "
"and their position never changes, whether you are reading it on a small "
"screen or big. The design that you see, is always an exact replica of a "
"printed page."
msgstr ""
"<b>PDF, DjVu and CBR/CBZ</b> 都屬於這類文件。這類文件又稱<b>不可重排</b>文"
"件，其版式是靜態的。這意味著頁面上的每個元素（文字與圖片）都有精確定位，無論"
"在大屏還是小屏裝置上閱讀，位置都不會改變。您所看到的版式始終與印刷頁面完全一"
"致。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2887-6
msgid ""
"Fixed-layout documents have only <span class=\"ui\">static page numbers</"
"span>. When you open these type of documents in KOReader, page numbers that "
"you see in the status bar, belong to the document itself. <span "
"class=\"ui\">Static page numbers</span> <b>don't change</b> with the type or "
"screen size of the reader device."
msgstr ""
"固定版式文件只有<span class=\"ui\">靜態頁碼</span>。在 KOReader 中開啟這類文"
"件時，狀態列中看到的頁碼屬於文件本身。<span class=\"ui\">靜態頁碼</span><b>不"
"會</b>隨閱讀裝置的類型或螢幕尺寸而改變。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2891-6
msgid "2. Reflowable Documents"
msgstr "可重排文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2893-6
msgid ""
"<b>EPUB, MOBI, AZW, HTML</b> are examples of this type of documents. The "
"layout of these documents is not fixed. This means, the text and other "
"content can adapt (reflow) to fit the size of the screen or window that you "
"are viewing the document in."
msgstr ""
"<b>EPUB、MOBI、AZW、HTML</b> 都屬於這類文件。這類文件的版式並不固定。也就是"
"說，文字及其他內容會自行調整（重排），以適配您閱讀文件時所用螢幕或視窗的大"
"小。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2896-6
msgid ""
"You can imagine these type of documents as very long text files or web "
"pages, which naturally don't have page breaks. When you open these "
"documents, KOReader calculates the page numbers on the first opening by "
"dividing this long document into <b>screen sized</b> pages. As a result of "
"this, if you open a document on a 10-inch reader, your book will have less "
"pages than a 6-inch reader because more words can fit on a single page of "
"bigger screen (more words per page = less pages in total)."
msgstr ""
"可以把這類文件想像成很長的純文字檔案或網頁，它們本身自然沒有分頁。開啟這類文"
"件時，KOReader 會在首次開啟時把這份長文件切分為<b>螢幕大小</b>的頁來計算頁"
"碼。因此，若在 10 英寸閱讀器上開啟文件，書的總頁數會少於 6 英寸閱讀器，因為更"
"大的螢幕單頁能容納更多文字（每頁字數越多 = 總頁數越少）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2899-6
msgid ""
"This also means that if you change the appearance of the text, for example "
"by making the font bigger, this will change your page numbers. Because with "
"a bigger font size, less text will fit on the screen, increasing the total "
"number of pages."
msgstr ""
"這也意味著，如果您改動文字外觀，例如把字型調大，頁碼也會隨之變化。因為字型大"
"小變大後，螢幕能容納的文字變少，總頁數就會增加。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2901-6
msgid "Stable page numbers"
msgstr "固定頁碼"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2903-6
msgid ""
"Due to their changing nature, <b>reflowable document page numbers</b> are "
"not very useful for referencing. When you open a <b>PDF</b> file (which is a "
"fixed-layout document) on your e-reader and on your computer at the same "
"time, page 42 will always show the same content on both devices. But for an "
"<b>EPUB</b> file, page 42 on one device will be different from the other."
msgstr ""
"由於頁碼會不斷變化，<b>可重排文件的頁碼</b>並不太適合用作引用參照。如果您同時"
"在電子書閱讀器和電腦上開啟某個 <b>PDF</b> 檔案（固定版式文件），第 42 頁在兩"
"臺裝置上顯示的內容始終相同。但對 <b>EPUB</b> 檔案而言，一臺裝置上的第 42 頁與"
"另一臺並不相同。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2908-6
msgid ""
"So now you might ask: <b>\"Is it possible to have non-changing page numbers "
"on a reflowable document like EPUB?\"</b> Yes it is possible with the <span "
"class=\"ui\">stable page numbers</span> feature. There are two types of "
"<b>stable page numbers</b> in KOReader:"
msgstr ""
"此時您可能會問：<b>「像 EPUB 這樣的可重排文件，能不能擁有固定不變的頁碼？」</"
"b>可以，藉助 <span class=\"ui\">固定頁碼</span>功能即可實現。KOReader 提供兩"
"種<b>固定頁碼</b>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2915-6
msgid "- Publisher page numbers:"
msgstr "- 出版商頁碼："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2917-6
msgid ""
"KOReader supports documents with <b>publisher page numbers</b> feature, "
"which allows publishers to embed page numbers from printed books directly to "
"the e-book version. When you enable this feature, KOReader doesn't calculate "
"the page numbers itself. Instead, it shows you the <b>embedded</b> page "
"numbers from the publisher. This means, the page number you see in your "
"<span class=\"ui\">status bar</span> matches the print version of the book."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 支援<b>出版商頁碼</b>功能，出版商可利用該功能把印刷版書籍的頁碼直接"
"嵌入電子版中。啟用該功能後，KOReader 不會自行計算頁碼，而是顯示出版商提供的"
"<b>內嵌頁碼</b>。這樣一來，您在<span class=\"ui\">狀態列</span>中看到的頁碼便"
"與印刷版一致。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2922-6
msgid "You can enable this feature from:"
msgstr "若要啟用該功能，請按照下列路徑操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2924-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Stable page numbers / Use stable page "
"numbers"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 固定頁碼 / 使用固定頁碼"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2927-6
msgid ""
"If you also check the <span class=\"ui\">Show stable page numbers in margin</"
"span> option from the same menu, these publisher page numbers will be shown "
"next to the text in a small font."
msgstr ""
"如果同時勾選了該選單中的<span class=\"ui\">在邊緣顯示固定頁碼</span>選項，這"
"些出版商頁碼將以小號字型顯示在正文旁。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2932-6
msgid "- Characters per page:"
msgstr "- 每頁字元數："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2934-6
msgid ""
"What if your book doesn't have <b>publisher page numbers</b> (majority of "
"them don't) but you still need stable page numbers?"
msgstr ""
"如果您的書沒有<b>出版商頁碼</b>（大多數書都沒有），卻仍需要固定頁碼，該怎麼"
"辦？"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2937-6
msgid ""
"Then you can enable the <span class=\"ui\">characters per page</span> "
"feature of KOReader. When you use this feature, KOReader calculates the page "
"numbers according to a defined number of <span class=\"ui\">characters per "
"page</span> (instead of your screen size). So, for example you can set "
"KOReader to \"count <b>1500 characters</b> as a single page\" (default value "
"of this setting which roughly equals to 250 words in English language). And "
"approximately 250 words is the single page of a standard <b>mass market "
"paperback/PA5 format</b> book."
msgstr ""
"此時可以啟用 KOReader 的 <span class=\"ui\">每頁字元數</span>功能。使用該功能"
"後，KOReader 會按照設定的 <span class=\"ui\">每頁字元數</span>來計算頁碼，而"
"不再依據螢幕尺寸。例如，您可以把 KOReader 設為「把 <b>1500 個字元</b>算作一"
"頁」（這是該設定的預設值，大致相當於英文 250 個單詞）。而約 250 個單詞正是標"
"準<b>大眾市場平裝本/PA5 開本</b>圖書一頁的容量。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2943-6
msgid ""
"So when you enable this feature, your page count will be similar to a real "
"book printed at the mentioned size. Of course you can change this <span "
"class=\"ui\">characters per page</span> setting from the menu to simulate "
"different book sizes."
msgstr ""
"因此啟用該功能後，書的總頁數會接近按上述尺寸印刷的實體書。當然，您也可以在選"
"單中調整 <span class=\"ui\">每頁字元數</span>設定，以模擬不同開本的書籍。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2946-6
msgid ""
"If you have the printed version of a book, you can adjust the <span "
"class=\"ui\">characters per page</span> number to match the <b>total page "
"numbers</b> to the printed book so it would be easier to find a passage in "
"the other version."
msgstr ""
"如果您手頭有某本書的紙質版，可以調整 <span class=\"ui\">每頁字元數</span>的數"
"值，使<b>總頁數</b>與紙質版一致，這樣便更容易在另一版本中定位到同一段落。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2950-6
msgid "Changes after enabling the stable page numbers feature"
msgstr "啟用固定頁碼功能後的變化"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2952-6
msgid ""
"When you enable the <b>stable page numbers</b> for a document, these changes "
"happen:"
msgstr "為某份文件啟用<b>固定頁碼</b>後，會發生以下變化："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2956-7
msgid ""
"Your status bar switches to <b>stable page numbers</b> for the read/"
"remaining/total page counts."
msgstr "狀態列中的已讀、剩餘及總頁數會切換為<b>固定頁碼</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2959-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">File browser</span> shows <b>stable page numbers</b> for "
"this document for the <b>total page count</b>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>會按<b>固定頁碼</b>顯示這份文件的<b>總頁"
"數</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2963-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</span>, <span class=\"ui\">Table of Contents</"
"span> and <span class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> shows <b>stable page "
"numbers.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">書籤</span>、<span class=\"ui\">目錄</span>和<span "
"class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>也會顯示<b>固定頁碼。</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2967-7
msgid ""
"If you export your highlights from this document, export file will have the "
"<b>stable page numbers</b> for the highlight and note locations."
msgstr ""
"若從這份文件匯出劃線，匯出檔案中劃線與筆記的位置資訊將使用<b>固定頁碼</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2971-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-toctools"
msgid "4.6 Table of Contents Tools"
msgstr "4.6 目錄工具"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2972-6
msgid ""
"Some of the digital books you come across might not have a proper table of "
"contents (<b>ToC</b>). Depending on the preparation of the book, you can "
"experience these ToC problems:"
msgstr ""
"一些電子書可能沒有合適的目錄（<b>ToC</b>）。根據書籍的製作情況，可能會遇到下"
"列目錄相關問題："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2976-7
msgid ""
"No ToC in the book, so you can’t jump between the chapters or see the "
"remaining reading times"
msgstr "書籍缺少目錄，因此你無法在章節間跳轉或檢視剩餘閱讀時間"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:2977-7
msgid ""
"There is a ToC but it is not very useful because it has wrong or missing "
"chapter titles"
msgstr "書籍包含的目錄用處不大，因為目錄中的章節標題存在錯誤或缺失"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2980-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has some features that you can use when reading books with a "
"problematic table of contents section."
msgstr "KOReader 的一些功能可以在閱讀這類目錄有問題的書籍時提供幫助。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2984-6
msgid ""
"Note that <span class=\"ui\">Alternative table of contents</span> is not "
"available on <b>fixed layout documents</b> like PDF, DJVU etc. because it "
"requires HTML tags to create a ToC. <span class=\"ui\">Custom table of "
"contents</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Custom hidden flows</span> features "
"are available on all file types."
msgstr ""
"請注意<span class=\"ui\">替代性目錄</span>無法應用於 PDF、DJVU 等<b>固定版式"
"文件</b>，因為建立替代性目錄功能依賴於文件的 HTML 標籤。<span class=\"ui\">自"
"訂目錄</span>及<span class=\"ui\">自訂隱藏頁</span>功能則可用於所有檔案格式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2990-6
msgid ""
"Automatically creating a table of contents: ALTERNATIVE TABLE OF CONTENTS"
msgstr "自動建立目錄：替代性目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:2992-6
msgid ""
"First feature is the <span class=\"ui\">Alternative table of contents</span> "
"which you can find in:"
msgstr "透過下列路徑可以找到<span class=\"ui\">替代性目錄</span>功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:2997-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.div:465-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Alternative table of contents"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 替代性目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3000-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> An "
"EPUB document is basically a ZIP file containing one or more HTML files. "
"Your book might be one big HTML file for the whole book or it might contain "
"separate chapters as individual HTML files (which is a better structure)."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> EPUB "
"文件本質上是包含一個或多個 HTML 檔案的 ZIP 壓縮檔。整本書可能僅包含單"
"個 .html 檔案，或者每章節被拆分為獨立 .html 檔案（這種結構更好）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3003-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Alternative table of contents</span> tries to create a "
"ToC from the headings in your book (<b>H1</b> to <b>H6</b> tags in the HTML "
"files in your EPUB). If your book doesn’t contain any headings, it will try "
"to build a ToC from the document fragments (individual HTML files in your "
"EPUB book) which will point to the beginning of each file."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">替代性目錄</span>功能會嘗試利用書籍的章節標題（EPUB 文件"
"中 <b>H1</b> 到 <b>H6</b> 的 HTML 標籤）自動生成目錄。如果書籍不包含任何標"
"題，該功能會嘗試根據文件分段（EPUB 文件中的獨立 HTML 檔案）生成目錄。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3008-6
msgid ""
"You can choose which heading levels to include (or ignore) in your ToC from "
"this menu:"
msgstr "可以在下列選單中選擇替代性目錄所包含（或忽略）哪些章節標題層級："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3010-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Style tweaks / Miscellaneous / Alternative ToC hints"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 樣式微調 / 雜項 / 替代性目錄標記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3013-6
msgid "Manually creating a table of contents: CUSTOM TABLE OF CONTENTS"
msgstr "手動建立目錄：自訂目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3015-6
msgid ""
"Custom table of contents feature allows you to create your own ToC from the "
"selected parts of your book. This ToC can contain only one level so you "
"can’t have sub-chapters while using this feature. To create your own ToC, "
"first enable:"
msgstr ""
"利用自訂目錄功能可以從書籍內頁中選定文段來組成標題。此目錄只能包含一個層級，"
"因此無法列入子章節標題。要建立自訂目錄，請先在下列路徑中啟用自訂目錄："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3019-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Custom table of contents"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 自訂目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3022-6
msgid ""
"Once you enable this feature, new menu items will be added to the user "
"interface which allows you to select your chapters. You can add a chapter to "
"your ToC from two places:"
msgstr ""
"啟用自訂目錄後，使用者介面將出現新的選單項，用以選擇章節標題。可以從以下兩種"
"途徑新增章節："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3025-7
msgid ""
"<b>From a highlight:</b> While reading a book, select a text like you are "
"highlighting it or long press on a word. In the popup menu you will see the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Start TOC chapter</span> item. When you press on it, you "
"will see a dialog asking you to enter your chapter title. The text you "
"selected will be already entered in the dialog. Edit your title if necessary "
"and press create."
msgstr ""
"<b>透過劃線</b>：在閱讀書籍時，滑動文段選中（像類似劃線操作）、或在文字上長"
"按。在彈出選單中可見<span class=\"ui\">開始目錄章節</span>選項。點擊該項，會"
"出現對話方塊要求輸入章節標題。前面選中的文段會被自動填入，可按照需要進行編"
"輯。點擊建立即可儲存。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3028-7
msgid "<b>From the Page browser:</b> Open the Page browser via"
msgstr "<b>從頁面瀏覽器中新增</b>：按照下列路徑進入頁面瀏覽器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3032-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.div:500-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Page browser"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 頁面瀏覽器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3035-6
msgid ""
"Long press on the page thumbnail that you want to be the beginning of your "
"chapter and select <span class=\"ui\">Start TOC chapter</span> item from the "
"popup menu. You will see a dialog asking you to enter your chapter title."
msgstr ""
"長按要作為章節開頭的頁面縮圖，然後在彈出的選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">開始目"
"錄章節</span>。隨後會彈出對話方塊，提示你輸入章節標題。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3038-6
msgid ""
"When you are done creating your ToC and don’t want to see these extra "
"buttons, you can disable them by unchecking:"
msgstr ""
"當完成自訂目錄的建立、不再需要這些額外按鈕，可以透過取消勾選下列選項來將其停"
"用："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3040-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Custom layout features / Edit mode"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 版式自訂功能 / 編輯模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3043-6
msgid ""
"Creating this ToC will not alter your original ToC which comes with your "
"book. You can clear your <b>Custom table of contents</b> from this same menu "
"(in case you want to create a new one). And you can disable this feature "
"completely in the same way you enabled it, if you want to return to the "
"original ToC. Note that if you disable this feature after creating a custom "
"ToC to return to the original one, your custom ToC will not be deleted. You "
"can still switch between the original and your custom ToC."
msgstr ""
"建立自訂目錄並不會替換掉書籍內建的原目錄。在同一份選單中還可清除已建立的<b>自"
"訂目錄</b>（比如要建立一份新的）。要回到原目錄，可透過與啟用自訂目錄時相同的"
"方式將其停用。請注意，停用該功能並不會將刪除已建立的自訂目錄，之後仍可切換顯"
"示原目錄及自訂目錄。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3046-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-hiddenflows"
msgid "4.7 Excluding Sections"
msgstr "4.7 排除章節"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3048-6
msgid ""
"Some books or documents might contain long footnotes or bibliography "
"sections. Like a scientific book which is 250 pages long but last 50 pages "
"are Appendices, Index and References. Normally these pages are included in "
"the progress bar and reading time calculations since they are part of the "
"book. But generally these sections exist as a reference and they are not "
"read completely so you might want to exclude them to make your remaining "
"page count and time estimates more accurate. Or maybe you have an anthology "
"book which contain some stories you have already read. <span "
"class=\"ui\">Custom hidden flows</span> feature of KOReader allows you to "
"exclude these kind of parts of your book."
msgstr ""
"有寫書籍或文件可能附有大篇幅的腳註或參考書籍。比如一本 250 頁的科學類書籍最"
"後 50 頁全是附錄、專業術語索引及參考文獻。通常情況下這些頁碼仍會被計入閱讀進"
"度列和閱讀時間統計。但這些章節大多只作為參考，並不需要逐頁閱讀，因此可能希望"
"將其排除使頁碼計數和預估閱讀用時更加準確。再比如一本選集中包含了一些已經讀過"
"的篇章。<span class=\"ui\">自訂隱藏頁</span>功能可以將這類章節排除出去。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3052-6
msgid ""
"Have a look at the image for an overview of the process. Steps will be "
"explained after the image:"
msgstr "請瀏覽下方圖示大致瞭解操作過程，詳細步驟列於圖片下方："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3058-6
msgid "How to exclude a section by creating a hidden flow:"
msgstr "透過建立隱藏頁來排除部分章節："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3061-7
msgid "Go to the first page of the section you want to exclude"
msgstr "轉到要排除章節的起始頁"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3062-7
msgid "Open the <span class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> via:"
msgstr "按照下列路徑進入<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3065-8
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+navigating.ol.li.div:533-2"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Page browser"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 頁面瀏覽器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3067-7
msgid ""
"Long press on the page thumbnail that you want to be the beginning of your "
"excluded section and select <span class=\"ui\">Start hidden flow here</span> "
"item from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"找到要排除章節的起始頁，在頁面縮圖上長按，從彈出選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">"
"在此開始隱藏流</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3069-7
msgid ""
"You will see that the pages starting from your selection now have a gray "
"hatched background."
msgstr "此時可以看到從所選頁面開始的章節全部被灰色陰影覆蓋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3070-7
msgid ""
"Now go to the last page of your excluded section. You can navigate there "
"from the <span class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> or using other ways like "
"<span class=\"ui\">Book map, Skim widget</span> etc."
msgstr ""
"接下來，轉到被排除頁碼段的最後一頁。可以透過<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</"
"span>或<span class=\"ui\">書籍地圖、快速翻頁工具</span>等定位頁面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3073-7
msgid ""
"Once you are at the last page of your excluded section, open the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> again (if you are not already in it)."
msgstr "在被排除章節的結束頁上再次進入<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3075-7
msgid ""
"Find the last page of your hidden section and long press on the <b>next "
"page</b>. Choose <span class=\"ui\">Restart regular flow here</span> from "
"the popup menu. You will see that the background of the remaining pages will "
"return to normal color, indicating the end of hidden flow and the beginning "
"of regular flow."
msgstr ""
"找到要隱藏章節的結束頁，然後長按<b>下個頁面</b>的縮圖。從彈出選單中選擇<span "
"class=\"ui\">從此恢復正常排版流</span>。可以看到從所選頁面開始的章節不再被灰"
"色陰影覆蓋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3081-6
msgid "Working with the hidden sections:"
msgstr "頁碼段被隱藏後的表現："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3083-6
msgid ""
"When you create a hidden flow section as described above, KOReader’s "
"behavior will be similar to the situation as if you removed a section of a "
"paper book by cutting it out:"
msgstr ""
"當按照上述步驟建立隱藏頁後 KOReader 會將其視作不存在，類似於從紙版書中撕下部"
"分書頁："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3086-7
msgid ""
"These hidden flow sections will be skipped when turning pages. For example "
"assume that you created a hidden flow for <b>Chapter 10</b>. Now you are on "
"the last page of <b>Chapter 9</b>. When you turn the page, you will see "
"<b>Chapter 11</b>."
msgstr ""
"翻頁時將直接跳過隱藏頁。例如將<b>第十章</b>標記為隱藏頁後，從<b>第九章</b>的"
"最後一頁繼續翻頁將直接顯示<b>第十一章</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3087-7
msgid ""
"Page numbering will continue as if these hidden flow sections <b>do not "
"exist</b>."
msgstr "頁碼計數將<b>無視被隱藏的頁碼段</b>繼續增加。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3088-7
msgid ""
"These hidden sections will not be shown in your <span class=\"ui\">Progress "
"bar</span> (but read the explanation below) and will not be considered in "
"<b>time to read</b> calculations. But they will still be visible in the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Skim widget</span>."
msgstr ""
"被隱藏的章節將不會顯示在<span class=\"ui\">進度列</span>上（請另行閱讀下方解"
"釋），且不會被計入<b>閱讀用時</b>。但這些頁碼仍可透過<span class=\"ui\">快速"
"翻頁工具</span>存取。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3091-7
msgid ""
"Following direct links to the pages included in these hidden flow sections "
"will still work. Also you can still reach these sections from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Table of contents, Book map, Page browser, Skim widget</span>."
msgstr ""
"連結到位於被隱藏頁頁面的引用仍然有效。隱藏頁的頁面也可透過<span class=\"ui\">"
"目錄、書籍地圖、頁面瀏覽器和快速翻頁工具</span>存取。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3094-6
msgid ""
"As we said above, your hidden flows will be excluded from your <span "
"class=\"ui\">Progress bar</span>. But if you jump to one of your hidden "
"sections using any of the methods mentioned above, your Progress bar "
"temporarily becomes this hidden section’s progress bar. You can imagine this "
"as the progress bar is zooming into that hidden flow section. If you exit "
"out of this hidden section by turning the page at the end of it, or using "
"other navigation tools, your Progress bar will go back to showing the whole "
"book again (with your custom hidden flows again not visible)."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，隱藏頁將不會被計入<span class=\"ui\">進度列</span>。但如果使用上一"
"條提到的幾種方式存取隱藏頁的某一頁，進度列將臨時變為該隱藏頁的章節進度列。可"
"以把這想像成進度列放大到了被隱藏的章節。當翻到隱藏頁最末頁、或使用其他頁面定"
"位工具離開被隱藏的章節，進度列將恢復為顯示全書閱讀進度，此時自訂隱藏頁將從進"
"度列上消失。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3097-6
msgid "Removing and cleaning up hidden sections:"
msgstr "移除並清理被隱藏章節："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3098-6
msgid ""
"You can remove individual hidden flow sections from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Page browser</span> in the same way you created them. You can "
"also clear all of them at once with the menu item:"
msgstr ""
"隱藏頁可在<span class=\"ui\">頁面瀏覽器</span>中逐一恢復，方法與設定隱藏時一"
"致。還可以透過下列選單項一次性全部恢復："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3101-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Custom layout features / Clear all "
"marked pages"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 自訂版式功能 / 清除所有頁面標記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3104-6
msgid ""
"As you work on creating hidden flows by tagging pages as <span "
"class=\"ui\">Start hidden flow</span> or <span class=\"ui\">Restart regular "
"flow</span>, some of the previously made ones may stop having an effect. For "
"example in the case that you make <span class=\"ui\">Start hidden flow</"
"span> a few pages before an existing <span class=\"ui\">Start hidden flow</"
"span>, that existing one is no longer involved. This overlapping or obsolete "
"tags are remembered for practical purposes. Again in the previous example, "
"if you end that second hidden flow before the existing-but-no-longer-"
"involved Start hidden flow, this deactivated one will be involved again. You "
"can clear all these inactive markers if they interfere with your custom "
"flows, or once you finish making your hidden flows and happy with the "
"results:"
msgstr ""
"在透過標記頁面為<span class=\"ui\">隱藏頁起始處</span>或<span class=\"ui\">正"
"文頁碼起始處</span>來設定隱藏頁時，部分已經設定隱藏的頁碼可能不再生效。例如在"
"<span class=\"ui\">隱藏頁起始處</span>的早幾頁再次執行<span class=\"ui\">標記"
"為隱藏頁起始處</span>操作，之前設定的標記將不會被包含在內。出於實用性考慮，這"
"些重疊或失效的標記仍會被保留。還是上面的例子，當新設定的隱藏頁最末頁位於先前"
"已失效的隱藏頁區域內，先前失效的隱藏頁將再次生效。如果這些標記相互干擾，或對"
"隱藏頁的設定結果已經滿意，可以將失效的隱藏頁標記清除："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3108-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Custom layout features / Clear inactive "
"marked pages"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 自訂版式功能 / 清除失效的頁面標記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3117-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-formattingyourbook"
msgid "5 FORMATTING YOUR E-BOOK"
msgstr "5 排版你的電子書"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3119-6
msgid ""
"After learning the basics of KOReader from the previous section, now you "
"want to start reading probably. But before that, why not customize the "
"appearance of your book to make it look really nice."
msgstr ""
"在上一節瞭解了 KOReader 的基本用法後，您大概已經想開始閱讀了。不過在此之前，"
"不妨先調整一下書籍的外觀，讓它看起來更賞心悅目。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3121-6
msgid ""
"In this section, we will do a step-by-step \"digital typesetting\" to make "
"your e-book look more like a printed book. Aim of this tutorial is to get "
"you familiar with the KOReader's <b>text appearance settings</b> so you can "
"change them according to your taste later."
msgstr ""
"在本節中，我們將一步步進行「數字排版」，讓電子書看起來更接近印刷書。本教程旨"
"在幫助您熟悉 KOReader 的<b>文字外觀設定</b>，以便日後按自己的喜好進行調整。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3124-6
msgid "Here are the steps:"
msgstr "具體步驟如下："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3127-7
msgid ""
"<b>Get a nice font:</b> First we need a font for our book which looks more "
"like a printed book (and at the same time readable on an e-ink screen). If "
"you have a favorite font, you can use that. Otherwise you can download one "
"of our suggestions below. We have two fonts for different looks: <b>serif</"
"b> and <b>sans-serif</b> (if you don't know what these mean, just click on "
"the links to see the difference):"
msgstr ""
"<b>挑選一款合適的字型：</b>首先需要為書籍選一款更接近印刷書、同時在電子墨水螢"
"幕上也清晰易讀的字型。如果您已有心儀的字型，直接使用即可；否則可以下載下面推"
"薦的一款。我們準備了兩款風格不同的字型：<b>襯線</b>和<b>無襯線</b>（若不清楚"
"二者的區別，點擊連結即可檢視差異）："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3133-8
msgid ""
"If you like <b>serif</b> fonts, download <b>Lusitana</b>. This is an elegant "
"classical serif typeface that is designed for reading long texts. You can "
"download it from <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/"
"Lusitana\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"如果您喜歡<b>襯線</b>字型，可下載 <b>Lusitana</b>。這是一款典雅的古典襯線字"
"型，專為長文閱讀而設計。可點擊<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/"
"Lusitana\">這裡</a>下載。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3136-8
msgid ""
"If you like <b>sans-serif</b> fonts, download <b>Red Hat Text</b>. This is a "
"geometric sans typeface that prioritizes legibility. You can download it "
"from <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Red+Hat+Text\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"如果您喜歡<b>無襯線</b>字型，可下載 <b>Red Hat Text</b>。這是一款幾何風格的無"
"襯線字型，尤為注重易讀性。可點擊<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/"
"Red+Hat+Text\">這裡</a>下載。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3140-7
msgid ""
"<b>Transfer the font to your device:</b> If you don't know how, check this "
"part of the guide and come back here after copying the font to your device: "
"<a href=\"#L2-fonts\" class=\"internalink\">Using your own fonts</a>. You "
"should restart KOReader after transferring the font so it can add the font "
"to the <span class=\"ui\">font list</span>."
msgstr ""
"<b>把字型傳到裝置上：</b>如果不清楚操作方法，可先查閱指南中的相關部分，把字型"
"複製到裝置後再回到這裡：<a href=\"#L2-fonts\" class=\"internalink\">使用自己"
"的字型</a>。傳入字型後應重新啟動 KOReader，以便將字型加入<span class=\"ui\">"
"字型清單</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3143-7
msgid ""
"<b>Set your new font:</b> Open your book and go to the menu you see below. "
"Your newly added font should appear at the beginning of the font list. "
"Select it:"
msgstr ""
"<b>設定新字型：</b>開啟書籍，進入下圖所示的選單。新加入的字型應出現在字型清單"
"的開頭，選中它即可："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3145-7
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Font"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3148-7
msgid ""
"<b>Disable <span class=\"ui\">Embedded Fonts</span>:</b> Now we have to "
"disable this option by setting it to <span class=\"ui\">off</span> so "
"KOReader will use our selected font instead of the one included in the book. "
"If the setting is <b>grayed out</b> so you can't change the setting, this "
"means that there are no fonts embedded in this book so you can skip to the "
"next step:"
msgstr ""
"<b>停用<span class=\"ui\">內嵌字型</span>：</b>現在需要把該選項設為 <span "
"class=\"ui\">關閉</span>，讓 KOReader 使用我們選定的字型，而不是書籍內建的字"
"型。如果該設定項<b>呈灰色不可更改</b>，說明本書沒有內嵌字型，可跳過本步："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3152-7
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Embedded fonts"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 內嵌字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3155-7
msgid ""
"<b>Adjust <span class=\"ui\">Font size</span>:</b> Now we will adjust our "
"font size. For <b>Lusitana</b> <span class=\"ui\">22.0</span> is a nice "
"size. For <b>Red Hat Text</b> you can go down to <span class=\"ui\">20.0</"
"span>. However, this is a personal preference, so you can set it to whatever "
"looks best to you. Set the font size here:"
msgstr ""
"<b>調整<span class=\"ui\">字型大小</span>：</b>現在來調整字型大小。對 "
"<b>Lusitana</b> 而言，<span class=\"ui\">22.0</span> 是個合適的大小；<b>Red "
"Hat Text</b> 則可以小到 <span class=\"ui\">20.0</span>。不過這純屬個人偏好，"
"您可以按自己看著最舒服的數值來設。在此處設定字型大小："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3160-7
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_font.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Font size"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_font.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 字型大小"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3163-7
msgid ""
"<b>Adjust <span class=\"ui\">Font weight</span>:</b> If you are using "
"KOReader on an e-ink device, your text will look <b>less black</b> compared "
"to the LCD/OLED screens. Generally fonts are not designed specifically for e-"
"ink screens so we will fix this by making it darker with the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Font weight</span> setting. <span class=\"ui\">+1</span> is a "
"good starting point. Some thin fonts might require <span class=\"ui\">+2</"
"span>. You can set it more precisely by tapping the <span class=\"ui\">three "
"dots</span> at the end of the setting line:"
msgstr ""
"<b>調整<span class=\"ui\">字重</span>：</b>如果在電子墨水螢幕裝置上使用 "
"KOReader，文字看起來會比 LCD/OLED 螢幕<b>偏淡</b>。一般字型並非專為電子墨水螢"
"幕設計，因此可以透過 <span class=\"ui\">字重</span>設定把文字調深來彌補。"
"<span class=\"ui\">+1</span> 是不錯的起點，某些較細的字型可能需要 <span "
"class=\"ui\">+2</span>。點擊設定行末尾的 <span class=\"ui\">三個點</span>還可"
"以做更精細的調整："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3169-7
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_contrast.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Font weight"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_contrast.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 字重"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3172-7
msgid ""
"<b>Adjust <span class=\"ui\">Line spacing</span>:</b> Now we will adjust the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Line spacing</span> which determines the space between "
"lines vertically. This setting varies between fonts depending on the "
"character geometries. For <b>Lusitana</b> you can set it to <span "
"class=\"ui\">135 %</span>. <b>Red Hat Text</b> with its more open "
"characters, can afford a tighter <span class=\"ui\">120 %</span>. Set it "
"here:"
msgstr ""
"<b>調整<span class=\"ui\">行間距</span>：</b>接下來調整 <span class=\"ui\">行"
"間距</span>，它決定行與行之間的垂直距離。該設定因字型而異，取決於字元的字形結"
"構。<b>Lusitana</b> 可設為 <span class=\"ui\">135 %</span>；<b>Red Hat Text</"
"b> 字形較為舒展，可以用更緊湊的 <span class=\"ui\">120 %</span>。在此處設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3177-7
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Line Spacing"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 行間距"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3180-7
msgid ""
"<b>Adjust <span class=\"ui\">Margins</span>:</b> At this point our text "
"should look pretty nice. Now we will adjust the <span class=\"ui\">margins</"
"span> (empty white space around our text) as the last touch and finish our "
"adjustments. Now open this menu and adjust the settings as you see below:"
msgstr ""
"<b>調整<span class=\"ui\">邊距</span>：</b>到這一步，文字看起來應該已經相當不"
"錯了。最後再調整 <span class=\"ui\">邊距</span>（文字四周的留白），完成全部設"
"定。現在開啟下列選單，參照下圖進行調整："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:3183-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.ol.li.div:68-1"
msgid "BOTTOM MENU /"
msgstr "底部選單 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3185-8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">L/R Margins</span>: Set to <span class=\"ui\">level 7</"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">左右邊距</span>：設定為 <span class=\"ui\">級別 7</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3186-8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Top Margin</span>: Set to <span class=\"ui\">level 6</"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">上邊距</span>：設定為 <span class=\"ui\">級別 6</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3187-8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Bottom Margin</span>: Set to <span class=\"ui\">level 6</"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">下邊距</span>：設定為 <span class=\"ui\">級別 6</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3191-6
msgid ""
"After all these settings, your book should look more like a printed book. "
"You can make further adjustments to these settings if you wish."
msgstr ""
"完成上述設定後，書籍看起來應該更接近印刷書了。如果願意，還可以繼續微調這些設"
"定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3193-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-howtokeepsettings"
msgid "5.1 How To Save Settings"
msgstr "5.1 如何儲存設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3195-6
msgid ""
"So after all these settings, you might ask <b>\"Will my other books look "
"like this too?\"</b> No, not automatically. Because all these changes are "
"<b>valid only for the current book</b>."
msgstr ""
"設定完這些之後，您可能會問：<b>「我的其他書也會變成這樣嗎？」</b>不會，並不會"
"自動生效。因為所有這些改動<b>只對當前書籍有效</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3198-6
msgid ""
"In other reader applications, when you change a setting, let's say the font "
"used for books, it changes <b>globally</b>. Which means, if you change the "
"default font to <b>Verdana</b>, any books you open after this change "
"-including the ones that you are already reading- will be shown in this "
"Verdana font."
msgstr ""
"在其他閱讀器應用中，當你更改某項設定（例如書籍所用字型）時，更改會<b>全域性</"
"b>生效。也就是說，如果你把預設字型改為 <b>Verdana</b>，此後開啟的所有書籍——包"
"括你正在閱讀的——都會以這種 Verdana 字型顯示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3200-6
msgid ""
"KOReader's approach is different from this. We save appearance settings "
"<b>per book</b>. This gives you the flexibility to change your settings for "
"the current book without affecting others. For example if you have some "
"fantasy books, you can change the font to a medieval looking one only for "
"these books. Or you can set some books to open in <b>landscape orientation</"
"b> or <b>double column</b> mode."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 的做法與此不同。外觀設定是<b>按書籍</b>分別儲存的。這使你可以靈活地"
"更改當前書籍的設定，而不影響其他書籍。例如你有一些奇幻小說，可以只把這些書的"
"字型換成中世紀風格。也可以將某些書籍設為以<b>橫屏</b>或<b>雙欄</b>模式開啟。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3204-6
msgid "So this is how KOReader works:"
msgstr "KOReader 的機制是這樣的："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3207-7
msgid ""
"KOReader settings like font size, line spacing etc. have <b>default values</"
"b>."
msgstr "字型大小、行間距等 KOReader 設定都有<b>預設值</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3208-7
msgid ""
"If you open a new book, KOReader refers to these <b>default values</b> to "
"set the appearance of your book."
msgstr "開啟一本新書時，KOReader 會參照這些<b>預設值</b>來設定書籍外觀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3210-7
msgid ""
"When you make changes in a book, like adjusting the <b>text size</b>, they "
"affect only this specific book. Because your changes won't modify the "
"<b>default values</b>, so newly opened books won't be affected."
msgstr ""
"在某本書裡所做的改動（例如調整<b>文字大小</b>）只影響這一本書。因為這些改動不"
"會修改<b>預設值</b>，所以新開啟的書不受影響。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3211-7
msgid ""
"But you have the ability to save your changes as <b>defaults</b> and when "
"you do this, they will be used for the newly opened books too."
msgstr ""
"不過你也可以把改動儲存為<b>預設值</b>，這樣一來，新開啟的書籍同樣會採用這些設"
"定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3217-6
msgid "Let's see on an example:"
msgstr "來看一個例子："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3219-6
msgid ""
"During this exercise, we increased the <span class=\"ui\">Font weight</span> "
"of our book to <span class=\"ui\">+1.00</span>. Now open the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Font weight</span> menu and press the <span class=\"ui\">three "
"dots</span> at the end of the <span class=\"ui\">Font weight</span> setting "
"line. A dialog window will open and you will see this: <span "
"class=\"ui\">Default value: +0.00</span>. This means that when you open "
"another book, its font weight will still be <b>0 (Default value)</b>, "
"instead of <b>+1</b> as we have set before."
msgstr ""
"在剛才的操作中，我們把書籍的 <span class=\"ui\">字重</span>調到了 <span "
"class=\"ui\">+1.00</span>。現在開啟 <span class=\"ui\">字重</span>選單，點擊 "
"<span class=\"ui\">字重</span>設定行末尾的 <span class=\"ui\">三個點</span>。"
"此時會彈出一個對話方塊，顯示 <span class=\"ui\">預設值：+0.00</span>。這表示"
"開啟另一本書時，其字重仍為 <b>0（預設值）</b>，而不是我們之前設定的 <b>+1</"
"b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3226-6
msgid ""
"So to make a setting permanent, you have to set it as <b>default</b>. There "
"are two methods in KOReader for setting these <b>default</b> values:"
msgstr ""
"因此，要讓某項設定長期生效，必須把它設為<b>預設值</b>。KOReader 提供兩種設定"
"<b>預設值</b>的方法："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3230-7
msgid "Setting individual settings as defaults"
msgstr "將單項設定設為預設值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3231-7
msgid "Setting \"all of the settings\" as defaults at once"
msgstr "一次性將所有設定設為預設值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3234-6
msgid "1. Setting individual settings as defaults"
msgstr "1. 將單項設定設為預設值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3236-6
msgid ""
"Settings in KOReader generally can be set as default with a long-press. Have "
"a look at the screenshot below:"
msgstr "KOReader 中的設定通常都可以透過長按來設為預設值。請看下面的截圖："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3240-6
msgid ""
"Values on the right side marked in blue can be long-pressed to set them as "
"<b>defaults</b>. Let's say you want to make the text bolder. If you press on "
"<span class=\"ui\">+1</span> normally, it will change only for this book. "
"But if you long-press on it, you will see this dialog:"
msgstr ""
"右側以藍色標出的數值可以長按，將其設為<b>預設值</b>。假設想讓文字更粗一些：如"
"果普通點擊 <span class=\"ui\">+1</span>，改動只對本書生效；但長按它，就會看到"
"下面這個對話方塊："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3245-6
msgid ""
"If you press the <span class=\"ui\">Set as default</span> button, this book "
"and the books that you will open in the future will have <span "
"class=\"ui\">+1 font weight</span>."
msgstr ""
"如果點擊 <span class=\"ui\">設為預設</span>按鈕，本書以及今後開啟的書籍都將採"
"用 <span class=\"ui\">+1 字重</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3248-6
msgid ""
"This \"long-press to set as default\" rule works in menus too. For example "
"when changing the font from the top menu:"
msgstr ""
"這條「長按設為預設值」的規則在選單中同樣適用。例如從頂部選單更換字型時："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3251-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">short press</span> = change the font only for this book"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">短按</span> = 僅更改本書字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3253-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">long-press</span> = change the font for this book and all "
"the future books"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">長按</span> = 更改本書及今後所有書籍的字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3257-6
msgid ""
"Default values have a <span class=\"ui\">star</span> (★) in the menu system "
"or shown with a <span class=\"ui\">black border</span> around the indicators "
"as seen below:"
msgstr ""
"在選單系統中，預設值會帶有 <span class=\"ui\">星標</span> (★)，或在指示項周圍"
"顯示 <span class=\"ui\">黑色邊框</span>，如下圖所示："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3264-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> Remember that, the books that you have "
"already opened will keep their own settings. Changing defaults don't affect "
"them."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> 請記住，已經開啟過的書籍仍會保留各自的"
"設定。更改預設值不會影響它們。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3267-6
msgid "2. Setting \"all of the settings\" as defaults at once"
msgstr "2. 一次性將所有設定設為預設值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3269-6
msgid ""
"You also have the ability to set all of the current book settings as "
"defaults instead of one-by-one. This is useful if you make many changes to a "
"book and you want all your books to look like this one."
msgstr ""
"也可以把當前書籍的全部設定一次性設為預設值，而不必逐項操作。如果你對一本書做"
"了大量改動，並希望所有書籍都呈現出同樣的效果，這種做法會很有用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3271-6
msgid ""
"You can save the current document settings as <span class=\"ui\">defaults</"
"span> by choosing:"
msgstr "你可以透過選擇以下選項將更改儲存為<span class=\"ui\">預設值</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3274-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Document settings / Save document settings as "
"default"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 將當前文件設定儲存為預設值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3277-6
msgid ""
"This will overwrite all the settings with the current document's settings. "
"So all the books that you will open after pressing this menu item will look "
"exactly like your current book."
msgstr ""
"這會用當前文件的設定覆蓋所有設定。因此，點擊該選單項之後開啟的所有書籍，外觀"
"都會與當前這本書完全一致。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3279-6
msgid ""
"But what we can do about already opened books? Well, if you pressed the menu "
"item above and have set your <b>new defaults</b>, you can easily apply them "
"to any book now. Just open the book that you want to change, go to the same "
"menu and press this item:"
msgstr ""
"那麼已經開啟過的書又該怎麼辦？如果已經點擊了上面的選單項、設定好<b>新的預設值"
"</b>，現在就能輕鬆把它們應用到任意書籍：開啟想更改的書，進入同一選單，點擊下"
"面這一項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3281-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Document settings / Reset document settings to "
"default"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 將文件設定重設為預設值"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3284-6
msgid ""
"This basically tells KOReader to overwrite current book's settings with the "
"<b>defaults</b> (that you saved before). Don’t worry, this will only change "
"the appearance of the book. Your <b>reading position, highlights, notes and "
"bookmarks</b> will be preserved."
msgstr ""
"點擊該選項後，當前書籍設定將會回到上次配置的<b>預設值</b>。無需擔心，該選項僅"
"改變書籍樣式，<b>閱讀位置、劃線、筆記和書籤</b>會被保留。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3288-6
msgid "Applying a group of settings using profiles"
msgstr "使用設定檔應用一組設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3290-6
msgid "Ok, at this point you already know:"
msgstr "好了，至此你已經知道："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3293-7
msgid "How to change the individual settings of the current book"
msgstr "如何更改當前書籍的各項設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3294-7
msgid "How to set your changes as <b>defaults</b> so all books can use them"
msgstr "如何把改動設為<b>預設值</b>，讓所有書籍都能採用"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3298-6
msgid ""
"Now we will see another use case: Imagine that you have modified your "
"defaults to your liking so whenever you open a new book, it now looks "
"exactly as you want. And recently you started reading a fantasy fiction "
"series. You decided to immerse yourself in the books so you installed a nice "
"<b>medieval looking font</b> for this series (<a href=\"https://"
"fonts.google.com/specimen/Eagle+Lake\">here</a> is a nice one if you really "
"need something like this). But since this is a very different font, you had "
"to also change many settings like <span class=\"ui\">line spacing</span>, "
"<span class=\"ui\">font weight</span>, <span class=\"ui\">margins</span> etc."
msgstr ""
"現在來看另一種使用場景：假設你已經把預設值調成了自己喜歡的樣子，於是每次開啟"
"新書，外觀都正合心意。最近你開始讀一套奇幻叢書，為了更投入，特意為這套書裝了"
"一款漂亮的<b>中世紀風格字型</b>（如果確實需要，<a href=\"https://"
"fonts.google.com/specimen/Eagle+Lake\">這裡</a>有一款不錯的）。但由於這款字型"
"風格迥異，你還不得不改動 <span class=\"ui\">行間距</span>、<span "
"class=\"ui\">字重</span>、<span class=\"ui\">邊距</span>等許多設定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3303-6
msgid ""
"To change all these settings for these fantasy books, you have two options "
"according to what we have learned:"
msgstr "要為這些奇幻書籍改動上述全部設定，根據前面所學，你有兩種選擇："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3306-7
msgid ""
"You can change these settings for each book when you open them. This is very "
"tedious, not a good solution."
msgstr "可以在開啟每本書時逐本修改這些設定。這樣做非常繁瑣，並不是好辦法。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3307-7
msgid ""
"You can change settings for one book and use the <span class=\"ui\">Save "
"document settings as default</span> feature. But this will affect <b>all the "
"newly opened books</b>, which we don't want. We only want to apply the "
"medieval font settings to these few medieval books."
msgstr ""
"可以先改好一本書的設定，再用 <span class=\"ui\">儲存文件設定為預設</span>功"
"能。但這會影響到<b>所有新開啟的書籍</b>，並非我們所願——我們只想把中世紀字型的"
"設定應用到少數這幾本中世紀主題的書上。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3311-6
msgid ""
"Luckily KOReader has a feature called <span class=\"ui\">Profiles</span> "
"that allows us to save a book's settings and apply them to other books (you "
"can think of this like copy & paste)."
msgstr ""
"好在 KOReader 有一個名為<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>的功能，可以把某本書"
"的設定儲存下來並應用到其他書籍（可以把它理解為「複製與貼上」）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3314-6
msgid ""
"Now going back to our scenario, after adjusting all the settings for your "
"medieval fantasy book go here:"
msgstr "回到剛才的場景：為中世紀奇幻書籍調好全部設定後，前往下列路徑："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3316-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Profiles / New with current book settings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定檔 / 使用當前文件設定新建配置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3319-6
msgid ""
"It will ask you to name this profile. You can enter something like "
"<b>\"Medieval Fiction\"</b> and save. By doing this, we created a profile "
"named <b>Medieval Fiction</b> which includes the settings for the current "
"book. Now you can see this newly created profile in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Profiles</span> menu. To use this, you can open any book and "
"run this profile and all the saved settings will be applied."
msgstr ""
"它會要求為這個設定檔命名。可以輸入類似 <b>「Medieval Fiction」</b> 的名稱並儲"
"存。這樣就建立了一個名為 <b>Medieval Fiction</b> 的設定檔，其中包含當前書籍的"
"設定。現在可以在 <span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>選單中看到這個新建的設定檔。"
"要使用它，只需開啟任意書籍並執行該設定檔，所有已儲存的設定便會被應用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3324-6
msgid "You can run this profile from:"
msgstr "你可以從此處執行該設定檔："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3327-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Profiles menu</span> mentioned above"
msgstr "上文提到的<span class=\"ui\">設定檔選單</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3329-7
msgid "With a <a href=\"#L1-gestures\" class=\"internalink\">Gesture</a>"
msgstr "透過<a href=\"#L1-gestures\" class=\"internalink\">手勢</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3330-7
msgid "From a <a href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" class=\"internalink\">Quick Menu</a>"
msgstr "從<a href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" class=\"internalink\">快速選單</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3333-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> You "
"can even set a <b>trigger</b> for this profile so for example whenever you "
"open a book from the <b>\"Medieval Fiction\"</b> directory, this profile "
"will be automatically applied to it. Check the <a href=\"#L2-profiles\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Profiles</a> section for more information."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 甚至可"
"以為該設定檔設定一個<b>觸發條件</b>，例如每當開啟 <b>「Medieval Fiction」</"
"b> 目錄中的書籍時，就自動應用這個設定檔。詳情請參閱<a href=\"#L2-profiles\" "
"class=\"internalink\">設定檔</a>一節。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3339-6
msgid "5.2 Using your own fonts"
msgstr "5.2 使用自有字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3341-6
msgid "Adding new fonts to KOReader"
msgstr "向 KOReader 新增新字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3342-6
msgid ""
"You can add your own fonts to KOReader and use them as the <b>document font</"
"b>, <b>status bar font</b> and even as the <b>user interface font</b> (with "
"a user patch)."
msgstr ""
"可以把自己的字型新增到 KOReader，用作<b>文件字型</b>、<b>狀態列字型</b>，甚至"
"（藉助使用者補丁）用作<b>使用者介面字型</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3346-6
msgid "KOReader supports these common font formats:"
msgstr "KOReader 支援以下常見字型格式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3349-7
msgid "TrueType - <b>.ttf</b> extension"
msgstr "TrueType - <b>.ttf</b> 副檔名"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3351-7
msgid "OpenType - <b>.otf</b> extension"
msgstr "OpenType - <b>.otf</b> 副檔名"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3353-7
msgid "Web Open Font Format - <b>.woff</b> and <b>.woff2</b> extension"
msgstr "Web Open Font Format - <b>.woff</b> 和 <b>.woff2</b> 副檔名"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3358-6
msgid ""
"Font files with these extensions can be directly copied to the <span "
"class=\"ui\">/koreader/fonts/</span> folder on your device. Depending on "
"your device, this copying procedure might differ. For example:"
msgstr ""
"帶有這些副檔名的字型檔案可以直接複製到裝置上的 <span class=\"ui\">/koreader/"
"fonts/</span> 資料夾。具體複製方式可能因裝置而異，例如："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3362-7
msgid ""
"On <b>Kobo</b> devices complete path is <span class=\"ui\">/mnt/"
"onboard/.adds/koreader/fonts</span>"
msgstr ""
"在 <b>Kobo</b> 裝置上，完整路徑為 <span class=\"ui\">/mnt/onboard/.adds/"
"koreader/fonts</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3365-7
msgid ""
"On <b>PocketBook</b> devices, make a directory for each font in <span "
"class=\"ui\">/applications/koreader/fonts/</span> directory and copy your "
"font there."
msgstr ""
"在 <b>PocketBook</b> 裝置上，需在 <span class=\"ui\">/applications/koreader/"
"fonts/</span> 目錄下為每款字型各建一個目錄，再把字型複製進去。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3369-7
msgid ""
"On <b>Android OS</b> based devices, you can copy your fonts to these "
"directories:"
msgstr "在基於 <b>Android OS</b> 的裝置上，可以把字型複製到下列目錄："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:3372-9
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Internal storage/Fonts</span> - General font directory "
"for all Android apps"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Internal storage/Fonts</span> - 供所有 Android 應用使用的"
"通用字型目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:3374-9
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Internal storage/koreader/fonts</span> - KOReader "
"specific font directory."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Internal storage/koreader/fonts</span> - KOReader 專用字型"
"目錄。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3378-7
msgid ""
"On <b>Desktop</b> version, you can copy your fonts to the location that you "
"can see from the menu item shown below: <span class=\"ui\">Open fonts "
"folder</span>. Also if you turn on the <span class=\"ui\">Enable system "
"fonts</span> option from the same menu, KOReader can access all the fonts "
"that are available to your operating system:"
msgstr ""
"在 <b>Desktop</b> 版本中，可以把字型複製到下面選單項所顯示的位置：<span "
"class=\"ui\">開啟字型資料夾</span>。此外，若在同一選單中開啟 <span "
"class=\"ui\">可呼叫系統字型</span>選項，KOReader 便能使用作業系統中所有可用字"
"型："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:3382-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Font / Font settings / Open fonts folder"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 字型 / 字型設定 / 開啟字型資料夾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3386-6
msgid ""
"KOReader supports sub-directories for the <span class=\"ui\">Fonts</span> "
"directory, so you can copy font families as directories under this. After "
"copying your fonts to the mentioned directories, restart KOReader. New fonts "
"should appear at the beginning of the font list:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 支援為 <span class=\"ui\">Fonts</span> 目錄建立子目錄，因此可以把各"
"個字型系列作為子目錄複製進去。把字型複製到上述目錄後，重新啟動 KOReader，新字"
"型應出現在字型清單的開頭："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3389-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.div:274-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Font"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3392-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> KOReader can "
"generate a document with sample text rendered with all the fonts installed "
"on your device. This allows you to quickly compare the look and features of "
"the fonts like ligatures and character sets in non-Latin scripts like Greek, "
"Hebrew or Chinese. You can access this feature via:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> KOReader 可以生成一"
"份文件，用裝置上安裝的所有字型渲染範例文字。藉助它可快速比較各字型的外觀與特"
"性，例如希臘語、希伯來語或漢語等非拉丁文字中的連字和字元集。可透過下列路徑使"
"用該功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:3395-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Font / Font settings / Generate font test document"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 字型 / 字型設定 / 生成字型測試文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3398-6
msgid "Changing the status bar and user interface fonts"
msgstr "更改狀態列與使用者介面字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3400-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.p:285-0"
msgid "You can change the font of status bar items from here:"
msgstr "你可以在此更改狀態列項目的字型："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3402-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.div:287-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Status bar / Configure items / Item font"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 狀態列 / 設定項目 / 項目字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3405-6
msgid ""
"You can use any installed font for the status bar. If you need to display a "
"lot of information while maintaining legibility, we suggest the <b>DINish "
"Condensed</b> font. You can download it <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"playbeing/dinish\">here</a> and install using the same procedure explained "
"above."
msgstr ""
"狀態列可以使用任意已安裝的字型。如果需要在保持易讀的同時顯示大量資訊，推薦 "
"<b>DINish Condensed</b> 字型。可點擊<a href=\"https://github.com/playbeing/"
"dinish\">這裡</a>下載，並按上文相同的步驟安裝。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3409-6
msgid ""
"If you want to change the font of KOReader's user interface (menus and "
"dialogs), you can do it with a <span class=\"ui\">user patch</span>. "
"Instructions are here: <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/"
"14846\">User interface font changer patch</a>"
msgstr ""
"如果想更改 KOReader 使用者介面（選單和對話方塊）的字型，可以藉助 <span "
"class=\"ui\">使用者補丁</span>實現。相關說明見：<a href=\"https://github.com/"
"koreader/koreader/issues/14846\">使用者介面字型更換補丁</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3411-6
msgid "Font suggestions for e-ink screens"
msgstr "電子墨水螢幕字型推薦"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3412-6
msgid ""
"These fonts look good on an e-ink screen due to their increased contrast:"
msgstr "這些字型因對比度更高，在電子墨水螢幕上效果良好："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:3416-41
msgid "Serif suggestions"
msgstr "襯線字型建議"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3418-9
msgid "Spectral"
msgstr "Spectral（無東亞字集）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3419-9
msgid "Vollkorn"
msgstr "Vollkorn（無東亞字集）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3420-9
msgid "EB Garamond"
msgstr "EB Garamond（無東亞字集）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.p:3423-41
msgid "Sans Serif suggestions"
msgstr "無襯線字型建議"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3425-9
msgid "Geologica (Current user guide font)"
msgstr "Geologica（本使用者指南當前所用字型）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3426-9
msgid "Varela Round"
msgstr "Varela Round（圓體，無東亞字集）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3427-9
msgid "Wix Madefor Text"
msgstr "Wix Madefor Text（無東亞字集）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.table.tr.td.ul.li:3428-9
msgid "Google Sans Flex"
msgstr "Google Sans Flex"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3433-6
msgid ""
"In the guide we have a <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"specialfonts\">Special Fonts</a> section that might be useful if you need a "
"font that is specifically developed for better legibility, Dyslexia or ADHD."
msgstr ""
"指南中設有<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-specialfonts\">特殊字型</a>一"
"節，如果你需要專為提升易讀性、或針對閱讀障礙（Dyslexia）與注意力缺陷多動障礙"
"（ADHD）設計的字型，這一節或許會有幫助。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3436-6
msgid ""
"Also we suggest checking the <a href=\"https://github.com/Chairzard/WP-"
"Fonts\">WP Fonts</a> project. It has the largest compilation of free/open-"
"source fonts for KOReader, with bugfixes and other additions like kerning "
"fixes, enabling ligatures and opentype features that weren't properly "
"implemented, etc."
msgstr ""
"此外還推薦看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Chairzard/WP-Fonts\">WP Fonts</"
"a> 項目。它收錄了規模最大的 KOReader 免費/開源字型合集，並附帶錯誤修復及其他"
"改進，例如修正字距微調、啟用連字、補全未正確實現的 OpenType 特性等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3440-6
msgid "Monospace suggestion"
msgstr "等寬字型建議"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3441-6
msgid ""
"If you are planning to use your own monospace font, probably you already "
"have a favorite one, so we are not offering any examples here. If you need, "
"you can find and compare many monospace fonts at <a href=\"https://"
"www.programmingfonts.org/\">programmingfonts.org</a>"
msgstr ""
"如果你打算使用自己的等寬字型，可能你已經有一個最喜歡的字型了，所以我們在這裡"
"不提供任何例子。但是你可以在<a href=\"https://www.programmingfonts.org/"
"\">programmingfonts.org</a>上找到並比較許多等寬字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3443-6
msgid ""
"You can also discover more fonts on the <a href=\"https://"
"fonts.google.com\">Google Fonts</a> website."
msgstr ""
"你還可以在<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com\">Google Fonts</a>網站上發現更多"
"字型。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3449-6
msgid "Using different fonts in one document"
msgstr "在一本書籍中套用多種字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3451-6
msgid ""
"In HTML/CSS based documents like EPUBs, books can specify to use fonts by "
"family instead of a specific font name. These families can be <b>Serif, Sans-"
"Serif, Monospace, Cursive, Fantasy, Emoji, Fang Song and Math</b>. For "
"example in a book, normal text can be shown in <b>Sans-serif</b> while "
"dialogues are shown in <b>Serif</b> font. KOReader normally uses your "
"default font for all these families except <b>Monospace</b> and <b>Math</b> "
"(which is determined by the style of the text nodes, for example <b>'font-"
"family: serif'</b>). If you want these families to look distinct, you can "
"assign specific fonts for them here:"
msgstr ""
"在基於 HTML/CSS 的文件（如 EPUB）中，書籍可以指定使用字型族而不是特定的字型名"
"稱。這些字型族可以是<b>襯線體（Serif）、無襯線體（Sans-Serif）、等寬體"
"（Monospace）、草書體（Cursive）、花體（Fantasy）、表情符號體（Emoji）、仿宋"
"體（Fang Song）和數學體（Math）</b>。例如，在一本書中，正常的文字可以用<b>無"
"襯線體</b>顯示，而對話則用<b>襯線體</b>顯示。KOReader 通常對所有這些字型族使"
"用預設字型，但<b>等寬體（Monospace）</b>和<b>數學體（Math）</b>除外（具體由文"
"字節點的樣式決定，例如 <b>'font-family: serif'</b> ）。如果你希望這些字型族看"
"起來更具區別性，你可以在這裡為它們指定特定的字型："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3457-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Font / Font-family fonts"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 字型 / 字型系列"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3460-6
msgid ""
"To change a family font for the current book just tap on the desired font "
"name. If you want to set this for all your books, long-tap to set it as a "
"<b>default (★)</b>. If a book abuses this font family feature to the point "
"where your default font is hardly used, you can disable that family font for "
"this book by unchecking the association."
msgstr ""
"要更改當前書籍的字型系列，只需點擊所需的字型名稱。如果你想為所有書籍設定此設"
"定，請長按將其設定為<b>預設設定（★）</b>。如果某本書濫用了此字型系列功能，以"
"至於幾乎不使用預設字型，則可以透過取消選中該關聯來停用該字型系列。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3464-6
msgid "Changing font quickly"
msgstr "快速切換字型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3466-6
msgid ""
"If you are switching between fonts frequently (i.e. <b>monospace</b> for "
"programming books and <b>serif</b> for novels) there is a workaround which "
"makes this easier than going into the menu each time. You can create "
"profiles for your fonts and all font related settings like <span "
"class=\"ui\">line spacing, contrast, bold</span> etc. and add these profiles "
"to a <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span>. So with a single gesture you can "
"open your font selection menu and change the font like shown in the image "
"below:"
msgstr ""
"如果你經常在字型之間切換（比如程式設計書籍用<b>等寬字型</b>，小說用<b>襯線字"
"型</b>），有一個解決方案可以讓你比每次都進入選單更容易。你可以為你的字型和所"
"有字型相關設定（如<span class=\"ui\">行間距，對比度，粗體</span>等）建立設定"
"檔，並將這些設定檔新增到<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>中。因此，只需一個"
"手勢，你就可以開啟字型選擇選單，並更改字型，如下圖所示："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3473-6
msgid ""
"Check the <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#qmandprofiles\">QUICK MENU AND "
"PROFILES</a> section of this guide to learn how to do this."
msgstr ""
"檢視本指南的<a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#qmandprofiles\">快速選單與設定檔"
"</a>部分，瞭解具體操作方法。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3476-6
msgid "Monospace font scale"
msgstr "等寬字型比例"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3478-6
msgid ""
"If your book includes parts with <b>Monospace</b> fonts (like in programming "
"books), Monospace text might look disproportional even if it is technically "
"at the same size as the rest of the book. This is caused by differing font "
"metrics. KOReader has an option that allows you to adjust the relative "
"Monospace font size to fix this difference:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的書籍包含使用<b>等寬</b>字型的部分（如程式設計書籍），等寬文字可能看起"
"來不成比例，即使其字型大小與其他文字在技術上相同。這是由不同的字型指標引起"
"的。KOReader 有一個選項允許你調整等寬字型的相對大小："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3481-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Font / Font settings / Monospace fonts scaling"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 字型 / 字型設定 / 等寬字型縮放"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3484-6
msgid ""
"Here you can increase or decrease the size of your Monospace font by "
"adjusting its scaling as a percentage of the default size."
msgstr "在這裡，你可以透過調整預設大小的百分比來增加或減少等寬字型的大小。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3486-6
msgid ""
"Technical details of KOReader font system and troubleshooting <span "
"class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 字型系統的技術細節與故障排除 <span class=\"microns_warning\" "
"title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3488-6
msgid ""
"If you are having problems with the font weights when adding fonts to "
"KOReader, this section can help you to understand how KOReader's font "
"processing works:"
msgstr ""
"如果在向 KOReader 新增字型時遇到字重方面的問題，本節可幫助你理解 KOReader 的"
"字型處理機制："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3491-7
msgid ""
"When starting up, KOReader compiles the available fonts by reading their "
"embedded <b>font metadata/info</b> and classifies them according to family "
"and weights. KOReader tries to determine the <b>font family information</b> "
"from the metadata included in the font, so <b>font names are not important</"
"b> when copying to your device."
msgstr ""
"啟動時，KOReader 會讀取各字型內嵌的<b>字型元資料/資訊</b>來整理可用字型，並按"
"字型系列和字重分類。KOReader 會嘗試從字型所含元資料中判斷<b>字型系列資訊</"
"b>，因此把字型複製到裝置時<b>字型名稱並不重要</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3496-7
msgid ""
"If you have more than one font file for a font family, KOReader will try to "
"fit fonts in one of these 4 categories: <b>Regular, Bold, Italic & "
"BoldItalic</b>. An ideal case looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"如果某個字型系列有多個字型檔案，KOReader 會嘗試把它們歸入以下 4 類之一："
"<b>Regular, Bold, Italic & BoldItalic</b>。理想情況如下："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3498-9
msgid ""
"Luciole-Regular.ttf mapped to <span class=\"ui\">Font weight: 0</span> "
"(Regular 400)"
msgstr ""
"Luciole-Regular.ttf 對映到 <span class=\"ui\">字重：0</span> (Regular 400)"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3500-9
msgid ""
"Luciole-Bold.ttf mapped to <span class=\"ui\">Font weight: +3</span> (Bold "
"700)"
msgstr "Luciole-Bold.ttf 對映到 <span class=\"ui\">字重：+3</span> (Bold 700)"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3502-9
msgid "Luciole-Regular-Italic.ttf"
msgstr "Luciole-Regular-Italic.ttf"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul.li:3503-9
msgid "Luciole-Bold-Italic.ttf"
msgstr "Luciole-Bold-Italic.ttf"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.ul:3503-36
msgid ""
"If a font variation is not available, as well as for fractional adjustments, "
"it will be synthesized from the nearest available weight."
msgstr ""
"如果某個字型變體不存在，或需要進行小數級的微調，KOReader 會從最接近的可用字重"
"合成得到。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3507-7
msgid ""
"If your font provides only one file and it is not <b>Bold</b>, KOReader will "
"assign it as (Regular 400) <span class=\"ui\">Font weight: 0</span> and "
"synthesize all other weights and variants itself. In other words KOReader "
"will fake italic and bold for this font. (If your single font file is a "
"<b>Bold</b> font, then KOReader will synthesize the <b>Regular</b> weight "
"from this bold font.)"
msgstr ""
"如果某款字型只提供一個檔案、且並非 <b>Bold</b>，KOReader 會把它指定為 "
"(Regular 400) 的 <span class=\"ui\">字重：0</span>，並自行合成其餘所有字重與"
"變體。換句話說，KOReader 會為這款字型「偽造」斜體和粗體。（如果這唯一的字型檔"
"案是 <b>Bold</b>，KOReader 則會由這個粗體合成出 <b>Regular</b> 字重。）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3513-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> If you long-press on the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Font weight</span> label in the bottom menu, it will tell you "
"which weight classes your current font provides."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> 如果在底部選單中長按 <span "
"class=\"ui\">字重</span>標籤，就會顯示當前字型提供了哪些字重級別。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3517-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\"></span> If your font also has other "
"variants, things can get confusing. Let's say you copied a font family to "
"your device. And upon startup, KOReader has read these variants of the font: "
"<b>Light, Thin, Normal, Medium, ExtraBlack, SemiBold, Bold, Black</b> in "
"this order. You would expect to see <b>Normal</b> variant to be used as the "
"document's normal font (because it is named as <b>Normal</b>) but KOReader "
"will use the <b>Light</b> variant because that is the first font in the list "
"that doesn't have the <b>bold flag</b>. And it will ignore the <b>Thin, "
"Normal</b> and <b>Medium</b> variants because it has already found a \"not "
"bold\" font for the document."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\"></span> 如果你的字型還有其他變體，情況就可能"
"變得複雜。假設你把一整個字型系列複製到了裝置上，啟動時 KOReader 讀到了該字型"
"的以下變體，順序為：<b>Light、Thin、Normal、Medium、ExtraBlack、SemiBold、"
"Bold、Black</b>。你可能以為 <b>Normal</b> 變體會被用作文件的正文字型（因為它"
"的名字就叫 <b>Normal</b>），但 KOReader 實際會選用 <b>Light</b>，因為它是清單"
"中第一個不帶<b>粗體標記</b>的字型。而 <b>Thin、Normal</b> 和 <b>Medium</b> 變"
"體會被忽略，因為 KOReader 已經為文件找到了一個「非粗體」字型。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3525-6
msgid ""
"And again according to this list, <b>ExtraBlack</b> will be used as the bold "
"font because it is the first font in the list with the <b>bold flag</b>. And "
"KOReader will ignore the <b>SemiBold, Bold, Black</b> variants, because "
"KOReader has already found the \"bold\" it is looking for."
msgstr ""
"同樣按這個清單，<b>ExtraBlack</b> 會被用作粗體字型，因為它是清單中第一個帶有"
"<b>粗體標記</b>的字型。而 <b>SemiBold, Bold, Black</b> 變體會被 KOReader 忽"
"略，因為它已經找到了所需的「粗體」字型。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3529-6
msgid ""
"As a summary of the above: We copied the whole family and expected "
"<b>Normal</b> and <b>Bold</b> variants to be chosen but instead, KOReader "
"used <b>Light</b> and <b>ExtraBlack</b> variants. This happened because the "
"order of the fonts that are fed to KOReader is not under our control so "
"\"first come is first served\"."
msgstr ""
"小結一下：我們複製了整個字型系列，本以為會選中 <b>Normal</b> 和 <b>Bold</b> "
"變體，結果 KOReader 卻用了 <b>Light</b> 和 <b>ExtraBlack</b>。這是因為字型送"
"入 KOReader 的順序不受我們控制，只能「先到先得」。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3535-6
msgid ""
"Solution is, transferring only the font files that you want to be used, like "
"this:"
msgstr "解決辦法是只傳入你希望使用的字型檔案，例如："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3538-7
msgid ""
"Keep only one of <b>Thin, Extra Light, Light, Normal, Medium</b>: It will be "
"used as the <b>regular font</b> (If your <b>Regular</b> font is too thin, "
"just replace it with <b>Medium</b> weight if you have it)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Thin、Extra Light、Light、Normal、Medium</b> 中只保留一個：它會被用作<b>常"
"規字型</b>（如果你的 <b>Regular</b> 字型太細，且手頭有 <b>Medium</b> 字重，換"
"成它即可）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3542-7
msgid ""
"Keep only one of <b>Semi Bold, Bold, Extra Bold, Black, Extra Black</b>: It "
"will be used as the <b>bold font</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Semi Bold、Bold、Extra Bold、Black、Extra Black</b> 中只保留一個：它會被用"
"作<b>粗體字型</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3543-7
msgid ""
"You can also add italic variants of the same weight (i.e. medium/medium-"
"italic)."
msgstr "也可以額外加入同字重的斜體變體（例如 medium/medium-italic）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3546-6
msgid ""
"5.3 Style tweaks <span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced topic\"></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"5.3 樣式微調 <span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced topic\"></"
"span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3548-6
msgid ""
"Style tweaks feature of KOReader allows you to modify how your book is "
"rendered by KOReader. We won't go through a full CSS course here. We just "
"want to show you the basics so when you see a style tweak, you will at least "
"have a rough idea what it does."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 的樣式微調功能允許你修改 KOReader 顯示書籍的方式。我們不會在這裡進行"
"完整的 CSS 課程。我們只想向你展示一些基本的東西，這樣當你看到一個樣式微調時，"
"你至少會有一個大致的概念。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3550-6
msgid "What is a style tweak?"
msgstr "什麼是樣式微調？"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3551-6
msgid ""
"We can describe an EPUB document as a <b>HTML file + some CSS rules</b>. "
"These CSS rules determine how different parts of the book (headings, bold "
"text, quotes etc.) will be shown on a reader app. With <span "
"class=\"ui\">style tweaks</span>, you can change how your book will be "
"rendered by adding new rules and/or overriding the rules written by the "
"publisher that is embedded in your book."
msgstr ""
"我們可以將 EPUB 文件描述為<b> HTML 檔案 + 一些 CSS 規則</b>。這些 CSS 規則決"
"定了書籍的不同部分（標題、粗體文字、引用等）在閱讀應用中的顯示方式。藉助"
"<span class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>，你可以透過新增新規則和/或覆蓋書籍中嵌入"
"的、由出版商編寫的規則，來更改書籍的呈現方式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3553-6
msgid "Let's see this on an example <span class=\"ui\">style tweak</span>:"
msgstr "讓我們看一個<span class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>的例子："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3555-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.p:440-0"
msgid "img { width: 10px !important; height: 10px !important }"
msgstr "img { width: 10px !important; height: 10px !important }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3556-6
msgid ""
"In plain language this rule says: <b>\"Ignore their original size and make "
"all the images in this book 10 pixels wide and 10 pixels high.\"</b> So if "
"you add this style tweak to KOReader, all the images in your book will be "
"shown tiny."
msgstr ""
"用通俗的語言來說，這條規則是：<b>忽略它們的原始大小，讓這本書中的所有圖片都"
"有 10 個像素寬，10 個像素高。</b>因此，如果你將此樣式微調新增到 KOReader，你"
"書中的所有圖片都將顯示的很小。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3559-6
msgid "Now lets explain this tweak item by item:"
msgstr "現在讓我們逐項解釋這個調整："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3562-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">img</span> - This is a CSS selector that targets all "
"<b>img</b> (image) elements in the book."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">img</span> - 這是一個 CSS 選擇器，目標是書籍中的所有 "
"<b>img</b>（圖片）元素。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3565-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">{ width: 10px !important; height: 10px !important; }</"
"span> - This is the declaration block. It contains the styles which will be "
"applied to the selected <b>img</b> elements."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">{ width: 10px !important; height: 10px !important; }</"
"span> - 這是宣告塊。它包含將應用於所選 <b>img</b> 元素的樣式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3568-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">width: 10px !important;</span> - This first part sets the "
"width of the targeted <b>img</b> elements to 10 pixels. The <b>!important</"
"b> declaration is an override switch which ensures that your width value "
"takes precedence over any other existing <b>width</b> declaration applied to "
"these images."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">width: 10px !important;</span> - 第一部分將目標 <b>img</"
"b> 元素的寬度設定為 10 像素。<b>!important</b> 宣告是一個覆蓋開關，它確保您的"
"寬度值優先於應用於這些圖片的任何其他現有 <b>width</b> 宣告。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3573-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">height: 10px !important;</span> - This part sets the "
"height of the targeted <b>img</b> elements to 10 pixels. Again, the <b>!"
"important</b> declaration is an override switch which ensures that your "
"height value takes precedence over any other existing <b>height</b> "
"declaration applied to these images."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">height: 10px !important;</span> - 這部分將目標 <b>img</b> "
"元素的高度設定為 10 像素。同樣，<b>!important</b> 是一個覆蓋開關，可確保您的"
"高度值優先於應用於這些圖片的任何其他現有 <b>height</b> 宣告。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3580-6
msgid ""
"In summary, this CSS rule is designed to set a <b>fixed width and height of "
"10 pixels</b> for all <b>img</b> elements in your book, <b>ignoring their "
"original style</b>."
msgstr ""
"總之，這個 CSS 規則旨在將你的書中的所有 <b>img</b> 元素設定<b>固定寬度和高度"
"為 10 像素</b>，並<b>忽略其原始樣式</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3584-6
msgid "Some useful examples of style tweaks"
msgstr "一些有用的樣式微調範例"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3586-6
msgid ""
"These are some useful style tweaks that you can use directly or modify "
"according to your liking. Next heading explains how to use them in KOReader."
msgstr ""
"這些是一些有用的樣式微調，你可以直接使用或根據自己的喜好修改。下一個標題解釋"
"了如何在 KOReader 中使用它們。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3589-7
msgid "Add a separator line above each heading in a book:"
msgstr "在書籍中的每個標題上方新增分隔線："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3590-7
msgid "H1, H2, H3, H4 { border-top: 2px solid black; }"
msgstr "H1, H2, H3, H4 { border-top: 2px solid black; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3592-7
msgid "Add some margin above the headings:"
msgstr "在標題上方新增一些邊距："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3593-7
msgid "H1, H2, H3, H4 { margin-top: 2em !important; }"
msgstr "H1, H2, H3, H4 { margin-top: 2em !important; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3595-7
msgid "Or if the book has too much margin above the headings, remove them:"
msgstr "或者，如果書的標題上方的邊距過多，請將其刪除："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3596-7
msgid "H1, H2, H3, H4 { margin-top: 0 !important; }"
msgstr "H1, H2, H3, H4 { margin-top: 0 !important; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3598-7
msgid "Add a small gap between paragraphs to make the text more readable:"
msgstr "在段落之間新增一個小間隙，使文字更具可讀性："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3599-7
msgid ""
"p + p { margin-top: 0.5em !important; margin-bottom: 0.5em !important; }"
msgstr ""
"p + p { margin-top: 0.5em !important; margin-bottom: 0.5em !important; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3601-7
msgid "Disable all images in an EPUB:"
msgstr "停用 EPUB 中的所有圖片："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3602-7
msgid "img { display: none !important; }"
msgstr "img { display: none !important; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3604-7
msgid "Make images very small instead of disabling them:"
msgstr "使圖片非常小，而不是停用它們："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3606-8
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.ul.li.p:491-2"
msgid "img { width: 10px !important; height: 10px !important }"
msgstr "img { width: 10px !important; height: 10px !important }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3609-7
msgid ""
"Make the code block sections in computer science books tidier and more "
"readable (<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/"
"9261#issuecomment-2508866126\">Here you can see an example</a>):"
msgstr ""
"使電腦科學書籍中的程式碼塊部分更整潔、更易讀（<a href=\"https://github.com/"
"koreader/koreader/issues/9261#issuecomment-2508866126\">在這裡你可以看到一個"
"例子</a>）："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:3611-8
msgid ""
"pre,code { font-size: 0.6em !important; line-height: 1.8em !important; "
"background-color: #eee !important; margin: 1em 0 !important; padding: 1em 0 !"
"important; }"
msgstr ""
"pre,code { font-size: 0.6em !important; line-height: 1.8em !important; "
"background-color: #eee !important; margin: 1em 0 !important; padding: 1em 0 !"
"important; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3623-6
msgid "How to add style tweaks"
msgstr "如何新增樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3625-6
msgid ""
"Ok, now we have seen what <span class=\"ui\">style tweaks</span> are. But "
"how can we use them? There are three types of <span class=\"ui\">style "
"tweaks</span> in KOReader:"
msgstr ""
"好的，現在我們已經瞭解了什麼是<span class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>。但我們如何"
"使用它們呢？KOReader 中有三種類型的<span class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3631-6
msgid "1. Built-in style tweaks"
msgstr "1. 內建樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3633-6
msgid ""
"This heading is new, and the screenshot above and below. Anything to add?"
msgstr "新建標題，上下截圖。還有需要新增的嗎？"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3635-6
msgid ""
"These tweaks are included in KOReader. They are the easiest to use since you "
"just enable them from the menu to use them. You don't need to write any CSS "
"code:"
msgstr ""
"這些調整都包含在 KOReader 中。它們是最容易使用的，因為你只需從選單中啟用它們"
"即可使用它們。你不需要寫任何 CSS 程式碼："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3637-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Style tweaks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3640-6
msgid ""
"They come in many categories. To apply a tweak to the <b>current book only</"
"b>, tick the checkbox. If you want to get more information about this tweak "
"or enable it for <b>all the books</b>, long-press on its name. A dialog will "
"appear:"
msgstr ""
"它們有很多種類。若要<b>僅對當前書籍</b>應用調整，請勾選核取方塊。如果你想獲得"
"更多關於這個調整的資訊，或者對<b>所有的書</b>啟用它，長按它的名字。將出現一個"
"對話方塊："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3645-7
msgid "This area shows the name and description of the tweak"
msgstr "此區域顯示參數的名稱和說明"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3646-7
msgid ""
"This box shows the CSS code of the tweak. You can tap on this area to copy "
"the code to the clipboard. Then you can paste and modify this code in your "
"<span class=\"ui\">Book-specific tweak</span> as explained under the next "
"heading."
msgstr ""
"此框顯示了調整的 CSS 程式碼。你可以點擊此區域將程式碼複製到剪貼簿。然後，你可"
"以在你的<span class=\"ui\">僅本書調整</span>中貼上和修改此程式碼，如下一標題"
"所述。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3649-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Show in action list</span> button allows you to toggle "
"this tweak with a gesture or add it to a <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</"
"span>. See the heading named <b>\"How to use tweaks efficiently\"</b> below "
"for more info."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">顯示在動作清單中</span>按鈕允許你透過手勢切換此調整，或將"
"其新增到<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>中。有關更多資訊，請參閱下面的<b>"
"「如何有效使用微調」</b>一節。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3653-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Use on all books</span> button activate this tweak for "
"all your books. A <b>star (★)</b> will appear next to its name in the menu, "
"indicating that this tweak will be applied to all books. You can disable "
"this with the same steps."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">用於所有書籍</span>按鈕為所有書籍啟用此調整。選單中其名稱"
"旁邊將出現一個<b>星號（★）</b>，表示此調整將應用於所有書籍。你可以使用相同的"
"步驟停用此功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3658-6
msgid "2. Book-specific tweak"
msgstr "2.僅本書調整"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3660-6
msgid ""
"As you can guess from its name, this type of tweaks are only active for the "
"book which you created them in. This feature is more useful for testing your "
"tweaks or if you need to fix something on the current book and you know that "
"you won't need it on other books. After creating this type of tweak, if you "
"decide that you will need it on other books too (i.e. from the same "
"publisher), you can convert it to a <span class=\"ui\">user style tweak</"
"span>, which we will explain next."
msgstr ""
"正如其名，這類微調僅對你建立它們時所在的那本書籍有效。此功能在你需要測試微調"
"效果，或明確只需對當前書籍做特定修復時更為實用。建立此類微調後，如果你認為其"
"他書籍（例如，來自同一出版商的書籍）也需要此設定，你可以將其轉換為<span "
"class=\"ui\">使用者樣式微調</span>，我們將在下面解釋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3662-6
msgid ""
"To create a <span class=\"ui\">book specific tweak</span>, use the "
"integrated editor which you can find here:"
msgstr ""
"要建立<span class=\"ui\">僅本書調整</span>，請使用你可以在此處找到的整合編輯"
"器："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3664-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Style tweaks / Book-specific tweak"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 樣式微調 / 僅本書調整"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3667-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> In the editor we "
"have a <span class=\"ui\">CSS</span> menu on the bottom toolbar. This menu "
"contains many useful CSS syntax and properties. When you open this menu "
"please first read the <span class=\"ui\">Long-press for info</span> help. "
"Also you can long-press on CSS items in this menu to see a description."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 編輯器底部工具欄有 "
"<span class=\"ui\">CSS</span> 選單，內建多種常用 CSS 語法和特性。在開啟該選單"
"前，請先閱讀<span class=\"ui\">長按取得資訊</span>幫助。另外，長按選單中的 "
"CSS 項可閱讀其功能描述。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3672-6
msgid "3. User style tweaks"
msgstr "3.使用者樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3674-6
msgid ""
"These group of tweaks are different from the previous ones in the way they "
"are created. Also unlike the previous type, they are not limited to a single "
"book. They can be applied globally to all of your books."
msgstr ""
"這組調整在建立方式上與之前的調整不同。與之前的類型不同，它們也不限於一本書。"
"它們可以在全域性範圍內應用於你的所有書籍。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3676-6
msgid "Procedure is roughly like this, which we will explain in detail:"
msgstr "程式大致是這樣的，我們將詳細解釋："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3679-7
msgid "Create your user tweak file"
msgstr "建立使用者調整檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3680-7
msgid "Transfer it to your device"
msgstr "傳輸到你的裝置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3681-7
msgid "Enable your tweak from the menu"
msgstr "從選單中啟用"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3685-6
msgid "1. Creating the user tweak file:"
msgstr "1. 建立使用者調整檔案："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3686-6
msgid ""
"A <span class=\"ui\">user style tweak</span> is actually a normal text file "
"with a <b>.css</b> extension. You can create this file:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">使用者樣式微調</span>實際上是一個副檔名為 <b>.css</b> 的普"
"通純文字檔案。你可以這樣建立此檔案："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3691-7
msgid "On your computer"
msgstr "在你的電腦上"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3692-7
msgid "On your device if it has a text editor (like Android OS based devices)"
msgstr "在你的裝置上，如果它有一個文字編輯器（如基於 Android 作業系統的裝置）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3693-7
msgid "In KOReader's integrated text editor which you can find in plugins"
msgstr "在 KOReader 的整合文字編輯器中，你可以在外掛中找到"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3696-6
msgid "You can copy / paste the examples we mentioned above to your file."
msgstr "你可以將上面提到的範例複製/貼上到你的檔案中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3700-6
msgid "2. Transferring the file to your device:"
msgstr "2. 將檔案傳輸到你的裝置："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3701-6
msgid ""
"After creating the file(s) which contain your CSS rules, save or transfer "
"them to the <span class=\"ui\">styletweaks</span> folder under your KOReader "
"installation. Give the files descriptive names because filename will be the "
"title of the tweak in the KOReader menu system. You can use underscores "
"\"<b>_</b>\" in your filenames, they will be treated as spaces in the menu. "
"<b>You need to restart KOReader after transferring your files so it can load "
"them.</b>"
msgstr ""
"建立包含 CSS 規則的檔案後，將其儲存或傳輸到 KOReader 安裝下的 <span "
"class=\"ui\">styletweaks</span> 資料夾中。為檔案指定描述性名稱，因為檔名將是 "
"KOReader 選單系統中微調的標題。你可以在檔名中使用下劃線\"<b>_</b>\"，它們將在"
"選單中被視為空格。<b>你需要在傳輸檔案後重新啟動 KOReader，以便它可以載入它"
"們。</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3706-6
msgid "2. Enabling the tweak:"
msgstr "2. 啟用調整："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3707-6
msgid "After the restart, open a book and go to this menu:"
msgstr "重新啟動後，開啟一本書並轉到此選單："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3709-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.div:594-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Style tweaks / User style tweaks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 樣式微調 / 使用者樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3712-6
msgid ""
"Now you should see your tweak in the list with a checkbox next to it. To "
"apply your tweak to the <b>current book only</b>, tick the checkbox. If you "
"want this tweak to be enabled for <b>all the books</b>, long-press on its "
"name. A dialog will appear. Tap the menu item <span class=\"ui\">Use on all "
"books</span>. A <b>star (★)</b> will appear next to its name in the menu, "
"indicating that this tweak will be applied to all books. You can disable "
"this with the same steps. See below for an example:"
msgstr ""
"現在你應該在清單中看到你的調整，旁邊有一個核取方塊。要將你的調整僅應用於<b>當"
"前書籍</b>，請勾選核取方塊。如果你希望對<b>所有書籍</b>啟用此調整，請長按其名"
"稱。將出現一個對話方塊。輕按選單項<span class=\"ui\">用於所有書籍</span>。一"
"個<b>星號（★）</b>將出現在選單中其名稱旁邊，表示此調整將應用於所有書籍。你可"
"以使用相同的步驟停用此功能。下面是一個例子："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3717-6
msgid ""
"In the image above, I have 3 style tweak files in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">styletweaks</span> folder under my KOReader installation. First "
"one is disabled because checkbox is empty. Second one is enabled for this "
"book only since checkbox is marked but there is no star. Third one is "
"enabled for all the books <b>(★)</b>."
msgstr ""
"在上圖中，我在 KOReader 安裝下的 <span class=\"ui\">styletweaks</span> 資料夾"
"中有 3 個樣式微調檔案。第一個被停用，因為核取方塊為空。第二個選項僅對本書啟"
"用，因為核取方塊已標記，但沒有星號。第三個選項適用於所有書籍<b>（★）</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3720-6
msgid ""
"You might notice that there is also a <span class=\"ui\">right triangle "
"icon</span> next to the first tweak. This means that this tweak can be "
"activated using gestures. This will explained in the next heading."
msgstr ""
"你可能會注意到，在第一個調整旁邊還有一個<span class=\"ui\">直角三角形圖示</"
"span>。這意味著可以使用手勢啟用此調整。這將在下一個標題中解釋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3723-6
msgid "How to use tweaks efficiently"
msgstr "如何有效地使用微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3725-6
msgid ""
"When creating your <span class=\"ui\">user style tweaks</span> you can make "
"multiple tweak files, each modifying some part of the book like in the "
"example image above. You can have one file for the <b>headings</b>, others "
"to modify <b>paragraphs</b>, <b>links</b> etc. This modular system allows "
"you to enable tweaks depending on your document."
msgstr ""
"在建立<span class=\"ui\">使用者樣式微調</span>時，你可以建立多個調整檔案，每"
"個檔案都修改了書的某些部分，如上圖所示。你可以有一個檔案用於<b>標題</b>，其他"
"檔案用於修改<b>段落</b>、<b>連結</b>等。這個模組化系統允許你根據文件進行調"
"整。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3729-6
msgid ""
"As we said above, you can toggle <span class=\"ui\">user style tweaks</span> "
"from this menu location:"
msgstr ""
"正如我們上面所說的，你可以從這個選單位置切換<span class=\"ui\">使用者樣式微調"
"</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3732-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+formattingyourbook.div:617-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Style tweaks / User style tweaks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 樣式微調 / 使用者樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3735-6
msgid ""
"Also we have easier ways to toggle your style tweaks than going to the menu "
"every time."
msgstr "此外，我們還有更簡單的方法來切換你的樣式微調，而不是每次都去選單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3737-6
msgid "1. You can assign a gesture to a tweak"
msgstr "1. 你可以將手勢指定給調整"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3738-6
msgid ""
"To do this, first we have to add our <span class=\"ui\">user style tweak</"
"span> to the list of gesture actions:"
msgstr ""
"為此，首先我們必須把我們的<span class=\"ui\">使用者樣式微調</span>新增到手勢"
"動作清單中："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3742-7
msgid ""
"Go to the <span class=\"ui\">user style tweaks</span> menu and long-press on "
"your style tweak"
msgstr "轉到<span class=\"ui\">使用者樣式微調</span>選單，長按樣式微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3744-7
msgid ""
"In the dialog press the button <span class=\"ui\">Show in action list</span>"
msgstr "在對話方塊中，按下按鈕<span class=\"ui\">顯示在動作清單中</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3745-7
msgid ""
"A <span class=\"ui\">right triangle icon</span> will appear next to your "
"style tweak in the menu"
msgstr "選單中樣式微調旁邊將出現一個<span class=\"ui\">直角三角形圖示</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3749-6
msgid ""
"You can see it in the example image above, next to the <b>Adjust margins</b> "
"style tweak. Now this style tweak is added to the actions list. You can find "
"it under <span class=\"ui\">Gesture Manager > Reflowable documents</span> "
"category. It will be at the end of the list."
msgstr ""
"你可以在上面的示例圖片中看到它，在<b>調整邊距</b>樣式微調旁邊。現在，此樣式微"
"調已新增到動作清單中。你可以在<span class=\"ui\">手勢管理員>可重排文件</span>"
"類別下找到它。它將在清單的末尾。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3755-6
msgid "2. You can add a tweak to your Quick Menu"
msgstr "2. 你可以在快速選單中新增微調"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3757-6
msgid ""
"To add a tweak to your <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span>, first it has to "
"be added to the actions list as described in the heading above. Then you can "
"follow the instructions under the <a href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Quick Menu</a> section of this guide."
msgstr ""
"要在<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>中新增微調，首先必須將其新增到上述標題"
"中描述的動作清單中。然後，你可以按照本指南<a href=\"#L2-quickmenu\" "
"class=\"internalink\">快速選單</a>部分的說明進行操作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3760-6
msgid ""
"You can even combine both methods and create a special <span "
"class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span> for your style tweaks and then assign it to a "
"gesture. This way, with a simple gesture you can access all your style "
"tweaks and activate them as needed."
msgstr ""
"你甚至可以將這兩種方法結合起來，為你的樣式微調建立一個特殊的<span "
"class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>，然後將其分配給一個手勢。這樣只需一個簡單的手"
"勢，你就可以存取所有的樣式微調，並根據需要啟用它們。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3763-6
msgid "Finding elements for modifying"
msgstr "尋找要修改的元素"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3765-6
msgid ""
"Note that in some books, titles might not be in <b>&lt;H1&gt; or &lt;H2&gt;</"
"b> elements, but in something like <b>&lt;p class=\"tit123\"&gt;</b>. You "
"can find which selectors are used for a part of text by checking the source. "
"To achieve this, select the text around the element which you are interested "
"in, and choose <span class=\"ui\">View HTML</span> from the dialog. In the "
"example above, your style tweak would look like this:"
msgstr ""
"請注意，在某些書籍中，標題可能不在 <b>&lt;H1&gt; 或 &lt;H2&gt;</b> 元素中，而"
"是在類似 <b>&lt;p class=\"tit123\"&gt;</b> 的內容中。你可以透過檢查源程式碼來"
"尋找用於文字部分的選擇器。要實現這一點，請選擇你感興趣的元素周圍的文字，然後"
"從對話方塊中選擇<span class=\"ui\">檢視 HTML</span>。在上面的示例中，你的樣式"
"微調看起來像這樣："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3769-6
msgid "P.tit123 { border-top: 2px solid black; }"
msgstr "P.tit123 { border-top: 2px solid black; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3771-6
msgid "instead of this:"
msgstr "而不是這樣："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3773-6
msgid "H1 { border-top: 2px solid black; }"
msgstr "H1 { border-top: 2px solid black; }"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3781-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-annotating"
msgid "6 ANNOTATING DOCUMENTS"
msgstr "6 標註文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3783-6
msgid ""
"KOReader gives you options to interact with your book like you can do with a "
"real book. Many settings of the bookmark window can be changed here:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 提供了多種選項，可以像印刷書一樣做記號。書籤頁面的多項設定可以在下列"
"路徑變更："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3785-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Settings / Bookmarks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 設定 / 書籤"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3790-6
msgid "BOOKMARKS:"
msgstr "閱讀位置書籤："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3792-6
msgid ""
"You can add (and remove) a bookmark by pressing the upper right corner. This "
"is the equivalent of folding the corner of a page on a real book and shows a "
"similar icon when you enable it."
msgstr ""
"可透過點擊螢幕右上角來新增（或移除）書籤。該操作類似於將印刷書的書頁折起一"
"角，並且會顯示類似形狀的圖示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3796-6
msgid "HIGHLIGHTS:"
msgstr "文段劃線："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3798-6
msgid ""
"You can highlight text in 4 different styles. In the image below, you can "
"see a normal paragraph followed by different styles of highlights. <span "
"class=\"ui\">Lighten</span> (with gray background), <span "
"class=\"ui\">Underline, Strikeout</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Invert</"
"span>."
msgstr ""
"有四種不同樣式的劃線可用使用。下圖展示了一段普通文字及不同樣式的劃線：<span "
"class=\"ui\">淺色</span>（灰色背景）、<span class=\"ui\">下劃線、刪除線</"
"span>及<span class=\"ui\">反色</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3804-6
msgid ""
"You can use all these styles at the same time, like they are different "
"colored highlight markers. Or you can decide your favorite style and set it "
"as default from this menu by long pressing:"
msgstr ""
"你可以同時使用所有這些樣式，就像使用不同顏色的熒光筆一樣。或者你也可以在此選"
"單中透過長按來選定你最喜歡的樣式並將其設為預設："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3806-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+annotating.div:27-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Highlight style"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 劃線樣式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3811-6
msgid ""
"Also if you have a device with a color screen, you can create highlights in "
"different colors:"
msgstr "另外，如果當前裝置配有彩色螢幕，還可使用不同顏色進行劃線："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3813-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Highlights / Highlight color"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 劃線 / 劃線用色"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3818-6
msgid "Some tips for color highlights:"
msgstr "使用多色劃線時的技巧："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3821-7
msgid ""
"You can change the color of an existing highlight by tapping on it and "
"choosing <span class=\"ui\">Color</span> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"已經劃下的劃線段落可以改變用色；點擊劃線段落，在彈出選單中選擇<span "
"class=\"ui\">顏色</span>選項即可。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3824-7
msgid ""
"You can combine the colors with different highlight styles like "
"<b>Underline</b> and <b>Strikethrough</b> to create a powerful highlighting "
"system. For example you can use a <span style=\"text-decoration: line-"
"through; font-weight: bold; color: red;\">red strikethrough</span> style for "
"removals or <span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold; "
"color: orange;\">orange underline</span> style for important points etc."
msgstr ""
"你可以將顏色與<b>下劃線</b>、<b>刪除線</b>等不同的劃線樣式結合，可以建立一套"
"強大的劃線系統。例如可以用<span style=\"text-decoration: line-through; font-"
"weight: bold; color: red;\">紅色刪除線</span>樣式標記刪除段落，或用<span "
"style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold; color: orange;\">橙色"
"下劃線</span>樣式標記重點等等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3831-6
msgid "Setting the defaults for highlights"
msgstr "設定預設劃線樣式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3837-7
msgid ""
"In the highlights menu you can long-press on a highlight type to set it as "
"default (★)"
msgstr "在劃線選單中，可以在某種樣式上長按將其設定為預設項（★）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3838-7
msgid ""
"<b>After selecting a color</b>, you can long-press on the color name in this "
"menu to set that color as default (★)"
msgstr ""
"<b>選擇一種顏色</b>後，可透過在選單中長按顏色名稱將所選顏色設為預設項（★）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3839-7
msgid ""
"You can press the <span class=\"ui\">Apply current style and color to all "
"highlights</span> option to make all the highlights in the current book "
"same. <b>Be careful, there is no undo!</b>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">將當前樣式及顏色應用於全部劃線</span>選項可以將整本書中所"
"有劃線統一為一種樣式。<b>請務必謹慎，該操作是不可逆的！</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3845-6
msgid "NOTES:"
msgstr "筆記："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3847-6
msgid ""
"You can also add notes to your highlights. Just tap on a highlight and "
"choose <span class=\"ui\">Add note</span> from the popup menu. You can also "
"choose a <span class=\"ui\">Note marker</span> that shows which highlights "
"contain a note. There are three styles: <span class=\"ui\">Underline, Side "
"line</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Side mark</span> (which is the pencil "
"icon shown on the right side of the picture below):"
msgstr ""
"還可為劃線新增筆記；只需點擊一段劃線，從彈出選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">新增"
"筆記</span>。還可選擇一種<span class=\"ui\">筆記標記</span>標出包含筆記的劃"
"線。有三種樣式可供選擇 —— <span class=\"ui\">下劃線、批註線</span>和<span "
"class=\"ui\">筆記符號</span>（一枚顯示文段右側的鉛筆圖示，如下圖所示）："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3855-6
msgid ""
"To enable this feature and choose a <span class=\"ui\">Note marker</span> "
"style, go to:"
msgstr ""
"請按下列路徑啟用該功能並選擇一種<span class=\"ui\">筆記標記</span>樣式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3858-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Highlight style / Note marker"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 劃線樣式 / 筆記標記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3861-6
msgid "What you can do with your highlight?"
msgstr "你可以對劃線做哪些操作？"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3863-6
msgid ""
"After highlighting a part of your document, you can tap on the highlight to "
"see the <span class=\"ui\">highlight menu</span>. From this highlight menu, "
"you can reach another extended menu by tapping on the <span class=\"ui\">... "
"(three dots)</span> button as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"對文件中的一部分完成劃線後，點擊該劃線即可看到<span class=\"ui\">劃線選單</"
"span>。在此劃線選單中，點擊<span class=\"ui\">…（三個點）</span>按鈕即可開啟"
"另一個擴展選單，如下圖所示："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3868-6
msgid "Using this extended menu you can:"
msgstr "使用此擴展選單，你可以："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3870-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Extend</span> your highlight to include more text"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">展開</span>劃線以納入更多文字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3872-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Copy</span> the text to clipboard to paste elsewhere"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">複製</span>文字到剪貼簿，以便貼上到別處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3874-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Search</span> the text on Wikipedia"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">搜尋</span>維基百科中的該文字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3876-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Look up</span> the text in an installed dictionary"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">查詢</span>已安裝字典中的該文字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3878-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Translate</span> the text using the <span "
"class=\"external\">Google Translate</span> service"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">翻譯</span>文字，使用 <span class=\"external\">Google "
"Translate</span> 服務"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3881-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">View HTML</span> source of the highlighted section, which "
"is useful when writing a <span class=\"ui\">style tweak</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">檢視 HTML</span>可顯示被劃線片段的源程式碼，這在編寫<span "
"class=\"ui\">樣式微調</span>時很有用"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3883-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Generate QR code</span> which includes the highlighted "
"text, to scan from another device with a camera and a QR-code reader "
"application"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">生成 QR 碼</span>，其中包含劃線文字，可用另一臺帶相機和 "
"QR 碼掃描應用的裝置掃描"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:3885-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Search</span> for the text in the book"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">搜尋</span>書中的該文字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3889-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-howtohighlight"
msgid "6.1 Highlight Modes"
msgstr "6.1 劃線模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3891-6
msgid "KOReader has two highlighting modes for different use cases:"
msgstr "KOReader 提供兩種不同的劃線模式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3895-6
msgid "Normal mode"
msgstr "普通模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3897-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Normal mode</span> is similar to selecting a text with "
"your finger on a phone/tablet and more suitable if your highlights are "
"shorter than one page."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">普通模式</span>與在手機或平板電腦上用手指選擇文字類似，適"
"用於劃線文段在同一頁內的情況。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3901-7
msgid "Long-press on the starting word"
msgstr "在要劃線文段的首字上長按"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3902-7
msgid "Move your finger to the end of the passage"
msgstr "移動手指到要劃線文段的末尾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3903-7
msgid "Release finger"
msgstr "抬起手指"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3906-6
msgid ""
"When you reach page boundaries, KOReader will turn the page for you to "
"continue highlighting <b>(only in EPUB/HTML documents)</b>. You can disable "
"this feature from:"
msgstr ""
"當劃到頁面邊界時，KOReader 會自動翻頁以保持劃線連貫（<b>僅對 EPUB 和 HTML 文"
"件有效</b>）。該功能可透過下列路徑停用："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3908-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Long-press on text / Auto-"
"scroll when selection reaches a corner"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 在文字上長按 / 在選區到達書角時自動捲動"
"頁面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3911-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> <span "
"class=\"ui\">Long-press on corner gesture</span> can cause problem when you "
"want to long-press on text near the corners. We have special <span "
"class=\"ui\">gesture manager actions</span> that allows you to <b>toggle</b> "
"or <b>temporarily disable</b> corner long-press gestures. You can assign "
"these actions to a gesture or use them in your <span class=\"ui\">quick "
"menu</span>. You can find them here:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 當你想長按靠近邊角"
"的文字時，<span class=\"ui\">邊角長按手勢</span>可能會造成干擾。我們提供了專"
"門的<span class=\"ui\">手勢管理員動作</span>，可用來<b>切換</b>或<b>臨時停用"
"</b>邊角長按手勢。你可以將這些動作指定給某個手勢，或放入<span class=\"ui\">快"
"速選單</span>中使用。可在此處找到它們："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:3917-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Gesture manager / \"ANY GESTURE\" / Device / "
"Toggle┆Ignore long-press on corners"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 手勢管理員 / 「任意手勢」 / 裝置 / 切換┆忽略邊角長按"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3920-6
msgid "Select and highlight mode"
msgstr "選擇並進入劃線模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3922-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Select and highlight mode</span> is more suitable for "
"highlighting longer passages which cross page boundaries. It might also work "
"better if you have touch screen sensitivity problems or motor control issues "
"with your hands. Because in this highlight mode you don’t need to drag your "
"finger along the screen."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">選擇並進入劃線模式</span>更適合跨頁的長段落劃線。在該模式"
"下無需用手指在螢幕上滑動即可完成劃線，因此對閱讀裝置的觸控靈敏度不佳，或使用"
"者較難控制手部運動的情況尤為有用。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3925-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> If "
"you have dictionary lookup enabled, when you long-press a word, you have to "
"drag your finger to initiate this mode."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 如果開"
"啟查閱字典功能，在長按某個文字時需拖動才能啟動該模式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3928-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Long-press on text / Dictionary "
"on single word selection"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 在文字上長按 / 在字典中查詢選中單字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3933-6
msgid "How to highlight:"
msgstr "劃線的方法："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3938-7
msgid ""
"Long-press (or drag if dictionary lookup is enabled as described above) on "
"the starting word, popup menu will show up."
msgstr ""
"在要劃線文段的首字上長按（如果啟用了尋找字典功能則是對首字拖拽）呼出選單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3939-7
msgid ""
"Tap on <span class=\"ui\">Select</span>, now you are in highlighting mode. "
"When you are in this mode, you will see an indicator at the upper left "
"corner of the screen (which you can tap on it to get more information). You "
"can cancel highlighting by tapping on the beginning of highlight again. You "
"can turn pages with taps/swipes and freely navigate the document (TOC, skim "
"etc) in this mode."
msgstr ""
"點擊<span class=\"ui\">多選</span>選項進入劃線模式，此時螢幕左上角將出現一枚"
"圖示（可點擊該圖示獲得更多資訊）。再次點擊劃線起始處可取消劃線。在劃線模式下"
"可使用點擊或滑動翻頁，並可使用目錄或快速翻頁工具前往任意頁。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3940-7
msgid ""
"Long-press (or drag if dictionary lookup is enabled as described above) on "
"the ending word for your highlight, menu will show up again."
msgstr ""
"在劃線的末字上長按選單會再次顯示；若啟用了查詢字典功能，則透過拖拽末字呼出選"
"單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:3941-7
msgid ""
"Tap <span class=\"ui\">Highlight</span> this time to finish highlighting the "
"passage."
msgstr "現在點擊<span class=\"ui\">劃線</span>即可完成對文段的劃線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3945-6
msgid ""
"This dialog normally opens at the center of the screen. If you want this "
"dialog to open closer to your highlight location, you can change the <span "
"class=\"ui\">center</span> option here to <span class=\"ui\">gesture "
"position</span> (located on the second page of this menu):"
msgstr ""
"通常情況下該對話方塊將顯示在螢幕中間。如果希望對話方塊顯示在劃線位置附近，可"
"以將選單第二頁的<span class=\"ui\">中間</span>選項改為<span class=\"ui\">手勢"
"位置</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3949-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\">/ Taps and Gestures / Long-press on text / Highlight "
"dialog position"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\">/ 輕觸與手勢 / 在文字上長按 / 劃線對話方塊位置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3951-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> There is a "
"<b>faster</b> method for this mode if you don’t need <b>long-press menu "
"items</b> shown above. You can disable the popup menu completely so when you "
"long-press on a word you will immediately enter the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Select and highlight</span> mode. This method is much faster "
"and you can highlight any length of text with just two taps. To use this "
"method enable this option:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 若不需要上圖所示的"
"<b>文字長按選單</b>，有更<b>簡單</b>的方式進入該模式。在完全停用長按文字的彈"
"出選單後，長按將直接進入<span class=\"ui\">選擇及劃線</span>模式。這種方式更"
"快捷，只需點擊兩次即可劃線任意長度的文段。啟用下列選項來使用該功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:3956-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Long-press on text / Select and "
"highlight"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 在文字上長按 /選擇並劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3959-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> KOReader can "
"highlight a passage in different styles. If you use <span "
"class=\"ui\">Lighten</span> option, text background will be gray. Due to e-"
"ink limitations, screens can’t change from white to gray directly, so "
"highlighted part first has to turn black and then gray. If you want to avoid "
"this flashing, you can choose <span class=\"ui\">Inverted</span> as your "
"highlight style. In this mode text background will be black so it can be set "
"without flashing. You can adjust these highlighting options from:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> KOReader 可以劃線包"
"含不同樣式的整篇文章。<span class=\"ui\">淺色</span>選項將使文段背景變為灰"
"色。受限於 e-ink 技術特性螢幕無法直接從白切換為灰色，所以被劃線的文段將先變黑"
"然後再變灰。要避免這種螢幕閃爍，請選擇<span class=\"ui\">反色</span>作為劃線"
"樣式。該選項將使文段背景變黑所以無需螢幕閃爍。請在下列路徑中調整劃線選項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:3963-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+annotating.div.div:184-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Highlight style"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 劃線樣式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3966-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> You can add "
"multiple highlights and notes to the same section of text. If they are "
"overlapping, when you tap on a highlight you will be presented with a menu "
"to choose which highlight you want to edit."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 同一文段可被多次劃"
"線及新增筆記。若多層劃線重疊在一起，點擊劃線處會彈出選單以供選擇想要編輯的劃"
"線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3969-6
msgid "Selecting punctuation while highlighting"
msgstr "劃線時自動納入標點"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3971-6
msgid ""
"When you are highlighting, KOReader tries to include the related punctuation "
"marks around your selection. For example if you highlight from the first "
"word to the last word of a sentence, KOReader will automatically include the "
"punctuation marks at the both ends of the sentence to your highlight."
msgstr ""
"在進行劃線操作時，KOReader 會嘗試將與選段相關的標點符號納入劃線。例如，當從頭"
"到尾劃線一個句子時，KOReader 會自動將句子兩端的標點符號一併劃線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3973-6
msgid ""
"But if you start highlighting from the middle of a sentence, period at the "
"end <b>will not be included</b> because KOReader assumes that you want to "
"make a partial highlight. So if you want the punctuation marks to be added "
"to your highlight, be sure that you select the <b>whole sentence</b>. Also "
"you can add these marks later by long pressing the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Highlight edit</span> buttons."
msgstr ""
"但如果從句子中間開始劃線，KOReader 會認為使用者只是想劃線句子片段，因此<b>不"
"會自動包含</b>句末標點。若要將標點包含在劃線中，請在選擇時選中<b>完整句子</"
"b>。之後也可長按<span class=\"ui\">編輯劃線</span>按鈕補上標點符號。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3977-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-editinghighlight"
msgid "6.2 Editing Highlights"
msgstr "6.2 編輯劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3979-6
msgid ""
"When you tap on an already highlighted text <b>(without a note)</b>, you "
"will see this popup menu. <span class=\"ui\">Delete</span> and <span "
"class=\"ui\">Add note</span> items are clear. Bottom row menu items are used "
"to extend or shrink the highlight."
msgstr ""
"點擊<b>不含筆記</b>的劃線文字，可以看到包含<span class=\"ui\">刪除</span>及"
"<span class=\"ui\">新增筆記</span>選項的彈出選單。選單底部的按鈕則用於擴展或"
"縮減劃線區域。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3985-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> This "
"adjustment works only on reflowable documents like EPUBs. If you want to "
"extend or shrink a highlight on PDFs, you have to delete it and highlight "
"again due to the limitations of the PDF format."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 該項調"
"整僅對 EPUB 等可重排格式生效。在 PDF 文件中擴展或縮減劃線時，受限於 PDF 格式"
"需要先整段刪除再重新劃線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3988-6
msgid ""
"When you tap on an already highlighted text <b>with a note added</b>, you "
"will see this popup menu. Tap on <span class=\"ui\">Edit highlight</span> to "
"open the menu above where you can edit both the highlight and the contained "
"note:"
msgstr ""
"點擊<b>附帶筆記</b>的劃線文字，可以看到如下所示的彈出選單。點擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">編輯劃線</span>開啟上圖所示選單，以便對劃線及附帶的筆記進行編"
"輯："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:3993-6
msgid ""
"On your <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</span> page you can filter the view to "
"see only one type of bookmark by pressing the menu icon ( <img "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:22px;"
"\"> ) You can also filter by highlight style:"
msgstr ""
"在<span class=\"ui\">書籤管理</span>介面，點擊選單按鈕（<img "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:22px;"
"\">）可以篩選顯示出某一類型的書籤；也可按照劃線樣式篩選："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:3999-6
msgid "Editing the text of a highlight"
msgstr "編輯被劃線的文段文字"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4001-6
msgid ""
"In addition to adding a note, KOReader also allows you to edit the "
"highlighted text itself that is shown in your <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks "
"list</span>. In some situations this might be more useful than adding a note "
"to a highlight. For example imagine that you are reviewing a text. You want "
"to highlight a sentence which contains many dates and one of the dates is "
"wrong. When you want add a note to point to this mistake, you need to "
"specify in your note, which one is wrong. But if you edit the text of a "
"highlight, you can directly write <b>\"(this date needs to be checked)\"</b> "
"next to the problematic date."
msgstr ""
"除了新增筆記，KOReader 還支援直接編輯<span class=\"ui\">書籤清單</span>中顯示"
"的劃線文字。在某些情況下，這可能比為劃線新增筆記更實用。比如要標記包含多項日"
"期的句子但其中一項日期有誤，而要新增一條筆記來指出錯誤，得在筆記中明確寫明。"
"但如果可以直接編輯被劃線文字，就可以直接在有誤的日期後寫上<b>「該日期需要再次"
"核對」</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4004-6
msgid ""
"Note that this editing <b>doesn't change</b> the book content or the "
"highlighted passage on the page. You will still see the same highlighted "
"sentence in the reader. Your edit will be visible in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Bookmarks list</span>. And when you export your highlights "
"later, edited text will be the one that is exported."
msgstr ""
"請注意，此編輯操作<b>不會改變</b>頁面上顯示的被劃線文段，閱讀時看到的仍是書籍"
"原文。編輯內容要在<span class=\"ui\">書籤清單</span>介面檢視；在匯出劃線時，"
"被匯出的文字會是編輯後的版本。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4007-6
msgid "To edit a highlight text, you can:"
msgstr "要編輯被劃線的文字，請按如下步驟操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4009-7
msgid "Tap on the highlight"
msgstr "點擊劃線文段"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4010-7
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Details</span> from the popup menu"
msgstr "在彈出選單中點擊<span class=\"ui\">詳情</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4012-7
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Edit text</span> from the details dialog"
msgstr "在詳情對話方塊中點擊<span class=\"ui\">編輯文字</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4016-6
msgid "Also you can do it from the Bookmarks window:"
msgstr "你也可以從書籤視窗中進行操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4019-7
msgid "Go to the <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks list</span> via menu or gesture"
msgstr "透過點擊選單或手勢開啟<span class=\"ui\">書籤清單</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4021-7
msgid "Long press on the highlight you want to edit"
msgstr "長按想要編輯的被劃線文段"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4022-7
msgid "Press <span class=\"ui\">Edit text</span> in the menu"
msgstr "在選單中點擊<span class=\"ui\">編輯文字</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4024-7
msgid ""
"Change the text in the dialog and press the <span class=\"ui\">Save</span> "
"button"
msgstr "在彈出對話方塊中修改文字，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">儲存</span>按鈕"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4028-6
msgid ""
"If you want to <b>revert</b> an edited text to the original highlight, "
"follow the steps above and at the step <b>3</b>, instead of <span "
"class=\"ui\">Edit text</span>, press the <span class=\"ui\">Reset text</"
"span> button."
msgstr ""
"若要將編輯後的文字<b>撤回到</b>書籍原文，按上方所屬步驟操作但在<b>第三步</b>"
"時不要點擊<span class=\"ui\">編輯被劃線文字</span>，而是點擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">還原原始文字</span>按鈕。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4032-6
msgid "Changing how the added notes are shown in the Bookmarks List"
msgstr "更改新增的筆記在書籤清單中的顯示方式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4034-6
msgid ""
"Normally when you open the Bookmarks list, only the content of your "
"highlights are shown. If you added a note to a highlight, you will only see "
"a pencil icon in the Bookmarks list. You can long-press on an item in this "
"list to show (and edit) the added note. If you want to see the note text too "
"in your <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks list</span> you can set it from here:"
msgstr ""
"通常情況下，書籤清單中僅會列出使用者對文段的劃線。如果劃線附帶筆記，只會在書"
"籤清單中顯示一枚鉛筆圖示。可以長按清單中的某一項劃線以檢視（並編輯）附帶的筆"
"記。若要在<span class=\"ui\">書籤清單</span>中同時展示筆記，可按照下列路徑設"
"定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4037-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Settings / Bookmarks / Show in items"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 設定 / 書籤 / 書籤介面中的展示元素"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4040-6
msgid "You can choose to show:"
msgstr "有如下幾種顯示方式可供選擇："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4042-7
msgid "<b>Only</b> highlight text (default behavior)"
msgstr "<b>僅顯示</b>劃線文段（預設設定）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4044-7
msgid "<b>Both</b> highlight text and the note"
msgstr "<b>同時顯示</b>劃線文字及筆記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4046-7
msgid "<b>Note if there is one</b>, otherwise highlight text"
msgstr "<b>存在筆記時僅顯示筆記</b>，否則顯示劃線文段"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4049-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> Normally number of "
"items in the bookmarks window is static and divided equally. If you want a "
"more flexible layout, you can change the <span class=\"ui\">Max lines per "
"bookmark</span> setting from here:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 通常情況下，書籤視"
"窗中的項目是數量固定且均勻分佈的。若要使用更加靈活的版式，可在下列選單中調整"
"<span class=\"ui\">每份書籤的最大行數</span>選項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:4052-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Settings / Bookmarks / Max lines per bookmark"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 設定 / 書籤 / 每條書籤的最大行數"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4055-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-exportinghighlights"
msgid "6.3 Exporting Highlights"
msgstr "6.3 匯出劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4057-6
msgid ""
"After finishing a book, you can move it to a specific folder for archiving "
"or processing purposes. Enable <span class=\"ui\">Move to archive</span> "
"plugin and set your target directory in the plugin’s settings (<span "
"class=\"ui\">Set archive folder</span>). After this, you can move a book to "
"your archive folder using:"
msgstr ""
"在讀完一本書後，可以將其移到指定資料夾作為存檔。啟用<span class=\"ui\">移至存"
"檔</span>外掛，指定存檔目錄路徑（<span class=\"ui\">設定存檔資料夾</span>）。"
"完成設定後，可透過下列方式將書籍移入存檔："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4063-7
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">Move to archive</span> plugin menu"
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">移至存檔</span>外掛選單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4065-7
msgid "With a gesture or"
msgstr "利用指定的手勢或者"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4066-7
msgid "With a <span class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span> entry"
msgstr "使用<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>中的入口"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4070-6
msgid ""
"KOReader provides different ways of exporting your highlights and notes from "
"your reader device:"
msgstr "KOReader 提供多種匯出劃線和筆記的方式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4072-6
msgid "1. Export Highlights plugin"
msgstr "1、使用匯出劃線外掛"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4074-6
msgid ""
"This versatile plugin can export your highlights to <b>local files</b> or "
"<b>online services</b>."
msgstr "這款多功能外掛可以將劃線匯出為<b>本地文件</b>或上傳到<b>雲服務</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4079-6
msgid "Local export"
msgstr "本地匯出"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4081-6
msgid "You can export your highlights to your device in these file formats:"
msgstr "劃線可被匯出為以下幾種檔案格式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4084-7
msgid "Text (.txt)"
msgstr "純文字（.txt）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4085-7
msgid "HTML (.html)"
msgstr "HTML 網頁（.html）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4086-7
msgid "Markdown (.md)"
msgstr "Markdown 文件（.md）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4087-7
msgid "Kindle Clippings (.txt)"
msgstr "Kindle 筆記與摘錄（.txt）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4088-7
msgid "JSON (.json)"
msgstr "JSON 檔案（.json）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4091-6
msgid "You can choose your preferred export formats from:"
msgstr "可以在下列選單中選擇想要使用的匯出格式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4093-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Export Highlights / Choose formats and services"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 匯出劃線 / 選擇檔案格式及服務商"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4096-6
msgid "You can see the export location (and also change it if you want):"
msgstr "可以在下列選單中檢視（或修改）匯出檔案存放目錄："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4098-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Export Highlights / Choose export folder"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 匯出劃線 / 選擇存放資料夾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4103-6
msgid "Online services"
msgstr "線上服務"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4105-6
msgid "You can also export to these services over the network:"
msgstr "還可透過網路將劃線匯出到下列服務平台："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4108-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://joplinapp.org/\">Joplin</a> - a note taking application"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://joplinapp.org/\">Joplin</a> - 一款筆記應用程式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4110-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://readwise.io/\">Readwise</a> - an online bookmarks/"
"highlights application"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://readwise.io/\">Readwise</a> - 一款線上書籤及劃線軟體"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4112-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/usememos/memos\">Memos</a> - a self-hosted open "
"source memo hub"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/usememos/memos\">Memos</a> - 一款自託管的開源備"
"忘錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4114-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://flomoapp.com\">Flomo</a> - an online note taking service"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://flomoapp.com\">Flomo</a> - 一款線上筆記服務"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4118-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.xmnote.com/\">XMNote</a> - an Android bookmark "
"organizer in Chinese language"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.xmnote.com/\">XMNote</a> - 一款安卓平台的中文介面書籤管"
"理軟體"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4124-6
msgid ""
"You can find detailed setup instructions for these services on our related "
"<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/Highlight-export\">wiki "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"這些服務的詳細操作指南可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/"
"wiki/Highlight-export\">維基頁面</a>上查閱。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4128-6
msgid ""
"After selecting your formats, you can export the notes for the <b>current "
"book</b> or <b>all the books in your library</b> from the same plugin menu."
msgstr ""
"在選擇匯出格式後，可以在該外掛選單中匯出<b>當前書籍</b>或<b>個人書庫中全部書"
"籍</b>的筆記。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4131-6
msgid ""
"If you want to export only some of the books in your library, you can do "
"this from the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>:"
msgstr ""
"若想僅匯出部分書籍的筆記，可以在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中這樣操"
"作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4133-7
msgid "Select multiple books in the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>"
msgstr "在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中同時選中多本書籍"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4134-7
msgid "Tap on the menu button (shown as a check mark) at the top right corner"
msgstr "點擊右上角的選單按鈕（顯示為複選標記）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4135-7
msgid "Select <span class=\"ui\">Export highlights</span> from the menu shown"
msgstr "從選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">匯出劃線</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4139-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> You can also export only chosen "
"highlight styles: <b>lighten, underline, strikeout, invert</b>. Normally "
"KOReader exports all of them. You can choose from:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> 僅<b>淺色、下劃線、刪除線、反色</b>四種"
"劃線樣式可被匯出。通常情況下 KOReader 會將它們全部匯出。也可在下列選單中選擇"
"性匯出："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4142-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Export Highlights / Choose highlight styles"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 匯出劃線 / 選擇劃線樣式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4145-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> You can customize the filename of the "
"exports from the plugin's menu (<span class=\"ui\">Set export filename</"
"span>) to include date/time information and other useful info."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> 你可以透過外掛選單（<span class=\"ui\">"
"設定匯出的檔名</span>）自訂匯出檔案的名稱，加入日期/時間資訊和其他有用資訊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4148-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> You can assign "
"export actions to gestures for quicker access. You can find these under the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Reader</span> category of the <span class=\"ui\">Gesture "
"Manager</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 可以為匯出操作指定"
"手勢以快速呼叫。這些選項位於<span class=\"ui\">閱讀器</span>類目下的<span "
"class=\"ui\">手勢管理員</span>中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4154-6
msgid "2. Using KoHighlights"
msgstr "2、使用 KoHighlights"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4156-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"external\">KoHighlights</span> is an external program that you "
"can install on your computer. It can access your book notes and highlights "
"when you plug your reader to your computer. Check the <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/noembryo/KoHighlights\">GitHub project page</a> for download and "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">KoHighlights</span> 是安裝於電腦中的外部軟體。將閱讀"
"裝置連線到電腦後，它可以自動讀取劃線和筆記。請前往該項目的 <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/noembryo/KoHighlights\">GitHub</a> 取得下載連結和使用說明。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4162-6
msgid "3. Using Calibre"
msgstr "三、使用 Calibre"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4164-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> is an external program that you can "
"install on your computer. You can import highlights into your <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> database with its <span "
"class=\"external\">KOReader Sync</span> plugin. You can install the "
"mentioned plugin within the <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> "
"application. Check the <a href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\">project page</"
"a> for download and instructions."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 安裝在電腦上的外部軟體。藉助 <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 的 <span class=\"external\">KOReader 同步外"
"掛</span>，可以將劃線匯入到 Calibre 資料庫中。該外掛要在 <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 軟體內啟用。請前往 Calibre 的<a "
"href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\">項目頁</a>取得下載連結及使用說明。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4171-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> When "
"you open a document in KOReader, it creates a directory alongside the "
"document with same name as the document. This directory contains a .LUA file "
"which includes all the highlights, notes and user options (formatting "
"properties etc.) related to that document. You can manually backup/restore "
"these directories."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 在 "
"KOReader 中開啟某個文件後，文件所在目錄中將生成一個同名資料夾；資料夾內有一個"
"與文件關聯的 .lua 檔案，包含了全部的劃線、筆記和使用者設定項（如文字格式設"
"定）等。使用者可手動備份及還原這個資料夾內容。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4180-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-pdfs"
msgid "7 READING PDFS"
msgstr "7 閱讀 PDF 文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4182-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-readingpdfs"
msgid "7.1 PDF Reading Tips"
msgstr "7.1 PDF 閱讀技巧"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4183-6
msgid ""
"KOReader provides you different ways to read a PDF/DJVU document which is "
"optimized for bigger page sizes (generally A4 or Letter) on your smaller "
"screen device:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 提供了多種解決方案以提升在小尺寸螢幕上閱讀大開本（通常為 A4 規格或信"
"紙開本）的 PDF 和 DJVU 文件的體驗："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4189-6
msgid "<b>1. You can enable</b><span class=\"ui\">Reflow</span>"
msgstr "<b>1. 啟用</b><span class=\"ui\">頁面重排</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4191-6
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_font.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Reflow"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_font.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 頁面重排"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4194-6
msgid ""
"Reflow tries to extract the text portion from your document (if it is "
"available) and format it as a single column. Results are generally "
"satisfactory. You can also set this as a <b>default</b> by tapping and "
"holding on it."
msgstr ""
"重排功能會嘗試從你的文件中提取文字部分（如果可用），並將其格式化為單欄顯示。"
"效果通常令人滿意。你也可以透過點擊並按住它將其設定為<b>預設值</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4199-6
msgid "<b>2. You can enable</b> <span class=\"ui\">Zoom To Content</span>"
msgstr "<b>2. 啟用</b><span class=\"ui\">頁面放大</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4202-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+pdfs.div:24-0"
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"bottom_fit.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> /"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"bottom_fit.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4207-6
msgid ""
"With this option KOReader tries to crop margins from your document so text "
"can look bigger on your screen. You can set <span class=\"ui\">fit</span> to "
"<span class=\"ui\">width</span> in the same menu which will try to fit only "
"page width instead of whole page, so your text will look bigger."
msgstr ""
"使用此選項，KOReader 會嘗試從文件中裁剪邊距，以便文字在螢幕上看起來更大。你可"
"以在同一選單中設定<span class=\"ui\">適配</span>到<span class=\"ui\">寬度</"
"span>，該選單將嘗試僅適合頁面寬度而不是整個頁面，因此你的文字看起來會更大。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4213-6
msgid ""
"<b>3. You can try to use your device in</b><span class=\"ui\">Landscape "
"orientation</span>"
msgstr "<b>3. 將閱讀裝置設定為</b><span class=\"ui\">橫屏模式</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4215-6
msgid ""
"This will make your screen wider so your document may look big enough to "
"read comfortably."
msgstr "這將使你的螢幕更寬，以便你的文件看起來足夠大，可以舒適地閱讀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4217-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+pdfs.div:39-0"
msgid "BOTTOM MENU /"
msgstr "底部選單 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4221-6
msgid ""
"4. You can zoom to 100 percent size and instead scroll the screen to read "
"different parts"
msgstr "4、以文件原始尺寸瀏覽，透過捲動螢幕瀏覽頁面的不同部分"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4223-6
msgid ""
"This is especially helpful with comic books. First enable <span "
"class=\"ui\">column mode</span> from this menu item:"
msgstr ""
"這對閱讀漫畫書尤其有幫助。請先透過該選單項啟用<span class=\"ui\">分欄模式</"
"span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4226-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+pdfs.div:48-0"
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"bottom_fit.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> /"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"bottom_fit.svg\" style=\"width:22px;\"> /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4229-6
msgid ""
"Then select an appropriate flow direction for your document from the same "
"menu:"
msgstr "然後從同一選單中為文件選擇適當的流向："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4234-7
msgid ""
"For example if you are reading an article which has two columns, you will "
"scroll down until the end of page reading left column then go to right upper "
"side to continue reading right column:"
msgstr ""
"例如，如果你正在閱讀一篇雙欄排版的文章，你會向下捲動，先讀完左側欄至本頁末"
"尾，然後移至右上方繼續閱讀右側欄："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4237-7
msgid ""
"Or if you are reading a comic book, you will want to go <b>“right / down "
"left / right”</b> in a zigzag pattern:"
msgstr ""
"或者，如果你正在閱讀漫畫書，你將需要以鋸齒形模式\"<b>右/下左/右</b>\"："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4241-7
msgid ""
"For a Japanese comic book (right-to-left panel order) this might be the "
"reverse:"
msgstr "對於日本漫畫書（從右到左的面板順序），這可能是相反的："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4245-6
msgid ""
"In this mode you can also adjust <span class=\"ui\">Horizontal/Vertical "
"Overlap</span> and <span class=\"ui\">Number of Columns</span> from the same "
"menu to fit the text on your screen better. Feel free to experiment with "
"these settings."
msgstr ""
"在此模式下，你還可以從同一選單調整<span class=\"ui\">水平/垂直重疊</span>和"
"<span class=\"ui\">分欄數</span>，以更好地適應螢幕上的文字。請隨意嘗試這些設"
"定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4249-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> When reading a PDF "
"document, if you are in a zoomed in view other than 100% (column, row or "
"manual) or in the <span class=\"ui\">reflow mode</span>, you can tap the top "
"left corner of screen to enter <span class=\"ui\">flip mode</span>. This "
"mode temporarily displays the full page without cropping, scaled to fit your "
"screen. You can turn the pages in this mode. To exit, tap on this icon."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_tip\" title=\"Useful tip\"></span> 閱讀 PDF 文件時，如"
"果你正處於 100% 以外的縮放檢視（如分欄、分行或手動縮放）或者開啟了<span "
"class=\"ui\">頁面重排模式</span>，點擊螢幕左上角可進入<span class=\"ui\">翻頁"
"模式</span>。此模式會臨時顯示未經裁剪的完整頁面，並自動縮放以適應螢幕，你可在"
"此模式下翻頁。再次點擊該圖示可從該模式中退出。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4252-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-pdfbottom"
msgid "7.2 PDF Specific Menu Items"
msgstr "7.2 PDF 文件專有選單項"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4256-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Contrast</span> setting adjusts black levels in your "
"document. Be aware that same contrast value applies to both text and images "
"in your document. If you set it very high, your images may become too dark."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">對比度</span>設定調整文件中的黑色級別。請注意，相同的對比"
"度值適用於文件中的文字和圖片。如果你把它設定得很高，你的圖片可能會變得太暗。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4259-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Dewatermark</span> removes watermarks from the rendered "
"document. It can also be used to remove gray backgrounds. This feature can "
"convert a grayscale or color document to black & white to produce more "
"contrast for easier reading."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">移除浮水印</span>從呈現的文件中移除浮水印。它也可以用來刪"
"除灰色背景。此功能可以將灰度或彩色文件轉換為黑白，提高對比度，以便於閱讀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4262-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Render quality</span> <b>(only active in Reflow mode)</b> "
"sets the quality of text and image extraction processing and output. <span "
"class=\"ui\">High</span> is more pleasing but it can be much slower (several "
"seconds for page turn) than <span class=\"ui\">default</span> depending on "
"your document. If your PDF/DJVU files are slow, this is the first setting "
"you should check."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">渲染品質</span><b>（僅在重排模式下處於活動狀態）</b>設定文"
"字和圖片提取處理和輸出的品質。<span class=\"ui\">高品質</span>更令人愉悅，但"
"它可能比<span class=\"ui\">預設</span>慢得多（翻頁需要幾秒鐘），具體取決於你"
"的文件。如果你的 PDF/DJVU 檔案很慢，這是你應該檢查的第一個設定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4272-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Document language</span> sets the language that will be "
"used by the OCR engine."
msgstr "<span class=\"ui\">文件語言</span>設定 OCR 引擎將使用的語言。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4275-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Forced OCR</span> as the name says, forces the use of OCR "
"even if the document has a text layer."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">強制 OCR </span>顧名思義，即使文件具有文字層，也強制使用 "
"OCR。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4278-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Writing direction</span> <b>(only active in Reflow mode)</"
"b> sets the direction of original document. Set this to <b>RTL</b> for "
"languages like Arabic and Hebrew."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">書寫方向</span><b>（僅在重排模式下有效）</b>設定原始文件的"
"方向。對於阿拉伯語和希伯來語等語言，將其設定為<b>從右到左（RTL）</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4283-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Document columns</span> <b>(only active in Reflow mode)</"
"b> sets the number of text columns in the original document."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">文件分欄</span><b>僅在重排模式下有效</b>用於設定原始文件的"
"文字分欄數。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4291-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Auto straighten</span> feature can straighten the pages "
"of a problematic document, for example pages of a PDF which are scanned with "
"an angle. It is available in <b>PDF, DJVU, CBZ/CBT</b> documents and "
"<b>image</b> files. To enable, choose the maximum tilt angle which KOReader "
"will try to correct. If it doesn’t correct you might have to choose a bigger "
"angle. Note that this feature <b>might slow down your reader</b> depending "
"on several factors."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">自動校直</span>功能可以拉直有問題文件的頁面，例如傾斜掃描"
"的 PDF 頁面。它在 <b>PDF、DJVU、CBZ/CBT</b> 文件和<b>圖片</b>檔案中可用。要啟"
"用此功能，請選擇 KOReader 將嘗試校正的最大傾斜角度。如果未校正，你可能需要選"
"擇一個更大的角度。請注意，此功能<b>可能會減慢你的閱讀器</b>速度，具體取決於多"
"個因素。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4297-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-savepdfhighlights"
msgid "7.3 Saving PDF Highlights"
msgstr "7.3 儲存 PDF 劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4299-6
msgid ""
"For saving your highlights, you can use the <span class=\"ui\">Export "
"highlights</span> feature of KOReader which is explained in a previous "
"section."
msgstr ""
"可以使用前面章節介紹過的<span class=\"ui\">匯出劃線</span>功能來儲存劃線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4301-6
msgid ""
"If you are making your highlights on a PDF document, KOReader can also save "
"them directly to the PDF file. This can be useful in certain situations "
"because with this method, your highlights become a part of the PDF file. "
"This means you can see them on other applications or platforms without "
"installing KOReader. For example if you are sending a file with highlights "
"to another user, they don't have to install KOReader to see your highlights. "
"You can just send the PDF file with your highlights saved into it and they "
"can open and see them with a <b>compatible</b> PDF reader."
msgstr ""
"當在 PDF 文件上做劃線時，KOReader 還會將劃線直接儲存到 PDF 文件中，該功能在某"
"些情況下非常實用。劃線會成為 PDF 文件的一部分，以便在其他軟體或其他未安裝 "
"KOReader 的系統中檢視。例如將包含劃線的 PDF 文件傳送給他人後，對方無需安裝 "
"KOReader 即可閱讀劃線，只需使用<b>相容劃線功能</b>的 PDF 閱讀軟體開啟即可。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4304-6
msgid ""
"This feature should work on all PDF readers. We tested and confirmed these: "
"Adobe Acrobat Reader, Chrome Browser, Deepin Reader, Evince, Firefox "
"Browser, Foxit Reader, Ghostscript, LibreOffice, Moon Reader, MuPDF, Okular, "
"Xpdf, Zathura."
msgstr ""
"該功能應適用於所有 PDF 閱讀軟體。我們已測試並確認下列軟體可用：Adobe Acrobat "
"Reader、Chrome Browser、Deepin Reader、Evince、Firefox Browser、Foxit "
"Reader、Ghostscript、LibreOffice、Moon Reader、MuPDF、Okular、Xpdf、Zathura。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4306-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> If you are using "
"the <span class=\"ui\">Progress Sync</span> plugin, saving PDF highlights "
"will change your file so your synchronization will fail. If you are planning "
"to use both features, in the <span class=\"ui\">Progress Sync</span> "
"plugin's settings, change the <span class=\"ui\">Document matching method</"
"span> to <span class=\"ui\">Filename</span> instead of the default <span "
"class=\"ui\">Binary</span> matching:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 若<span "
"class=\"ui\">進度同步</span>外掛被啟用，儲存 PDF 劃線將會修改檔案，進而導致進"
"度同步失敗。若希望同時使用這兩種功能，請將<span class=\"ui\">進度同步</span>"
"外掛設定中的<span class=\"ui\">文件比對方式</span>選項從預設的<span "
"class=\"ui\">二進位制</span>改為<span class=\"ui\">檔名</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:4313-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Progress sync / Document matching method"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 閱讀進度同步 / 文件比對方式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4316-6
msgid "Important information about saving PDF highlights feature"
msgstr "關於 PDF 文件劃線功能的重要資訊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4317-6
msgid ""
"Since making highlights for later usage can involve significant effort, if "
"you are planning to use this feature, you should understand how it works in "
"order to avoid frustrating situations."
msgstr ""
"要讓劃線相容其他閱讀場景會相當費工夫；如果打算使用該功能，最好詳細瞭解其工作"
"原理以避免發生令人沮喪的情況。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4319-6
msgid ""
"<b>QUICK SUMMARY:</b> If you want to be able to delete or export your PDF "
"highlights later, you have to copy the <span class=\"ui\">.sdr folder</span> "
"associated with your book when you backup or copy your book to other "
"devices. Without this folder, KOReader can still show the saved highlights "
"but it can't know where they are in the file, so it can't modify them. "
"Please continue reading for more information about this."
msgstr ""
"<b>簡單總結</b>：若希望 PDF 文件中的劃線還可刪除或匯出，需要在備份或複製文件"
"到其他裝置時連同文件關聯的<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>一併複製。若"
"此資料夾丟失，KOReader 雖仍可檢視已儲存的劃線，但無法再對劃線進行編輯。請繼續"
"閱讀下方章節進一步瞭解。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4325-6
msgid "How normal highlights work in KOReader"
msgstr "KOReader 中普通劃線的工作原理"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4327-6
msgid ""
"When you make a highlight in KOReader, whether the document is an EPUB or "
"PDF, this highlight is written into a settings file. For example if you are "
"reading <b>Alice in Wonderland.epub</b> you will have a folder named <span "
"class=\"ui\">Alice in Wonderland.sdr</span> in the same folder as your book. "
"Your highlights will be kept in a file under this <span class=\"ui\">.sdr "
"folder</span>. Which means, if you delete this <span class=\"ui\">.sdr "
"folder</span> which is associated with your book, you will lose your "
"highlights."
msgstr ""
"當使用者在 KOReader 中劃線文段，不管是在 EPUB 還是 PDF 文件中，這段劃線會被寫"
"入一個設定檔案。例如在閱讀 <b>Alice in Wonderland.epub</b> 時，在書籍檔案所在"
"目錄會生成一個名為 <span class=\"ui\">Alice in Wonderland.sdr</span> 的資料"
"夾。劃線資料會儲存到這個<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>中的檔案裡。倘"
"若這個與書籍關聯的<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>被刪除，書籍中的劃線"
"也會丟失。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4334-6
msgid "How PDF highlights work in KOReader"
msgstr "KOReader 中 PDF 文件劃線的工作原理"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4335-6
msgid ""
"PDF highlights feature works a bit different than the description above. As "
"we mentioned before, when you save your PDF highlights, they will be "
"directly written into the PDF file, which means they become a part of the "
"file itself. That's why you can send this PDF to another user and they can "
"see the highlights with a compatible PDF reader. They won't need your <span "
"class=\"ui\">.sdr folder</span> which contains a record of your highlights "
"because now the highlights are embedded directly into the PDF file."
msgstr ""
"PDF 文件的劃線功能與上述說明有所不同。如前所述，儲存 PDF 劃線時，劃線資料會被"
"直接寫入到 PDF 文件中，成為文件的一部分。這就是為何該 PDF 被發送給其他使用者"
"後對方可使用相容的 PDF 閱讀軟體檢視劃線。對方無需獲得包含了劃線記錄的關聯"
"<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>，因為劃線已被直接嵌入 PDF 文件中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4338-6
msgid ""
"Let's explain the problem which can arise when you are using this feature, "
"on an example. Imagine that you are reading a PDF book on your <b>e-reader</"
"b> with KOReader:"
msgstr ""
"讓我們透過一個例子來解釋使用此功能時可能出現的問題。想像一下，你正在使用 "
"KOReader 在<b>電子閱讀器</b>上閱讀 PDF 書籍:"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4342-7
msgid ""
"You are making highlights and <span class=\"ui\">Save highlights to PDF</"
"span> option is enabled, so as you make these highlights, KOReader saves "
"them to your PDF file."
msgstr ""
"若<span class=\"ui\">將劃線儲存到 PDF 文件</span>選項開啟，KOReader 會在做下"
"劃線的同時將劃線寫入 PDF 文件。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4344-7
msgid ""
"You want to continue reading the book on your <b>phone</b> with KOReader, so "
"you copy this PDF file from your <b>e-reader</b> to your <b>phone</b> (but "
"you didn't copy the <span class=\"ui\">.sdr folder</span>, only the PDF "
"file)."
msgstr ""
"你想繼續用 KOReader 在你的<b>手機</b>上閱讀這本書，所以你把這個 PDF 檔案從你"
"的<b>電子閱讀器</b>複製到你的<b>手機</b>上（但是你沒有複製<span "
"class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>，只有 PDF 檔案）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4348-7
msgid ""
"When you open the book on your <b>phone</b> with KOReader, you will see that "
"your highlights are still there."
msgstr "當用<b>手機上的</b> KOReader 開啟書籍，可以看到劃線仍保留在書籍中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4352-6
msgid ""
"Now the situation on both of your devices looks identical. Both your <b>e-"
"reader</b> and <b>phone</b> KOReader shows the PDF file with the same "
"highlights. But it only <b>looks</b> identical, actually there is a big "
"difference."
msgstr ""
"此時兩處裝置上的情況是一致的，<b>電子書閱讀器</b>和<b>手機上</b>的 KOReader "
"都能檢視 PDF 文件中的劃線。但兩者僅是<b>看起來</b>一樣，實際卻有很大不同。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4357-6
msgid ""
"KOReader on your <b>e-reader</b> has the knowledge of which highlights in "
"this PDF file are made by KOReader because it has the <span "
"class=\"ui\">.sdr folder</span>. But KOReader on your phone doesn't have "
"this knowledge. It only has the PDF file."
msgstr ""
"<b>電子書閱讀器</b>上的 KOReader 知道此 PDF 文件中的哪些劃線是由 KOReader 新"
"增的，因為它有關聯的<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>。但手機上的 "
"KOReader 則不知道這些資訊，它只能讀取 PDF 文件。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4360-6
msgid ""
"Difference arises when you try to delete the pdf highlights or export them. "
"Your <b>e-reader</b> can both delete these PDF highlights and export them. "
"But your <b>phone</b> KOReader can't, because as we said, it doesn't have "
"the <span class=\"ui\">.sdr folder</span> of your book so the highlights in "
"the book look like a part of the original book from its point of view."
msgstr ""
"在嘗試刪除或匯出 PDF 劃線時差異就更大了。<b>電子書閱讀器</b>上的 KOReader 即"
"可刪除也可匯出劃線，但<b>手機上</b>的 KOReader 則不能。如前所述，它缺少文件關"
"聯的<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>，所以它無法區分哪部分是劃線，而只"
"能將劃線視作原文的一部分。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4365-6
msgid ""
"So in short, if you want to be able to delete or export your PDF highlights "
"later, you have to copy the <span class=\"ui\">.sdr folder</span> associated "
"with your book when you backup or copy your book to other devices."
msgstr ""
"所以簡單來說，如果打算之後匯出 PDF 劃線，務必在備份或複製 PDF 文件到其他裝置"
"時將關聯的<span class=\"ui\"> .sdr 資料夾</span>一併複製。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4368-6
msgid "7.4 Importing PDF Highlights"
msgstr "7.4 匯入 PDF 劃線"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4370-6
msgid ""
"KOReader can import highlights from PDF files which are marked with other "
"PDF applications. We can't give a list of compatible applications, but "
"import feature generally works with popular PDF readers."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 可以從由其他 PDF 應用程式標註過的 PDF 檔案中匯入劃線。我們無法列出所"
"有相容的應用程式，但匯入功能通常適用於常見的 PDF 閱讀軟體。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4372-6
msgid "To import the highlights:"
msgstr "匯入劃線的方法："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4375-7
msgid "Open your PDF file with KOReader"
msgstr "用 KOReader 開啟你的 PDF 檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4377-7
msgid "Open the <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</span> dialog from here:"
msgstr "從此處開啟<span class=\"ui\">書籤</span>對話方塊："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:4379-8
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+pdfs.ol.li.div:201-2"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Bookmarks"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_bookmark.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 書籤"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4382-7
msgid ""
"Press the <span class=\"ui\" style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> button "
"at the top-left corner."
msgstr ""
"點擊左上角的 <span class=\"ui\" style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> 按"
"鈕。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4385-7
msgid ""
"On the opened dialog, choose <span class=\"ui\">Import embedded annotations</"
"span>. Your highlights will be added to the <span class=\"ui\">Bookmarks</"
"span> list."
msgstr ""
"在開啟的對話方塊中，選擇<span class=\"ui\">匯入內嵌標註</span>。你的劃線將被"
"新增到<span class=\"ui\">書籤</span>清單中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4389-6
msgid ""
"After the import process, highlights in the PDF will turn into regular "
"KOReader highlights. Which means, you can:"
msgstr ""
"匯入完成後，PDF 中的劃線將轉換為普通的 KOReader 劃線。這意味著，你可以："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4392-7
msgid "Add notes to them"
msgstr "為它們新增筆記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4393-7
msgid "Change their style and color"
msgstr "更改它們的樣式和顏色"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4394-7
msgid "Delete them <b>(See the note below)</b>"
msgstr "刪除它們<b>（參見下方說明）</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4395-7
msgid "Export them in various formats"
msgstr "以各種格式匯出它們"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4398-6
msgid ""
"<b>How deletion works:</b> When you import highlights, KOReader doesn't "
"modify the original highlights in your PDF. It adds imported highlights as a "
"layer on top of the originals. So if you delete an imported highlight, only "
"this <b>added layer</b> is deleted. Your original highlights are not deleted "
"from the PDF file. You can open this PDF with another reader and still see "
"the original highlights."
msgstr ""
"<b>刪除的原理：</b> 匯入劃線時，KOReader 不會修改 PDF 中原有的劃線，而是將匯"
"入的劃線作為一層疊加在原有劃線之上。因此，刪除某條匯入的劃線時，只會刪除這<b>"
"新增的一層</b>。PDF 檔案中的原有劃線不會被刪除，用其他閱讀軟體開啟該 PDF 仍可"
"看到原有劃線。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4402-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> If you enable the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Write highlights into PDF</span> option, embedded "
"highlights too will be deleted from the PDF file when you delete an imported "
"highlight."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 如果啟用了<span "
"class=\"ui\">將劃線儲存到 PDF</span>選項，刪除某條匯入的劃線時，PDF 檔案中嵌"
"入的劃線也會被一併刪除。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:4406-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Highlights / Write highlights into PDF"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 劃線 / 將劃線儲存到 PDF"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4409-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-ocr"
msgid "7.5 Using OCR"
msgstr "7.5 使用 OCR"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4410-6
msgid ""
"<b>OCR (Optical Character Recognition)</b> is the process of extracting text "
"from images. In KOReader context, it is generally used for extracting text "
"from scanned book pages in PDF files. KOReader relies on <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdoc\">Tesseract Open Source OCR Engine</a> for "
"this task."
msgstr ""
"<b>OCR（光學字元識別）</b>是從圖片中提取文字的過程。在 KOReader 上下文中，它"
"通常用於從 PDF 檔案中的掃描書頁中提取文字。KOReader 依賴於<a href=\"https://"
"github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdoc\"> Tesseract 開源 OCR 引擎</a>用於此任務。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4416-6
msgid "To use this feature you need to:"
msgstr "要使用此功能，你需要："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4418-7
msgid ""
"Install <span class=\"external\">Tesseract</span> language data to your "
"KOReader"
msgstr "安裝 <span class=\"external\">Tesseract</span> 語言資料到你的 KOReader"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4420-7
msgid ""
"Add newly installed languages to koreader/defaults.lua configuration file "
"(necessary only if your language is other than English or Chinese)"
msgstr ""
"將新安裝的語言新增到 koreader/defaults.lua 設定檔（僅當你的語言不是英語或中文"
"時才需要）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4424-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"Buttons of the OCR menu <b>will not function</b> until you install the "
"necessary Tesseract files. Details of this process can be read in our <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/Dictionary-"
"support#dictionary-lookups-in-scanned-pages\">related wiki page</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 在 "
"Tesseract 識別引擎的必要檔案安裝前，OCR 選單中的各個按鈕<b>不會響應</b>。詳細"
"的操作過程請前往<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/"
"Dictionary-support#dictionary-lookups-in-scanned-pages\">維基頁面</a>閱讀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4434-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-manga"
msgid "8 READING COMICS AND MANGA"
msgstr "8 閱讀漫畫"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4436-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-mangarefresh"
msgid "8.1 Page Refresh Interval"
msgstr "8.1 頁面重新整理間隔"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4438-6
msgid ""
"Comic books generally need more frequent page refreshes than the pure text "
"content. For normal text, you can set your page refresh interval to high "
"numbers without problem. But images can leave more residue and cause "
"ghosting, especially depending on the panel of your e-reader."
msgstr ""
"漫畫書一般需要比純文字內容更頻繁的頁面重新整理。對於普通文字，你可以毫無問題"
"地將頁面重新整理間隔設定為一個很高的數字。但圖片可能會留下更多殘留並導致重"
"影，這與你的電子閱讀器的螢幕密切相關。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4440-6
msgid ""
"KOReader allows you to assign any gesture to switch to different refresh "
"rates. For example you can set <b>swipe up left edge</b> for <span "
"class=\"ui\">every page</span> refresh when reading comics and set <b>swipe "
"down left edge</b> for <span class=\"ui\">every x page</span> refresh for "
"text only books. So when you open a comic, you can switch to more frequent "
"refresh with a simple tap or swipe (or vice versa)."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 允許將手勢分配到不同的重新整理頻率。例如，你可以在閱讀漫畫時設定<b>"
"向上滑動左邊緣</b>為<span class=\"ui\">每頁</span>重新整理，並設定<b>向下滑動"
"左邊緣</b>為<span class=\"ui\">每 x 頁</span>重新整理純文字書籍。因此，當你開"
"啟漫畫時，你可以透過簡單的點擊或滑動（反之亦然）切換到更頻繁的重新整理。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4446-6
msgid "This action is under:"
msgstr "此操作位於："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4448-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and Gestures / Gesture manager / \"ANY "
"GESTURE\" / Screen and lights / Full refresh rate"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 手勢管理 / 螢幕與燈光相關 / 全螢幕刷新"
"率"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4451-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-panelzoom"
msgid "8.2 Panel Zoom"
msgstr "8.2 區塊放大"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4453-6
msgid ""
"This feature makes reading comic books easier on smaller screens. You can "
"enable it while you are reading a <b>PDF, DJVU, CBZ or CBT</b> document via:"
msgstr ""
"此功能使在較小的螢幕上閱讀漫畫書更容易。你可以在閱讀 <b>PDF、DJVU、CBZ 或 "
"CBT</b> 文件時啟用它："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4456-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Panel Zoom (manga/comic)"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 分格縮放（適用於漫畫書籍）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4459-6
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, KOReader tries to find the boundaries of "
"rectangular panels on the screen. If you long-press on a panel, KOReader "
"zooms in and shows just that panel."
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後，KOReader 會嘗試在螢幕上尋找矩形面板的邊界。如果長按面板，"
"KOReader 會放大並僅顯示該面板。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4461-6
msgid ""
"As you can guess, this feature works best with comics that has clean panel "
"boundaries. Also there is no <b>page turn</b> in this mode to jump to the "
"next panel due to this boundary problem. You have to close the zoomed in "
"panel and long-press on the next one. To do this, just <span "
"class=\"ui\">swipe down</span> this zoomed in panel. Also you can use any "
"<span class=\"ui\">multiswipe gesture</span> (any combination of up, down, "
"left, right) to exit this view."
msgstr ""
"正如你所猜到的，此功能最適合具有乾淨窗格邊界的漫畫。此外，由於這個邊界問題，"
"在這種模式下無法<b>翻頁</b>跳轉到下一個窗格。你必須關閉放大的窗格，然後長按下"
"一個窗格進行放大。要做到這一點，只需<span class=\"ui\">向下滑動</span>這個放"
"大的窗格。此外，你還可以使用任何<span class=\"ui\">多重滑動手勢</span>（上、"
"下、左、右的任意組合）來退出此檢視。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4466-6
msgid "Procedure can be seen below:"
msgstr "過程可以在下面看到："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4470-6
msgid ""
"If you want to use this feature with other file types like EPUB, FB2, HTML "
"or image files, you should open the file with a different engine: In the "
"<span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> long-tap on the file name, tap <span "
"class=\"ui\">Open with…</span> and select <span class=\"ui\">MuPDF</span>."
msgstr ""
"如果要將此功能用於 EPUB、FB2、HTML 或圖片檔案等其他檔案類型，則應使用其他引擎"
"開啟該檔案：在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器中</span>長按檔名，點擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">開啟方式</span>，並選擇 <span class=\"ui\">MuPDF</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4474-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-manganextfile"
msgid "8.3 Jumping to the Next File"
msgstr "8.3 轉到下一檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4476-6
msgid ""
"When you reach the last page of a book, KOReader shows you a dialog. In this "
"dialog there is an <span class=\"ui\">Open next file</span> action which "
"will open the next file in the same directory as the current book. So you "
"can put your series in separate directories and read them one after another "
"without going back to the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>."
msgstr ""
"當翻到書籍尾頁，KOReader 將顯示一個對話方塊，其中的<span class=\"ui\">開啟下"
"一本書籍</span>操作將開啟當前書籍所在目錄中名稱排序挨著的另一本書。因此將一套"
"叢書放進同個資料夾可以一本接一本順序閱讀，無需返回<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽"
"器</span>操作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4481-6
msgid ""
"When opening this next file, KOReader skips the files that you have marked "
"as <b>finished</b>. This feature is useful for example when you have a "
"folder of manga files and you have already read some of them. You can mark a "
"file as finished from the end of book dialog shown above. Also you can mark "
"it from the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> by long-pressing on the "
"file. After copying them to your device, you can:"
msgstr ""
"開啟下一個檔案時，KOReader 會跳過標記為<b>已閱讀</b>的檔案。這個功能是有用"
"的，例如當你有一個資料夾的漫畫檔案，你已經讀了其中的一些。你可以從上面所示的"
"書籍結束對話方塊中將檔案標記為已完成。也可以在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</"
"span>上標記它，長按該檔案。將它們複製到你的裝置後，你可以："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4487-7
msgid "Open the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> in KOReader"
msgstr "在 KOReader 中開啟<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4489-7
msgid ""
"Long press on the ones you already finished and tap <span class=\"ui\">Mark "
"as finished</span>"
msgstr "長按你已經讀完的書，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">標記為已讀</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4492-6
msgid ""
"Now you can read all the files by just tapping <span class=\"ui\">Open next "
"file</span> at the end of the book. KOReader will skip the ones you have "
"already read."
msgstr ""
"現在，你只需點擊本書末尾的<span class=\"ui\">開啟下一個檔案</span>即可讀取所"
"有檔案。KOReader 會跳過你已經讀過的那些書籍。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4495-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-mangaprepare"
msgid "8.4 Optimizing Manga"
msgstr "8.4 最佳化漫畫"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4497-6
msgid ""
"If you like reading manga books on your e-ink device there are some tips "
"that can make your experience better. Preparing your own manga files is the "
"best solution if you're not satisfied with how comics look on your device."
msgstr ""
"對喜歡在電子墨水螢幕裝置上閱讀漫畫的使用者，下面有一些提升閱讀體驗的小技巧。"
"若漫畫在裝置上的呈現方式不盡如人意，對漫畫書檔案進行預處理是最佳解決方案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4501-6
msgid "Which file type to use"
msgstr "使用哪種檔案類型"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4502-6
msgid ""
"File types like MOBI and EPUB are not suitable for handling primarily image "
"content (e.g., manga/comics). <b>MOBI</b> support in KOReader is minimal to "
"nonexistent, and <b>EPUB’s</b> text rendering priorities can cause problems "
"when showing full-page images. For further technical details, please visit "
"this <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/"
"9163#issuecomment-1146637205\">GitHub issue</a>."
msgstr ""
"MOBI 和 EPUB 等檔案類型不適合主要處理圖片內容（例如漫畫/漫畫）。KOReader 中"
"的 <b>MOBI</b> 支援幾乎為零，而 <b>EPUB</b> 的文字渲染優先順序在顯示整頁圖片"
"時可能會導致問題。有關更多技術細節，請存取<a href=\"https://github.com/"
"koreader/koreader/issues/9163#issuecomment-1146637205\">對應 GitHub 議題</"
"a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4506-6
msgid ""
"Your best option is building a <b>CBZ</b> file which works better in "
"KOReader. A file with <b>.cbz</b> extension is a zip file (with no "
"compression) that is a collection of images. It saves multiple images, "
"commonly <b>.png</b> or <b>.jpeg</b> files, organized into pages of the "
"comic. KOReader can also open <b>CBT</b> files, which are similar to <b>CBZ</"
"b> files but use <b>TAR</b> archive format."
msgstr ""
"最好的選擇是建立一份在 KOReader 中效果更好的 <b>CBZ</b> 格式檔案。<b>.cbz</"
"b> 副檔名的檔案本質上是將未壓縮處理的圖片集打包而成的 ZIP 壓縮檔，內含通常為 "
"<b>.png</b> 或 <b>.jpeg</b> 格式、按照漫畫頁碼排序的多個圖片檔案。KOReader 也"
"支援開啟 <b>CBT</b> 格式檔案，它與 <b>CBZ</b> 相似，區別是使用 <b>TAR</b> 格"
"式打包。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4515-6
msgid ""
"Easiest way to convert a manga to <b>CBZ</b> is to get the manga as images "
"from various websites, then convert them using <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"ciromattia/kcc\">Kindle Comic Converter</a>. There are some useful settings "
"like <b>auto-rotating two-page splits to landscape and applying dithering</"
"b> so that e-ink rendered gradients are smoothly dithered without jagged "
"layers."
msgstr ""
"將漫畫轉換為 <b>CBZ</b> 的最簡單方法是從各種網站獲得漫畫圖片，然後使用 <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/ciromattia/kcc\">Kindle Comic Converter</a> 轉換它"
"們。有一些有用的設定，如<b>自動將跨頁雙頁旋轉為橫向並應用抖動</b>，使墨水螢幕"
"渲染的漸變平滑抖動，沒有鋸齒層。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4519-6
msgid "Which resolution to use"
msgstr "使用哪種解析度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4520-6
msgid ""
"The best results can be achieved by resizing your images to exactly your e-"
"reader screen size. A screen-specific <b>CBZ</b> which targets the exact "
"screen size of the device, prevents rescaling during reading. KOReader "
"downscales your images to your screen size while reading but this is not "
"recommended because KOReader adds a dithering pass before scaling and this "
"causes loss of quality."
msgstr ""
"透過將圖片大小調整為電子閱讀器螢幕尺寸，可以獲得最佳效果。特定於螢幕的 "
"<b>CBZ</b> 針對裝置的確切螢幕尺寸，可防止在讀取期間重新縮放。KOReader 在閱讀"
"時將圖片縮放到螢幕尺寸，但不建議這樣做，因為 KOReader 在縮放之前添加了抖動通"
"道，這會導致品質損失。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4523-6
msgid ""
"But if you want to use your hand made <b>CBZ</b> on more than one device or "
"you want to preserve high resolution for future proofing, your best option "
"might be to make the <b>CBZ</b> for your highest resolution device. Or pick "
"an arbitrary \"high\" resolution, possibly one that matches the source. "
"<b>300 PPI</b> or better (up to <b>450</b> or even <b>600</b>), unless the "
"source is lower of course. If we assume a screen size of <b>8\", 1500×2000</"
"b> is a good target resolution. For bigger images, you should try it on your "
"device and see whether it can deal with it. Especially old Kindles with low "
"memory can struggle with sizes like <b>3000×4000</b> for example. If you're "
"automating the process, it might be worth considering creating both a lower "
"and higher quality version (e.g., at <b>200/400</b> or <b>300/600</b> DPI)."
msgstr ""
"但是，如果你想在多臺裝置上使用手工製作的 <b>CBZ</b>，或者你想保留高解析度以備"
"將來使用，那麼最好的選擇可能是為你的最高解析度裝置製作 <b>CBZ</b>。或者選擇可"
"能與源解析度匹配的\"高\"解析度。<b>300 PPI</b> 或更高（<b>450</b> 甚至 "
"<b>600</b>），當然，除非來源較低。我們假設螢幕尺寸為<b>8\"，1500×2000</b>，這"
"是一個不錯的目標解析度。對於較大的圖片，你應該在你的裝置上嘗試一下，看看它是"
"否可以處理它。例如，記憶體不足的舊 Kindle 可能會難以處理 <b>3000×4000</b> 等"
"大小。如果你要自動化該過程，則可能需要考慮建立較低和較高品質的兩個版本（例如 "
"<b>200/400</b> 或 <b>300/600</b> DPI）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4533-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"KOReader doesn't parse <b>spine page-progression-direction=\"rtl\"</b> "
"attribute of the books. So it doesn’t change page turning direction even "
"though the file was created with right-to-left reading. Users can switch "
"this via:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"KOReader 不會解析書籍的 <b>spine page-progression-direction=\"rtl\"</b> 參"
"數，因此即使書籍指定了從右向左閱讀，軟體中的翻頁方向也不會改變。使用者可透過"
"下列路徑手動切換："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div.div:4537-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Page turns / Invert page turn "
"tap and swipes / buttons"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 翻頁方式 / 交換左右兩側翻頁功能 / 相關"
"按鈕"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4540-6
msgid "Advanced preparation of manga"
msgstr "對漫畫書籍進行高階預處理"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4542-6
msgid "The following is an example procedure to process one manga file:"
msgstr "以下是處理一個漫畫檔案的示例過程："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4545-7
msgid ""
"Download <span class=\"external\">Kindle Comic Converter (KCC)</span> from "
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ciromattia/kcc\">https://github.com/ciromattia/"
"kcc</a>"
msgstr ""
"下載<span class=\"external\"> Kindle 漫畫轉換器（KCC）</span>（連結<a "
"href=\"https://github.com/ciromattia/kcc\">https://github.com/ciromattia/"
"kcc</a>）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4547-7
msgid ""
"Download your manga from the source of your choosing (i.e. <span "
"class=\"external\">HakuNeko</span>)"
msgstr ""
"從你選擇的來源下載你的漫畫（如：<span class=\"external\">HakuNeko</span>）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4548-7
msgid ""
"Unpack the manga file. Now you should have a directory that contains only "
"images (or subdirectories with images, no archives)"
msgstr ""
"解壓漫畫檔案。現在，你應該有一個僅包含圖片的目錄（或包含圖片的子目錄，沒有存"
"檔）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4549-7
msgid ""
"Process this directory with <span class=\"external\">KCC</span>. Each "
"directory will produce a single <b>CBZ</b> file, so if you want to make "
"several volumes at once, select multiple directories at once"
msgstr ""
"使用 <span class=\"external\">KCC</span> 軟體處理這個資料夾，每個資料夾將被打"
"包為單個 <b>.cbz</b> 格式檔案。若要一次性製作多卷漫畫書籍，請同時選中多個資料"
"夾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4553-6
msgid "Some useful settings of <span class=\"external\">KCC</span>:"
msgstr "<span class=\"external\">KCC</span> 的一些有用設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4555-6
msgid ""
"<b>Spread splitter:</b> This feature detects double pages and allows you to "
"rotate or cut them in two."
msgstr "<b>跨頁分割器</b>：此功能可檢測雙頁，並允許你將其旋轉或切成兩半。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4558-6
msgid ""
"<b>Upscaling:</b> Enlarge images that is smaller than your target resolution."
msgstr "<b>放大</b>：放大比目標解析度小的圖片。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4561-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-mangatips"
msgid "8.5 Other Manga Tips"
msgstr "8.5 漫畫相關的其他技巧"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4563-6
msgid "Getting rid of rainbow effect on color e-ink screens"
msgstr "消除彩色電子墨水螢幕上的彩虹紋"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4565-6
msgid ""
"Due to the color e-ink screen technology, it is possible to see rainbow like "
"color artifacts when reading black-and-white comics/manga with fine shading "
"or dots. If you are having this problem, there is a KOReader plugin named "
"<span class=\"external\">Derainbowify</span> that solves it. You can see the "
"detailed info and install instructions on the <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"Euphoriyy/derainbowify.koplugin\">GitHub page</a> of this plugin."
msgstr ""
"受彩色電子墨水螢幕技術所限，閱讀帶有細密陰影或網點的黑白漫畫時，可能會看到類"
"似彩虹的彩色偽影。如果遇到此問題，可以用一款名為 <span "
"class=\"external\">Derainbowify</span> 的 KOReader 外掛解決。詳細資訊和安裝說"
"明見該外掛的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Euphoriyy/"
"derainbowify.koplugin\">GitHub</a> 頁面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4569-6
msgid "Immersive mode in KOReader"
msgstr "KOReader 中的沉浸式模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4571-6
msgid ""
"If you would like to enjoy your manga in a more immersive way, make sure "
"that you selected the exact same resolution as your device’s screen "
"resolution in <b>KCC</b> when creating your <b>CBZ</b> file. Also you can "
"hide the bottom progress bar while reading your manga in KOReader. So you "
"will have an immersive full screen view of your manga without obstructions."
msgstr ""
"如果你想以更身臨其境的方式欣賞你的漫畫，請確保在建立 <b>CBZ</b> 檔案時，你在 "
"<b>KCC</b> 中選擇了與裝置螢幕解析度完全相同的解析度。你還可以在 KOReader 中閱"
"讀漫畫時隱藏底部進度條。因此，你將獲得一個無障礙的沉浸式全屏漫畫檢視。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4577-6
msgid ""
"Extra step for smooth gradients <span class=\"microns_warning\" "
"title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"
msgstr ""
"讓漸變更平滑的額外步驟 <span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced "
"topic\"></span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4579-6
msgid ""
"After using <span class=\"external\">KCC</span> to create a <b>CBZ</b> file, "
"you can apply additional <b>dithering</b> to the images. This way, eink-"
"rendered gradients will be smoothly dithered without jagged layers. This "
"step will produce fine-tuned manga volumes which look better in KOReader."
msgstr ""
"使用 <span class=\"external\">KCC</span> 建立 <b>CBZ</b> 檔案後，你可以對圖片"
"應用額外的<b>抖動</b>。這樣，e-ink 渲染的漸變將平滑抖動，沒有鋸齒層。這一步將"
"製作出在 KOReader 中看起來更好的微調漫畫卷。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4586-6
msgid ""
"You can use <span class=\"external\">ImageMagick</span> to process your "
"images. <span class=\"external\">ImageMagick</span>, is a powerful open-"
"source software suite for displaying, creating, converting, modifying, and "
"editing raster images. You can download <span "
"class=\"external\">ImageMagick</span> and use it from the command line to "
"process many images at once."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用 <span class=\"external\">ImageMagick</span> 來處理你的圖片。<span "
"class=\"external\">ImageMagick</span> 是一個功能強大的開源軟體套件，用於顯"
"示、建立、轉換、修改和編輯光柵圖片。你可以下載 <span "
"class=\"external\">ImageMagick</span>，並從命令列使用它一次處理多個圖片。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4591-7
msgid ""
"Unpack the prepared <b>CBZ</b> file that you created with <span "
"class=\"external\">KCC</span>,"
msgstr ""
"解壓縮<b>CBZ</b>檔案，即之前用<span class=\"external\">KCC</span>建立並準備好"
"的那份，"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4593-7
msgid ""
"Download the following file <a href=\"https://disk.yandex.com/d/"
"glEebjmPYYp7og\">dither_pack.zip</a> (located on <span "
"class=\"external\">Yandex Disk</span>) which contains two <b>batch files "
"(.BAT)</b> and a <b>GIF</b> color template."
msgstr ""
"下載以下檔案 <a href=\"https://disk.yandex.com/d/"
"glEebjmPYYp7og\">dither_pack.zip</a>（位於 <span class=\"external\">Yandex "
"Disk</span> 上），其中包含兩個<b>批處理檔案（.bat）</b>和一個 <b>GIF</b> 顏色"
"模板。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4597-7
msgid "Extract these three files next to your images that will be processed"
msgstr "將這個三個檔案放到你要處理的圖片旁邊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4598-7
msgid ""
"Edit the <b>_magick_manga_ditherN_resize.bat</b> and change the resolution "
"to your device resolution (in both places in the <b>BAT</b> file)."
msgstr ""
"編輯 <b>_magick_manga_ditherN_resize.bat</b>，並將解析度更改為你的裝置解析度"
"（在 <b>bat</b> 檔案的兩個位置）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:4602-8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> Next step will "
"replace all the images in the directory with the processed ones. So make "
"sure that you have a copy of them in some other directory if you want to "
"keep the originals."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 下一項操作將會使目"
"錄中的圖片被替換為處理後的版本。若想保留原件，請確保這些檔案已在別處存有副"
"本。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4604-7
msgid ""
"Run <b>_magick_manga_ditherN_resize.bat</b> to resize and dither the images."
msgstr "執行 <b>_magick_manga_ditherN_resize.bat</b> 調整圖片大小和抖動。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4606-7
msgid ""
"Assuming you have <b>7-Zip</b> installed, run <b>_batch_archive.bat</b> to "
"pack all the processed images into a <b>CBZ</b> archive."
msgstr ""
"假設你安裝了 <b>7-Zip</b>，執行 <b>_batch_archive.bat</b> 將所有處理過的圖片"
"打包到 <b>CBZ</b> 檔案中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4612-6
msgid ""
"Reversing the page turn direction for authentic Japanese manga <span "
"class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"
msgstr ""
"反轉翻頁方向以還原正宗日本漫畫 <span class=\"microns_warning\" "
"title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4614-6
msgid ""
"You can make KOReader turn pages from <b>Left to Right</b>, so that swipes "
"and tap zones are swapped. To enable this, add the following lines:"
msgstr ""
"你可以讓 KOReader 從<b>左向右</b>翻頁，這樣滑動和點擊區域就會互換。要啟用此功"
"能，請新增以下行："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4616-6
msgid ""
"[\"/storage/emulated/0/Books/manga\"] = {<br> [\"inverse_reading_order\"] = "
"true,<br> [\"kopt_zoom_direction\"] = 0,<br> },"
msgstr ""
"[\"/storage/emulated/0/Books/manga\"] = {<br> [\"inverse_reading_order\"] = "
"true,<br> [\"kopt_zoom_direction\"] = 0,<br> },"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4625-6
msgid "to this file:"
msgstr "到此檔案："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section:4625-22
msgid "/koreader/settings/directory_defaults.lua"
msgstr "/koreader/settings/directory_defaults.lua"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4629-6
msgid ""
"where <b>/storage/emulated/0/Books/manga</b> is the absolute path to the "
"directory containing your mangas. After this change, when you open a file "
"from the mentioned directory, your swipes and tap zones will be swapped."
msgstr ""
"其中 <b>/storage/memulate/0/Books/manga</b> 是包含漫畫的目錄的絕對路徑。更改"
"後，當你從上述目錄開啟檔案時，你的滑動和點擊區域將被交換。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4638-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-managinglibrary"
msgid "9 MANAGING YOUR LIBRARY"
msgstr "9 管理藏書庫"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4640-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-filebrowser"
msgid "9.1 File Browser Usage"
msgstr "9.1 檔案瀏覽器使用情況"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4642-6
msgid ""
"You will see the <span class=\"ui\">file browser</span> interface when you "
"run KOReader for the first time. It is one of the two main interfaces of "
"KOReader. You will do all your file and folder operations here. You can "
"access it from the reading screen by:"
msgstr ""
"當你第一次執行 KOReader 時，你將看到<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>介"
"面。它是 KOReader 的兩個主要視窗之一。你將在此處執行所有檔案和資料夾操作。你"
"可以透過以下方式從閱讀螢幕存取它："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4645-6
msgid "TOP MENU /"
msgstr "頂部選單 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4651-6
msgid ""
"By default, <span class=\"ui\">file browser</span> shows your <span "
"class=\"ui\">HOME</span> folder, which is your main library folder. You can "
"change this by <b>long-pressing on any folder</b>. You can change <span "
"class=\"ui\">file browser</span>s many options like how books are displayed "
"or sorted via the <span class=\"ui\">TOP MENU</span> by swiping down from "
"the top part of the screen."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>顯示你的<span class=\"ui\">首"
"頁</span>資料夾，這是你的主庫資料夾。你可以透過<b>長按任何資料夾</b>來更改此"
"設定。你可以更改<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>的許多選項，例如透過"
"<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>從螢幕頂部向下滑動書籍的顯示或排序方式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4656-6
msgid "Circled items in the image are explained below:"
msgstr "圖片中帶圓圈的項目說明如下："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4658-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">RESET:</span> This option allows you to reset some "
"properties of your document like <b>reading progress, bookmarks, custom "
"cover image</b> etc. which you can choose in a following dialog."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">重設</span>：該選項可以重設書籍的部分資料，如<b>閱讀進度、"
"書籤、自訂封面</b>等，具體可在展開的對話方塊中選擇。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4662-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> Be very careful "
"when using the <span class=\"ui\">reset</span> dialog and double check which "
"items are marked, otherwise you can reset everything related to your book "
"accidentally."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 使用<span "
"class=\"ui\">重設</span>對話方塊時請務必謹慎操作，認真複核哪些項目已被勾選，"
"否則可能會意外重設書籍全部資料。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4666-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">OPEN WITH:</span> KOReader has different engines for "
"rendering different file types. In some cases you can open a file in a "
"different engine to get some other features. See <b>Viewing archive files</"
"b> and <b>Viewing image files</b> sections just below."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">開啟方式</span>：KOReader 有不同的引擎來渲染不同的檔案類"
"型。在某些情況下，你可以在不同的引擎中開啟檔案以獲得其他一些功能。請參閱下面"
"的<b>檢視存檔檔案</b>和<b>檢視圖片檔案</b>部分。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4671-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">IGNORE COVER:</span> If for some reason you want to "
"disable the cover for this book (it may have wrong cover or cover is not "
"very readable on the e-ink screen) you can select this."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">忽略封面</span>：如果由於某種原因你想停用這本書的封面（它"
"可能有錯誤的封面或封面在電子墨水螢幕上顯示的不清晰），你可以選擇這個。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4674-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">IGNORE METADATA:</span> If your book metadata is not "
"correct, name field may show useless information. Select this option to show "
"the file name instead of metadata."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">忽略元資料</span>：如果你的書籍元資料不正確，名稱欄位可能"
"會顯示無用的資訊。選擇此選項可顯示檔名而不是元資料。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4677-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">REFRESH CACHED BOOK INFORMATION:</span> KOReader caches a "
"book's metadata and book cover when you add it to your library. If you make "
"some changes to the book after copying to your device, this information "
"might need to be updated. If you see wrong cover or metadata, you can "
"refresh the book information with this menu item."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">重新整理快取的書籍資訊</span>：KOReader 在將書籍的元資料和"
"書籍封面新增到庫中時快取書籍的元資料和封面。如果你在複製到裝置後對書籍進行了"
"一些更改，則可能需要更新此資訊。如果你看到錯誤的封面或元資料，則可以使用此選"
"單項重新整理書籍資訊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4680-6
msgid "Showing hidden files and directories in File Browser"
msgstr "在檔案瀏覽器中顯示隱藏的檔案和目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4681-6
msgid ""
"Normally, KOReader <b>file browser</b> doesn't show these two groups of "
"files and directories:"
msgstr "通常，KOReader 的<b>檔案瀏覽器</b>不顯示以下兩類檔案和目錄："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4685-7
msgid ""
"<b>Hidden files and directories:</b> These are files and directories that "
"start with a dot (.) character, like <span class=\"ui\">.screensavers</"
"span>. If you want to see these directories and files, enable this option:"
msgstr ""
"<b>隱藏的檔案和目錄：</b> 指以點號（.）開頭的檔案和目錄，例如 <span "
"class=\"ui\">.screensavers</span>。如果想看到這些目錄和檔案，請啟用下列選項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:4688-7
msgid ""
"(FILE BROWSER) TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> / Settings / Show hidden files"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> / 設定 / 顯示隱藏檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4691-7
msgid ""
"<b>Unsupported file types:</b> These are the file types that KOReader "
"<b>can't open directly</b>, like font files with a <b>.ttf</b> extension. "
"KOReader can directly open these file types: PDF, EPUB, DJVU, MOBI, CBR, "
"CBZ, CBT, DOCX, RTF, HTML, HTMLZ, TXT, XPS, FB2, PDB, CHM and MD document "
"types, image files and ZIP/RAR archives, so only these files are visible in "
"the <span class=\"ui\">file browser</span>. If you want to see the "
"unsupported file types too, you can enable this option:"
msgstr ""
"<b>不支援的檔案類型：</b> 指 KOReader <b>無法直接開啟</b>的檔案類型，例如副檔"
"名為 <b>.ttf</b> 的字型檔案。KOReader 可直接開啟以下檔案類型：PDF、EPUB、"
"DJVU、MOBI、CBR、CBZ、CBT、DOCX、RTF、HTML、HTMLZ、TXT、XPS、FB2、PDB、CHM "
"和 MD 文件類型，以及圖片檔案和 ZIP/RAR 壓縮檔，因此 <span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏"
"覽器</span>中只顯示這些檔案。如果也想看到不支援的檔案類型，請啟用下列選項："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:4695-7
msgid ""
"(FILE BROWSER) TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> / Settings / Show unsupported files"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_cabinet.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> / 設定 / 顯示不支援的檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4699-6
msgid "Working on multiple files"
msgstr "操作多個文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4701-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">File browser</span> allows you to perform some operations "
"(like copying, moving, deleting, exporting highlights) on many files at the "
"same time. For this procedure, first you have to select the files. Currently "
"there are three different ways of selecting files for bulk operations in the "
"<span class=\"ui\">file browser</span>:"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>可同時對大量檔案執行諸如複製、移動、刪除"
"和匯出劃線的多種操作。要使用該功能，首先要選擇對應的檔案。<span class=\"ui\">"
"檔案瀏覽器</span>當前提供了三種進行批次操作的方式："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4704-6
msgid ""
"<b>- In the first method</b>, long press on a file name and choose <span "
"class=\"ui\">Select</span> from the popup dialog. This will activate the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Selection mode</span>. Now you can tap on other files to "
"add them to the selection. When you finish selecting your files, tap on the "
"<span class=\"ui\">checkmark icon</span> at the <b>top right corner</b> of "
"your screen. You can choose what to do with these files from the dialog. Or "
"exit the selection mode from the same dialog."
msgstr ""
"<b>- 第一種方式</b>：在檔名上長按，從彈出對話方塊中選擇<span class=\"ui\">多"
"選</span>。此時將進入<span class=\"ui\">連續選擇模式</span>。點擊其他檔案使其"
"被選中，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">勾號圖示</span>（位於<b>螢幕右上角</b>）。"
"在彈出對話方塊中可選擇要對這些檔案執行的操作，或者退出連續選擇模式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4709-6
msgid ""
"<b>- In the second method</b>, press the <span class=\"ui\">+ (plus) icon</"
"span> at the <b>top right corner</b> and choose <span class=\"ui\">Select "
"files</span> from the dialog. This will activate the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Selection mode</span> and rest is the same as the first method "
"above."
msgstr ""
"<b>- 第二種方式</b>：點擊<span class=\"ui\">加號圖示</span>（位於<b>螢幕右上"
"角</b>），從彈出對話方塊中選擇<span class=\"ui\">選擇多個檔案</span>。此時將"
"進入<span class=\"ui\">連續選擇模式</span>，接下來的操作與第一種方式相同。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4715-6
msgid ""
"<b>- In the third method</b>, you can choose your files based on a <span "
"class=\"ui\"> File search </span>. This is useful if you need to perform an "
"operation on many files distributed in different folders. For example you "
"want to move all files in your collection authored by Tolkien, to a new "
"folder. Steps for this action will be:"
msgstr ""
"<b>- 第三種方式</b>：透過<span class=\"ui\">檔案搜尋</span>功能篩選書籍。該方"
"式可十分高效地處理分散於多處目錄的多本書籍。例如，要將收藏清單中所有作者是托"
"爾金的書籍移至同個資料夾，請按下列步驟操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4720-7
msgid ""
"From the <span class=\"ui\">Top menu</span> press on the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Search tab</span> (with the magnifier icon) and choose <span "
"class=\"ui\">File search</span>."
msgstr ""
"從<span class=\"ui\">頂部選單</span>按<span class=\"ui\">搜尋選項卡</span>"
"（帶有放大鏡圖示）並選擇<span class=\"ui\">檔案搜尋</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4723-7
msgid ""
"Check <span class=\"ui\">Include subfolders</span> option if you want to "
"search inside the folders too. You can check <span class=\"ui\">Also search "
"in book metadata</span> if you want KOReader to look in book's metadata. "
"Otherwise KOReader will only look at the file names for the word you entered."
msgstr ""
"如果你也想在資料夾中搜尋，請選中<span class=\"ui\">包含子資料夾</span>選項。"
"如果你想讓 KOReader 在搜尋書籍的元資料，你可以選擇<span class=\"ui\">搜尋書籍"
"元資料</span>。否則，KOReader 只會搜尋檔名。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4726-7
msgid ""
"You can start the search from your library <span class=\"ui\">Home folder</"
"span> or your <span class=\"ui\">Current folder</span> by pressing on the "
"respective button."
msgstr ""
"你可以透過按相應的按鈕從庫<span class=\"ui\">主資料夾</span>或<span "
"class=\"ui\">當前資料夾</span>開始搜尋。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4729-7
msgid ""
"After search is finished, you will see a file list (if your search term is "
"found of course). Now you can tap on the <span class=\"ui\">Hamburger icon</"
"span> at the <b>top left corner</b> of the screen to enter the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Selection mode</span>."
msgstr ""
"在執行檢索後，將列出符合條件的檔案清單（若存在關鍵詞匹配的結果）。現在可點擊"
"<span class=\"ui\">漢堡選單</span>（位於<b>螢幕左上角</b>），進入<span "
"class=\"ui\">連續選擇模式</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4732-7
msgid ""
"Tap on all the files you want to perform operations on and tap on the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Checkmark icon</span> at the <b>top left corner</b> of your "
"screen. You will see a dialog which contains <span class=\"ui\">Select in "
"file browser</span>. Select this option."
msgstr ""
"點擊所有要處理的檔案，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">勾號圖示（√）</span>。該圖示"
"位於<b>螢幕左上角</b>，點擊後會彈出對話方塊，其中包含<span class=\"ui\">在檔"
"案瀏覽器選擇</span>選項。選擇該選項。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4737-7
msgid ""
"Now you will be back at the <span class=\"ui\">File browser</span> and the "
"files you selected in the <span class=\"ui\">Search dialog</span> will also "
"be selected here."
msgstr ""
"現在，你將回到<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>，你在<span class=\"ui\">搜"
"尋對話方塊</span>中選擇的檔案也將在此處選擇。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4740-7
msgid ""
"Tap on the <span class=\"ui\">Checkmark icon</span> at the <b>top right "
"corner</b> of your screen. Now you can choose what to do with these files "
"from the dialog."
msgstr ""
"點擊<span class=\"ui\">勾號圖示（√）</span>，它位於<b>螢幕右上角</b>。現在可"
"從彈出的對話方塊中選擇要對這些檔案執行的操作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4745-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.div:109-0"
msgid "Folder shortcuts"
msgstr "資料夾捷徑"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4747-6
msgid ""
"KOReader allows you to add your favorite folders to a quickly accessible "
"Folder shortcuts menu. For example if you have an <b>Archive</b> folder in "
"your library that is under <b>Home>Articles>Scientific>Archived</b>, you can "
"assign a folder shortcut to this <b>Archived</b> folder and access it "
"quickly even while reading a book."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 允許你將最喜歡的資料夾新增到快速存取的資料夾快速選單中。例如，如果你"
"的庫中有一個 <b>Archive</b> 資料夾，位於 "
"<b>Home>Articles>Scientific>Archived</b> 下，你可以為這個 <b>Archived</b> 資"
"料夾分配一個資料夾捷徑，即使在閱讀書籍時也可以快速存取它。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4751-6
msgid "Adding a folder shortcut:"
msgstr "新增資料夾捷徑："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4752-6
msgid ""
"There are two ways of adding a folder to your <span class=\"ui\">Folder "
"shortcuts</span> list:"
msgstr ""
"有兩種方法可以將資料夾新增到<span class=\"ui\">資料夾捷徑</span>清單中："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4755-7
msgid ""
"When you are in the File Browser, tap right corner <span class=\"ui\">+ "
"(plus) menu</span> button then tap <span class=\"ui\">Add to folder "
"shortcuts</span> item and enter a descriptive name for this shortcut. "
"<b>This will add the folder you are currently in.</b>"
msgstr ""
"當你在檔案瀏覽器中時，點擊右上角的<span class=\"ui\">+（附加）選單</span>按"
"鈕，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">新增到資料夾捷徑</span>項，並為此捷徑輸入描述"
"性名稱。<b>這將新增你當前所在的資料夾</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4758-7
msgid ""
"When you are in the File Browser, long-press on a folder name to open the "
"context menu. Tap <span class=\"ui\">Add to folder shortcuts</span> item and "
"enter a descriptive name for this shortcut. <b>This will add the folder you "
"pressed on.</b>"
msgstr ""
"在檔案瀏覽器中，長按資料夾名稱可開啟內容選單。點擊<span class=\"ui\">新增到資"
"料夾捷徑</span>項，然後為此捷徑輸入一個描述性名稱。<b>這將新增你按下的資料夾"
"</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4762-6
msgid ""
"Folders which are in your <span class=\"ui\">Folder shortcuts</span> list "
"will have a <b>star (★)</b> in the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">資料夾捷徑</span>清單中的資料夾會顯示<b>星號（★）</b>標"
"記，這一標記出現在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4766-6
msgid ""
"You can remove a folder from the shortcuts in the same way, by long-pressing "
"on it and selecting <span class=\"ui\">Remove from folder shortcuts</span>."
msgstr ""
"你可以以相同的方式從捷徑中刪除資料夾，方法是長按資料夾並選擇<span "
"class=\"ui\">從資料夾中刪除捷徑</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4769-6
msgid "Viewing your folder shortcuts:"
msgstr "檢視資料夾捷徑："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4770-6
msgid ""
"You can open your <span class=\"ui\">Folder shortcuts</span> from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> or <span class=\"ui\">Reading screen</span> "
"while reading a book."
msgstr ""
"你可以在閱讀書籍時從<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>或<span class=\"ui\">"
"閱讀螢幕</span>開啟<span class=\"ui\">資料夾快捷</span>方式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4775-7
msgid ""
"<b>From the File browser:</b> Top right corner <span class=\"ui\">+ (plus) "
"menu</span> then choosing <span class=\"ui\">Folder shortcuts</span> or "
"assigning a gesture."
msgstr ""
"<b>從檔案瀏覽器</b>：右上角<span class=\"ui\">+（附加）選單</span>，然後選擇"
"<span class=\"ui\">資料夾捷徑</span>或指定手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4779-7
msgid "<b>From the reading screen:</b> By assigning a gesture to it."
msgstr "<b>從閱讀螢幕</b>：透過為其分配手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4783-6
msgid ""
"It is under the <span class=\"ui\">File browser</span> section of the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Gesture manager</span>. You can learn how to set gestures in "
"the relevant section of this guide."
msgstr ""
"它位於<span class=\"ui\">手勢管理員</span>的<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</"
"span>部分。你可以在本指南的相關部分學習如何設定手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4788-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-viewingfiletypes"
msgid "9.2 Viewing Other File Types"
msgstr "9.2 瀏覽其他格式的檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4790-6
msgid "Viewing text files"
msgstr "檢視純文字檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4792-6
msgid ""
"If you have books in <b>.txt</b> format (which is more common in <b>Chinese</"
"b> and <b>Cyrillic</b> languages), you can try enabling the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Auto-detect TXT files layout</span> feature. In some cases it "
"can improve the rendering and make the text more \"book like\". When "
"enabled, the rendering engine will use heuristics (text wrapped under some "
"max line length, single or double blank lines marking paragraphs, "
"indentation or centered text considered heading...) to guess how to better "
"render the text and will try to create a <b>table of contents</b>."
msgstr ""
"如果你有 <b>.txt</b> 格式的書籍（在<b>中文</b>和<b>西里爾文</b>語言中更常"
"見），你可以嘗試啟用<span class=\"ui\">自動偵測 txt 檔案佈局</span>功能。在某"
"些情況下，它可以改善渲染效果，使文字更\"像書\"。啟用後，渲染引擎將使用啟發式"
"方法（文字被包裹在一些最大行長下，標記段落的單行或雙空行，縮排或被視為標題的"
"居中文字…）來猜測如何更好地渲染文字，並嘗試建立一個<b>目錄</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4798-6
msgid ""
"You can enable this feature here (which is visible only if you are reading "
"a .txt file):"
msgstr "你可以在此處啟用此功能（僅當你正在讀取 .txt 檔案時才可見）："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4800-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Style / Auto-detect TXT files layout"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 樣式 / 自動識別TXT檔案的版式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4803-6
msgid ""
"Note that this feature might mess up ASCII art drawings and space character "
"based formatting. If your book has these kind of features, it might be "
"better to use the default mode in which, the text file is rendered <b>as is</"
"b> in a monospace font."
msgstr ""
"請注意，此功能可能會弄亂 ASCII 藝術繪圖和基於空格字元的格式。如果你的書籍具有"
"這些功能，最好使用預設模式，在該模式下，純文字檔案以等寬字型按<b>原樣</b>呈"
"現。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4806-6
msgid "Viewing archive files"
msgstr "檢視存檔檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4808-6
msgid ""
"KOReader can read files stored/compressed in <b>ZIP</b> files. You can open "
"<b>ZIP</b>, <b>CBZ</b> and <b>EPUB</b> (as they are <b>ZIP</b> archives too) "
"files with the archive viewer to have a look at the contained files:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 可以讀取儲存/壓縮在 <b>ZIP</b> 壓縮檔中的檔案。你可以使用封存檢視器"
"開啟 <b>ZIP、</b><b>CBZ</b> 和 <b>EPUB</b>（因為它們也是 <b>ZIP</b> 壓縮檔）"
"檔案以檢視包含的檔案："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4815-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:179-1"
msgid "In <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> long-press the file name"
msgstr "在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>長按檔名"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4817-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:181-1"
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Open with…</span>"
msgstr "點擊<span class=\"ui\">開啟方式…</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4818-7
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Archive viewer</span>"
msgstr "點擊<span class=\"ui\">封存檢視器</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4821-6
msgid ""
"A ZIP file can contain many types of documents like html, txt or images. "
"KOReader can open your ZIP file properly <b>only if you give it a hint for "
"the type of file in the ZIP archive</b>. If you give your file only a "
"<b>.zip</b> extension, KOReader will assume that this archive contains "
"images and try to open it like a <b>CBZ</b> file."
msgstr ""
"ZIP 壓縮檔案可以包含多種類型的文件，如 HTML、TXT 或圖片。<b>只有當你提示 ZIP "
"壓縮檔中的檔案類型時，KOReader 才能正確開啟你的 ZIP 壓縮檔</b>。如果你只給檔"
"案一個 <b>.zip</b> 副檔名，KOReader 將假定該壓縮檔僅包含圖片，並嘗試像 "
"<b>CBZ</b> 檔案一樣開啟它。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4825-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">DEFAULT CASE:</span> yourfilename<b>.zip</b> - Assumed to "
"be a zip file of images (and opened by <span class=\"ui\">MuPDF engine</"
"span>)"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">預設情況</span>：檔名<b>.zip</b>，假定為圖片的 ZIP 壓縮檔"
"（並由<span class=\"ui\"> MuPDF 引擎</span>開啟）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4829-6
msgid ""
"If your zip file contains one of these types (instead of just images), "
"please name it accordingly:"
msgstr "如果你的 ZIP 壓縮檔含這些類型之一（而不僅僅是圖片），請相應地命名它："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4832-7
msgid "<b>FictionBook</b> - yourfilename.<b>fb2.zip</b>"
msgstr "<b>FB2格式（FictionBook）</b> - 檔名.<b>fb2.zip</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4834-7
msgid "<b>HTML</b> - yourfilename.htm.zip / yourfilename.<b>html.zip</b>"
msgstr "<b>HTML</b> - 檔名.htm.zip / 檔名.<b>html.zip</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4836-7
msgid "<b>Text log files</b> - yourfilename.<b>log.zip</b>"
msgstr "<b>文字記錄檔案</b> - 檔名.<b>log.zip</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4838-7
msgid "<b>Markdown</b> - yourfilename.<b>md.zip</b>"
msgstr "<b>Markdown 檔案</b> - 檔名.<b>md.zip</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4840-7
msgid "<b>Rich Text Format</b> - yourfilename.<b>rtf.zip</b>"
msgstr "<b>富文字格式</b> - 檔名.<b>rtf.zip</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4842-7
msgid "<b>Plain text</b> - yourfilename.<b>txt.zip</b>"
msgstr "<b>純文字</b> - 檔名.<b>txt.zip</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4846-6
msgid ""
"If the documents are not named like this, the wrong reader/format engine is "
"likely to be used and you will see the <span class=\"ui\">No reader engine "
"for this file or invalid file</span> message. You can rename this file as "
"explained above or long-press the filename and then choose <span "
"class=\"ui\">Open with...</span> to select the correct engine."
msgstr ""
"如果文件沒有這樣命名，則可能使用了錯誤的讀取器/格式引擎，你將看到<span "
"class=\"ui\">此檔案沒有讀取器引擎或檔案無效</span>訊息。你可以按照上述說明重"
"新命名此檔案，也可以長按檔名，然後選擇<span class=\"ui\">開啟方式…</span>選擇"
"正確的引擎。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4850-6
msgid "Viewing images"
msgstr "檢視圖片"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4852-6
msgid ""
"You can open image files with the image viewer instead of opening as a book. "
"Files opened like this don’t show up in your history and have better scaling "
"and rotation support."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用圖片檢視器開啟圖片檔案，而不是作為書籍開啟。像這樣開啟的檔案不會出"
"現在你的歷史記錄中，並且具有更好的縮放和旋轉支援。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4855-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:219-1"
msgid "In <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> long-press the file name"
msgstr "在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>長按檔名"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4857-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:221-1"
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Open with…</span>"
msgstr "點擊<span class=\"ui\">開啟方式…</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4858-7
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Image viewer</span>"
msgstr "點擊<span class=\"ui\">圖片檢視器</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4861-6
msgid "Viewing Markdown files"
msgstr "檢視 Markdown 檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4863-6
msgid "KOReader provides two options for reading Markdown documents."
msgstr "KOReader 提供了兩種讀取 Markdown 文件的選項。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4865-7
msgid ""
"You can open the document directly like a book by tapping on it. This mode "
"doesn't provide formatting. So your <b>.md</b> file will look like as it is "
"opened in a text editor."
msgstr ""
"你可以透過點擊它直接開啟文件就像一本書。此模式不提供格式設定。所以你的 "
"<b>.md</b> 檔案看起來就像在文字編輯器中開啟一樣。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4867-7
msgid ""
"You can convert your Markdown document to HTML. This action will render a "
"HTML file from your Markdown document with the correct formatting and a "
"<b>Table of Contents</b> created from the headings."
msgstr ""
"你可以將 Markdown 文件轉換為 HTML。此操作將呈現具有正確格式的 Markdown 文件中"
"的 HTML 檔案，並根據標題建立<b>目錄</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4871-6
msgid ""
"To convert a <b>.md</b> file, long press on it in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File Browser</span> and tap <span class=\"ui\">Convert</span> "
"from the popup menu. A new file with the same name but HTML extension will "
"be created in the same directory. Be aware that conversion might take a "
"while depending on your Markdown file and device speed."
msgstr ""
"要轉換 <b>.md</b> 檔案，請在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中長按該檔"
"案，然後從彈出選單中點擊<span class=\"ui\">轉換</span>按鈕。將在同一目錄中建"
"立一個同名但副檔名為 HTML 的新檔案。請注意，轉換可能需要一段時間，具體取決於"
"你的 Markdown 檔案和裝置速度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4876-6
msgid "Setting file associations"
msgstr "設定檔案關聯"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4878-6
msgid ""
"You can also set file associations for file types which KOReader doesn’t "
"automatically recognize. To associate a file with one of the KOReader "
"providers, first long tap on your file in the <span class=\"ui\">File "
"Browser</span> then choose a provider engine to handle this file. You can "
"check:"
msgstr ""
"你還可以為 KOReader 無法自動識別的檔案類型設定檔案關聯。要將檔案與 KOReader "
"提供程式之一相關聯，請首先在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中長按你的檔"
"案，然後選擇一個提供程式引擎來處理此檔案。你可以選擇："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4882-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Always use this engine for this file</span> to associate "
"this provider with this particular file only"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">始終對此檔案使用此引擎</span>僅將此提供程式與此特定檔案相"
"關聯"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4885-7
msgid ""
"Or check <span class=\"ui\">Always use this engine for file type</span> to "
"associate this provider with all the files that has same extension as this "
"one"
msgstr ""
"或者選擇<span class=\"ui\">始終對檔案類型使用此引擎</span>，將此提供程式與所"
"有與此提供程式具有相同副檔名的檔案相關聯"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4888-7
msgid ""
"From the same dialog, you can see the associations you made by tapping on "
"<span class=\"ui\">View defaults for file types</span>"
msgstr ""
"在同一對話方塊中，你可以透過點擊<span class=\"ui\">檢視預設檔案類型</span>來"
"檢視所建立的關聯"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4893-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-collections"
msgid "9.3 Collections"
msgstr "9.3 收藏清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4895-6
msgid ""
"KOReader's <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> feature can help you with "
"arranging your library more efficiently. As a very simple definition, "
"collections are user created lists of your books. For example you can create "
"two collections named <b>Fiction</b> and <b>Non-Fiction</b> to arrange your "
"books accordingly. Of course you can also use folders to do this but using "
"collections gives you more flexibility."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 的<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>功能可以讓個人書庫的管理更加高"
"效。簡單來說，收藏清單就是由使用者建立的書籍清單。例如可以建立標題分別為<b>文"
"學</b>和<b>非文學</b>的收藏清單，將對應的書籍編入其中。當然按資料夾存放書籍也"
"可實現類似目的，但收藏清單用起來更加靈活。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4899-6
msgid ""
"Some advantages of collections compared to the folder based organization:"
msgstr "使用收藏清單整理書籍相比資料夾的一些優勢："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4901-7
msgid ""
"Adding a book to a collection doesn't move the book file. So your books can "
"be located in different folders but they can appear in the same collection."
msgstr ""
"將書籍編入收藏清單並不會移動書籍檔案位置，因此存放在不同資料夾中的多本書籍可"
"以被編入同一份收藏清單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4902-7
msgid ""
"One book can be in many collections, which is not possible with folders. For "
"example you can have a <b>Science Fiction</b> collection and <b>War Fiction</"
"b> collection. A book can be added to both of these collections at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"同一本書可以被編入多份收藏清單，這很難透過資料夾實現。例如，一本書可以同時被"
"編入<b>科幻題材</b>收藏清單和<b>戰爭文學</b>收藏清單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4905-7
msgid ""
"You can trigger <span class=\"ui\">profiles</span> with <span "
"class=\"ui\">collections</span>. This will be explained below if you are not "
"familiar with the <span class=\"ui\">profiles</span> feature of KOReader. "
"(Of course you can trigger <span class=\"ui\">profiles</span> with folders "
"too but <span class=\"ui\">collections</span> doesn't require you to move "
"your books in order to use temporary <span class=\"ui\">profiles</span> for "
"example.)"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span> 可以應用於<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</"
"span>。如果對 KOReader 的<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>功能不熟悉，請查閱下"
"文說明。（當然，<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>也可應用於資料夾，但<span "
"class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>無需移動書籍檔案即可臨時套用<span class=\"ui\">設"
"定檔</span>。）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4913-6
msgid ""
"You can create collections to mirror any kind of categorization. Some "
"example ideas:"
msgstr "使用者可建立多份收藏清單來對應各種書籍分類方式，例如："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4915-7
msgid "<b>Genres:</b> Fiction, non-fiction, memoir..."
msgstr "<b>作品體裁</b>：虛構文學、非虛構文學、報告文學等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4917-7
msgid ""
"<b>Book status:</b> Currently reading, want to read, next, did not finish..."
msgstr "<b>閱讀狀態</b>：在讀、想讀、已讀、擱置等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4919-7
msgid "<b>Series:</b> Lord of the Rings, Harry Potter..."
msgstr "<b>叢書</b>：《指環王》、《哈利·波特》等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4921-7
msgid "<b>Document type:</b> Books, scientific articles, web articles..."
msgstr "<b>文件類型</b>：書籍、科研論文、網頁等。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4925-6
msgid "Creating and modifying collections"
msgstr "建立並編輯收藏清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4926-6
msgid ""
"You can create collections from the <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> "
"dialog located here:"
msgstr ""
"若要建立收藏清單，請按照下列路徑找到<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>對話方"
"塊："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4929-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Collections"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 收藏清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4932-6
msgid ""
"You can access this dialog from the reader view or from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>. When you open this menu, it will show you "
"a list of your collections. By default you will see <span "
"class=\"ui\">Favorites</span> there as a collection item which includes the "
"books you have already added to your <span class=\"ui\">Favorites</span> "
"list."
msgstr ""
"該對話方塊可在閱讀檢視或<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中使用。開啟時選"
"單會列出現有收藏清單。預設情況下將顯示一份標題為<span class=\"ui\">最愛</"
"span>的收藏清單，其中包含已被新增到<span class=\"ui\">最愛</span>清單的書籍。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4937-7
msgid ""
"<b>Adding a new collection:</b> Use the hamburger menu <img "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:26px;"
"\"> located at the top left corner of this screen > <span class=\"ui\">New "
"collection</span>"
msgstr ""
"<b>建立新收藏清單</b>：點擊螢幕左上角的漢堡狀選單鍵<img class=\"img_inline\" "
"src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> ⇨ 點擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">建立新收藏清單</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4941-7
msgid ""
"<b>Removing a collection:</b> Long tap on the collection name > <span "
"class=\"ui\">Remove collection</span>"
msgstr ""
"<b>刪除收藏清單</b>：在收藏清單標題上長按 ⇨ 點擊<span class=\"ui\">刪除該收藏"
"清單</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4944-7
msgid ""
"<b>Renaming a collection:</b> Long tap on the collection name > <span "
"class=\"ui\">Rename collection</span>"
msgstr ""
"<b>修改收藏清單標題</b>：在收藏清單標題上長按 ⇨ 點擊<span class=\"ui\">修改收"
"藏清單標題</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4947-7
msgid ""
"<b>Changing the order of your collections:</b> Use the hamburger menu <img "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:26px;"
"\"> located at the top left corner of this screen > <span "
"class=\"ui\">Arrange collection</span>"
msgstr ""
"<b>更改收藏清單順序</b>：點擊螢幕左上角的漢堡狀選單鍵<img "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:26px;"
"\"> ⇨ 點擊<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單排序</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4952-6
msgid "Adding books to your collections"
msgstr "將書籍新增到收藏清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4954-6
msgid ""
"There are three different places in KOReader where you can add books to your "
"collections:"
msgstr "有三種方式可以將書籍新增到收藏清單中："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4958-6
msgid "1. From the File Browser and History screen"
msgstr "一、透過檔案瀏覽器及歷史記錄檢視"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4959-6
msgid ""
"You can add a book to your collections from the <span class=\"ui\">File "
"browser</span> or <span class=\"ui\">History</span> screen. From the <span "
"class=\"ui\">History</span> screen you can add books <b>one at a time</b>. "
"Long press on the book and choose <span class=\"ui\">Collections...</span>. "
"Then you can choose which collection(s) you want to add this book to."
msgstr ""
"可以在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>或<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</"
"span>檢視中將書籍新增到收藏清單。<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span>檢視下可將"
"書籍<b>逐本新增</b>到收藏清單中。在書籍上長按，選擇<span class=\"ui\">收藏清"
"單…</span>，然後可以選擇將該書新增到一份或多份收藏清單中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4964-6
msgid ""
"If you are adding several books, you can do this from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File browser</span>. For multiple books this is the procedure:"
msgstr ""
"若要一次性新增多本書籍，請在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中按照下列方"
"式操作："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4966-7
msgid "Long press on a book"
msgstr "長按某本書"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4967-7
msgid "Choose <span class=\"ui\">Select</span> from the popup menu"
msgstr "在彈出選單中點擊<span class=\"ui\">多選</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4969-7
msgid "Select other books"
msgstr "選擇其他書籍"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4970-7
msgid ""
"Tap the <span class=\"ui\">checkmark</span> (✔️) icon at the top-right corner"
msgstr "點擊右上角的<span class=\"ui\">勾號</span>（✔️）圖示"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:4972-7
msgid "Tap <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span>"
msgstr "點擊<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4975-6
msgid ""
"For adding a single book, just long-press on it in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File browser</span> and choose <span class=\"ui\">Collections</"
"span> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"要新增單本書籍，只需在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中長按該書，在彈出"
"選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">新增到收藏清單</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4981-6
msgid "2. From the Collections menu"
msgstr "二、透過收藏清單管理選單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4982-6
msgid ""
"This method allows you to add single and multiple books to your <span "
"class=\"ui\">Collections</span>. Biggest difference from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File browser</span> method is that you can add <b>whole folders "
"and their subfolders</b> to your collections at once. This is very useful if "
"your books are already arranged in folders. For example if all your "
"<b>science fiction</b> books are in a single folder, you can create a "
"collection named <b>Science fiction</b> and add this folder at once."
msgstr ""
"該方法可以將一本或數本書籍新增到<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>中。與在"
"<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中操作不同，這種方法可以將<b>整個資料夾及"
"下層資料夾內</b>的全部書籍一次性新增到收藏清單。如果書籍文件已經按照資料夾分"
"類，該方法將十分高效。例如，如果全部<b>科幻類</b>書籍都在同一個資料夾內，可以"
"建立標題為<b>科幻題材</b>的收藏清單，然後將該資料夾新增進去。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:4990-6
msgid ""
"In the image above, <b>Box 1</b> shows the book adding options. You can "
"reach this menu from the collections screen's hamburger menu:"
msgstr ""
"如上圖所示，<b>方框 1 </b>標出了新增書籍選項。該選單可點擊當前收藏清單的漢堡"
"狀選單鍵呼出："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:4993-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Collections / Your collection name /"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 收藏清單 / 收藏清單標題 /"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:4997-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Add all books from a folder:</span> As its name says, "
"this options allows you to select a folder to add all the books in it to "
"this collection. Note that this option <b>doesn't add the books in "
"subfolders</b> of the chosen folder. For example if you select your "
"<b>Fiction</b> folder and you have folders named <b>Science Fiction</b> and "
"<b>War Fiction</b> under it, they won't be added with this option."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">將整個資料夾加入收藏清單</span>：如選項標題所示，該選項可"
"以將所選資料夾中的全部書籍一次性編入當前收藏清單。請注意，所選資料夾的<b>次級"
"資料夾中的書籍不會被新增</b>。例如，使用者選中名為<b>虛構作品</b>的資料夾，其"
"中包含名為<b>科幻作品</b>和<b>戰爭文學</b>的兩個次級資料夾，這兩個次級資料夾"
"內的書籍不會被新增到當前收藏清單中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5003-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Add all books from a folder and its subfolders:</span> "
"This is the option that will <b>add all the subfolders</b> of your chosen "
"folder. Be careful with this option because it will go down all the way "
"while adding the books. So if you have many levels of nested folders, there "
"might be too many books than you thought."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">將所選資料夾及次級資料夾中新增到收藏清單</span>：該選項會"
"將所選資料夾的<b>次級資料夾</b>一同加入收藏清單，使用時應當謹慎，因為該功能會"
"遍歷所選的資料夾目錄。若其中包含多個目錄層級，新增的書籍數量可能會遠超使用者"
"預期。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5006-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Add a book to collection</span>: This is the basic option "
"that will allow you to add a single book."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">新增書籍到收藏清單</span>：該選項可以將單本書籍新增到當前"
"收藏清單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5009-6
msgid "Removing books from your collections"
msgstr "從收藏清單中移除書籍"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5011-6
msgid ""
"You can remove a book from collections from the <span class=\"ui\">File "
"browser</span>, <span class=\"ui\">History</span> screen or the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Collections</span> screen. In the <span class=\"ui\">File "
"browser</span> and <span class=\"ui\">History</span> screens, long press on "
"the book and choose <span class=\"ui\">Collections...</span>. You will see a "
"checkmark next to the collections that you added this book to. Uncheck the "
"ones by tapping on it to remove the book from that collection. Also from the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> screen, you can long press on a book "
"and choose <span class=\"ui\">Remove from collection</span>."
msgstr ""
"可以透過<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>、<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</"
"span>檢視或<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>將書籍從收藏清單中移除。在<span "
"class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>和<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span>檢視中長按"
"書籍，選擇<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>，可以看到書籍所屬的收藏清單標題"
"前有勾選標記。點擊該標記取消勾選即可將書籍從對應收藏清單中移除。另外在<span "
"class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>介面長按書籍選擇<span class=\"ui\">從收藏清單中移"
"除</span>也可實現相同操作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5018-6
msgid "Arranging the books in your collections"
msgstr "給收藏清單中的書籍排序"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5020-6
msgid ""
"Collections can be very crowded but KOReader allows you to find your books "
"easily by providing many filtering options. If you look at the image above, "
"you can see the filtering options in <b>Box 2</b> and <b>Box 3</b>. <b>Box "
"2</b> allows you to filter by book status (new, reading, finished, on hold) "
"and <b>Box 3</b> allows you to filter by book metadata (author, series, "
"language, keywords). And also you can combine these two groups of filters "
"like this example: <b>\"Show me the new books in this collection which are "
"written by Isaac Asimov <span class=\"ui\">(Filter by authors -> Isaac "
"Asimov)</span> that I haven't started yet <span class=\"ui\">(Filter by "
"status -> New)</span>.\"</b>"
msgstr ""
"收藏清單可能十分冗長，因此 KOReader 提供多種篩選方式以便更容易地找到要讀的書"
"籍。如前圖所示，<b>方框 2 </b>和<b>方框 3 </b>標出了書籍篩選選項。<b>方框 2 "
"</b>可以按照書籍閱讀狀態（未讀、在讀、已讀、擱置）篩選；<b>方框 3 </b>可以透"
"過書籍元資料（作者、叢書、語種、關鍵詞）篩選。兩種篩選方式還可組合使用，你也"
"可以像這個例子一樣組合這兩組篩選器：\"<b>向我展示這份收藏清單中 Isaac "
"Asimov<span class=\"ui\">（按作者 -> Isaac Asimov）</span>編寫的我還沒有開始"
"閱讀的新書<span class=\"ui\">（按狀態 -> 未讀）</span>。</b>\""

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5026-6
msgid ""
"You can update the book metadata by long-pressing on the book in <span "
"class=\"ui\">File browser</span> and choosing <span class=\"ui\">Book "
"information</span> from the menu. In the popup window you can long-press on "
"any field to change the metadata like <b>author</b> or <b>keywords</b>. You "
"can also use <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> for this task, a third-"
"party application which makes managing your book metadata much easier."
msgstr ""
"在<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中長按某本書，可以更新書籍元資料或檢視"
"<span class=\"ui\">書籍資訊</span>。在彈出的對話方塊中長按任意項，可以編輯<b>"
"作者</b>或<b>關鍵詞</b>等書籍元資料。該操作也可透過 <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 完成，這是一款便捷管理書籍元資料的第三方軟"
"體。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5032-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> Be "
"aware that <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> changes the metadata "
"within the book itself, so the changed metadata is visible outside of <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span>. But KOReader doesn't change the book "
"file, it only adds custom metadata as a file in the book's <b>.sdr folder</"
"b>, so this metadata is visible in KOReader only."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 請注"
"意，<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 會改寫書籍內部的元資料，因此將檔"
"案從 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 中匯出後，修改過的元資料仍然有"
"效；但 KOReader 不會修改書籍檔案，而是將自訂的書籍元資料以獨立檔案的形式儲存"
"於與書籍關聯的<b> .sdr 資料夾</b>中，因此這些改動的元資料僅可使用 KOReader 檢"
"視。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5036-6
msgid "Searching in collections"
msgstr "在收藏清單中檢索"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5038-6
msgid ""
"There are two types of search you can perform in collections: You can search "
"for a phrase <b>in the book titles and metadata</b> or you can also search "
"<b>inside the book texts</b>. You can open the search dialog from:"
msgstr ""
"在收藏清單中有兩種不同的搜尋操作：在<b>書名及元資料</b>檢索關鍵詞，或者在<b>"
"書籍內文</b>搜尋。搜尋對話方塊可透過下列路徑呼出："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5041-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Collections / <img loading=\"lazy\" "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:26px;"
"\"> / Collections search"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 收藏清單 / <img loading=\"lazy\" "
"class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" style=\"width:26px;"
"\"> / 在收藏清單中檢索"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5045-6
msgid ""
"If you want to perform a search <b>in the book texts</b>, please keep these "
"points in mind:"
msgstr "在<b>檢索書籍全文</b>時有以下幾點需要注意："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5048-7
msgid ""
"This type of search is only available if you open the <span "
"class=\"ui\">collections</span> from the <span class=\"ui\">file browser</"
"span>. It is <b>not available</b> from the reading screen."
msgstr ""
"這種搜尋僅在透過<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>開啟<span class=\"ui\">收"
"藏清單</span>時才可用，在閱讀檢視下<b>不可用</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5051-7
msgid ""
"This search can be slow (around 2 seconds per book in the collection). So if "
"you have a crowded collection, it might take a long time."
msgstr ""
"這種搜尋可能非常緩慢（收藏清單中的每本書大約耗時 2 秒），如果收藏清單很長，搜"
"尋耗時將會非常久。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5054-6
msgid ""
"Search function depends on where you are in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">collections</span> window. If you are at the root level where "
"you can see all your collections, search will be performed on all "
"collections. If you want to search only in a specific collection, you have "
"to tap and enter the collection. This is especially important if you are "
"also searching in the book texts because it is a slow operation."
msgstr ""
"搜尋功能會因當前所處的<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>視窗層級而不同。當處"
"於瀏覽全部收藏清單的根目錄檢視下，搜尋範圍將包含全部收藏清單。若要在特定收藏"
"清單內搜尋，請點擊進入該收藏清單後再執行搜尋操作。如果同時檢索了書籍內文，這"
"種區別將十分關鍵，因為那是一項頗為耗時的操作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5057-6
msgid ""
"When you perform a search, results will be automatically saved as a new "
"collection."
msgstr "執行一次搜尋操作後，搜尋結果將自動生成一份新收藏清單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5059-6
msgid "Automatically synchronizing collections with folders"
msgstr "根據資料夾自動更新收藏清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5061-6
msgid ""
"After creating your collections and adding books to them, you will probably "
"want to keep them in sync with some folders. For example imagine that you "
"created a <b>Science Fiction</b> collection. And you also have a <b>SF</b> "
"folder in your library where you put your science fiction books. If you want "
"to make the <span class=\"ui\">science fiction collection</span> update "
"itself when you add a new file to this folder, you can do it with <span "
"class=\"ui\">connected folders</span> feature of the collections."
msgstr ""
"在建立收藏清單並新增書籍後，使用者可能希望收藏清單可以與資料夾內容保持同步。"
"例如，使用者使用<b>科幻</b>資料夾存放所有科幻作品，並用它建立了一份<b>科幻題"
"材</b>收藏清單。如果希望在向該資料夾中新增檔案後，<span class=\"ui\">科幻題材"
"收藏清單</span>可以自動更新，可以使用收藏清單的<span class=\"ui\">關聯資料夾"
"</span>功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5067-6
msgid ""
"With this feature you can connect one or more folders to your collection. "
"After that, KOReader will (re)scan the folders to add or remove books from "
"your collections in these conditions:"
msgstr ""
"該功能可以將一個或多個資料夾關聯到收藏清單，KOReader 將在下列幾種情況下重新掃"
"描這些資料夾，以便將書籍檔案的變化反應到收藏清單中："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5070-7
msgid "When connecting a folder to a collection"
msgstr "為收藏清單新增關聯資料夾後"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5071-7
msgid "When including subfolders of a connected folder"
msgstr "向關聯資料夾中添加了次級資料夾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5072-7
msgid "When showing the collection"
msgstr "檢視該收藏清單時"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5073-7
msgid "On program start"
msgstr "KOReader 啟動時"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5076-6
msgid "How to connect a folder to your collection:"
msgstr "將資料夾關聯到收藏清單的方法："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5081-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:445-1"
msgid ""
"Go to the <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> screen that is seen in the "
"image above."
msgstr "前往如上圖所示的<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>介面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5083-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:447-1"
msgid ""
"Long-press on the collection name which you want to connect folders <b>(1)</"
"b>."
msgstr "長按想要關聯到資料夾的收藏清單標題<b>①</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5084-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:448-1"
msgid ""
"Select <span class=\"ui\">Connect folders</span> from the pop-up menu "
"<b>(2)</b>."
msgstr "在彈出選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">關聯資料夾</span><b>②</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5086-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:450-1"
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">List of connected folders screen</span> will open."
msgstr "此時會顯示<span class=\"ui\">已關聯的資料夾</span>清單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5088-7
msgid ""
"Add a folder by pressing the <span class=\"ui\">PLUS icon</span> at the top "
"left corner of that screen, which will open the <span class=\"ui\">Folder "
"chooser screen</span>."
msgstr ""
"點擊螢幕左上角的<span class=\"ui\">加號圖示</span>，在彈出的<span "
"class=\"ui\">選擇資料夾</span>視窗中選擇要新增的資料夾。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5091-7
msgid "Repeat the last item if you want to connect more folders."
msgstr "重複最後一步以新增多個資料夾。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5094-6
msgid ""
"Collections with connected folders will have a <span class=\"ui\">folder "
"icon</span> as you can see from the image above <b>(3)</b>."
msgstr ""
"如上圖所示，關聯了資料夾的收藏清單標題右側有一個<span class=\"ui\">資料夾圖示"
"</span><b>③</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5097-6
msgid ""
"You might want to include subfolders of a folder too for synchronization. In "
"the <b>step 4</b> above, when you open the <span class=\"ui\">List of "
"connected folders screen</span>, you can long-press on a folder to <span "
"class=\"ui\">include/exclude subfolders</span> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"為了同步功能的正常執行，最好連同次級資料夾也一併新增。在上面的<b>第四步</b>，"
"在開啟<span class=\"ui\">已關聯的資料夾</span>清單中長按某個資料夾，在彈出選"
"單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">包含/排除次級目錄</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5102-6
msgid "How to disconnect a folder from your collection:"
msgstr "將收藏清單與資料夾斷開關聯的方法："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5105-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:469-1"
msgid ""
"Go to the <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span> screen that is seen in the "
"image above."
msgstr "前往如上圖所示的<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>介面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5107-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:471-1"
msgid ""
"Long-press on the collection name which you want to connect folders <b>(1)</"
"b>."
msgstr "長按想要關聯到資料夾的收藏清單標題<b>①</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5108-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:472-1"
msgid ""
"Select <span class=\"ui\">Connect folders</span> from the pop-up menu "
"<b>(2)</b>."
msgstr "在彈出選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">關聯資料夾</span><b>②</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5110-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ol.li:474-1"
msgid "<span class=\"ui\">List of connected folders screen</span> will open."
msgstr "此時會顯示<span class=\"ui\">已關聯的資料夾</span>清單。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5112-7
msgid ""
"Long-press on the folder which you want to disconnect and choose <span "
"class=\"ui\">Disconnect folder</span> from the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"長按想要斷開關聯的資料夾，在彈出選單中選擇<span class=\"ui\">斷開資料夾關聯</"
"span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5116-6
msgid "Using Collections with Profiles"
msgstr "將設定檔應用到收藏清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5118-6
msgid ""
"Your collections can be used with the <span class=\"ui\">profiles</span> "
"feature of KOReader. If you don't know about <span class=\"ui\">profiles</"
"span> yet, here is a description from our <a class=\"internalink\" "
"href=\"#L2-profiles\">Profiles</a> section:"
msgstr ""
"收藏清單可配合 KOReader 的<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>功能使用。如果對"
"<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>功能不瞭解，下面是取自<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-profiles\">設定檔</a>一節的介紹："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5123-6
msgid ""
"A <span class=\"ui\">profile</span> is basically a set of actions that can "
"be triggered with a single gesture (like a macro)."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>本質上是一套操作集合（就像巨集命令），可透過"
"單個手勢觸發。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5128-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:492-0"
msgid ""
"As an example, imagine that when reading some type of books, you always:"
msgstr "例如在閱讀某種類型的書籍時總會應用如下設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5130-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ul.li:494-1"
msgid "Rotate the screen to landscape orientation"
msgstr "將螢幕切換到橫向顯示模式"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5131-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ul.li:495-1"
msgid "Increase the font size and contrast and"
msgstr "增大字型大小並提高對比度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5132-7
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.ul.li:496-1"
msgid "Turn the screen light on"
msgstr "開啟螢幕前光"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5135-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:499-0"
msgid ""
"With the profiles plugin, you can do all these at once with a single action."
msgstr "藉助設定檔外掛，只需執行單次操作即可完成這些調整。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5137-6
msgid ""
"You can run a profile manually but real power of profiles can be unleashed "
"with its <span class=\"ui\">auto-execute</span> feature. Using this feature, "
"you can trigger a profile depending on some conditions. Here is the link to "
"the relevant section of the guide: <a class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-"
"profileautoexec\">Profile Auto-execution</a>. For now we will just explain "
"one trigger condition here: <span class=\"ui\">Collections</span>."
msgstr ""
"設定檔可以手動套用，但<span class=\"ui\">自動套用</span>特性才是該功能的強大"
"之處。該特性可以在指定情況下自動套用特定設定檔，請點擊<a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"#L2-profileautoexec\">自動套用配置</a>前往對應章"
"節瞭解。此處僅介紹在<span class=\"ui\">收藏清單</span>中自動套用配置的功能。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5140-6
msgid ""
"Basically you can create some profiles and set them to auto-execute if an "
"opened book is in some specific collection. Some useful examples:"
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，使用者可以建立若干套設定檔，並且在開啟特定收藏清單中的書籍時自動套"
"用。一些示例："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5143-7
msgid ""
"You can add all your manga to a <b>Manga</b> collection and make a profile "
"to switch the page turn direction to <b>Right-To-Left</b> and to invert page "
"turn taps and swipes when you open a manga book from this collection."
msgstr ""
"將所有漫畫書新增到<b>漫畫作品</b>收藏清單，建立一套設定檔在開啟該收藏清單中的"
"書籍時自動套用，將翻頁方向改為<b>從右向左</b>並交換左右兩側的點擊和滑動翻頁操"
"作。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5146-7
msgid ""
"You can add your comic books to a collection, which can trigger a profile to "
"decrease the screen refresh interval to <span class=\"ui\">every page</span> "
"to avoid ghosting."
msgstr ""
"可以將漫畫書新增到套用配置的收藏清單，閱讀時將頁面重新整理間隔降低到<span "
"class=\"ui\">逐頁重新整理</span>以避免殘影。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5148-7
msgid ""
"You can add your problematic PDFs to a collection, so when you open them "
"<span class=\"ui\">Auto OCR</span> or <span class=\"ui\">Reflow mode</span> "
"is activated with a profile."
msgstr ""
"可以將有問題的 PDF 文件編成一份收藏清單，在閱讀這些文件時套用設定檔觸發<span "
"class=\"ui\">自動 OCR </span>或者啟動<span class=\"ui\">頁面重排模式</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5153-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-optimizing"
msgid "9.4 Optimizing Documents"
msgstr "9.4 最佳化文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5155-6
msgid ""
"KOReader is designed to work efficiently even on the limited hardware of e-"
"book readers. But there will always be poorly formatted documents which slow "
"down KOReader. Here we will give some tips for optimizing your document "
"depending on the file type."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 的設計目標是在電子書閱讀器有限的硬體條件下也能高效執行。但總會遇到格"
"式糟糕、拖慢 KOReader 的文件。下面將按檔案類型給出一些最佳化文件的建議。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5159-6
msgid "EPUB files"
msgstr "EPUB 檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5162-7
msgid ""
"EPUB files are basically composed of text and images with some rules to "
"determine how these items are formatted on the screen. In ideal conditions, "
"this is a fairly simple process so EPUB files are generally fast in "
"KOReader. <b>But some EPUB books add a great number of formatting rules that "
"KOReader has to do many calculations just to show even a single sentence.</"
"b> This will slow down opening the book, turning the pages and changing the "
"appearance properties like font weight or line spacing."
msgstr ""
"EPUB 檔案基本上由文字和圖片組成，並帶有一些規則來確定這些項目在螢幕上的格式。"
"在理想情況下，這是一個相當簡單的過程，因此 EPUB 檔案在 KOReader 中通常速度很"
"快。<b>但是一些 EPUB 書籍添加了大量格式規則，KOReader 必須進行許多計算才能顯"
"示哪怕是一個句子。</b>這將減慢開啟書籍、翻頁和更改外觀屬性（如字型粗細或行間"
"距）的速度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:5165-8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"KOReader doesn't support <b>fixed layout EPUBs</b>. They will open, but will "
"render as reflowable EPUBs and probably won't look nice or readable."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> "
"KOReader 不支援<b>固定版式 EPUB 文件</b>。這類文件仍可在 KOReader 中開啟，但"
"會作為可重排 EPUB 渲染，版面可能會錯亂或難以閱讀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5168-7
msgid ""
"EPUB files are actually ZIP archives that contain HTML files. Some books can "
"be a single HTML file while others may be composed of multiple HTML files "
"like each chapter of the book is a separate HTML file. <b>If your book is "
"only a single HTML file, partial rendering can not work.</b> So appearance "
"changes will be slower than the divided chapter books, because for each "
"change, KOReader still has to calculate the whole book instead of only the "
"current chapter."
msgstr ""
"EPUB 檔案格式本質上是包含 .html 檔案的 ZIP 壓縮檔。有的書籍僅包含單個 .html "
"檔案，而有的則由多個 .html 檔案構成，比如每一章節都被拆分為了獨立的 .html 檔"
"案。<b>如果當前書籍僅包含單個 .html 檔案，分段渲染功能就無法啟用</b>，因此樣"
"式調整會比章節拆分的書籍更慢，因為每次調整 KOReader 都需要對整本書籍進行處"
"理，而不是僅渲染當前章節。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5171-7
msgid ""
"Another rare case of slowness is when the content is wrapped in a <b>HTML "
"table tag</b>. KOReader has to render/draw each cell on each page turn, so "
"if a cell (containing many paragraphs) spans 50 pages, this will make page "
"turning quite slow."
msgstr ""
"另一種罕見的緩慢情況是內容被包裝在 <b>HTML 表格標籤</b>中。KOReader 必須在每"
"次翻頁時渲染/繪製每個單元格，因此如果一個單元格（包含許多段落）跨越 50 頁，這"
"將使翻頁速度非常慢。有關解決方案，請參閱下文。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5174-6
msgid "Solutions:"
msgstr "解決方案："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5177-7
msgid ""
"You can set <span class=\"ui\">Embedded Styles</span> to <b>OFF</b> in the "
"bottom menu to see if ignoring all the document stylesheets makes it faster "
"(of course, you'll probably lose any nice formatting, but you'll know what "
"is the culprit)."
msgstr ""
"你可以在底部選單中將<span class=\"ui\">內建樣式</span>設定為<b>關閉</b>，看看"
"忽略所有文件樣式表是否會使其更快（當然，你可能會丟失任何漂亮的格式，但你會知"
"道罪魁禍首是什麼）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5181-7
msgid ""
"If you have HTML and CSS knowledge, you can inspect the HTML and the CSS "
"files directly from KOReader and judge their quality or unnecessary "
"complexity by yourself. To do this, you can long-press on some text and "
"choose <span class=\"ui\">View HTML</span> in the popup menu."
msgstr ""
"如果你具備 HTML 和 CSS 知識，你可以直接從 KOReader 檢查 HTML 和 CSS 檔案，並"
"自行判斷它們的品質或不必要的複雜性。為此，你可以長按某些文字並在彈出選單中選"
"擇<span class=\"ui\">檢視 HTML</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5184-7
msgid ""
"If you have the <b>“content wrapped in a table”</b> problem as mentioned "
"above in the problems section, you can add this <span class=\"ui\">table, "
"tr, td { display:block; }</span> book-specific style tweak to:"
msgstr ""
"如果你有上面問題部分提到的\"<b>內容包裝在表格中</b>\"的問題，你可以將這個 "
"<span class=\"ui\">table, tr, td { display:block; }</span> 僅本書樣式調整新增"
"到："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:5188-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Style tweaks / Book-specific tweak"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_document.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 樣式微調 / 僅本書調整"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5191-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span>’s e-book editor can check EPUB files "
"for problems and has tools to fix some of the problems."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 的電子書編輯器可以檢查 EPUB 檔案是否"
"存在問題，並具有修復某些問題的工具。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:5192-7
msgid ""
"You can download <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> from <a "
"href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 可從其<a href=\"https://calibre-"
"ebook.com/\">項目頁面</a>下載。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:5195-7
msgid ""
"You can see the instructions for the <b>Check book tool</b> of <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> <a href=\"https://manual.calibre-ebook.com/"
"edit.html#checking-the-book\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>書籍檢查工具</b>的使用說明可以在 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> "
"的<a href=\"https://manual.calibre-ebook.com/edit.html#checking-the-book\">使"
"用指南</a>中查閱。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5199-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"external\">EPUBCheck</span> application can check the validity "
"of the EPUB files and detect many types of errors. You can read an example "
"issue, where the problem is detected with <span "
"class=\"external\">EPUBCheck</span> <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/"
"koreader/issues/11268\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">EPUBCheck</span> 軟體可用於檢查 EPUB 文件的有效性並"
"偵測多種類型的錯誤。可參閱這條使用 <span class=\"external\">EPUBCheck</span> "
"檢測問題的<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/11268\">範例"
"議題</a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:5203-7
msgid ""
"You can download the <b>command line version</b> from <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/w3c/epubcheck\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>命令列版本</b>可透過<a href=\"https://github.com/w3c/epubcheck\">該連結</"
"a>下載。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.p:5206-7
msgid ""
"Or download a <b>graphical user interface version</b> from <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/w3c/epubcheck/wiki/GUI\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>帶圖形化互動介面（GUI）的版本</b>則可透過<a href=\"https://github.com/w3c/"
"epubcheck/wiki/GUI\">此連結</a>下載。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5210-6
msgid "PDF files"
msgstr "PDF 檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5212-6
msgid "PDF files can be slow because of these problems:"
msgstr "PDF 檔案可能因以下問題而變慢："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5215-7
msgid "PDF file itself might be <b>too big for your device memory</b>."
msgstr "PDF 檔案本身對於<b>你的裝置記憶體來說可能太大</b>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5217-7
msgid ""
"PDF file <b>might contain very large image files</b>. Even in documents with "
"a normal text layer (which you can select and highlight) there might be "
"another image layer embedded (generally a scan of the page). This slows down "
"the opening and page turning because these large images has to be rescaled "
"to fit on your screen and this process can be CPU intensive."
msgstr ""
"PDF 文件<b>可能內嵌大尺寸圖片檔案</b>。即使帶有正常文字層的文件（可選中並劃"
"線），仍可能疊加了另一個圖片層（頁面的整體掃描件）；這會拖慢文件開啟及翻頁速"
"度，因為大尺寸圖片需要被壓縮到螢幕尺寸以供顯示，而該過程非常消耗 CPU 算力。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5219-7
msgid ""
"PDF file might have <b>lots of individual elements</b> that needs precise "
"positioning, like a magazine page with lots of images and text boxes. In "
"this case KOReader has to calculate and draw all these elements which can "
"take time."
msgstr ""
"PDF 檔案可能包含許多需要精確定位的<b>單個元素</b>，例如包含大量圖片和文字框的"
"雜誌頁面。在這種情況下，KOReader 必須計算和繪製所有這些元素，這可能需要時間。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5222-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"ui\">Auto straighten</span> feature (which allows you to "
"adjust the tilt of the page) might also slow down your reader."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"ui\">自動拉直</span>功能（允許你調整頁面的傾斜）也可能會減慢你"
"的閱讀器速度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5225-7
msgid ""
"If you set your <span class=\"ui\">RENDER QUALITY</span> to <span "
"class=\"ui\">HIGH</span> while <span class=\"ui\">REFLOW</span> is <b>ON</"
"b>, text will be more pleasing but it can be much slower (up to several "
"seconds per page turn) than <span class=\"ui\">DEFAULT</span> depending on "
"your document."
msgstr ""
"如果你將<span class=\"ui\">繪製品質</span>設定為<span class=\"ui\">高品質</"
"span>，而<span class=\"ui\">重排</span>是<b>開啟</b>，文字將更令人愉悅，但它"
"可能比<span class=\"ui\">預設</span>慢得多（每頁翻幾秒鐘），具體取決於你的文"
"件。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.div:5231-8
msgid ""
"BOTTOM MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_contrast.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Render Quality"
msgstr ""
"底部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/bottom_contrast.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 繪製品質"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5235-6
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, for bad PDF files there are not many solutions. Generally "
"best solution with problematic PDFs is trying to find a better version of "
"it. Or if another file type is available for download, like EPUB instead of "
"PDF (or reverse) you can try that format."
msgstr ""
"不幸的是，對於糟糕的 PDF 檔案，沒有太多解決方案。通常，處理有問題的 PDF 最好"
"的辦法是嘗試找到更好的版本。或者，如果有其他檔案類型可供下載，例如用 EPUB 代"
"替 PDF（或反過來），也可以嘗試該格式。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5237-6
msgid ""
"Also you can try to convert your documents into the more flexible EPUB "
"format. Here are some apps that can help you when working with PDFs:"
msgstr ""
"你也可以嘗試把文件轉換為更靈活的 EPUB 格式。以下幾款軟體可在處理 PDF 時提供幫"
"助："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5240-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\">Calibre</a> can convert your "
"documents between many formats. It also has a built-in editor that allows "
"you to edit e-books (and fix problems) in the most popular e-book formats, "
"EPUB and Kindle."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\">Calibre</a> 可以將文件轉換為多種格式。"
"它的內建編輯器還可直接修改 EPUB 和 Kindle 等常見電子書格式並修正文件錯亂。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5243-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://www.willus.com/k2pdfopt/\">K2pdfopt</a> optimizes PDF/DJVU "
"files for mobile e-readers and smartphones. It works well on multi-column "
"PDF/DJVU files and can re-flow text even on scanned PDF files. It can also "
"be used as a general PDF copying/cropping/re-sizing/OCR-ing manipulation "
"tool."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://www.willus.com/k2pdfopt/\">K2pdfopt</a> 可以為便攜閱讀裝置"
"及手機改善 PDF 和 DJVU 文件。該軟體可以對分欄的文件進行編輯，甚至對掃描版 "
"PDF 檔案進行文字重排。同時，它可以作為一款通用的 PDF 複製、裁切、調整大小、"
"OCR 等的編輯軟體。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5246-7
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ocrmypdf/OCRmyPDF\">OCRmyPDF</a> is a command "
"line application which can add an OCR text layer to scanned PDF files "
"(containing only images without text), allowing them to be searched or copy-"
"pasted. It can especially be useful for reading old scanned books. It can "
"also optimize the images for a smaller file size."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ocrmypdf/OCRmyPDF\">OCRmyPDF</a> 是一款為掃描版 "
"PDF 文件新增 OCR 文字層的命令列軟體，使處理後的文件可以檢索及複製貼上。在閱讀"
"掃描版舊書時格外有用。它也可用於壓縮圖片檔案大小。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5250-6
msgid "Manga and Comics"
msgstr "漫畫與漫畫書"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5252-6
msgid ""
"We have a dedicated section for optimizing manga and comics: <a href=\"#L2-"
"mangaprepare\" class=\"internalink\">Optimizing Manga</a>"
msgstr ""
"我們設有專門介紹漫畫最佳化的章節：<a href=\"#L2-mangaprepare\" "
"class=\"internalink\">最佳化漫畫</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5254-6
msgid "TEXT files"
msgstr "TEXT 檔案"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5256-6
msgid ""
"KOReader has a very efficient text processing engine. Also books are cached "
"on first opening so KOReader can open them faster next time. But despite "
"these optimizations, unusually large text files might still take longer to "
"open. For example, online Chinese novels are known to reach tens of millions "
"of words and generally saved as text files."
msgstr ""
"KOReader 擁有非常高效的文字處理引擎，並且會在首次開啟書籍時將其快取，以便下次"
"更快開啟。但即便有這些最佳化，異常龐大的純文字檔案仍可能耗時更久才能開啟。例"
"如，網路上的中文小說動輒數千萬字，且通常儲存為純文字檔案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5258-6
msgid ""
"Problem with large text files is the delay when first rendering the book and "
"when modifying the text appearance later. If you try to change the font size "
"of a very large <b>.txt</b> book, you might see a big delay after each "
"adjustment because all of the book has to be rendered again. KOReader has a "
"<b>partial rendering</b> system which shortens this type of delay "
"considerably. But this feature <b>can't be used with text files</b> because "
"these files are not divided into chapters (you can read more about <span "
"class=\"ui\">partial rendering</span> <a href=\"#L2-indicators\" "
"class=\"internalink\">here</a>)."
msgstr ""
"大型純文字檔案的問題在於首次渲染書籍以及後續修改文字外觀時的延遲。若嘗試修改"
"一本非常大的 <b>.txt</b> 書籍的字型大小，每次調整後都可能明顯卡頓，因為整本書"
"都要重新渲染。KOReader 帶有<b>分段渲染</b>機制，可大幅縮短此類延遲。但該功能"
"<b>無法用於純文字檔案</b>，因為這類檔案沒有按章節拆分（關於<span "
"class=\"ui\">分段渲染</span>的更多說明見<a href=\"#L2-indicators\" "
"class=\"internalink\">此處</a>）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5264-6
msgid ""
"To benefit from <b>partial rendering</b> speed-up, you can convert your "
"large text file to <b>EPUB</b> format using the <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> application. <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> will automatically divide your text file "
"into smaller individual files during conversion and pack them into a "
"standard <b>EPUB</b> file. After this conversion, you can change your book "
"appearance much faster. You can download <span class=\"external\">Calibre</"
"span> from this <a href=\"https://calibre-ebook.com/\">page</a> and find "
"online tutorials for the <b>TXT-to-EPUB conversion</b> procedure."
msgstr ""
"若要享受<b>分段渲染</b>帶來的提速，可把大型純文字檔案轉換為 <b>EPUB</b> 格"
"式，方法是使用 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 軟體。<span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 會在轉換時自動把純文字檔案切分為多個較小的"
"獨立檔案，並打包成標準的 <b>EPUB</b> 檔案。轉換完成後，更改書籍外觀的速度會快"
"得多。可從 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 的<a href=\"https://"
"calibre-ebook.com/\">頁面</a>下載，並尋找有關<b>TXT 轉 EPUB</b> 操作的線上教"
"程。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5274-6
msgid "Web pages"
msgstr "網頁"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5276-6
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/gildas-lormeau/SingleFile#install\">SingleFile</"
"a> is a browser extension for <b>Mozilla Firefox, Google Chrome</b> and "
"<b>Microsoft Edge</b>. This extension allows saving a web page as a "
"<b>single .html file</b> with all the resources (images, stylesheets, "
"scripts) embedded. Then you can copy this single file to your device and "
"read with KOReader."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/gildas-lormeau/SingleFile#install\">SingleFile</"
"a> 是一款適用於 <b>Mozilla Firefox、Google Chrome</b> 及 <b>Microsoft Edge</"
"b> 的瀏覽器外掛。這款外掛可以將網頁包含的圖片、樣式表和指令碼等打包儲存為單"
"個 <b>.html</b> 檔案。之後可將這一個檔案複製到裝置上，用 KOReader 閱讀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5281-6
msgid "9.5 Using OPDS Catalogs"
msgstr "9.5 使用 OPDS 書目"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5283-6
msgid ""
"An <b>OPDS (Open Publication Distribution System) catalog</b> is an online "
"feed that acts like a digital library index. KOReader has OPDS support so "
"you can browse these digital libraries, search for books on them and "
"download the books directly to your device."
msgstr ""
"<b>OPDS（開放出版發行系統）書目</b>是一種線上資訊源，相當於數字圖書館的索引。"
"KOReader 支援 OPDS，因此你可以瀏覽這些數字圖書館、在其中檢索書籍，並把書籍直"
"接下載到裝置上。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5286-6
msgid ""
"KOReader comes pre-configured with some large OPDS catalogs like <a "
"href=\"https://www.gutenberg.org/\">Project Gutenberg</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://standardebooks.org/\">Standard Ebooks</a> and you can add "
"other OPDS catalogs. To open the OPDS dialog, go to:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 預置了一些大型 OPDS 書目，例如<a href=\"https://www.gutenberg.org/"
"\">古騰堡計劃</a>和<a href=\"https://standardebooks.org/\">Standard Ebooks</"
"a>，你也可以新增其他 OPDS 書目。要開啟 OPDS 對話方塊，請前往："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5290-6
msgid ""
"(FILE BROWSER) TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_search.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> / OPDS catalog"
msgstr ""
"（檔案瀏覽器）頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/"
"top_search.svg\" style=\"width:26px;\"> / OPDS 書目"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5293-6
msgid "Using personal OPDS servers"
msgstr "使用個人 OPDS 伺服器"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5294-6
msgid ""
"In addition to the public catalogs, you can use OPDS system to manage your "
"own library. Using the <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> application, "
"you can serve the books on your computer as an OPDS catalog, which you can "
"browse directly from KOReader. Click <a href=\"https://manual.calibre-"
"ebook.com/generated/en/calibre-server.html\">here</a> for <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> instructions about configuring an OPDS "
"server."
msgstr ""
"除公共書目外，你還可以用 OPDS 管理自己的書庫。藉助 <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 軟體，可以把電腦上的書籍作為 OPDS 書目提供"
"出來，並直接在 KOReader 中瀏覽。點擊<a href=\"https://manual.calibre-"
"ebook.com/generated/en/calibre-server.html\">此處</a>可檢視 <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 關於配置 OPDS 伺服器的說明。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5299-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"external\">Kavita</span> is also an open-source and feature "
"rich, cross platform reading server. You can setup your own server and share "
"your reading collection with your friends and family. It also has <b>OPDS</"
"b> and <b>progress sync</b> support for KOReader. Using this application, "
"you can access your library from your reader device and synchronize reading "
"positions between different devices to continue reading where you have left. "
"Project's page is <a href=\"https://www.kavitareader.com/\">here</a>. "
"Documentation for <b>OPDS</b> and <b>progress sync</b> for KOReader users is "
"<a href=\"https://wiki.kavitareader.com/guides/3rdparty/koreader/\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">Kavita</span> 也是一款開源、功能豐富且跨平台的閱讀伺"
"服器。你可以搭建自己的伺服器，與親友共享藏書。它還為 KOReader 提供 <b>OPDS</"
"b> 和<b>進度同步</b>支援。藉助該軟體，你可以從閱讀裝置存取書庫，並在不同裝置"
"間同步閱讀位置，以便從上次中斷處繼續閱讀。項目頁面見<a href=\"https://"
"www.kavitareader.com/\">此處</a>。面向 KOReader 使用者的 <b>OPDS</b> 和<b>進"
"度同步</b>文件見<a href=\"https://wiki.kavitareader.com/guides/3rdparty/"
"koreader/\">此處</a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5306-6
msgid ""
"After setting up your own OPDS servers, you need to add them to KOReader. "
"Instructions are <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/OPDS-"
"support\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"搭建好自己的 OPDS 伺服器後，還需將其新增到 KOReader。操作說明見<a "
"href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/wiki/OPDS-support\">此處</a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5308-6
msgid "9.6 Synchronizing Progress"
msgstr "9.6 同步閱讀進度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5310-6
msgid ""
"If you are using KOReader on several devices like e-reader, phone, tablet or "
"desktop computer, KOReader can synchronize your reading progress between "
"them. Using the <span class=\"ui\">progress sync</span> feature, you can "
"continue reading seamlessly when switching from your e-reader at home to "
"your phone on the commute for example."
msgstr ""
"如果你在電子書閱讀器、手機、平板或桌上型電腦等多個裝置上使用 KOReader，它可以"
"在這些裝置之間同步閱讀進度。藉助<span class=\"ui\">進度同步</span>功能，例如"
"從家裡的閱讀器切換到通勤路上的手機時，也能無縫續讀。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5313-6
msgid ""
"This feature is handled by the <span class=\"ui\">progress sync</span> "
"plugin. Setting up synchronization involves these three steps which we will "
"explain below:"
msgstr ""
"該功能由<span class=\"ui\">進度同步</span>外掛負責。同步的設定包含以下三個步"
"驟，下面逐一說明："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5317-7
msgid "Create a <b>sync account</b>"
msgstr "建立<b>同步帳號</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5318-7
msgid ""
"Login to your <b>sync account</b> from all the devices you want to "
"synchronize"
msgstr "在希望同步的所有裝置上登入你的<b>同步帳號</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5320-7
msgid "Automatically or manually synchronize your reading progress"
msgstr "自動或手動同步閱讀進度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5323-6
msgid "1. Creating a sync account"
msgstr "1. 建立同步帳號"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5325-6
msgid ""
"To create a sync account, connect to a network on your device and open the "
"<span class=\"ui\">progress sync</span> plugin in KOReader:"
msgstr ""
"要建立同步帳號，請先讓裝置連線網路，然後開啟 KOReader 中的<span class=\"ui\">"
"進度同步</span>外掛："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5328-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Progress sync"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 進度同步"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5331-6
msgid "and press the <span class=\"ui\">Register/Login</span> button."
msgstr "然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">註冊/登入</span>按鈕。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5334-6
msgid ""
"In the opening window, enter a <span class=\"ui\">username</span> and <span "
"class=\"ui\">password</span> then press the <span class=\"ui\">Register</"
"span> button. This will create an account on <span "
"class=\"external\">KOReader sync server</span> which will hold your reading "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"在彈出的視窗中輸入<span class=\"ui\">使用者名</span>和<span class=\"ui\">密碼"
"</span>，然後點擊<span class=\"ui\">註冊</span>按鈕。這會在 <span "
"class=\"external\">KOReader sync server</span> 上建立一個帳號，用於儲存你的閱"
"讀進度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5340-6
msgid "2. Login to your sync account"
msgstr "2. 登入同步帳號"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5342-6
msgid ""
"Open the same menu on the devices that you want to sync. Enter your <span "
"class=\"ui\">username</span> and <span class=\"ui\">password</span> and this "
"time press the <span class=\"ui\">Login</span> button. After this, your "
"devices will be connected to your sync account."
msgstr ""
"在希望同步的裝置上開啟同一選單，輸入<span class=\"ui\">使用者名</span>和"
"<span class=\"ui\">密碼</span>，這次點擊<span class=\"ui\">登入</span>按鈕。"
"之後，這些裝置就會連線到你的同步帳號。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5347-6
msgid ""
"You can give recognizable names to your devices. Again from the same menu, "
"press the <span class=\"ui\">Device hostname</span> and enter a name for the "
"current device."
msgstr ""
"你可以為裝置設定便於辨識的名稱。同樣在該選單中，點擊<span class=\"ui\">裝置主"
"機名</span>，為當前裝置輸入一個名稱。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5350-6
msgid "3. Sync your progress"
msgstr "3. 同步閱讀進度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5352-6
msgid ""
"After everything is set up, you can synchronize your reading progress "
"automatically or manually:"
msgstr "全部設定完成後，即可自動或手動同步閱讀進度："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5355-7
msgid ""
"<b>Automatic sync:</b> To synchronize <b>automatically</b>, enable the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Automatically keep documents in sync</span> menu item. Now "
"whenever you <b>close a book</b> or <b>suspend/resume your device</b>, "
"KOReader will send your reading progress to the server (of course this "
"requires an available network connection)."
msgstr ""
"<b>自動同步：</b>要<b>自動</b>同步，請啟用<span class=\"ui\">自動同步文件</"
"span>選單項。此後每當<b>關閉書籍</b>或<b>休眠/喚醒裝置</b>時，KOReader 都會把"
"閱讀進度傳送到伺服器（當然這需要可用的網路連線）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5360-7
msgid ""
"<b>Manual sync:</b> If you don't have constant internet connection on your "
"device for battery or availability reasons, you can choose to synchronize "
"<b>manually</b>. You have many options to trigger a synchronization:"
msgstr ""
"<b>手動同步：</b>如果裝置因省電或網路條件無法持續聯網，可選擇<b>手動</b>同"
"步。觸發同步的方式有很多種："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5364-8
msgid ""
"<b>From the menu:</b> In the <span class=\"ui\">Progress sync</span> "
"plugin's menu you can press the <span class=\"ui\">Push progress from this "
"device now</span> menu item to send your progress on the current device to "
"the server. To receive the latest progress from the server, press <span "
"class=\"ui\">Pull progress from other devices now</span> menu item."
msgstr ""
"<b>透過選單：</b>在<span class=\"ui\">進度同步</span>外掛的選單中，點擊<span "
"class=\"ui\">立即上傳本裝置的進度</span>選單項，可把當前裝置的進度傳送到伺服"
"器；點擊<span class=\"ui\">立即從其他裝置拉取進度</span>選單項，可取得伺服器"
"上的最新進度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5370-8
msgid ""
"<b>With gestures:</b> These actions (push/pull progress) are available in "
"the <span class=\"ui\">Gesture manager</span> so you can assign them to any "
"gesture you like."
msgstr ""
"<b>透過手勢：</b>這些操作（推送/拉取進度）可在<span class=\"ui\">手勢管理員</"
"span>中找到，你可以把它們指定給任意喜歡的手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5374-8
msgid ""
"<b>With quick menu:</b> You can add these actions to your <span "
"class=\"ui\">Quick Menu</span>."
msgstr ""
"<b>使用快速選單：</b>你可以將這些操作新增到<span class=\"ui\">快速選單</span>"
"中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5377-8
msgid ""
"<b>From profiles:</b> You can add these actions to your <span "
"class=\"ui\">Profiles</span>. Especially with the auto-execute feature of "
"<span class=\"ui\">profiles</span>, you can trigger sync with various "
"filters and conditions."
msgstr ""
"<b>透過設定檔：</b>你可以把這些操作新增到<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>中。"
"尤其配合<span class=\"ui\">設定檔</span>的自動執行功能，還能用各種篩選條件觸"
"發同步。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5382-6
msgid "Document matching method options"
msgstr "文件匹配方法選項"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5384-6
msgid ""
"In order to sync the progress of a document on two different devices, "
"KOReader first has to identify these two files as \"same\". Sometimes this "
"can be tricky, so we have two methods that you can choose from, depending on "
"your usage of KOReader. You can change the method from the <span "
"class=\"ui\">Document matching method</span> option in the <b>progress sync</"
"b> menu."
msgstr ""
"要在兩臺不同裝置上同步某個文件的進度，KOReader 首先必須判定這兩個檔案是「同一"
"個」。有時這並不容易，因此提供兩種方法供你根據使用習慣選擇。可在<span "
"class=\"ui\">文件匹配方法</span>選項中更改，它位於<b>進度同步</b>選單內。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5389-6
msgid "Binary matching (default)"
msgstr "二進位制匹配（預設）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5390-6
msgid ""
"By default, <b>progress sync</b> uses <span class=\"ui\">Binary matching</"
"span> method to identify the files. In this method, KOReader generates a "
"partial <b>MD5 hash</b> of the file’s content (which looks like this: "
"0b229176d4e8db7f...). Any tiny change to the file, completely changes this "
"hash so <b>binary matching</b> method works only if both files are perfectly "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，<b>進度同步</b>使用<span class=\"ui\">二進位制匹配</span>方法來識"
"別檔案。此方法會為檔案內容生成一段部分 <b>MD5 雜湊</b>（形如 "
"0b229176d4e8db7f...）。檔案哪怕只有極小的改動，也會徹底改變這段雜湊，因此<b>"
"二進位制匹配</b>方法只在兩個檔案完全一致時才有效。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5396-6
msgid ""
"If you are copying the <b>exact same file</b> manually to all your devices, "
"this method should work. But for example if you are using <span "
"class=\"external\">Calibre</span> to send books to your devices, <b>binary "
"matching</b> will fail."
msgstr ""
"如果你手動把<b>完全相同的檔案</b>複製到所有裝置，這種方法應該可行。但如果用 "
"<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 向裝置傳送書籍，<b>二進位制匹配</b>就"
"會失效。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5401-6
msgid ""
"Because <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> writes its own information "
"like <b>viewer progress</b> directly into the file, which changes the "
"<b>file hash calculation</b>, so KOReader will treat these files (original "
"and <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> modified) as two different "
"books. If you have this problem you can use the alternative method explained "
"below."
msgstr ""
"因為 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 會把自己的資訊（如<b>閱讀進度</"
"b>）直接寫入檔案，從而改變<b>檔案雜湊的計算結果</b>，KOReader 就會把這兩個檔"
"案（原始檔案與經 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 修改的檔案）當成兩本"
"不同的書。若遇到這種情況，可改用下面介紹的替代方法。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5407-6
msgid "Filename matching"
msgstr "檔名匹配"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5409-6
msgid ""
"This is a \"looser\" matching method designed for users whose files might "
"vary slightly between devices due to the changes made to the documents by "
"other software like <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span>, as explained "
"above."
msgstr ""
"這是一種「更寬鬆」的匹配方法，專為那些檔案在不同裝置間可能略有差異的使用者設"
"計——如上文所述，<span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 等軟體對文件的修改會"
"造成這種差異。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5411-6
msgid ""
"In this method, KOReader only checks if the <b>filenames (including the "
"extension) of the two documents</b> are identical to match them. So if you "
"are using <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> or some other library "
"management software to manage your library across different devices, you can "
"change to <span class=\"ui\">Filename matching</span>."
msgstr ""
"在此方法下，KOReader 只檢查<b>兩份文件的檔名（含副檔名）</b>是否相同，以此判"
"定匹配。因此，如果你使用 <span class=\"external\">Calibre</span> 或其他書庫管"
"理軟體跨裝置管理書庫，可以改用<span class=\"ui\">檔名匹配</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5415-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> You "
"can also have a look at the <a href=\"#L2-metadatastorage\" "
"class=\"internalink\">Book metadata storage options</a> section of the guide "
"for in-depth information."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\" title=\"Contextual information\"></span> 你也可"
"以查閱本指南的<a href=\"#L2-metadatastorage\" class=\"internalink\">書籍元資"
"料儲存選項</a>一節，瞭解更深入的資訊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5419-6
msgid "Privacy and security of the synchronization process"
msgstr "同步過程的隱私與安全性"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5422-7
msgid ""
"<span class=\"external\">KOReader sync server</span>, the software that "
"handles KOReader's synchronization process is an open-source project. You "
"can find more information including the source code on its <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/koreader/koreader-sync-server\">GitHub page</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"external\">KOReader sync server</span> 是負責處理 KOReader 同步"
"流程的軟體，屬於開源項目。你可在其<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/"
"koreader-sync-server\">GitHub 頁面</a>檢視更多資訊及源程式碼。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5424-7
msgid ""
"Synchronization server <b>does not store file name or content</b>. This "
"means, the server can't know what you are reading. When you synchronize the "
"progress of a document, only this information is transferred and kept on the "
"server:"
msgstr ""
"同步伺服器<b>不儲存檔名或檔案內容</b>。也就是說，伺服器無法知道你在讀什麼。同"
"步某個文件的進度時，只有以下資訊會被傳輸並儲存在伺服器上："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5427-9
msgid "User name (that you have chosen)"
msgstr "使用者名（由你自己選定）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5428-9
msgid ""
"Unique id of the document (MD5 hash of the file which looks like this: "
"0b229176...)"
msgstr "文件的唯一標識（檔案的 MD5 雜湊，形如 0b229176...）"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li.ol.li:5429-9
msgid "Furthest reading position for this document"
msgstr "本文件的最遠閱讀位置"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5432-7
msgid ""
"Your password <b>is not stored</b> on the server (only a MD5 hash is kept)."
msgstr "你的密碼<b>不會儲存</b>在伺服器上（僅保留其 MD5 雜湊）。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5435-7
msgid ""
"All communication between KOReader and the sync server is secured with HTTPS."
msgstr "KOReader 與同步伺服器之間的所有通訊均透過 HTTPS 加密保護。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5438-6
msgid ""
"Hosting your own sync server <span class=\"microns_warning\" "
"title=\"Advanced topic\"></span>"
msgstr ""
"自行託管同步伺服器 <span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced "
"topic\"></span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5440-6
msgid ""
"You also have the option to host your own sync server if you wish. You can "
"use the official <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader-sync-"
"server\">KOReader sync server</a> or one of the alternatives you can see on "
"this <a href=\"https://github.com/ruiribeiro04/awesome-koreader/#sync-"
"servers-self-hosted\">page</a>."
msgstr ""
"如果願意，你也可以自行託管同步伺服器。既可使用官方的<a href=\"https://"
"github.com/koreader/koreader-sync-server\">KOReader sync server</a>，也可選擇"
"本<a href=\"https://github.com/ruiribeiro04/awesome-koreader/#sync-servers-"
"self-hosted\">頁面</a>列出的替代方案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5443-6
msgid ""
"There are also other projects like <a href=\"https://github.com/janeczku/"
"calibre-web\">Calibre-Web</a> which are library management solutions with an "
"integrated <b>KOReader sync server</b>."
msgstr ""
"此外還有 <a href=\"https://github.com/janeczku/calibre-web\">Calibre-Web</a> "
"等項目，它們是集成了 <b>KOReader sync server</b> 的書庫管理方案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5446-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L2-metadataarchive"
msgid "9.7 Book Metadata Archive"
msgstr "9.7 書籍元資料存檔"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5448-6
msgid ""
"First we will explain KOReader's file deletion behavior so you will better "
"understand the <b>Book Metadata Archive</b> feature:"
msgstr ""
"我們先說明 KOReader 的檔案刪除行為，以便你更好地理解<b>書籍元資料存檔</b>功"
"能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5451-6
msgid ""
"Normally when you copy a document to your device and open it for the first "
"time, KOReader creates a new directory with a name like <span "
"class=\"ui\">your_document_name.sdr</span> and uses this directory to keep "
"the settings, annotations and progress for this document."
msgstr ""
"通常，當你把文件複製到裝置並首次開啟時，KOReader 會新建一個名稱類似 <span "
"class=\"ui\">your_document_name.sdr</span> 的目錄，用來儲存該文件的設定、標註"
"和閱讀進度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5454-6
msgid ""
"When you delete a document using KOReader's <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</"
"span>, KOReader deletes this <b>.sdr directory</b> too. Which means that you "
"lose all the settings, annotations and progress for the deleted document. If "
"you copy this document to your e-reader again and open it with KOReader, it "
"will be like opening it for the first time."
msgstr ""
"當你使用 KOReader 的<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>刪除文件時，KOReader "
"也會一併刪除這個 <b>.sdr 目錄</b>。這意味著該文件的所有設定、標註和閱讀進度都"
"會丟失。如果之後再把這份文件複製到閱讀器並用 KOReader 開啟，就等同於第一次開"
"啟它。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5457-6
msgid ""
"But for example, what if you want to delete the finished books (maybe you "
"don't like clutter in your library or you are out of space), but also you "
"don't want to lose the highlights from these books? <b>Book Metadata "
"Archive</b> feature allows you to do this."
msgstr ""
"但舉個例子：如果你想刪掉已讀完的書（也許是不想讓書庫雜亂，或者儲存空間不"
"足），卻又不想丟失這些書裡的劃線，該怎麼辦？<b>書籍元資料存檔</b>功能就能幫你"
"做到。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5462-6
msgid "How this feature works:"
msgstr "此功能的工作原理："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5465-7
msgid ""
"First you have to activate the feature by choosing an <b>archive location</"
"b> here:"
msgstr "首先需要在下列位置選擇一個<b>存檔位置</b>以啟用該功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li.div:5467-8
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Document / Book metadata archive / Archive location:"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 文件 / 書籍元資料存檔 / 存檔位置："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5470-7
msgid ""
"Now when you delete a document from the <span class=\"ui\">File Browser</"
"span>, you will see this option is enabled in the confirmation dialog: <span "
"class=\"ui\">[ ] save book to metadata archive</span>"
msgstr ""
"此後，當你從<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>刪除文件時，確認對話方塊中會"
"出現已啟用的該選項：<span class=\"ui\">[ ] 儲存書籍元資料以歸檔</span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5472-7
msgid ""
"If you check this option when deleting, KOReader will copy the settings file "
"for this document to your archive directory which you have chosen at the "
"first step above."
msgstr ""
"刪除時若勾選該選項，KOReader 會把該文件的設定檔案複製到你在第一步所選的存檔目"
"錄中。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:5474-7
msgid ""
"Then KOReader will delete your document and its associated <span "
"class=\"ui\">your_document_name.sdr</span> directory."
msgstr ""
"隨後 KOReader 會刪除該文件及其關聯的 <span "
"class=\"ui\">your_document_name.sdr</span> 目錄。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5478-6
msgid ""
"Your document is deleted, but its settings are in the archive. If you copy "
"this document to your device again and open it, KOReader will notice that "
"the settings for this document are in the archive and tell you this: "
"<b>\"This book was previously opened on this device. Would you like to "
"restore its metadata from the archive?\"</b> <span class=\"ui\">Restore</"
"span> button will use this archived settings file for this document so you "
"will get back the settings, annotations and progress for this document."
msgstr ""
"文件雖已刪除，但其設定仍儲存在存檔中。如果再次把該文件複製到裝置並開啟，"
"KOReader 會發現存檔中存有它的設定，並提示：<b>「此書曾在本裝置上開啟過。是否"
"從存檔恢復其元資料？」</b>點擊<span class=\"ui\">恢復</span>按鈕即可用這份存"
"檔設定為該文件找回設定、標註和閱讀進度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5482-6
msgid "You can see the list of archived documents here:"
msgstr "你可以在此處檢視已歸檔文件清單："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5483-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Document / Book metadata archive / Archived books "
"list"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 文件 / 書籍元資料存檔 / 已歸檔書籍清單"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5486-6
msgid ""
"From this list, you can access the archived document's <b>information/"
"metadata</b> and <b>bookmarks</b> by tapping on the name of the document. "
"Also you can delete the document from the archive."
msgstr ""
"在此清單中，點擊文件名稱即可檢視已歸檔文件的<b>資訊/元資料</b>和<b>書籤</b>；"
"也可以把該文件從存檔中刪除。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5492-6
msgid "Save metadata to archive on book closing"
msgstr "當關閉書籍時將元資料儲存至存檔"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5493-6
msgid ""
"If you enable this option from the same menu mentioned above, KOReader will "
"save a copy of the the <b>settings file</b> of every document when closing "
"it. Even if you delete a document and its .sdr folder outside of KOReader "
"(Android file manager, when connected to your pc...) you will still have a "
"backup of your document's settings."
msgstr ""
"如果在上述同一選單中啟用該選項，KOReader 會在關閉每份文件時儲存一份<b>設定檔"
"案</b>的副本。此後即使你在 KOReader 之外（例如透過 Android 的檔案應用，或連線"
"電腦時）刪除了文件及其 .sdr 資料夾，仍會保留該文件設定的備份。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5496-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> If <span class=\"ui\">Save metadata to "
"archive on book closing</span> option is enabled, but you uncheck the <span "
"class=\"ui\">save book to metadata archive</span> option in the file delete "
"dialog, KOReader will delete the previously created settings archive file "
"for this document."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_info\"></span> 如果啟用了<span class=\"ui\">當關閉書籍"
"時將元資料儲存至存檔</span>選項，卻在檔案刪除對話方塊中取消了<span "
"class=\"ui\">儲存書籍元資料以歸檔</span>選項，KOReader 將刪除此前為該文件建立"
"的設定存檔檔案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5501-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> KOReader "
"recognizes deleted files from their file hashes. This means the file you "
"copied back to your device should be identical to the deleted file. Any "
"changes like Calibre metadata written into the file or PDF highlights added, "
"will change the hash of a file. In this case KOReader can't offer you the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Restore</span> option because it will see this as a "
"different file. See the next section of the guide for more detailed info: <a "
"class=\"internalink\" href=\"L2-metadatastorage\">Book Metadata Storage</a>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> KOReader 透過檔案"
"雜湊識別被刪除的檔案。這意味著重新複製回裝置的檔案必須與被刪除的檔案完全一"
"致。任何改動（例如寫入檔案的 Calibre 元資料或新增的 PDF 劃線）都會改變檔案雜"
"湊。此時 KOReader 無法提供<span class=\"ui\">恢復</span>選項，因為它會把該檔"
"案視為另一份檔案。更詳細的資訊請參閱本指南的下一節：<a class=\"internalink\" "
"href=\"L2-metadatastorage\">書籍元資料儲存</a>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5505-6
msgid ""
"9.8 Book Metadata Storage<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced "
"topic\"></span>"
msgstr ""
"9.8 書籍元資料儲存<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Advanced "
"topic\"></span>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5507-6
msgid ""
"KOReader stores settings and extra information related to your books in the "
"same directory as your book file. We call this <b>metadata</b> and it "
"includes:"
msgstr ""
"KOReader 將與書籍相關的設定和額外資訊儲存在與書籍檔案相同的目錄中。我們稱之為"
"<b>元資料</b>，它包括："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5510-7
msgid "Visual settings for the book"
msgstr "書籍的顯示設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5511-7
msgid "Book reading progress"
msgstr "全書閱讀進度"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5512-7
msgid "Highlights, bookmarks and notes"
msgstr "劃線、書籤與筆記"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5515-6
msgid ""
"In a recent change, we added new ways of storing this metadata to solve "
"certain problems related to synchronization between devices. Currently there "
"are three different methods to store the metadata and each method has its "
"own benefits/negatives."
msgstr ""
"在最近的一次更改中，我們添加了儲存此元資料的新方法，以解決與裝置之間同步相關"
"的某些問題。目前有三種不同的方法來儲存元資料，每種方法都有自己的優缺點。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5517-6
msgid "You can change this setting from this menu:"
msgstr "你可以從此選單更改此設定："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5519-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Document / Book metadata location"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 文件相關 / 書籍元資料存放目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5522-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> We strongly "
"advise reading the section below to understand the differences and how each "
"method works before making any changes. Otherwise there is a risk of losing "
"your book settings, progress and annotations."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 強烈建議在改動任何"
"設定前閱讀下面的章節，瞭解各選項的功能及工作原理。否則可能面臨丟失書籤、閱讀"
"進度及標註的風險。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5525-6
msgid "1. Individual metadata folders next to the book files - DEFAULT SETTING"
msgstr "1.書籍檔案旁邊的單個元資料資料夾-預設設定"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5527-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Document / Book metadata location: book folder"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 文件 / 書籍元資料存放目錄：書籍所在資料夾"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5530-6
msgid ""
"This is the <b>default</b> method used on a new installation of KOReader. In "
"this method, when you copy <b>Alice in Wonderland.epub</b> to your device "
"and open it for the first time, a folder named <span class=\"ui\">Alice in "
"Wonderland.sdr</span> will be created in the same directory. This directory "
"contains the files for your settings, annotations and book progress for this "
"book."
msgstr ""
"這是 KOReader 新安裝時使用的<b>預設</b>方法。在此方法中，當你將 <b>Alice In "
"Wonderland.epub</b> 複製到裝置並首次開啟時，將在同一目錄中建立一個名為 <span "
"class=\"ui\">Alice In Wonderland.sdr</span> 的資料夾。此目錄包含本書的設定、"
"標註和書籍進度的檔案。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5535-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:899-0"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "好處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5537-7
msgid "You can manually backup and restore the settings for each book."
msgstr "你可以手動備份和還原每本書的設定。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5538-7
msgid ""
"When you perform directory synchronization or backups with a system like "
"<b>Syncthing</b> or <b>Dropbox</b>, your settings will be synchronized "
"alongside your books."
msgstr ""
"當你使用 <b>Syncthing</b> 或 <b>Dropbox</b> 等系統執行目錄同步或備份時，你的"
"設定將與你的書籍同步。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5540-7
msgid ""
"You can rename the parent directories where your book resides, this doesn't "
"confuse KOReader."
msgstr "你可以重新命名書籍所在的父目錄，這不會導致 KOReader 混淆。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5543-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:907-0"
msgid "Negatives"
msgstr "壞處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5545-7
msgid ""
"If you reorganize your library by moving/renaming the book files or their "
"accompanying .sdr folder outside of KOReader file browser, you will lose "
"metadata of those books without any warning."
msgstr ""
"如果你在 KOReader 檔案瀏覽器之外透過其他方式移動/重新命名書籍檔案或其附帶"
"的 .sdr 資料夾來重新組織你的庫，你將在沒有任何警告的情況下丟失這些書籍的元資"
"料。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5546-7
msgid ""
"These <b>.sdr</b> folders will be visible when you browse your library "
"directories with another file browser or from your computer, which may "
"clutter your view."
msgstr ""
"當你使用其他檔案瀏覽器或從計算機瀏覽庫目錄時，這些 <b>.sdr</b> 資料夾將可見，"
"這可能會使你的檢視變得混亂。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5550-6
msgid "2. Metadata directories under a single KOReader directory"
msgstr "2.單個 KOReader 目錄下的元資料目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5552-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Document / Book metadata location: ./docsettings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 文件 / 書籍元資料資料夾：./docsettings"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5555-6
msgid ""
"This method is essentially same as the default one above. The difference is, "
"in this method, all <b>.sdr</b> folders of your books will be under a single "
"directory <b>which is under the KOReader main directory structure</b>, "
"instead of your library directory, next to the book files."
msgstr ""
"此方法與上面的預設方法基本相同。不同的是，在這種方法中，你的所有書籍的 "
"<b>.sdr</b> 資料夾都將位於<b> KOReader 主目錄結構</b>下的單個目錄下，而不是書"
"籍檔案旁邊的庫目錄下。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5558-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:922-0"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "好處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5560-7
msgid ""
"Book <b>.sdr</b> folders will only be visible to and used by KOReader. They "
"won't clutter your view of your library directories when you browse your "
"library with another file browser or from your computer."
msgstr ""
"書籍<b>.sdr</b> 資料夾僅對 KOReader 可見並由其使用。當你使用另一個檔案瀏覽器"
"或從計算機瀏覽庫時，它們不會打亂你對庫目錄的檢視。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5564-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:928-0"
msgid "Negatives"
msgstr "壞處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5566-7
msgid ""
"If you reorganize your library by moving/renaming the moving/renaming "
"library directories, book files or their accompanying .sdr folder outside of "
"KOReader file browser, you will lose metadata of those books without any "
"warning."
msgstr ""
"如果你透過在 KOReader 檔案瀏覽器之外移動/重新命名移動/重新命名庫目錄、書籍檔"
"案或其附帶的.sdr資料夾來重新組織你的庫，你將在沒有任何警告的情況下遺失這些書"
"籍的元資料。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5568-7
msgid ""
"Since your book metadata will not be in your library folders, any "
"synchronization or backups of your library will not include them."
msgstr ""
"由於你的書籍元資料不在庫資料夾中，因此庫的任何同步或備份都不會包含它們。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5571-6
msgid ""
"3. Individual HASHED metadata directories under a single KOReader directory"
msgstr "3.單個 KOReader 目錄下的單個 HASHED 元資料目錄"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5573-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / Document / Book metadata location: ./hashdocsettings"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:26px;\"> / 文件 / 書籍元資料資料夾：./hashdocsettings"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5576-6
msgid ""
"This method is similar to the previous one as the <b>.sdr</b> folders will "
"be under an internal directory. But this method is developed to address the "
"shortcomings of the previous method. Because, normally if you rename a book "
"outside KOReader (with the native file manager/reader of the device or from "
"a connected computer), its <b>.sdr</b> folder name will no longer match and "
"your metadata for that book will be lost. <b>If you are only using the "
"KOReader File Browser for file operations, this is automatically handled so "
"there are no repercussions.</b>"
msgstr ""
"此方法與前一種方法類似，因為 <b>.sdr</b> 資料夾將位於內部目錄下。但這種方法是"
"為了解決以前方法的缺點而開發的。因為，通常如果你在 KOReader 之外重新命名一本"
"書（使用裝置的本機檔案瀏覽器/閱讀器或從連線的計算機），其 <b>.sdr</b> 資料夾"
"名稱將不再匹配，並且該書的元資料將丟失。<b>如果你只使用 KOReader 檔案瀏覽器進"
"行檔案操作，則會自動處理，因此不會產生任何影響。</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5580-6
msgid ""
"In this <b>HASHED</b> method, <b>.sdr</b> folders are not identified by the "
"filepath/filename of the book. Instead, a partial <b>MD5 hash</b> will be "
"used to link the books to their settings. This hash is used as a unique ID "
"for the book and it is calculated based on the <b>contents of the book file</"
"b>. Also same hash is used for naming its .sdr folder."
msgstr ""
"在這種 <b>HASHED</b> 方法中，<b>.sdr</b> 資料夾不是由書籍的檔案路徑/檔名標識"
"的。相反，將使用部分<b> MD5 雜湊</b>將書籍連結到其設定。此雜湊用作書籍的唯一 "
"ID，並根據<b>書籍檔案的內容</b>計算。同樣的雜湊也用於命名其 .sdr 資料夾。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5585-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:949-0"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "好處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5587-7
msgid ""
"Book <b>.sdr</b> folders will only be visible to and used by KOReader. They "
"won't clutter your view of your library directories when you browse your "
"library directories with another file browser or from your computer."
msgstr ""
"書籍 <b>.sdr</b> 資料夾僅對 KOReader 可見並由其使用。當你使用另一個檔案瀏覽器"
"或從計算機瀏覽庫目錄時，它們不會弄亂你對庫目錄的檢視。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5590-7
msgid ""
"You can rename, move, and copy your books with another file browser or from "
"your computer. KOReader will still recognize the books after these "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用其他檔案瀏覽器或從計算機重新命名、移動和複製書籍。經過這些操作後，"
"KOReader 仍將識別這些書籍。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5592-7
msgid ""
"In this method, KOReader associates the same <b>.sdr</b> folder with all "
"copies of the book, even if these copies are on different devices. For "
"example if you are using <b>Syncthing</b>, this method enables you to sync "
"your <span class=\"ui\">/hashdocsettings</span> folder alongside your book "
"files, across many devices that all have KOReader installed. Despite the "
"different relative paths of those books on each device, you can still get "
"your annotations and progress synchronized across your devices. This isn't "
"possible with other methods."
msgstr ""
"在這種方法中，KOReader 將同一個 <b>.sdr</b> 資料夾與書籍的所有副本相關聯，即"
"使這些副本位於不同的裝置上。例如，如果你正在使用 <b>Syncthing</b>，此方法使你"
"能夠在安裝了 KOReader 的許多裝置上同步你的 <span class=\"ui\">/"
"hashdocsettings</span> 資料夾以及你的書籍檔案。儘管這些書在每個裝置上的相對路"
"徑不同，但你仍然可以在裝置之間同步標註和進度。這在其他方法中是不可能的。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5597-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+managinglibrary.p:961-0"
msgid "Negatives"
msgstr "壞處"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5599-7
msgid ""
"Any operations that modify the file directly (such as writing highlights "
"into PDFs or downloading from <b>Calibre</b>) will change the file so its "
"<b>MD5 ID will change</b> (unlike renaming or moving which is safe with this "
"method). In this case KOReader wouldn't be able to recognize the book so "
"these books will lose their metadata."
msgstr ""
"任何直接修改檔案的操作（如將劃線寫入 PDF 文件或從 <b>Calibre</b> 下載劃線）都"
"會使檔案發生變化，導致檔案的<b> MD5 校驗值發生變化</b>（不過重新命名檔案或移"
"動檔案對此沒有影響）。此時 KOReader 無法識別該書籍，因此該書籍的元資料將會丟"
"失。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ul.li:5602-7
msgid ""
"Calculating file IDs may slow down <span class=\"ui\">File browser</span> "
"navigation when browsing larger directories."
msgstr ""
"在瀏覽較大目錄時，計算檔案 ID 可能會減慢<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>"
"的導航速度。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5612-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:L1-gestures"
msgid "10 GESTURES AND KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS"
msgstr "10 手勢與鍵盤快速鍵"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:5614-6
msgid ""
"There are many types of gestures you can use to control KOReader. Some "
"gestures have limitations regarding where on the screen they can be used and "
"which directions are supported. These limitations are indicated below."
msgstr ""
"你可以使用許多類型的手勢來控制 KOReader。某些手勢在螢幕上的使用位置和支援的方"
"向方面存在限制。這些限制如下所示。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:5618-6
