#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7334-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-switchdocuments"
msgid "Switching between documents quickly"
msgstr "在文件之間快速切換"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7335-6
msgid ""
"If you need to switch between two documents (when comparing them for "
"example), there is a quicker way than going through the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>. KOReader can open the last document with a "
"gesture (<b><span style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> multiswipe</"
"b>). If you define a gesture’s action as <span class=\"ui\">Open previous "
"document</span>, you can switch between two documents quickly similar to the "
"<b>Alt+Tab</b> feature on the desktop computers. You can find this feature "
"under:"
msgstr ""
"如果需要在兩個文件之間切換（例如在比較它們時），有一種比使用<span "
"class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>更快的方法。KOReader 可以使用手勢（<b><span "
"style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> 多重手勢</b>）。如果將手勢的動作定"
"義為<span class=\"ui\">開啟之前的文件</span>，則可以在兩個文件之間快速切換，"
"類似於桌上型電腦上的 <b>Alt+Tab</b> 功能。你可以在以下位置找到此功能："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7339-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and gestures / Gesture manager / \"ANY "
"GESTURE\" / General / Open Previous Document"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 手勢管理 / 「任意手勢」 / 通用類 / 開啟"
"之前的文件"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7342-6
msgid ""
"Also you can use the <span class=\"ui\">History</span> dialog to switch "
"between documents quickly. The history screen can be opened with the <span "
"style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> multiswipe gesture. You can also "
"define any other gesture for this of course."
msgstr ""
"此外，你還可以使用<span class=\"ui\">歷史記錄</span>對話方塊在文件之間快速切"
"換。可以使用 <span style=\"font-family: microns;\"></span> 多重手勢開啟歷史"
"記錄螢幕。當然，你也可以為此定義任何其他手勢。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7346-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-seewordcount"
msgid "See line/word count of a page"
msgstr "每頁的行數/字數"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7347-6
msgid ""
"If you want to know how many lines or words are being shown on the current "
"page you can see it at:"
msgstr "如果你想知道當前頁面上顯示了多少行或字，可以在以下位置檢視："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7349-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+tips.div:31-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Book information"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 書籍資訊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7352-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-changebookcover"
msgid "Changing book cover"
msgstr "更改書籍封面"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7354-6
msgid "You can change your book cover from this menu:"
msgstr "你可以從以下選單更改書籍封面："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7356-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Book information / (long-tap) Cover image: / Set "
"custom"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 書籍資訊 /（長按）封面圖片：/ 自訂"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7359-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-createwallpaper"
msgid "Creating a sleep screen wallpaper from documents"
msgstr "用文件製作螢幕保護桌布"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7360-6
msgid ""
"Some books don’t come with proper book covers. Or they may have their cover "
"on the second page so it doesn’t show up properly. Or maybe the cover is not "
"suitable for e-ink (too light or dark). Or you prefer to set some image from "
"the book as cover."
msgstr ""
"有些書沒有合適的書籍封面。或者他們的封面可能位於第二頁，因此無法正確顯示。或"
"者封面可能不適合電子墨水（太亮或太暗）。或者你更喜歡將書中的一些圖片設定為封"
"面。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7362-6
msgid ""
"In situations like this you can quickly take a screenshot and set it as the "
"current book’s cover. There are two screenshot gestures depending on where "
"you are:"
msgstr ""
"遇到這類情況，可以快速截圖並將其設為當前書籍的封面。根據所處介面，截圖手勢有"
"兩種："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:7365-7
msgid ""
"The default screenshot gesture <span class=\"ui\">long-diagonal swipe</span> "
"if you are in <b>reader mode</b> and <b>file browser</b>"
msgstr ""
"預設截圖手勢 <span class=\"ui\">長對角線滑動</span>，適用於<b>閱讀模式</b>和"
"<b>檔案瀏覽器</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.ol.li:7369-7
msgid ""
"The alternative screenshot gesture <span class=\"ui\">two-finger large "
"diagonal tap on corners</span> if you are in the <b>image viewer</b>"
msgstr ""
"另一種截圖手勢 <span class=\"ui\">雙指對角大幅點擊邊角</span>，適用於<b>圖片"
"檢視器</b>"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7373-6
msgid ""
"In <b>image viewer</b>, you can zoom and pan the image before taking the "
"screenshot, so it will be cropped to exact size and aspect ratio of your "
"device without stretching."
msgstr ""
"在<b>圖片檢視器</b>中，可在截圖前縮放和平移圖片，使其按裝置的精確尺寸和寬高比"
"裁剪，而不會被拉伸。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7375-6
msgid ""
"After taking your screenshot you can select <span class=\"ui\">Set as book "
"cover</span> from the dialog."
msgstr "截圖後，可在對話方塊中選擇 <span class=\"ui\">設定為書籍封面</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7378-6
msgid "You can remove the custom book cover from this menu:"
msgstr "你可以在此處刪除此自訂書籍封面："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7380-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html+tips.div:62-0"
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Book information"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_hamburger.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 書籍資訊"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7383-6
msgid ""
"On the book information page, long-press on the <span class=\"ui\">Cover "
"image</span> item and then select <span class=\"ui\">Reset custom</span>."
msgstr ""
"在書籍資訊頁面，長按<span class=\"ui\">封面圖片</span>項，然後選擇<span "
"class=\"ui\">重設自訂</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7386-6
msgid ""
"You can also reset the book cover with the <span class=\"ui\">Reset</span> "
"dialog, which you can access by long-pressing the filename in the <span "
"class=\"ui\">File Browser</span>."
msgstr ""
"你還可以使用<span class=\"ui\">重設</span>對話方塊重設書籍封面，你可以透過在"
"<span class=\"ui\">檔案瀏覽器</span>中長按檔名來存取該對話方塊。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7389-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> Be very careful "
"when using this <span class=\"ui\">Reset</span> dialog and be sure that only "
"<span class=\"ui\">Custom cover image</span> item is checked otherwise you "
"can reset everything related to your book accidentally."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\" title=\"Warning\"></span> 使用該 <span "
"class=\"ui\">重設</span> 對話方塊時務必謹慎，確保僅勾選 <span class=\"ui\">自"
"訂封面圖片</span> 一項，否則可能意外重設與該書籍相關的全部內容。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7394-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-disablelinks"
msgid "Avoiding opening links accidentally"
msgstr "避免意外開啟連結"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7395-6
msgid ""
"If your document has links and you are accidentally tapping them while "
"turning the page or using other gestures, you can turn off <span "
"class=\"ui\">Following links by tapping</span> via this menu item:"
msgstr ""
"如果你的文件有連結，並且你在翻頁或使用其他手勢時不小心點擊了它們，你可以透過"
"以下選單項關閉 <span class=\"ui\">點擊時開啟連結</span>："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7398-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Taps and Gestures / Links / Tap to follow links"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 輕觸與手勢 / 連結類操作 / 點擊前往連結"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7401-6
msgid ""
"After disabling this setting, to follow a link you have to long-tap on it "
"and select <span class=\"ui\">Follow link</span> from the popup menu. If you "
"have the opposite problem and you want to make tapping links easier, you can "
"enable <span class=\"ui\">Allow larger tap area around links</span> from the "
"same menu."
msgstr ""
"停用此設定後，要追蹤連結，必須長時間點擊它，然後從彈出選單中選擇<span "
"class=\"ui\">追蹤連結</span>。如果你有相反的問題，並且希望更容易點擊連結，則"
"可以從同一選單中啟用<span class=\"ui\">允許連結周圍有更大的點擊區域</span>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7405-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-midnightstatistics"
msgid "Reading statistics after midnight"
msgstr "午夜後統計閱讀資料"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7406-6
msgid ""
"In reading statistics you can change the start of day used for calculations. "
"This is useful if you are reading after midnight for example and want your "
"reading session counted as today instead of the next day. This applies only "
"to the <span class=\"ui\">Day timeline view</span> and optionally to the "
"<span class=\"ui\">Calendar view</span>; it does not apply to any of the "
"other statistics reports. You can set this time at:"
msgstr ""
"在讀取統計資料時，你可以更改用於計算的一天的開始時間。例如，如果你在午夜之後"
"閱讀並希望將閱讀時間計為今天而不是第二天，這將非常有用。這僅適用於<span "
"class=\"ui\">日時間線檢視</span>，並可選擇性地應用於<span class=\"ui\">日曆檢"
"視</span>；它不適用於任何其他統計報告。你可以在以下位置設定此時間："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7409-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Reading statistics / Settings / Daily timeline "
"starts at..."
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/top_tools.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 閱讀統計資料 / 設定 / 日時間線起始於..."

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7412-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-verticaltategaki"
msgid "Reading vertically formatted books"
msgstr "閱讀豎排書籍"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7414-6
msgid ""
"Currently official KOReader doesn't support rendering books formatted as "
"vertical text (tategaki - 縦書き) but one of our users has created a fork "
"that can do this. It is basically a clone of KOReader with added vertical "
"text rendering."
msgstr ""
"目前官方 KOReader 尚不支援渲染豎排文字的書籍（tategaki，即日文「縦書き」），"
"但有一位使用者做出了可實現該功能的分支。它基本上是 KOReader 的復刻，額外加入"
"了豎排文字渲染。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7416-6
msgid ""
"<b>Japanese vertical writing</b> is the main target of this fork. But since "
"the implementation supports <b>EPUB writing-mode: vertical-rl</b> at the "
"rendering engine level, it may also work for other vertical writing "
"languages. It can at least render Chinese too, according to the feedback "
"from Chinese users."
msgstr ""
"<b>日文豎排書寫</b>是該分支的主要目標。但由於其實現在渲染引擎層面支援 "
"<b>EPUB writing-mode: vertical-rl</b>，它也可能適用於其他豎排書寫的語言。據中"
"文使用者回饋，它至少也能渲染中文。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7420-6
msgid ""
"Be aware that this is a fork (not a plugin or a user patch), so it "
"completely replaces your KOReader. But ordinary horizontal books behave much "
"like they do in the official KOReader, so this replacement should be "
"functionally equivalent."
msgstr ""
"請注意，這是一個分支（不是外掛，也不是使用者補丁），會完全替換你現有的 "
"KOReader。不過普通橫排書籍的表現與官方 KOReader 基本一致，因此這種替換在功能"
"上應當是等效的。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7422-6
msgid ""
"You can switch to this fork without first uninstalling your current "
"KOReader. Just follow the instructions in the fork's <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/m-tky/koreader-tategumi\">repo</a>. Development discussion on our "
"repo is <a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/11469\">here</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"無需先解除安裝當前的 KOReader 即可切換到該分支，只需按照該分支<a "
"href=\"https://github.com/m-tky/koreader-tategumi\">倉庫</a>中的說明操作。我"
"們倉庫中的開發討論<a href=\"https://github.com/koreader/koreader/issues/"
"11469\">在此</a>。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7424-6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\"></span>If you switch to this fork, please "
"use the fork's repo for vertical text related questions/issues, instead of "
"the official KOReader repo."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"microns_warning\"></span>若切換到該分支，與豎排文字相關的問題/"
"議題請提交到該分支的倉庫，而不要提交到 KOReader 官方倉庫。"

