"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 螢幕相關 / 自動調暗"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7472-6
msgctxt "user_guide/en.html:tip-optimizebatteryhealth"
msgid "Optimizing battery health"
msgstr "最佳化電池健康"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7474-6
msgid ""
"Li-ion batteries experience more degradation at the extreme ends of their "
"charge levels. To minimize this degradation and extend your battery life, "
"you can limit your minimum discharge level to <b>20%</b> and maximum charge "
"level to <b>80%</b> (as in electric vehicles and some newer phones). Which "
"means you start charging your device when the battery goes down to 20% and "
"unplug when it reaches 80% (or 30%-70% if you are extra cautious)."
msgstr ""
"鋰離子電池過充過放都會極大影響電池壽命。為了最大限度地減少影響並延長電池壽"
"命，你可以將最低電量限制為 <b>20%</b>，將最大充電電量限制為 <b>80%</b>（如電"
"動車和一些較新的手機）。這意味著當電池電量降至 20% 時，你需要開始為裝置充電，"
"並在電池電量達到 80%（如果你格外小心，則為 30%-70%）時拔下插頭。"

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.p:7478-6
msgid ""
"KOReader can warn you by showing an alert when charge level reaches your "
"defined limits:"
msgstr "KOReader 可以在電量達到你定義的限制時顯示警報來警告你："

#: user_guide/en.html%2Bhtml.body.div.main.div.section.div:7479-6
msgid ""
"TOP MENU / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / Device / Device Status Alerts / Battery Level"
msgstr ""
"頂部選單 / <img class=\"img_inline\" src=\"pictures/gear.svg\" "
"style=\"width:22px;\"> / 裝置 / 裝置狀態提醒 / 電池電量"

